2.15.17| kapālān vibhidyante1 sphuṭanti rucakāni ca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ nidānasthāne bhagnanidānaṃ nāma pañcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||15||

ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
2.16.1| athāto mukharogāṇāṃ nidānaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
2.16.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
2.16.3| mukharogāḥ pañcaṣaṣṭirbhavanti saptasvāyataneṣu|
