dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ|

4.2.1| athātaḥ sadyovraṇacikitsitaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
4.2.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
4.2.3| dhanvantarirdharmabhṛtāṃ variṣṭho vāgviśāradaḥ|
1viśvāmitrasutaṃ śiṣyamṛṣṭiṃ suśrutamanvaśāt||
4.2.4| nānādhārāmukhaiḥ śastrairnānāsthānanipātitaiḥ|
