4.2.5| āyatāścaturasrāśca tryasrā maṇḍalinastathā|
ardhacandrapratīkāśā viśālāḥ kuṭilāstathā||
4.2.6| 1śarāvanimnamadhyāśca yavamadhyāstathā 'pare|
