tatra snehauṣadhivivekamātraṃ yatra bheṣajaṃ sa mṛduriti, madhūcchiṣṭamiva viśadamavilepi yatra bheṣajaṃ sa madhyamaḥ, kṛṣṇamavasannamīṣadviśadaṃ cikkaṇaṃ ca yatra bheṣajaṃ sa khara iti; ata ūrdhvaṃ dagdhasneho bhavati, taṃ punaḥ sādhu sādhayet|
tatra pānābhyavahārayormṛduḥ, nasyābhyaṅgayormadhyamaḥ, bastikarṇapūraṇayostu khara iti||
