prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.1.1| athāto 'nnapānarakṣakalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.1.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
5.1.3| dhanvantariḥ kāśipatistapodharmabhṛtāṃ varaḥ|
suśrutaprabhṛtīñchiṣyāñchaśāsāhataśāsanaḥ||
5.1.4| ripavo vikramākrāntā ye ca sve kṛtyatāṃ gatāḥ|
sisṛkṣavaḥ krodhaviṣaṃ vivaraṃ prāpya tādṛśam||
5.1.5| viṣairnihanyurnipuṇaṃ nṛpatiṃ duṣṭacetasaḥ|
striyo vā vividhān yogān kadācitsubhagecchayā||
5.1.6| viṣakanyopayogādvā kṣaṇājjahyādasūnnaraḥ|
tasmādvaidyena satataṃ viṣādrakṣyo narādhipaḥ||
5.1.7| yasmācca ceto 'nityatvamaśvavat prathitaṃ nṛṇām|
na viśvasyāttato rājā kadācidapi kasyacit||
5.1.8| kulīnaṃ dhārmikaṃ snigdhaṃ subhṛtaṃ saṃtatotthitam|
alubdhamaśaṭhaṃ bhaktaṃ kṛtajñaṃ priyadarśanam||
5.1.9| krodhapāruṣyamātsaryamāyālasyavivarjitam|
jitendriyaṃ kṣamāvantaṃ śuciṃ śīladayānvitam||
5.1.10| medhāvinamasaṃśrāntamanuraktaṃ1 hitaiṣiṇam|
paṭuṃ pragalbhaṃ nipuṇaṃ dakṣamālasyavarjitam1||
5.1.11| pūrvoktaiśca guṇairyuktaṃ nityaṃ sannihitāgadam|
mahānase prayuñjīta vaidyaṃ tadvidyapūjitam||
5.1.12| praśastadigdeśakṛtaṃ śucibhāṇḍaṃ mahacchuci|
sajālakaṃ gavākṣāḍhyamāptavarganiṣevitam||
5.1.13| vikakṣasṛṣṭasaṃsṛṣṭaṃ savitānaṃ kṛtārcanam|
parīkṣitastrīpuruṣaṃ bhaveccāpi mahānasam||
5.1.14| tatrādhyakṣaṃ niyuñjīta prāyo vaidyaguṇānvitam|
śucayo dakṣiṇā dakṣā vinītāḥ priyadarśanāḥ||
5.1.15| saṃvibhaktāḥ sumanaso nīcakeśanakhāḥ sthirāḥ|
snātā dṛḍhaṃ saṃyaminaḥ kṛtoṣṇīṣāḥ susaṃyatāḥ||
5.1.16| tasya cājñāvidheyāḥ syurvividhāḥ parikarmiṇaḥ|
āhārasthitayaścāpi bhavanti prāṇino yataḥ||
5.1.17| tasmānmahānase vaidyaḥ pramādarahito bhavet|
māhānasikavoḍhāraḥ saupaudanikapaupikāḥ||
5.1.18| bhaveyurvaidyavaśagā ye cāpyanye 'tra kecana|
iṅgitajño manuṣyāṇāṃ vākceṣṭāmukhavaikṛtaiḥ||
5.1.19| vidyādviṣasya dātāramebhirliṅgaiśca buddhimān|
na dadātyuttaraṃ pṛṣṭo vivakṣan mohameti ca||
5.1.20| apārthaṃ bahu saṅkīrṇaṃ bhāṣate cāpi mūḍhavat|
sphoṭayatyaṅgulīrbhūmimakasmādvilikheddhaset||
5.1.21| vepathurjāyate tasya trastaścānyo 'nyamīkṣate|
1kṣāmo vivarṇavaktraśca nakhaiḥ kiñcicchinattyapi||
5.1.22| ālabhetāsakṛddīnaḥ kareṇa ca śiroruhān|
niryiyāsurapadvārairvīkṣate ca punaḥ punaḥ||
5.1.23| vartate viparītaṃ tu viṣadātā vicetanaḥ|
kecidbhayāt pārthivasya tvaritā vā tadājñayā||
5.1.24| asatāmapi santo 'pi ceṣṭāṃ kurvanti mānavāḥ|
tasmāt parīkṣaṇaṃ kāryaṃ bhṛtyānāmādṛtairnṛpaiḥ||
5.1.25| anne pāne dantakāṣṭhe tathā 'bhyaṅge 'valekhane|
utsādane kaṣāye ca pariṣeke 'nulepane||
5.1.26| srukṣu vastreṣu śayyāsu kavacābharaṇeṣu ca|
pādukāpādapīṭheṣu pṛṣṭheṣu gajavājinām||
5.1.27| viṣajuṣṭeṣu cānyeṣu nasyadhūmāñjanādiṣu|
lakṣaṇāni pravakṣyāmi cikitsāmapyanantaram||
5.1.28| nṛpabhaktādbaliṃ nyastaṃ saviṣaṃ bhakṣayanti ye|
tatraiva te vinaśyanti makṣikāvāyasādayaḥ||
5.1.29| hutabhuk tena cānnena bhṛśaṃ caṭacaṭāyate|
mayūrakaṇṭhapratimo jāyate cāpi duḥsahaḥ||
5.1.30| bhinnārcistīkṣṇadhūmaśca nacirāccopaśāmyati|
cakorasyākṣivairāgyaṃ jāyate kṣiprameva tu||
5.1.31| dṛṣṭvā 'nnaṃ viṣasaṃsṛṣṭaṃ mriyante jīvajīvakāḥ|
kokilaḥ svaravaikṛtyaṃ krauñcastu madamṛcchati||
5.1.32| hṛṣyenmayūra udvignaḥ krośataḥ śukasārike|
haṃsaḥ kṣveḍati cātyarthaṃ bhṛṅgarājastu kūjati||
5.1.33| pṛṣato visṛjatyaśruṃ viṣṭhāṃ muñcati markaṭaḥ|
sannikṛṣṭāṃstataḥ kuryādrājñastān mṛgapakṣiṇaḥ||
5.1.34| veśmano 'tha vibhūṣārthaṃ rakṣārthaṃ cātmanaḥ sadā|
upakṣiptasya cānnasya bāṣpeṇordhvaṃ prasarpatā||
5.1.35| hṛtpīḍā bhrāntanetratvaṃ śiroduḥkhaṃ ca jāyate|
tatra nasyāñjane kuṣṭhaṃ lāmajjaṃ naladaṃ madhu||
5.1.36| kuryācchirīṣarajanīcandanaiśca pralepanam|
hṛdi candanalepastu tathā sukhamavāpnuyāt||
5.1.37| pāṇiprāptaṃ pāṇidāhaṃ nakhaśātaṃ karoti ca|
atra pralepaḥ śyāmendragopāsomotpalāni ca||
5.1.38| sa cet pramādānmohādvā tadannamupasevate|
aṣṭhīlāvattato jihvā bhavatyarasavedinī||
5.1.39| tudyate dahyate cāpi śleṣmā cāsyāt prasicyate|
tatra bāṣperitaṃ karma yacca syāddāntakāṣṭhikam||
5.1.40| mūrcchāṃ chardimatīsāramādhmānaṃ dāhavepathū|
indriyāṇāṃ ca vaikṛtyaṃ kuryādāmāśayaṃ gatam||
5.1.41| tatrāśu madanālābubimbīkośātakīphalaiḥ|
chardanaṃ dadhyudaśvidbhyāmathavā taṇḍulāmbunā||
5.1.42| dāhaṃ mūrcchāmatīsāraṃ tṛṣṇāmindriyavaikṛtam|
āṭopaṃ pāṇḍutāṃ kārśyaṃ kuryāt pakvāśayaṃ gatam||
5.1.43| virecanaṃ sasarpiṣkaṃ tatroktaṃ nīlinīphalam|
dadhnā dūṣīviṣāriśca peyo vā madhusaṃyutaḥ||
5.1.44| dravadravyeṣu sarveṣu kṣīramadyodakādiṣu|
bhavanti vividhā rājyaḥ phenabudbudajanma ca||
5.1.45| chāyāścātra na dṛśyante dṛśyante yadi vā punaḥ|
bhavanti yamalāśchidrāstanvyo vā vikṛtāstathā||
5.1.46| śākasūpānnamāṃsāni klinnāni virasāni ca|
sadyaḥ paryuṣitānīva vigandhāni bhavanti ca||
5.1.47| gandhavarṇarasairhīnāḥ sarve bhakṣyāḥ phalāni ca|
pakvānyāśu viśīryante pākamāmāni yānti ca||
5.1.48| viśīryate kūrcakastu dantakāṣṭhagate viṣe|
jihvādantauṣṭhamāṃsānāṃ śvayathuścopajāyate||
5.1.49| athāsya dhātakīpuṣpapathyājambūphalāsthibhiḥ|
sakṣaudraiḥ pracchite śophe kartavyaṃ pratisāraṇam||
5.1.50| athāvā 'ṅkoṭhamūlāni tvacaḥ saptacchadasya vā|
śirīṣamāṣakā vā 'pi sakṣaudrāḥ pratisāraṇam||
5.1.51| jihvānirlekhavalau dantakāṣṭhavadādiśet|
picchilo bahulo 'bhyaṅgo vivarṇo vā viṣānvitaḥ||
5.1.52| sphoṭajanmarujāsrāvatvakpākaḥ svedanaṃ jvaraḥ|
daraṇaṃ cāpi māṃsānāmabhyaṅge viṣasaṃyute||
5.1.53| tatra śītāmbusiktasya kartavyamanulepanam|
candanaṃ tagaraṃ kuṣṭhamuśīraṃ veṇupatrikā||
5.1.54| somavallyamṛtā śvetā padmaṃ kālīyakaṃ tvacam|
kapittharasamūtrābhyāṃ pānametacca yujyate||
5.1.55| utsādane parīṣeke kaṣāye cānulepane|
śayyāvastratanutreṣu jñeyamabhyaṅgalakṣaṇaiḥ||
5.1.56| keśaśātaḥ śiroduḥkhaṃ khebhyaśca rudhirāgamaḥ|
granthijanmottamāṅgeṣu viṣajuṣṭe 'valekhane||
5.1.57| pralepo bahuśastatra bhavitāḥ kṛṣṇamṛttikāḥ|
ṛṣyapittaghṛtaśyāmāpālindītaṇḍulīyakaiḥ||
5.1.58| gomayasvaraso vā 'pi hito vā mālatīrasaḥ|
raso mūṣikaparṇyā vā dhūmo vā 'gārasaṃbhavaḥ||
5.1.59| śiro 'bhyaṅgaḥ śirastrāṇaṃ snānamuṣṇīṣameva ca|
srajaśca viṣasaṃsṛṣṭāḥ sādhayedavalekhanāt||
5.1.60| mukhālepe mukhaṃ śyāvaṃ yuktamabhyaṅgalakṣaṇaiḥ|
padminīkaṇṭakaprakhyaiḥ kaṇṭakaiścopacīyate||
5.1.61| tatra kṣaudraghṛtaṃ pānaṃ pralepaścandanaṃ ghṛtam|
payasyā madhukaṃ phañjī bandhujīvaḥ punarnavā||
5.1.62| asvāsthyaṃ kuñjarādīnāṃ lālāsrāvo 'kṣiraktatā|
sphikpāyumeḍhramuṣkeṣu yātuśca sphoṭasaṃbhavaḥ||
5.1.63| tatrābhyaṅgavadeveṣṭā yātṛvāhanayoḥ kriyā|
śoṇitāgamanaṃ khebhyaḥ śirorukkaphasṃsravaḥ||
5.1.64| nasyadhūmagate liṅgamindiryāṇāṃ ca vaikṛtam|
tatra dugdhairgavādīnāṃ sarpiḥ sātiviṣaiḥ śṛtam||
5.1.65| pāne nasye ca saśvetaṃ hitaṃ samadayantikam|
gandhahānirvivarṇatvaṃ puṣpāṇāṃ mlānatā bhavet||
5.1.66| jighrataśca śiroduḥkhaṃ vāripūrṇe ca locane|
tatra bāṣperitaṃ karma mukhālepe ca yat smṛtam||
5.1.67| karṇatailagate śrotravaiguṇyaṃ śophavedane|
karṇasrāvaśca tatrāśu kartavyaṃ pratipūraṇam||
5.1.68| svaraso bahuputrāyāḥ saghṛtaḥ kṣaudrasaṃyutaḥ|
somavalkarasaścāpi suśīto hita iṣyate||
5.1.69| aśrūpadeho dāhaśca vedanā dṛṣṭivibhramaḥ|
añjane viṣasaṃsṛṣṭe bhavedāndhyamathāpi ca||
5.1.70| tatra sadyo ghṛtaṃ peyaṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca samāgadham|
añjanaṃ meṣaśṛṅgasya niryāso varuṇasya ca||
5.1.71| muṣkakasyājakarṇasya pheno gopittasaṃyutaḥ|
kapitthameṣaśṛṅgyośca puṣpaṃ bhallātakasya vā||
5.1.72| ekaikaṃ kārayet puṣpaṃ bandhūkāṅkoṭayorapi|
śophaḥ srāvastathā svāpaḥ pādayoḥ sphoṭajanma ca||
5.1.73| bhavanti viṣajuṣṭābhyāṃ pādukābhyāmasaṃśayam|
upānatpādapīṭhāni pādukāvat prasādhayet||
5.1.74| bhūṣaṇāni hatārcīṃṣi na vibhānti yathā purā|
svāni sthānāni hanyuśca dāhapākāvadāraṇaiḥ||
5.1.75| pādukābhūṣaṇeṣūktamabhyaṅgavidhimācaret|
viṣopasargo bāṣpādirbhūṣaṇānto ya īritaḥ||
5.1.76| samīkṣyopadravāṃstasya vidadhīta cikitsitam|
mahāsugandhimagadaṃ yaṃ pravakṣyāmi taṃ bhiṣak||
5.1.77| pānālepananasyeṣu vidadhītāñjaneṣu ca|
virecanāni tīkṣṇāni kuryāt pracchardanāni ca||
5.1.78| sirāśca vyadhayet kṣipraṃ prāptaṃ visrāvaṇaṃ yadi|
mūsikā 'jaruhā vā 'pi haste baddhā tu bhūpateḥ||
5.1.79| karoti nirviṣaṃ sarvamannaṃ viṣasamāyutam|
hṛdayāvaraṇaṃ nityaṃ kuryācca mitramadhyagaḥ||
5.1.80| pibedghṛtamajeyākhyamamṛtākhyaṃ ca buddhimān|
sarpirdadhi payaḥ kṣaudraṃ pibedvā śītalaṃ jalam||
5.1.81| mayūrānnakulān godhāḥ pṛṣatān hariṇānapi|
satataṃ bhakṣayeccāpi rasāṃsteṣāṃ pibedapi||
5.1.82| godhānakulamāṃseṣu hariṇasya ca buddhimān|
dadyāt supiṣṭāṃ pālindīṃ madhukaṃ śarkarāṃ tathā||
5.1.83| śarkarātiviṣe deye māyūre samahauṣadhe|
pārṣate cāpi deyāḥ syuḥ pippalyaḥ samahauṣadhāḥ||
5.1.84| sakṣaudraḥ saghṛtaścaiva śimbīyūṣo hitaḥ sadā|
viṣaghnāni ca seveta bhakṣyabhojyāni buddhimān||
5.1.85| pippalīmadhukakṣaudraśarkarekṣurasāmbubhiḥ|
chardayedguptahṛdayo bhakṣitaṃ yadi vai viṣam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne 'nnapānarakṣākalpo nāma prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ||

dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.2.1| athātaḥ sthāvaraviṣavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.2.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
5.2.3| sthābaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ caiva dvividhaṃ viṣamucyate|
daśādhiṣṭhānamādyaṃ tu dvitīyaṃ ṣoḍaśāśrayam||
5.2.4| mūlaṃ patraṃ phalaṃ puṣpaṃ tvak kṣīraṃ sāra eva ca|
niryāso dhātavaścaiva kandaśca daśamaḥ smṛtaḥ||
5.2.5| tatra klītakāśvamāraguñjāsugandhagargarakakaraghāṭavidyucchikhāvijayānītyaṣṭau mūlaviṣāṇi; viṣapatrikālambāvaradārukarambhamahākarambhāṇi pañca patraviṣāṇi; kumudvatīveṇukākarambhamahākarambhakarkoṭakareṇukakhadyotakacarmarībhagandhāsarpaghātinandanasārapākānīti dvādaśa phalaviṣāṇi; vetrakādambavallījakarasbhamahākarambhāṇi pañca puṣpaviṣāṇi; antrapācakakartarīyasaurīyakakaraghāṭakarambhanandananārācakāni sapta tvaksāraniryāsaviṣāṇi; kumudaghnīsnuhījālakṣīrīṇi trīṇi kṣīraviṣāṇi; phenāśma(bhasma)haritālaṃ ca dve dhātuviṣe; kālakūṭavatsanābhasarṣapapālakakardamakavairāṭakamustakaśṛṅgīviṣaprapuṇḍarīkamūlakahālāhalamahāviṣakarkaṭakānīti trayodaśa kandaviṣāṇi; ityevaṃ pañcapañcāśat sthāvaraviṣāṇi bhavanti||
5.2.6| catvāri vatsanābhāni mustake dve prakīrtite|
ṣaṭ caiva sarṣapāṇyāhuḥ śeṣāṇyekaikameva tu||
5.2.7| udveṣṭanaṃ mūlaviṣaiḥ pralāpo moha eva ca|
jṛmbhāṅgodveṣṭanaśvāsā jñeyāḥ patraviṣeṇa tu||
5.2.8| muṣkaśophaḥ phalaviṣairdāho 'nnadveṣa eva ca|
bhavet puṣpaviṣaiśchardirādhmānaṃ moha eva ca||
5.2.9| tvaksāraniryāsaviṣairupayuktairbhavanti hi|
āsyadaurgandhyapāruṣyaśirorukkaphasaṃsravāḥ||
5.2.10| phenāgamaḥ kṣīraviṣairviḍbhedo gurujihvatā|
hṛtpīḍanaṃ dhātuviṣairmūrcchā dāhaśca tāluni||
5.2.11| prāyeṇa kālaghātīni viṣāṇyetāni nirdiśet|
kandajāni tu tīkṣṇāni teṣāṃ vakṣyāmi vistaram||
5.2.12| sparśājñānaṃ kālakūṭe vepathuḥ stambha eva ca|
grīvāstambho vatsanābhe pītaviṇmūtranetratā||
5.2.13| sarṣape vātavaiguṇyamānāho granthijanma ca|
grīvādaurbalyavāksaṅgau pālake 'numatāviha||
5.2.14| prasekaḥ kardamākhyena viṅbhedo netrapītatā|
vairāṭakenāṅgaduḥkhaṃ śirorogaśca jāyate||
5.2.15| gātrastambho vepathuśca jāyate mustakena tu|
śṛṅgīviṣeṇāṅgasādadāhodaravivṛddhayaḥ||
5.2.16| puṇḍarīkeṇa raktatvamakṣṇorvṛddhistathodare|
vaivarṇyaṃ mūlakaiśchardirhikkāśophapramūḍhatāḥ||
5.2.17| cireṇocchvasiti śyāvo naro hālāhalena vai|
mahāviṣeṇa hṛdaye granthiśūlodgamau bhṛśam||
5.2.18| karkaṭenotpatatyūrdhvaṃ hasan dantān daśatyapi|
kandajānyugravīryāṇi pratyuktāni trayodaśa||
5.2.19| sarvāṇi kuśalairjñeyānyetāni daśabhirguṇaiḥ|
rūkṣamuṣṇaṃ tathā tīkṣṇaṃ sūkṣmamāśuvyavāyi ca||
5.2.20| vikāśi viśadaṃ caiva laghvapāki ca tat smṛtam|
tadraukṣyāt kopayedvāyumauṣṇyāt pittaṃ saśoṇitam||
5.2.21| matiṃ ca mohayettaikṣṇyānmarmabandhān chinatti ca|
śarīrāvayavān saukṣmyāt praviśedvikaroti ca||
5.2.22| āśutvādāśu taddhanti vyavāyāt prakṛtiṃ bhajet|
kṣapayecca vikāśitvāddoṣāndhātūnmalānapi||
5.2.23| vaiśadyādatiricyeta duścikitsyaṃ ca lāghavāt|
durharaṃ cāvipākitvāttasmāt kleśayate ciram||
5.2.24| sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ yacca kṛtrimaṃ cāpi yadviṣam|
sadyo vyāpādayettattu jñeyaṃ daśaguṇānvitam||
5.2.25| yat sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamakṛtrimaṃ vā dehādaśeṣaṃ yadanirgataṃ tat|
jīrṇaṃ viṣaghnauṣadhibhirhataṃ vā dāvāgnivātātapaśoṣitaṃ vā||
5.2.26| svabhāvato vā guṇaviprahīnaṃ viṣaṃ hi dūṣīviṣatāmupaiti|
vīryālpamāvānna nipātayettat kaphāvṛtaṃ varṣagaṇānubandhi||
5.2.27| tenārdito bhinnapurīṣavarṇo vigandhavairasyamukhaḥ pipāsī|
mūrcchan vaman gadgadavāgviṣaṇṇo bhavecca duṣyodaraliṅgajuṣṭaḥ||
5.2.28| āmāśayasthe kaphavātarogī pakvāśayasthe 'nilapittarogī|
bhavennaro dhvastaśiroruhāṅgo vilūnapakṣastu yathā vihaṅgaḥ||
5.2.29| sthitaṃ rasādiṣvathavā yathoktān karoti dhātuprabhavān vikārān|
kopaṃ ca śītāniladurdineṣu yātyāśu pūrvaṃ śṛṇu tatra rūpam||
5.2.30| nidrā gurutvaṃ ca vijṛmbhaṇaṃ ca viśleṣaharṣāvathavā 'ṅgamardaḥ|
tataḥ karotyannamadāvipākāvarocakaṃ maṇḍalakoṭhamohān||
5.2.31| dhātukṣayaṃ pādakarāsyaśophaṃ dakodaraṃ chardimathātisāram|
vaivarṇyamūrcchāviṣamajvarān vā kuryāt pravṛddhāṃ prabalāṃ tṛṣāṃ vā||
5.2.32| unmādamanyajjanayettathā 'nyadānāhamanyat kṣapayecca śukram|
gādgadyamanyajjanayecca kuṣṭhaṃ tāṃstān vikārāṃśca bahuprakārān||
5.2.33| dūṣitaṃ deśakālānnadivāsvapnairabhīkṣṇaśaḥ|
yasmāddūṣayate dhātūn tasmāddūṣīviṣaṃ smṛtam||
5.2.34| sthāvarasyopayuktasya vege tu prathame nṛṇām|
śyāvā jihvā bhavetstabdhā mūrcchā śvāsaśca jāyate||
5.2.35| dvitīye vepathuḥ sādo dāhaḥ kaṇṭharujastathā|
viṣamāmāśayaprāptaṃ kurute hṛdi vedanām||
5.2.36| tāluśoṣaṃ tṛtīye tu śūlaṃ cāmāśaye bhṛśam|
durvarṇe harite śūne jāyete cāsya locane||
5.2.37| pakvāmāśayayostodo hikkā kāso 'ntrakūjanam|
caturthe jāyate vege śirasaścātigauravam||
5.2.38| kaphapraseko vaivarṇyaṃ parvabhedaśca pañcame|
sarvadoṣaprakopaśca pakvādhāne ca vedanā||
5.2.39| ṣaṣṭhe prajñāpraṇāśaśca bhṛśaṃ cāpyatisāryate|
skandhapṛṣṭhakaṭībhaṅgaḥ sannirodhaśca saptame||
5.2.40| prathame viṣavege tu vānte śītāmbusecitam|
agadaṃ madhusarpirbhyāṃ pāyayeta samāyutam||
5.2.41| dvitīye pūrvavadvāntaṃ pāyayettu virecanam|
tṛtīye 'gadapānaṃ tu hitaṃ nasyaṃ tathā 'ñjanam||
5.2.42| caturthe snehasaṃmiśraṃ pāyayetāgadaṃ bhiṣak|
pañcame kṣaudramadhukakvāthayuktaṃ pradāpayet||
5.2.43| ṣaṣṭhe 'tīsāravat siddhiravapīḍaśca saptame|
mūrdhni kākapadaṃ kṛtvā sāsṛgvā piśitaṃ kṣipet||
5.2.44| vegāntare tvanyatame kṛte karmaṇi śītalām|
yavāgūṃ saghṛtakṣaudrāmimāṃ dadyādviṣāpahām||
5.2.45| koṣātakyo 'gnikaḥ pāṭhāsūryavallyamṛtābhayāḥ|
śirīṣaḥ kiṇihī śelurgiryāhvā rajanīdvayam||
5.2.46| punarnave hareṇuśca trikaṭuḥ sārive balā|
eṣāṃ yavāgūrniṣkvāthe kṛtā hanti viṣadvayam||
5.2.47| madhukaṃ tagaraṃ kuṣṭhaṃ bhadradāru hareṇavaḥ|
punnāgailailavālūni nāgapuṣpotpalaṃ sitā||
5.2.48| viḍaṅgaṃ candanaṃ patraṃ priyaṅgurdhyāmakaṃ tathā|
haridre dve bṛhatyau ca sārive ca sthirā sahā||
5.2.49| kalkaireṣāṃ ghṛtaṃ siddhamajeyamiti viśrutam|
viṣāṇi hanti sarvāṇi śīghramevājitaṃ kvacit||
5.2.50| dūṣīviṣārtaṃ susvinnamūrdhvaṃ cādhaśca śodhitam|
pāyayetāgadaṃ nityamimaṃ dūṣiviṣāpaham||
5.2.51| pippalyo dhyāmakaṃ māṃsī śāvaraḥ paripelavam|
suvarcikā sasūkṣmailā toyaṃ kanakagairikam||
5.2.52| kṣaudrayukto 'gado hyeṣa dūṣīviṣamapohati|
nāmnā dūṣīviṣāristu na cānyatrāpi vāryate||
5.2.53| jvare dāhe ca hikkāyāmānāhe śukrasaṃkṣaya|
śophe 'tisāre mūrcchāyāṃ hṛdroge jaṭhare 'pi ca||
5.2.54| unmāde vepathau caiva ye cānye syurupadravāḥ|
yathāsvaṃ teṣu kurvīta viṣaghnairauṣadhaiḥ kriyām||
5.2.55| sādhyamātmavataḥ sadyo yāpyaṃ savatsarotthitam|
dūṣīviṣamasādhyaṃ tu kṣīṇasyāhitasevinaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne sthāvaraviṣavijñānīyo nāma dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ||2||

tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.3.1| athāto 1jaṅgamaviṣavijñānīyaṃ kalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.3.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
5.3.3| jaṅgamasya viṣasyoktānyadhiṣṭhānāni ṣoḍaśa|
samāsena mayā yāni vistarasteṣu vakṣyate||
5.3.4| tatra dṛṣṭiniḥśvāsadaṃṣṭrānakhamūtrapurīṣaśukralālārtavamukhasandaṃśaviśardhitatuṇḍāsthipittaśūkaśavānīti1||
5.3.5| tatra dṛṣṭiniḥśvāsaviṣā divyāḥ sarpāḥ, bhaumāstu daṃṣṭrāviṣāḥ, mārjāraśvavānaramakaramaṇḍūkapākamatsyagodhāśambūkapracalākagṛhagodhikācatuṣpādakīṭāstathā 'nye daṃṣṭrānakhaviṣāḥ, cipiṭapicciṭakakaṣāyavāsikasarṣapakatoṭakavarcaḥkīṭakauṇḍinyakāḥ śakṛnmūtraviṣāḥ, mūṣikāḥ śukraviṣāḥ, lūtā 1lālāmūtrapurīṣamukhasandaṃśanakhaśukrārtavaviṣāḥ, vṛścikaviśvambharavaraṭīrājīvamatsyocciṭiṅgāḥ samudravṛścikāścāla(ra)viṣāḥ, citraśiraḥsarāvakurdiśatadārukārimedakasārikāmukhā mukhasandaṃśaviśardhitamūtrapurīṣaviṣāḥ, makṣikākaṇabhajalāyukā mukhasandaṃśaviṣāḥ, viṣahatāsthi sarpakaṇṭakavaraṭīmatsyāsthi cetyasthiviṣāṇi, śakulīmatsyaraktarājivarakī(ṭī)matsyāśca pittaviṣāḥ, sūkṣmatuṇḍocciṭiṅgavaraṭīśatapadīśūkavalabhikāśṛṅgibhramarāḥ śūkatuṇḍaviṣāḥ, kīṭasarpadehā gatāsavaḥ śavaviṣāḥ; śeṣāstvanuktā mukhasandaṃśaviṣeṣveva gaṇayitavyāḥ||
5.3.6| bhavanti cātra
rājño 'rideśe ripavastṛṇāmbumārgānnadhūmaśvasanān viṣeṇa|
saṃdūṣayantyebhiratipraduṣṭān vijñāya liṅgairabhiśodhayettān||
5.3.7| duṣṭaṃ jalaṃ picchilamugragandhi phenānvitaṃ rājibhirāvṛtaṃ ca|
maṇḍūkamatsyaṃ mriyate vihaṅgā mattāśca sānūpacarā bhramanti||
5.3.8| majjanti ye cātra narāśvanāgāste chardimohajvaradāhaśophān|
ṛcchanti(gacchanti) teṣāmapahṛtya 1doṣān duṣṭaṃ jalaṃ śodhayituṃ yateta||
5.3.9| dhavāśvakarṇāsanapāribhadrān sapāṭalān siddhakamokṣakau ca|
dagdhvā sarājadrumasomavalkāṃstadbhasma śītaṃ vitaret saraḥsu||
5.3.10| bhasmāñjaliṃ cāpi ghaṭe nidhāya viśodhayedīpsitamevamambhaḥ|
kṣitipradeśaṃ viṣadūṣitaṃ tu 1śilātalaṃ tīrthamatheriṇaṃ vā||
5.3.11| spṛśanti gātreṇa tu yena yena govājināgoṣṭrakharā narā vā|
tacchūnatāṃ yāstyatha dahyate ca viśīryate romanakhaṃ tathaiva||
5.3.12| tatrāpyanantāṃ saha sarvagandhaiḥ piṣṭvā surābhirviniyojya mārgam|
siñcet payobhiḥ sumṛdanvitaistaṃ viḍaṅgapāṭhākaṭabhījalairvā||
5.3.13| tṛṇeṣu bhakteṣu ca dūṣiteṣu sīdanti mūrcchanti vamanti cānye|
viḍbhedamṛcchantyathavā mriyante teṣāṃ cikitsāṃ praṇayedyathoktām||
5.3.14| viṣāpahairvā 'pyagadairvilipya vādyāni citrāṇyapi vādayeta|
tāraḥ sutāraḥ sasurendragopaḥ sarvaiśca tulyaḥ kuruvindabhāgaḥ||
5.3.15| pittena yuktaḥ kapilānvayena vādyapralepo vihitaḥ praśastaḥ|
vādyasya śabdena hi yānti nāśaṃ viṣāṇi ghorāṇyapi yāni 1santi||
5.3.16| dhūme 'nile vā viṣasaṃprayukte khagāḥ śramārtāḥ prapatanti bhūmau|
kāsapratiśyāyaśirorujaśca bhavanti tīvrā nayanāmayāśca||
5.3.17| lākṣāharidrātiviṣābhayābdahareṇukailādalavakrakuṣṭham|
priyaṅgukāṃ cāpyanale nidhāya dhūmānilau cāpi viśodhayeta||
5.3.18| prajāmimāmātmayonerbrahmaṇaḥ sṛjataḥ kila|
akarodasuro vighnaṃ kaiṭabho nāma darpitaḥ||
5.3.19| tasya kruddhasya vai vaktrādbrahmaṇastejaso nidheḥ|
krodho vigrahavān bhūtvā nipapātātidāruṇaḥ||
5.3.20| sa taṃ dadāha garjantamantakābhaṃ mahābalam|
tato 'suraṃ ghātayitvā tattejo 'vardhatādbhutam||
5.3.21| tato viṣādo devānāmabhavattaṃ nirīkṣya vai|
viṣādajananatvācca viṣamityabhidhīyate||
5.3.22| tataḥ sṛṣṭvā prajāḥ śeṣaṃ tadā taṃ krodhamīśvaraḥ|
vinyastavān sa bhūtesu sthāvareṣu careṣu ca||
5.3.23| yathā 'vyaktarasaṃ toyamantarīkṣānmahīgatam|
teṣu teṣu pradeśeṣu rasaṃ taṃ taṃ niyacchati||
5.3.24| evameva viṣaṃ yadyaddravyaṃ vyāpyāvatiṣṭhate|
svabhavādeva taṃ tasya rasaṃ samanuvartate||
5.3.25| viṣe yasmādguṇāḥ sarve tīkṣṇāḥ prāyeṇa santi hi|
viṣaṃ sarvamato jñeyaṃ sarvadoṣaprakopaṇam||
5.3.26| te tu vṛttiṃ prakupitā jahati svāṃ viṣārditāḥ|
nopayati viṣaṃ pākamataḥ prāṇān ruṇaddhi ca||
5.3.27| śleṣmaṇā++āvṛtamārgatvāducchvāso 'sya nirudhyate|
visaṃjñaḥ sati jīve 'pi tasmāttiṣṭhati mānavaḥ||
5.3.28| śukravat sarvasarpāṇāṃ viṣaṃ sarvaśarīragam|
kruddhānāmeti cāṅgebhyaḥ śukraṃ nirmanthanādiva||
5.3.29| teṣāṃ baḍiśavaddaṃṣṭrāstāsu sajjati cāgatam|
anudvṛttā viṣaṃ tasmānna muñcanti ca bhoginaḥ||
5.3.30| yasmādatyarthamuṣṇaṃ ca tīkṣṇaṃ ca paṭhitaṃ viṣam|
ataḥ sarvaviṣeṣūktaḥ pariṣekastu śītalaḥ||
5.3.31| mandaṃ kīṭeṣu nātyuṣṇaṃ bahuvātakaphaṃ viṣam|
ataḥ kīṭaviṣe cāpi svedo na pratiṣidhyate||
5.3.32| kīṭairdaṣṭānugraviṣaiḥ sarpavat samupācaret|
svabhāvādeva tiṣṭhettu prahārādaṃśayorviṣam||
5.3.33| vyāpya sāvayavaṃ dehaṃ digdhaviddhāhidaṣṭayoḥ|
laulyādviṣānvitaṃ māṃsaṃ yaḥ khādenmṛtamātrayoḥ||
5.3.34| yathāviṣaṃ sa rogeṇa kliśyate mriyate 'pi vā|
ataścāpyanayormāṃsamabhakṣyaṃ mṛtamātrayoḥ||
5.3.35| muhūrtāttadupādeyaṃ prahārādaṃśabarjitam|
savātaṃ gṛhadhūmābhaṃ purīṣaṃ yo 'tisāryate||
5.3.36| ādhmāto 'tyarthamuṣṇāsro vivarṇaḥ sādapīḍitaḥ|
udvamatyatha phenaṃ ca viṣapītaṃ tamādiśet||
5.3.37| na cāsya hṛdayaṃ vahnirviṣajuṣṭaṃ dahatyapi|
taddhi sthānaṃ cetanāyāḥ svabhavādvyāpya tiṣṭhiti||
5.3.38| aśvatthadevāyatanaśmaśānavalmīkasandhyāsu catuṣpatheṣu|
yāmye sapitrye parivarjanīyā ṛkṣe narā marmasu ye ca daṣṭāḥ||
5.3.39| darvīkarāṇāṃ viṣamāśughāti sarvāṇi coṣṇe dviguṇībhavanti|
ajīrṇapittātapapīḍiteṣu bālapramehiṣvatha garbhiṇīṣu||
5.3.40| vṛddhāturakṣīṇabubhukṣiteṣu rūkṣeṣu bhīruṣvatha durdineṣu|
śastrakṣate yasya na raktameti rājyo latābhiśca na saṃbhavanti||
5.3.41| śītābhiradbhiśca na romaharṣo viṣābhibhūtaṃ parivarjayettam|
jihvā sitā yasya ca keśaśāto nāsāvabhaṅgaśca sakaṇṭhabhaṅgaḥ||
5.3.42| kṛṣṇaḥ saraktaḥ śvayathuśca daṃśe hanvoḥ sthiratvaṃ ca sa varjanīyaḥ|
vartirghanā yasya nireti vaktrādraktaṃ sravedūrdhvamadhaśca yasya||
5.3.43| daṃṣṭrānipātāḥ sakalāśca yasya taṃ cāpi vaidyaḥ parivarjayettu|
unmattamatyarthamupadrutaṃ vā hīnasvaraṃ vā 'pyathavā vivarṇam||
5.3.44| sāriṣṭamatyarthamaveginaṃ ca jahyānnaraṃ tatra na karma kuryāt||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne jaṅgamaviṣavijñānīyo nāma tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ||3||

caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.4.1| athātaḥ sarpadaṣṭaviṣavijñānīyaṃ 1kalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.4.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvanatariḥ||
5.4.3| dhanvantariṃ mahāprājñaṃ sarvaśāstraviśārada|
pādayorupasaṃgṛhya suśrutaḥ paripṛcchati||
5.4.4| sarpasaṃkhyāṃ vibhāgaṃ ca daṣṭalakṣaṇameva ca|
jñānaṃ ca viṣavegānāṃ bhagavan vaktumarhasi||
5.4.5| tasya tadvacanaṃ śrutvā prābravīdbhiṣajāṃ varaḥ|
asaṃkhyā 1vāsukiśreṣṭhā vikhyātāstakṣakādayaḥ||
5.4.6| mahīdharāśca nāgendrā hutāgnisamatejasaḥ|
ye cāpyajasraṃ garjanti varṣanti ca tapanti ca||
5.4.7| sasāgaragiridvīpā yairiyaṃ dhāryate mahī|
kruddhā niḥśvāsadṛṣṭibhyāṃ ye hanyurakhilaṃ jagat||
5.4.8| namastebhyo 'sti no teṣāṃ kāryaṃ kiñciccikitsayā|
ye tu daṃṣṭrāviṣā bhaumā ye daśanti ca mānuṣān||
5.4.9| teṣāṃ saṅkhyāṃ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadanupūrvaśaḥ|
aśītistveva sarpāṇāṃ bhidyate pañcadhā tu sā||
5.4.10| darvīkarā maṇḍalino rājimantastathaiva ca|
nirviṣā vaikarañjāśca trividhāste punaḥ smṛtāḥ||
5.4.11| darvīkarā maṇḍalino rājimantaśca 1pannagāḥ|
teṣu darvīkarā jñeyā viṃśatiḥ ṣaṭ ca pannagāḥ||
5.4.12| dvāviṃśatirmaṇḍalino rājimantastathā daśa|
nirviṣā dvādaśa jñeyā vaikarañjāstrayastathā||
5.4.13| vaikarañjodbhavāḥ sapta citrā1 maṇḍalirājilāḥ|
pādābhimṛṣṭā duṣṭā vā kruddhā grāsārthino 'pi vā||
5.4.14| te daśanti mahākrodhāstrividhaṃ1 bhīmadarśanāḥ|
sarpitaṃ raditaṃ cāpi tṛtīyamatha nirviṣam|
sarpāṅgābhihataṃ kecidicchanti khalu tadvidaḥ||
5.4.15| padāni yatra dantānāmekaṃ dve vā bahūni vā|
nimagnānyalparaktāni yānyudvṛtya karoti hi||
5.4.16| cañcumālakayuktāni vaikṛtyakaraṇāni ca|
saṅkṣiptāni saśophāni vidyāttat sarpitaṃ bhiṣak||
5.4.17| rājyaḥ salohitā yatra nīlāḥ pītāḥ sitāstathā|
vijñeyaṃ raditaṃ 1tattu jñeyamalpaviṣaṃ ca tat||
5.4.18| aśophamalpaduṣṭāsṛk prakṛtisthasya dehinaḥ|
padaṃ padāni vā vidyādaviṣaṃ taccikitsakaḥ||
5.4.19| sarpaspṛṣṭasya bhīrorhi bhayena kupito 'nilaḥ|
kasyacit kurute śophaṃ sarpāṅgābhihataṃ tu tat||
5.4.20| vyādhitodvigradaṣṭāni jñeyānyalpaviṣāṇi tu|
tathā 'tivṛddhabālābhidaṣṭamalpaviṣaṃ smṛtam||
5.4.21| suparṇadevabrahmarṣiyakṣasiddhaniṣevite|
viṣaghnauṣadhiyukte ca deśe na kramate viṣam||
5.4.22| rathāṅgalāṅgalacchatrasvastikāṅkuśadhāriṇaḥ|
jñeyā darvīkarāḥ sarpāḥ phaṇinaḥ śīghragāminaḥ||
5.4.23| maṇḍalairvividhaiścaitrāḥ pṛthavo mandagāminaḥ|
jñeyā maṇḍalinaḥ sarpā 1jvalanārkasamaprabhāḥ||
5.4.24| snigdhā vividhavarṇābhistiryagūrdhvaṃ ca rājibhiḥ|
citritā iva ye bhānti rājimantastu te smṛtāḥ||
5.4.25| muktārūpyaprabhā ye ca kapilā ye ca pannagāḥ|
sugandhayaḥ suvarṇābhāste jātyā brāhmaṇāḥ smṛtāḥ||
5.4.26| kṣatriyāḥ snigdhavarṇāstu pannagā bhṛśakopanāḥ|
sūryacandrākṛticchatralakṣma teṣāṃ tathā 'mbujam||
5.4.27| kṛṣṇā 1vajranibhā ye ca lohitā varṇatastathā|
dhūmrāḥ pārāvatābhāśca vaiśyāste pannagāḥ smṛtāḥ||
5.4.28| mahiṣadvīpivarṇābhāstathaiva paruṣatvacaḥ|
bhinnavarṇāśca ye kecicchūdrāte parikīrtitāḥ||
5.4.29| kopayantyanilaṃ jantoḥ phaṇinaḥ sarva eva tu|
pittaṃ maṇḍalinaścāpi kaphaṃ cānekarājayaḥ||
5.4.30| apatyamasavarṇābhyāṃ dvidoṣakaralakṣaṇam|
jñeyau doṣaiśca dampatyorviśeṣaścātra vakṣyate||
5.4.31| rajanyāḥ paścime yāme sarpāścitrāścaranti hi|
śeṣeṣūktā maṇḍalino divā darvīkarāḥ smṛtāḥ||
5.4.32| darvīkarāstu taruṇā vṛddhā maṇḍalinastathā|
rājimanto vayomadhyā jāyante mṛtyuhetavaḥ||
5.4.33| nakulākulitā bālā vāriviprahatāḥ kṛśāḥ|
vṛddhāmuktatvaco bhītāḥ sarpāstvalpaviṣāḥ smṛtāḥ||
5.4.34| tatra darvīkarāḥ kṛṣṇasarpo, mahākṛṣṇaḥ, kṛṣṇodaraḥ śvetakapoto, mahākapoto, balāhako, mahāsarpaḥ, śaṅkhakapālo1, lohitākṣo, gavedhukaḥ, parisarpaḥ, khaṇḍaphaṇaḥ, kakudaḥ, padmo, mahāpadmo, darbhapuṣpo, dadhimukhaḥ, puṇḍarīko, bhrūkuṭīmukho, viṣkiraḥ, puṣpābhikīrṇo, girisarpaḥ, ṛjusarpaḥ, śvetodaro, mahāśirā, alagarda, aśīviṣa iti (1);
maṇḍalinastu ādarśamaṇḍalaḥ, śvetamaṇḍalo, raktamaṇḍalaḥ, citramaṇḍalaḥ, pṛṣato, rodhrapuṣpo, milindako, gonaso, vṛddhagonasaḥ, panaso, mahāpanaso, veṇupatrakaḥ, śiśuko madanaḥ, pālindiraḥ, piṅgalaḥ1, tantukaḥ puṣpapāṇḍuḥ, ṣaḍaṅgo, agniko babhruḥ, kaṣāyaḥ, kaluṣaḥ pārāvato, hastābharaṇaḥ, citrakaḥ, eṇīpada iti (2);
rājimantastu puṇḍarīko rājicitro, aṅgularājiḥ, bindurājiḥ, kardamakaḥ, tṛṇaśoṣakaḥ, sarṣapakaḥ śvetahanuḥ, darbhapuṣpaścakrako, godhūmakaḥ, kikkisāda iti (3);
nirviṣāstu galagolī, śūkapatro, ajagaro, divyako, varṣāhikaḥ, puṣpaśakalī, jyotīrathaḥ, kṣīrikāpuṣpako, ahipatāko, andhāhiko, gaurāhiko, vṛkṣeśaya iti (4);
vaikarañjāstu trayāṇāṃ darvīkarādīnāṃ vyatikarājjātāḥ, tadyathā mākuliḥ, poṭagalaḥ, snigdharājiriti|
tatra kṛṣṇasarpeṇa gonasyāṃ vaiparītyena vā jāto mākuliḥ; rājilena gonasyāṃ vaiparītyena vā jātaḥ poṭagalaḥ; kṛṣṇasarpeṇa rājimatyāṃ vaiparītyena vā jātaḥ snigdharājiriti|
teṣāmādyasya pitṛvadviṣotkarṣo, dvayormātṛvadityeke (5);
trayāṇāṃ vaikarañjānāṃ punardivyelakarodhrapuṣpakarājicitrakapoṭagalapuṣpābhikīrṇadarṇadarbhapuṣpavellitakāḥ sapta; teṣāmādyāstrayo rājilavat, śeṣā maṇḍalivat, evameteṣāṃ sarpāṇāmaśītirvyākhyātā||
5.4.35| tatra mahānetrajihvāsyaśirasaḥ pumāṃsaḥ, sūkṣmanetrajihvāsyaśirasaḥ striyaḥ, ubhayalakṣaṇā mandavisā akrodhā napuṃsakā iti||
5.4.36| tatra sarveṣāṃ sarpāṇāṃ sāmānyata eva daṣṭalakṣaṇaṃ vakṣyāmaḥ|
kiṃ kāraṇaṃ viṣaṃ hi niśitanistriṃśāśanihutavahadeśyamāśukāri muhūrtamapyupekṣitamāturamatipātayati, na cāvakāśo 'sti vāksamūhamupasartuṃ pratyekamapi daṣṭalakṣaṇe 'bhihite 1sarvatra traividhyaṃ bhavati, tasmāt traividhyameva vakṣyāmaḥ; etaddhyāturahitamasaṃmohakaraṃ ca, api cātraiva sarvasarpavyañjanāvarodhaḥ||
5.4.37| tatra darvīkaraviṣeṇa tvaṅnayananakhadaśanavadanamūtrapurīṣadaṃśakṛṣṇatvaṃ raukṣyaṃ śiraso gauravaṃ sandhivedanā kaṭīpṛṣṭhagrīvādaurbalyaṃ jṛmbhaṇaṃ vepathuḥ svarāvasādo ghurghurako jaḍatā śuṣkodgāraḥ kāsaśvāsau hikkā vāyorūrdhvagamanaṃ śūlodveṣṭanaṃ tṛṣṇā lālāsrāvaḥ phenāgamanaṃ sroto 'varodhastāstāśca vātavedanā bhavanti; maṇḍaliviṣeṇa tvagādīnāṃ pītatvaṃ śītābhilāṣaḥ paridhūpanaṃ dāhastṛṣṇā mado mūrcchā jvaraḥ śoṇitāgamanamūrdhvamadhaśca māṃsānāmavaśātanaṃ śvayathurdaṃśakothaḥ pītarūpadarśanamāśukopastāstāśca pittavedanā bhavanti; rājimadviṣeṇa śuklatvaṃ tvagādīnāṃ śītajvaro romaharṣaḥ stabdhatvaṃ gātrāṇāmādaṃśaśophaḥ sāndrakaphaprasekaśchardirabhīkṣṇamakṣṇoḥ kaṇḍūḥ kaṇṭhe śvayathurghurghuraka ucchvāsanirodhastamaḥpraveśastāstāśca kaphavedanā bhavanti||
