drākṣā sugandhā nagavṛttikā ca śvetā 1samaṅgā samabhāgayuktā||
5.5.77| deyo dvibhāgaḥ surasācchadasya kapitthabilvādapi dāḍimācca|
1tathā 'rdhabhāgaḥ sitasindhuvārādaṅkoṭhamūlādapi gairikācca||
5.5.78| eṣo 'gadaḥ kṣaudrayuto nihanti viśeṣato maṇḍalināṃ viṣāṇi|
vaṃśatvagārdrā++āmalakaṃ kapitthaṃ kaṭutrikaṃ haimavatī sakuṣṭhā||
5.5.79| karañjabījaṃ tagaraṃ śirīṣapuṣpaṃ ca gopittayutaṃ nihanti|
viṣāṇi lūtondurapannagānāṃ kaiṭaṃ ca lepāñjananasyapānaiḥ||
5.5.80| pūrīṣamūtrānilagarbhasaṅgānnihanti vartyañjananābhilepaiḥ|
kācārmakothān paṭalāṃśca ghorān puṣpaṃ ca hantyañjananasyayogaiḥ||
5.5.81| samūlapuṣpāṅkuravalkabījāt kvāthaḥ śirīṣāt trikaṭupragāḍhaḥ|
salāvaṇaḥ kṣaudrayuto 'tha pīto viśeṣataḥ kīṭaviṣaṃ nihanti||
5.5.82| kuṣṭhaṃ trikaṭukaṃ dārvī madhukaṃ lavaṇadvayam|
mālatī nāgapuṣpaṃ ca sarvāṇi madhurāṇi ca||
5.5.83| kapittharasapiṣṭo 'yaṃ śarkarākṣaudrasaṃyutaḥ|
viṣaṃ hantyagadaḥ sarvaṃ mūṣikāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ||
5.5.84| 1somarājīphalaṃ puṣpaṃ kaṭabhī sindhuvārakaḥ|
corako varuṇaḥ kuṣṭhaṃ sarpagandhā sasaptalā||
5.5.85| punarnavā śirīṣasya puṣpamāragvadhārkajam|
śyāmā 'mbaṣṭhā viḍaṅgāni tathā 'mrāśmantakāni ca||
5.5.86| bhūmī kurabakaścaiva gaṇa ekasaraḥ smṛtaḥ|
ekaśo dvitriśo vā 'pi prayoktavyo viṣāpahaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne sarpadaṣṭaviṣacikitsitaṃ nāma pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ||5||

ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.6.1| athāto dundubhisvanīyaṃ 1kalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.6.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
