5.6.4| anena dundubhiṃ limpet patākāṃ toraṇāni ca|
śravaṇāddarśanāt sparśāt 1viṣāt saṃpratimucyate||
5.6.5| eṣa kṣārāgado nāma śarkarāsvaśmarīṣu ca|
arśaḥsu 1vātagulmeṣu kāsaśūlodareṣu ca||
5.6.6| ajīrṇe grahaṇīdoṣe bhaktadveṣe1 ca dāruṇe|
1śophe sarvasare cāpi deyaḥ śvāse ca dāruṇe||
5.6.7| sadā sarvaviṣārtānāṃ sarvayaivopayujyate|
eṣa takṣakamukhyānāmapi daryāṅkuśo 'gadaḥ||
5.6.8| viḍaṅgatriphalādantībhadradāruhareṇavaḥ|
tālīśapatramañjiṣṭhākeśarotpalapadmakam||
5.6.9| dāḍimaṃ mālatīpuṣpaṃ rajanyau sārive sthire|
priyaṅgustagaraṃ kuṣṭhaṃ bṛhatyau cailavālukam||
5.6.10| sacandanagavākṣībhiretaiḥ siddhaṃ viṣāpaham|
sarpiḥ kalpāṇakaṃ hyetadgrahāpasmāranāśanam||
5.6.11| pāṇḍvāmayagaraśvāsamandāgnijvarakāsanut|
śoṣiṇāmalpaśukrāṇāṃ vandhyānāṃ ca praśasyate||
5.6.12| apāmārgasya bījāni śirīṣasya ca māṣakān|
śvete dve kākamācīṃ ca gavāṃ mūtreṇa peṣayet||
5.6.13| sarpiretaistu saṃsiddhaṃ viṣasaṃśamanaṃ param|
amṛtaṃ nāma vikhyātamapi saṃjīvayenmṛtam||
5.6.14| candanāguruṇī kuṣṭhaṃ tagaraṃ tilaparṇikam|
1prapauṇḍarīkaṃ naladaṃ saralaṃ devadāru ca||
5.6.15| bhadraśriyaṃ yavaphalāṃ bhārgīṃ nīlīṃ sugandhikām|
kāleyakaṃ padmakaṃ ca madhukaṃ 1nāgaraṃ jaṭām||
5.6.16| punnāgailailavālūni gairikaṃ dhyāmakaṃ balām|
toyaṃ sarjarasaṃ māṃsīṃ śatapuṣpāṃ hareṇukām||
5.6.17| tālīśapatraṃ kṣudrailāṃ priyaṅguṃ sakuṭannaṭam|
śilāpuṣpaṃ saśaileyaṃ patraṃ kālānusārivām||
5.6.18| 1kaṭutrikaṃ śītaśivaṃ kāśmaryaṃ kaṭurohiṇīm|
somarājīmativiṣāṃ pṛthvikāmindravāruṇīm1||
5.6.19| uśīraṃ varuṇaṃ mustaṃ kustumburu nakhaṃ tathā|
śvete haridre sthauṇeyaṃ lākṣāṃ ca lavaṇāni ca||
5.6.20| kumudotpalapadmāni puṣpaṃ cāpi tathā 'rkajam|
campakāśokasumanastilvakaprasavāni ca||
5.6.21| pāṭalīśālmalīśailuśirīṣāṇāṃ tathaiva ca|
kusumaṃ tṛṇamūlyāśca surabhīsindhuvārajam1||
5.6.22| dhavāśvakarṇapārthānāṃ puṣpāṇi tiniśasya ca|
gugguluṃ kuṅkumaṃ bimbīṃ sarpākṣīṃ gandhanākulīm||
5.6.23| etat saṃbhṛtya saṃbhāraṃ sūkṣmacūrṇāni1 kārayet|
gopittamadhusarpirbhiryuktaṃ śṛṅge nidhāpayet||
5.6.24| bhagnaskandhaṃ vivṛtākṣaṃ mṛtyordaṃṣṭrāntaraṃ gatam|
anenāgadamukhyena 1manuṣyaṃ punarāharet||
5.6.25| eṣo 'gnikalpaṃ durvāraṃ kruddhasyāmitatejasaḥ|
viṣaṃ nāgapaterhanyāt prasabhaṃ vāsukerapi||
5.6.26| mahāsugandhināmā 'yaṃ pañcāśītyaṅgasaṃyutaḥ|
rājā 'gadānāṃ sarveṣāṃ rājño haste bhavet sadā||
5.6.27| 1snātānuliptastu nṛpo bhavet sarvajanapriyaḥ|
bhrājiṣṇutāṃ ca 1labhate śatrumadhyagato 'pi san||
5.6.28| uṣṇavarjyo vidhiḥ kāryo viṣārtānāṃ vijānatā|
muktvā kīṭaviṣaṃ taddhi śītenābhipravardhate||
5.6.29| annapānavidhāvuktamupadhārya śubhāśubham|
śubhaṃ deyaṃ viṣārtebhyo viruddhebhyaśca vārayet||
5.6.30| phāṇitaṃ śugrusauvīramajīrṇādhyaśanaṃ tathā|
varjayecca samāsena navadhānyādikaṃ gaṇam||
5.6.31| divāsvapnaṃ vyavāyaṃ ca vyāyāmaṃ krodhamātapam|
surātilakulatthāṃśca varjayeddhi viṣāturaḥ||
5.6.32| prasannadoṣaṃ prakṛtisthadhātumannābhikāṅkṣaṃ1 samasūtrajihvam|
1prasannavarṇendriyacittaceṣṭaṃ vaidyo 'vagacchedaviṣaṃ manuṣyam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne dundubhisvanīyakalpo nāma ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ||6||

saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.7.1| athāto mūṣikakalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
5.7.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
5.7.3| pūrvaṃ śukraviṣā uktā bhūṣikā ye samāsataḥ|
nāmalakṣaṇabhaiṣajyairaṣṭādaśa nibodha me1||
5.7.4| lālanaḥ putrakaḥ kṛṣṇo haṃsiraścikviras(haṃsiraścikkiras) tathā|
chucchundaro 'lasaścaiva kaṣāyadaśano 'pi ca||
5.7.5| kuliṅgaścājitaścaiva capalaḥ kapilastathā|
kokilo 'ruṇasaṃjñaśca mahākṛṣṇastathonduraḥ||
5.7.6| śvetena mahatā sārdhaṃ kapilenākhunā tathā|
mūṣikaśca kapotābhastathaivāṣṭādaśa smṛtāḥ||
5.7.7| śukraṃ patati yatraiṣāṃ śukraspṛṣṭaiḥ1 spṛśanti vā|
nakhadantādibhistasmin gātre raktaṃ praduṣyati||
5.7.8| jāyante granthayaḥ śophāḥ karṇikā maṇḍalāni ca|
pīḍakopacayaścogro visarpāḥ kiṭibhāni ca||
5.7.9| parvabhedo rujastīvrā 1mūrcchā 'ṅgasadanaṃ jvaraḥ|
daurbalyamaruciḥ śvāso vamathurlomaharṣaṇam||
5.7.10| daṣṭarūpaṃ samāsoktametadvyāsamataḥ1 śṛṇu|
lālāsrāvo lālanena hikkā chardiśca jāyate||
5.7.11| taṇḍulīyakakalkaṃ tu lihyāttatra samākṣikam|
putrakeṇāṅgasādaśca pāṇḍuvarṇaśca jāyate||
5.7.12| cīyate granthibhiścāṅgamākhuśāvakasannibhaiḥ|
śirīṣeṅgudakalkaṃ tu lihyāttatra samākṣikam||
5.7.13| 1kṛṣṇena daṃśe śopho 'sṛkchardiḥ prāyaśca durdine|
śirīṣaphalakuṣṭhaṃ tu pibet kiṃśukabhasmanā||
5.7.14| haṃsireṇānnavidveṣo jṛmbhā romṇāṃ ca harṣaṇam|
pibedāragvadhādiṃ tu suvāntastatra mānavaḥ||
5.7.15| cikvireṇa(cikkireṇa) śiroduḥkhaṃ śopho hikkā vamistathā|
jālinīmadanāṅkoṭhakaṣāyairvāmayettu tam||
5.7.16| yavanālarṣabhīkṣāraṃ bṛhatyoścātra dāpayet|
1chucchundareṇa taṭ chardirjvaro daurbalyameva ca||
5.7.17| grīvāstambhaḥ pṛṣṭhaśopho gandhājñānaṃ visūcikā|
cavyaṃ harītakī śuṇṭhī viḍaṅgaṃ pippalī madhu||
5.7.18| aṅkoṭhabījaṃ ca tathā pibedatra viṣāpaham|
grīvāstambho 'lasenordhvavāyurdaṃśe rujā jvaraḥ||
5.7.19| mahāgadaṃ sasarpiṣkaṃ lihyāttatra samākṣikam|
nidrā kaṣāyadantena hṛcchoṣaḥ kārśyameva ca||
5.7.20| kṣaudropetāḥ śirīṣasya lihyāt sāraphalatvacaḥ|
kuliṅgena rujaḥ1 śopho rājyaśca daṃśamaṇḍale||
5.7.21| sahe sasindhuvāre ca lihyāttatra samākṣike|
1ajitenāṅgakṛṣṇatvaṃ chardirmūrcchā ca hṛdgrahaḥ||
5.7.22| snukkṣīrapiṣṭāṃ pālindīṃ mañjiṣṭhāṃ madhunā lihet|
capalena bhavecchardirmūrcchā ca saha tṛṣṇayā||
5.7.23| 1kṣaudreṇa triphalāṃ lihyādbhadrakāṣṭhajaṭānvitām|
kapilena vraṇe kotho jvaro granthyudgamaḥ satṛṭ||
5.7.24| lihyānmadhuyutāṃ śvetāṃ śvetāṃ cāpi punarnavām|
granthayaḥ kokilenogrā jvaro dāhaśca dāruṇaḥ1||
5.7.25| varṣābhūnīlinīkvāthakalkasiddhaṃ ghṛtaṃ pibet|
aruṇenānilaḥ kruddho vātajān kurute gadān||
5.7.26| mahākṛṣṇena pittaṃ ca śvetena kapha eva ca|
mahatā kapilenāsṛk 1kapotena catuṣṭayam||
5.7.27| bhavanti caiṣāṃ daṃśeṣu granthimaṇḍalakarṇikāḥ|
piḍakopacayaścograḥ śophaśca bhṛśadāruṇaḥ||
5.7.28| dadhikṣīraghṛtaprasthāstrayaḥ pratyekaśo matāḥ|
karañjāragvadhavyoṣabṛhatyaṃśumatīsthirāḥ||
5.7.29| niṣkvāthya caiṣāṃ kvāthasya caturtho 'ṃśaḥ punarbhavet|
1trivṛdgojyamṛtāvakrasarpagandhāḥ samṛttikāḥ||
5.7.30| kapitthadāḍimatvak ca ślakṣṇapiṣṭāḥ1 pradāpayet|
tat sarvamekataḥ kṛtvā śanairmṛdvagninā pacet||
5.7.31| pañcānāmaruṇādīnāṃ viṣametadvyapohati|
kākādanīkākamācyoḥ svaraseṣvathavā kṛtam||
5.7.32| sirāśca 1srāvayet prāptāḥ kuryāt saṃśodhanāni ca|
sarveṣāṃ ca vidhiḥ kāryo mūṣikāṇāṃ viṣeṣvayam||
5.7.33| dagdhvā visrāvayeddaṃśaṃ pracchitaṃ ca pralepayet|
śirīṣarajanīkuṣṭhakuṅkumairamṛtāyutaiḥ||
5.7.34| chardanaṃ jālinīkvāthaiḥ śukākhyāṅkoṭhayorapi|
śukākhyākoṣavatyośca mūlaṃ madana eva ca||
5.7.35| devadālīphalaṃ caiva dadhnā pītvā viṣaṃ vamet|
sarvamūṣikadaṣṭānāmeṣa yogaḥ sukhāvahaḥ||
5.7.36| phalaṃ vacā devadālī kuṣṭhaṃ gomūtrapeṣitam|
pūrvakalpena yojyāḥ1 syuḥ sarvonduruviṣacchidaḥ||
5.7.37| virecane trivṛddantītriphalākalka iṣyate|
śirovirecane sāraḥ śirīṣasya phalāni ca||
5.7.38| hitastrikaṭukāḍhyaśca gomayasvaraso 'ñjane|
1kapitthagomayarasau lihyānmākṣikasaṃyutau||
5.7.39| rasāñjanaharidrendrayavakaṭvīṣu vā kṛtam|
prātaḥ sātiviṣaṃ kalkaṃ lihyānmākṣikasaṃyutam||
5.7.40| taṇḍulīyakamūleṣu sarpiḥ siddhaṃ pibennaraḥ|
āsphotamūlasiddhaṃ vā pañcakāpitthameva vā||
5.7.41| mūṣikāṇāṃ viṣaṃ prāyaḥ kupyatyabhreṣvanirhṛtam1|
tatrāpyeṣa vidhiḥ kāryo yaśca dūṣiviṣāpahaḥ||
5.7.42| sthirāṇāṃ rujatāṃ vā 'pi vraṇānāṃ karṇikāṃ bhiṣak|
pāṭayitvā yathādoṣaṃ vraṇavaccāpi śodhayet||
5.7.43| śvaśṛgālatarakṣvṛkṣavyāghrādīnāṃ yadā 'nilaḥ|
śleṣmapraduṣṭo muṣṇāti saṃjñāṃ saṃjñāvahāśritaḥ||
5.7.44| tadā prasrastalāṅgūlahanuskandho 'tilālavān|
1atyarthabadhiro 'ndhaśca so 'nyonyamabhidhāvati||
5.7.45| tenonmattena daṣṭasya daṃṣṭriṇā saviṣeṇa tu|
suptatā jāyate daṃśe kṛṣṇaṃ cātisravatyasṛk||
5.7.46| digdhaviddhasya liṅgena prāyaśaścopalakṣitaḥ|
yena cāpi bhaveddaṣṭastasya ceṣṭāṃ rutaṃ naraḥ||
5.7.47| bahuśaḥ pratikurvāṇaḥ kriyāhīno vinaśyati|
daṃṣṭriṇā yena daṣṭaśca tadrūpaṃ yastu paśyati||
5.7.48| 1apsu vā yadi vā++ādarśo 'riṣṭaṃ tasya vinirdiśet|
trasyatyakasmādyo 'bhīkṣṇaṃ 1dṛṣṭvā spṛṣṭvā 'pi vā jalam||
5.7.49| jalatrāsaṃ tu vidyāttaṃ riṣṭaṃ 1tadapi kīrtitam|
adaṣṭo vā jalatrāsī na kathañcana sidhyati||
5.7.50| prasupto 'thotthito vā 'pi svasthastrasto na sidhyati|
daṃśaṃ visrāvya tairdaṣṭe sarpiṣā paridāhitam||
5.7.51| pradihyādagadaiḥ sarpiḥ purāṇaṃ pāyayeta ca|
arkakṣīrayutaṃ 1hyasya dadyāccāpi viśodhanam||
5.7.52| śvetāṃ punarnavāṃ cāsya dadyāddhattūrakāyutām|
palalaṃ tilatailaṃ ca rūpikāyāḥ payo guḍaḥ||
5.7.53| nihanti viṣamālarkaṃ meghavṛndamivānilaḥ|
mūlasya śarapuṅkhāyāḥ karṣaṃ dhattūrakārdhikam||
5.7.54| taṇḍulodakamādāya peṣayettaṇḍulaiḥ saha|
unmattakasya patraistu saṃveṣṭyāpūpakaṃ pacet||
5.7.55| khādedauṣadhakāle tamalarkaviṣadūṣitaḥ|
karoti 1śvavikārāṃstu tasmiñjīryati cauṣadhe||
5.7.56| vikārāḥ śiśire yāpyā gṛhe vārivivarjite|
tataḥ śāntavikārastu snātvā caivāpare 'hani||
5.7.57| śāliṣāṣṭikayorbhaktaṃ kṣīreṇoṣṇena bhojayet|
dinatraye pañcame vā vidhireṣo 'rdhamātrayā||
5.7.58| kartavyo bhiṣajā 'vaśyamalarkaviṣanāśanaḥ|
kupyet svayaṃ viṣaṃ yasya na sa jīvati mānavaḥ||
5.7.59| tasmāt prakopayedāśu svayaṃ yāvat1 prakupyati|
1bījaratnauṣadhīgarbhaiḥ kumbhaiḥ śītāmbupūritaiḥ||
5.7.60| snāpayettaṃ nadītīre samantrairvā catuṣpathe|
baliṃ nivedya tatrāpi piṇyākaṃ palalaṃ dadhi||
5.7.61| mālyāni ca vicitrāṇi māṃsaṃ pakvāmakaṃ tathā|
alakādhipate yakṣa sārameyagaṇādhipa||
5.7.62| alarkajuṣṭametanme nirviṣaṃ kuru mācirāt|
dadyāt saṃśodhanaṃ tīkṣṇamevaṃ 1snātasya dehinaḥ||
5.7.63| aśuddhasya surūḍhe 'pi vraṇe kupyati tadviṣam|
śvādayo 'bhihitā vyālā ye 'tra1 daṃṣṭrāviṣā mayā||
5.7.64| ataḥ karoti daṣṭastu teṣāṃ ceṣṭāṃ rutaṃ naraḥ|
bahuśaḥ pratikurvāṇo na cirānmriyate ca saḥ||
5.7.65| nakhadantakṣataṃ vyālairyatkṛtaṃ taddhimardayet|
siñcettailena koṣṇena te hi vātaprakopakāḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne mūṣikakalpo nāma saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ||7||

aṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
5.8.1| athātaḥ kīṭakalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
