5.8.108| tatreṣṭāḥ kuṭajośīratuṅgapadmakavañjulāḥ|
śirīṣakiṇihīśelukadambakakubhatvacaḥ||
5.8.109| raktamaṇḍanibhe daṃśe piḍakāḥ sarṣapā iva|
jāyante tāluśoṣaśca dāhaścālaviṣārdite||
5.8.110| tatra priyaṅguhrīberakuṣṭhalāmajjavañjulāḥ|
agadaḥ śatapuṣpā ca sapippalavaṭāṅkurāḥ||
5.8.111| pūtirmūtraviṣādaṃśo visarpī kṛṣṇaśoṇitaḥ|
kāsaśvāsavamīmūrcchājvaradāhasamanvitaḥ||
5.8.112| manaḥśilālamadhukakuṣṭhacandanapadmakaiḥ|
madhumiśraiḥ salāmajjairagadastatra kīrtitaḥ||
5.8.113| āpāṇḍupiḍako daṃśo dāhakledasamanvitaḥ|
raktāyā raktaparyanto vijñeyo raktasaṃyutaḥ||
5.8.114| kāryastatrāgadastoyacandanośīrapadmakaiḥ|
tathaivārjunaśelubhyāṃ tvagbhirāmrātakasya ca||
5.8.115| picchilaṃ kasanādaṃśādrudhiraṃ śītalaṃ sravet|
kāsaśvāsau ca tatroktaṃ raktalūtāckitsitam||
5.8.116| purīṣagandhiralpāsṛk kṛṣṇāyā daṃśa eva tu|
jvaramūrcchāvamīdāhakāsaśvāsasamanvitaḥ||
5.8.117| tatrailāvakrasarpākṣīgandhanākulicandanaiḥ|
mahāsugandhisāhitaiḥ pratyākhyāyāgadaḥ smṛtaḥ||
5.8.118| daṃśe dāho 'gnivaktrāyāḥ srāvo 'tyarthaṃ jvarastathā|
1coṣakaṇḍūromaharṣā dāhavisphoṭasaṃyutaḥ||
5.8.119| kṛṣṇāpraśamanaṃ cātra pratyākhyāya prayojayet|
sārivośīrayaṣṭyāhvacandanotpalapadmakam||
5.8.120| sarvāsāmeva yuñjīta viṣe śleṣmātakatvacam|
bhiṣak sarvaprakāreṇa tathā cākṣīvapippalam||
5.8.121| kṛcchrasādhyaviṣā hyaṣṭau proktā dve ca yadṛcchayā|
avāryaviṣavīryāṇāṃ lakṣaṇāni nibodha me||
5.8.122| dhyāmaḥ sauvarṇikādaṃśaḥ sapheno matsyagandhakaḥ|
śvāsaḥ kāso jvarastṛṣṇā mūrcchā cātra sudāruṇā||
5.8.123| ādaṃśe lājavarṇāyā dhyāmaṃ pūti sravedasṛk|
dāho mūrcchā 'tisāraśca 1śiroduḥkhaṃ ca jāyate||
5.8.124| ghoro daṃśastu jālinyā rājimānavakīryate|
stambhaḥ śvāsastamovṛddhistāluśoṣaśca jāyate||
5.8.125| eṇīpadmāstathā daṃśo bhavet kṛṣṇatilākṛtiḥ|
1tṛṣṇāmūrcchājvaracchardikāsaśvāsasamanvitaḥ||
5.8.126| daṃśaḥ kākāṇḍikādaṣṭe pāṇḍurakto 'tivedanaḥ|
tṛṇmūrcchāśvāsahṛdrogahikkākāsāḥ syuruccritāḥ||
5.8.127| rakto mālāguṇādaṃśo dhūmagandho 'tivedanaḥ|
bahudhā ca viśīryeta dāhamūrcchājvarānvitaḥ||
5.8.128| asādhyāsvapyabhihitaṃ pratyākhyāyāśu yojayet|
doṣocchrāyaviśeṣeṇa dāhacchedavivarjitam||
5.8.129| sādhyābhirābhirlūtābhirdaṣṭamātrasya1 dehinaḥ|
vṛddhipatreṇa matimān samyagādaṃśamuddharet||
5.8.130| amarmaṇi vidhānajño varjitasya jvarādibhiḥ|
daṃśasyotkartanaṃ kuyādalpaśvayathukasya ca||
5.8.131| madhusaindhavasaṃyuktairagadairlepayettataḥ|
priyaṅgurajanīkuṣṭhasamaṅgāmadhukaistathā||
5.8.132| sārivāṃ madhukaṃ drākṣāṃ payasyāṃ kṣīramoraṭam|
vidārīgokṣurakṣaudramadhukaṃ pāyayeta vā||
5.8.133| kṣīriṇāṃ tvakkaṣāyeṇa suśītena ca secayet|
upadravān yathādoṣaṃ viṣaghnaireva sādhayet||
5.8.134| nasyāñjanābhyañjanapānadhūmaṃ tathā 'vapīḍaṃ kavalagrahaṃ ca|
saṃśodhanaṃ cobhayataḥ pragāḍhaṃ kuryātsirāmokṣaṇameva cātra||
5.8.135| kīṭadaṣṭavraṇān sarvānahidaṣṭavraṇānapi|
1ādāhapākāttān sarvāñcikitsedduṣṭavadbhiṣag||
5.8.136| vinivṛtte tataḥ śophe karṇikāpātanaṃ hitam|
nimbapatraṃ trivṛddantī kusumbhaṃ kusumaṃ madhu||
5.8.137| gugguluḥ saindhavaṃ kiṇvaṃ varcaḥ pārāvatasya ca|
viṣavṛddhikaraṃ cānnaṃ hitvā saṃbhojanaṃ hitam||
5.8.138| viṣebhyaḥ khalu sarvebhyaḥ karṇikāmarujāṃ sthirām|
pracchayitvā madhūnmiśraiḥ śodhanīyairupācaret||
5.8.139| saptaṣaṣṭhasya kīṭānāṃ śatasyaitadvibhāgaśaḥ|
daṣṭalakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ cikitsā cāpyanantaram||
5.8.140| saviṃśamadhyāyaśatametaduktaṃ vibhāgaśaḥ|
ihoddiṣṭānanirdiṣṭānarthān vakṣyāmyathottare||
5.8.141| sanātanatvādvedānāmakṣaratvāttathaiva ca|
tathā dṛṣṭaphalatvācca hitatvādapi dehinām||
5.8.142| vāksamūhārthavistārāt pūjitatvācca dehibhiḥ|
cikitsitāt puṇyatamaṃ na kiṃcidapi śuśrumaḥ||
5.8.143| ṛṣerindraprabhāvasyāmṛtayonerbhiṣagguroḥ|
dhārayitvā tu vimalaṃ mataṃ paramasaṃmatam|
uktāhārasamācāra iha pretya ca modate||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ kalpasthāne kiṭakalpo nāmāṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ||8||

iti bhagavatā śrīdhanvantariṇopadiṣṭāyāṃ tacchiṣyeṇa maharṣiṇā suśrutena viracitāyāṃ suśrutasaṃhitāyāṃ pañcamaṃ kalpasthānaṃ samāptam||



atha uttaratantram|

prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.1.1| athāta aupadravikamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.1.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.1.3| adhyāyānāṃ śate viṃśe yaduktamasakṛnmayā|
vakṣyāmi bahudhā samyaguttare 'rthānimāniti||
6.1.4| idānīṃ tat pravakṣyāmi tantramuttaramuttamam|
nikhilenopadiśyante yatra rogāḥ pṛthagvidhāḥ||
6.1.5| śālākyatantrābhihitā videhādhipakīrtitāḥ|
ye ca vistarato dṛṣṭāḥ kumārābādhahetavaḥ||
6.1.6| ṣaṭsu kāyacikitsāsu ye coktāḥ paramarṣibhiḥ|
upasargādayo rogā ye cāpyāgantavaḥ smṛtāḥ||
6.1.7| triṣaṣṭī rasasaṃsargāḥ svasthavṛttaṃ tathaiva ca|
yuktārthā yuktayaścaiva doṣabhedāstathaiva ca||
6.1.8| yatroktā vividhā arthā rogasādhanahetavaḥ|
mahatastasya tantrasya durgādhasyāmbudheriva||
6.1.9| ādāvevottamāṅgasthān rogānabhidadhāmyaham|
saṅkhyayā lakṣaṇaiścāpi sādhyāsādhyakrameṇa ca||
6.1.10| vidyāddvayaṅgulabāhulyaṃ svāṅguṣṭhodarasaṃmitam|
dvyaṅgulaṃ sarvataḥ sārdhaṃ bhiṣaṅnayanabudbudam||
6.1.11| suvṛttaṃ gostanākāraṃ sarvabhūtaguṇodbhavam|
palaṃ bhuvo 'gnito raktaṃ vātāt kṛṣṇaṃ sitaṃ jalāt||
6.1.12| ākāśādaśrumārgāśca jāyante netrabudbude|
dṛṣṭiṃ cātra tathā vakṣye yathā brūyādviśāradaḥ||
6.1.13| netrāyāmatribhāgaṃ tu kṛṣṇamaṇḍalamucyate|
kṛṣṇāt saptamamicchanti dṛṣṭiṃ dṛṣṭiviśāradāḥ||
6.1.14| maṇḍalāni ca sandhīṃśca paṭalāni ca locane|
yathākramaṃ vijānīyāt pañca ṣaṭ ca ṣaḍeva ca||
6.1.15| pakṣmavartmaśvetakṛṣṇadṛṣṭīnāṃ maṇḍalāni tu|
anupūrvaṃ tu te madhyāścatvāro 'ntyā yathottaram||
6.1.16| pakṣmavartmagataḥ sandhirvartmaśuklagato 'paraḥ|
śuklakṛṣṇagatastvanyaḥ kṛṣṇadṛṣṭigato 'paraḥ|
tataḥ kanīnakagataḥ ṣaṣṭhaścāpāṅgagaḥ smṛtaḥ||
6.1.17| dve vartmapaṭale vidyāccatvāryanyāni cākṣiṇi|
jāyate timiraṃ yeṣu vyādhiḥ paramadāruṇaḥ||
6.1.18| tejojalāśritaṃ bāhyaṃ teṣvanyat piśitāśritam|
medastṛtīyaṃ paṭalamāśritaṃ tvasthi cāparam||
6.1.19| pañcamāṃśasamaṃ dṛṣṭesteṣāṃ bāhulpamiṣyate|
sirāṇāṃ kaṇḍarāṇāṃ ca medasaḥ kālakasya ca||
6.1.20| guṇāḥ kālāt paraḥ śleṣmā bandhane 'kṣṇoḥ sirāyutaḥ|
sirānusāribhirdoṣairviguṇairūrdhvamāgataiḥ||
6.1.21| jāyante netrabhāgeṣu rogāḥ paramadāruṇāḥ|
tatrāvilaṃ sasaṃrambhamaśrukaṇḍūpadehavat1||
6.1.22| gurūṣātodarāgādyairjuṣṭaṃ cāvyaktalakṣaṇaiḥ|
saśūlaṃ vartmakoṣeṣu śūkapūrṇābhameva ca||
6.1.23| vihanyamānaṃ rūpe vā kriyāsvakṣi yathā purā|
dṛṣṭvaiva dhīmān budhyeta doṣeṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ tu tat||
6.1.24| tatra saṃbhavamāsādya yathādoṣaṃ bhiṣagjitam|
vidadhyānnetrajā rogā balavantaḥ syuranyathā||
6.1.25| saṅkṣepataḥ kriyāyogo nidānaparivarjanam|
vātādīnāṃ pratīghātaḥ prokto vistarataḥ punaḥ||
6.1.26| uṣṇābhitaptasya jalapraveśāddūrekṣaṇāt svapnaviparyayācca|
prasaktasaṃrodanakopaśokakleśābhighātādatimaithunācca||
6.1.27| śuktāranālāmlakulatthamāṣaniṣevaṇādvegavinigrahācca|
svedādatho dhūmaniṣevaṇācca chardervighātādvamanātiyogāt|
bāṣpagrahāt sūkṣmanirīkṣaṇācca netre vikārān janayanti doṣāḥ||
6.1.28| vātāddaśa tathā pittāt kaphāccaiva trayodaśa|
raktāt ṣoḍaśa vijñeyāḥ sarvajāḥ pañcaviṃśatiḥ||
6.1.29| tathā bāhyau punardvau ca rogāḥ ṣaṭsaptatiḥ smṛtāḥ|
hatādhimantho nimiṣo dṛṣṭirgambhīrikā ca yā||
6.1.30| yacca vātahataṃ vartma na te sidhyanti vātajāḥ|
yāpyo 'tha tanmayaḥ kācaḥ sādhyāḥ syuḥsānyamārutāḥ||
6.1.31| śuṣkākṣipākādhīmanthasyandamārutapryayāḥ|
asādhyo hrasvajāḍyo yo jalasrāvaśca paittikaḥ||
6.1.32| parimlāyī ca nīlaśca yāpyaḥ kāco 'tha tanmayaḥ|
abhiṣyando 'dhimantho 'mlādhyuṣitaṃ śuktikā ca yā||
6.1.33| dṛṣṭiḥ pittavidagdhā ca dhūmadarśī ca sidhyati|
asādhyaḥ kaphajaḥ srāvo yāpyaḥ kācaśca tanmayaḥ||
6.1.34| abhiṣyando 'dhimanthaśca balāsagrathitaṃ ca yat|
dṛṣṭiḥ śleṣmavidagdhā ca pothakyo lagaṇaśca yaḥ||
6.1.35| 1krimigranthipariklinnavartmaśuklārmapiṣṭakāḥ|
śleṣmopanāhaḥ sādhyāstu kathitāḥ śleṣmajeṣu tu||
6.1.36| raktasrāvo 'jakājātaṃ śoṇitārśovraṇānvitam1|
śukraṃ na sādhyaṃ kācaśca yāpyastajjaḥ prakīrtitaḥ||
6.1.37| manthasyandau 1kliṣṭavartma harṣotpātau tathaiva ca|
sirājātā 'ñjanākhyā ca sirājālaṃ ca yat smṛtam||
6.1.38| parvaṇyathāvraṇaṃ śukraṃ śoṇitārmārjunaśca yaḥ|
ete sādhyā vikāreṣu raktajeṣu bhavanti hi||
6.1.39| pūyāsrāvo nākulāndhyamakṣipākātyayo 'lajī|
asādhyāḥ sarvajā yāpyaḥ kācaḥ kopaśca pakṣmaṇaḥ||
6.1.40| vartmāvabandho yo vyādhiḥ sirāsu piḍakā ca yā|
prastāryarmādhimāṃsārma snāyvarmotsaṅginī ca yā||
6.1.41| pūyālasaścārbudaṃ ca śyāvakardamavartmanī|
tathā 'rśovartma śuṣkārśaḥ śarkarāvartma yacca vai||
6.1.42| saśophaścāpyaśophaśca pāko bahalavartma ca|
aklinnavartma kumbhīkā bisavartma ca sidhyati||
6.1.43| sanimitto 'nimittaśca dvāvasādhyau tu bāhyajau|
ṣaṭsaptatirvikārāṇāmeṣā saṃgrahakīrtitā1||
6.1.44| nava sandhyāśrayāsteṣu vartmajāstvekaviṃśatiḥ|
śuklabhāge daśaikaśca catvāraḥ kṛṣṇabhāgajāḥ||
6.1.45| sarvāśrayāḥ saptadaśa dṛṣṭijā dvādaśaiva tu|
bāhyajau dvau samākhyātau rogau paramadāruṇau|
bhūya etān pravakṣyāmi saṅkhyārūpacikitsitaiḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre aupadraviko nāma prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ||1||

dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.2.1| athātaḥ sandhigatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.2.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.2.3| pūyālasaḥ sopanāhaḥ srāvāḥ parvaṇikā 'lajī|
krimigranthiśca vijñeyā rogāḥ sandhigatā nava||
6.2.4| pakvaḥ śophaḥ sandhijaḥ saṃsravedyaḥ sāndraṃ pūyaṃ pūti pūyālasaḥ saḥ|
granthirnālpo dṛṣṭisandhāvapākaḥ kaṇḍūprāyo nīrujastūpanāhaḥ||
6.2.5| gatvā sandhīnaśrumārgeṇa doṣāḥ kuryuḥ srāvān rugvihīnān kanīnāt|
tān vai srāvān netranāḍīmathaike tasyā liṅgaṃ kīrtayiṣye caturdhā||
6.2.6| pākaḥ sandhau saṃsravedyaśca pūyaṃ pūyāsrāvo naikarūpaḥ pradiṣṭaḥ|
śvetaṃ sāndraṃ picchilaṃ saṃsravedyaḥ śleṣmāsrāvo nīrujaḥ sa pradiṣṭaḥ||
6.2.7| raktāsrāvaḥ śoṇitotthaḥ saraktamuṣṇaṃ nālpaṃ saṃsravennātisāndram|
pītābhāsaṃ nīlamuṣṇaṃ jalābhaṃ pittāsrāvaḥ saṃsravet sandhimadhyāt||
6.2.8| tāmrā tanvī dāhaśūlopapannā raktājjñeyā parvaṇī vṛttaśophā|
jātā sandhau kṛṣṇaśukle 'lajī syāttasminneva khyāpitā pūrvaliṅgaiḥ||
6.2.9| krimigranthirvartmanaḥ pakṣmaṇaśca kaṇḍūṃ kuryuḥ krimayaḥ sandhijātāḥ|
nānārūpā 1vartmaśuklasya sandhau caranto 'ntarnayanaṃ dūṣayanti||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre sandhigatarogavijñānīyo nāma dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ||2||

tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.3.1| athāto vartmagatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.3.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.3.3| pṛthagdoṣāḥ samastā vā yadā vartmavyapāśrayāḥ|
sirā vyāpyāvatiṣṭhante vartmasvadhikamūrcchitāḥ||
6.3.4| 1vivardhya māṃsaṃ raktaṃ ca tadā vartmavyapāśrayān|
vikārāñjanayantyāśu nāmatastānnibodhata||
6.3.5| utsaṅginyatha kumbhīkā pothakyo vartmaśarkarā|
tathā 'rśovartma śuṣkārśastathaivāñjananāmikā||
6.3.6| bahalaṃ vartma yaccāpi vyādhirvartmāvabandhakaḥ|
kliṣṭakardamavartmākhyau śyāvavartma tathaiva ca||
6.3.7| praklinnamapariklinnaṃ vartma vātahataṃ tu yat|
arbudaṃ nimiṣaścāpi śoṇitārśaśca yat smṛtam||
6.3.8| lagaṇo biśanāmā ca pakṣmakopastathaiva ca|
ekaviṃśatirityete vikārā vartmasaṃśrayāḥ||
6.3.9| nāmabhiste samuddiṣṭā lakṣaṇaistān pracakṣmahe|
abhyantaramukhī bāhyotsaṅge 'dho vartmanaśca1 yā||
6.3.10| vijñeyotsaṅginī nāma tadrūpapiḍakācitā|
kumbhīkabījapratimāḥ piḍakā 1yāstu vartmajāḥ||
6.3.11| 1ādhmāpayanti bhinnā yāḥ kumbhīkapiḍakāstu tāḥ|
srāviṇyaḥ 1kaṇḍurā gurvyo raktasarṣapasannibhāḥ|
piḍakāśca rujāvatyaḥ pothakya iti saṃjñitāḥ||
6.3.12| piḍakābhiḥ susūkṣmābhirghanābhirabhisaṃvṛtā|
piḍakā yā kharā sthūlā sā jñeyā vartmaśarkarā||
6.3.13| 1ervārubījapratimāḥ piḍakā mandavedanāḥ|
sūkṣmāḥ kharāśca vartmasthāstadarśovartma kīrtyate||
6.3.14| dīrgho 'ṅkuraḥ kharaḥ stabdho dāruṇo vartmasaṃbhavaḥ|
vyādhireṣa samākhyātaḥ śuṣkārśa iti saṃjñitaḥ||
6.3.15| dāhatodavatī tāmrā piḍakā vartmasaṃbhavā|
mṛdvī mandarujā sūkṣmā jñeyā sā 'ñjananāmikā||
6.3.16| vartmopacīyate yasya piḍakābhiḥ samantataḥ|
savarṇābhiḥ samābhiśca vidyādbahalavartma tat||
6.3.17| kaṇḍūmatā 'lpatodena vartmaśophena yo naraḥ|
na samaṃ chādayedakṣi bhavedbandhaḥ sa vartmanaḥ||
6.3.18| mṛdvalpavedanaṃ tāmraṃ yadvartma samameva ca|
akasmācca bhavedraktaṃ kliṣṭavartma tadādiśet||
6.3.19| kliṣṭaṃ punaḥ pittayutaṃ vidahecchoṇitaṃ yadā|
tadā klinnatvamāpannamucyate vartmakardamaḥ||
6.3.20| yadvartma bāhyato 'nyaśca śyāvaṃ śūnaṃ savedanam|
dāhakaṇḍūparikledi1 śyāvavartmeti tanmatam||
6.3.21| arujaṃ bāhyataḥ śūnamantaḥ klinnaṃ sravatyapi|
kaṇḍūnistodabhūyiṣṭhaṃ klinnavartma taducyate||
6.3.22| yasya dhautāni dhautāni saṃbadhyante punaḥ punaḥ|
vartmānyaparipakvāni vidyādaklinnavartma tat||
6.3.23| vimuktasandhi niśceṣṭaṃ vartma yasya na mīlyate|
etadvātahataṃ vidyāt sarujaṃ yadi vā 'rujam||
6.3.24| vartmāntarasthaṃ viṣamaṃ granthibhūtamavedanam|
vijñeyamarbudaṃ puṃsāṃ saraktamavalambitam||
6.3.25| nimeṣaṇīḥ sirā vāyuḥ praviṣṭo vartmasaṃśrayāḥ|
1cālayatyati vartmāni nimeṣaḥ sa gado mataḥ||
6.3.26| chinnāśchinā vivardhante vartmasthā mṛdavo 'ṅkurāḥ|
dāhakaṇḍūrujopetāste 'rśaḥ śoṇitasaṃbhavāḥ1||
6.3.27| apākaḥ kaṭhinaḥ sthūlo granthirvartmabhavo 'rujaḥ|
sakaṇḍūḥ picchilaḥ kolapramāṇo lagaṇastu saḥ||
6.3.28| śūnaṃ yadvartma bahubhiḥ sūkṣmaiśchidraiḥ samanvitam|
bisamantarjala iva bisavartmeti tanmatam||
6.3.29| doṣāḥ pakṣmāśayagatāstīkṣṇāgrāṇi kharāṇi ca|
nirvartayanti pakṣmāṇi tairghuṣṭaṃ cākṣi dūyate||
6.3.30| uddhṛtairuddhṛtaiḥ1 śāntiḥ pakṣmabhiścopajāyate|
vātātapānaladveṣī pakṣmakopaḥ sa ucyate||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre vartmagatarogavijñānīyo nāma tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ||3||

caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.4.1| athātaḥ śuklagatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.4.2| athovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.4.3| prastāriśuklakṣatajādhimāṃsasrāyvarmasaṃjñāḥ khalu pañca rogāḥ|
syuḥ śuktikā cārjunapiṣṭakau ca jālaṃ sirāṇāṃ piḍakāśca yāḥ syuḥ||
6.4.4| rogā balāsagrathitena sārdhamekādaśākṣṇoḥ khalu śuklabhāge|
prastāri prathitamihārma śuklabhāge vistīrṇaṃ tanu rudhiraprabhaṃ sanīlam||
6.4.5| śuklākhyaṃ mṛdu kathayanti śuklabhāge saśvetaṃ samamiha1 vardhate cireṇa|
yanmāṃsaṃ pracayamupaiti śuklabhāge padmābhaṃ tadupadiśanti lohitārma||
6.4.6| vistīrṇaṃ mṛdu bahalaṃ yakṛtprakāśaṃ śyāvaṃ vā tadadhikamāṃsajārma vidyāt|
śukle yat piśitamupaiti vṛddhimetat snāyvarmetyabhipaṭhitaṃ kharaṃ prapāṇḍu||
6.4.7| śyāvāḥ syuḥ piśitanibhāśca bindavo ye śuktyābhāḥ sitanayane sa śuktisaṃjñaḥ|
eko yaḥ śaśarudhiropamastu binduḥ śuklastho bhavati tamarjunaṃ vadanti||
6.4.8| utsannaḥ salilanibho 'tha piṣṭaśuklo binduryo bhavati sa piṣṭakaḥ suvṛttaḥ|
jālābhaḥ kaṭhinasiro mahān saraktaḥ santānaḥ smṛta iha jālasaṃjñitastu||
6.4.9| śuklasthāḥ sitapiḍakāḥ sirāvṛtā yāstā vidyādasitasamīpajāḥ sirājāḥ|
kāṃsyābho1 bhavati site 'mbubindutulyaḥ sa jñeyo 'mṛdurarujo balāsakākhyaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre śuklagatarogavijñānīyo nāma caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ||4||

pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.5.1| athātaḥ kṛṣṇagatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.5.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.5.3| yat savraṇaṃ śukla(śukra)mathāvraṇaṃ vā pākātyayaścāpyajakā tathaiva|
catvāra ete 'bhihitā vikārāḥ kṛṣṇāśrayāḥ saṃgrahataḥ purastāt||
6.5.4| nimagnarūpaṃ hi bhavettu kṛṣṇe sūcyeva viddhaṃ pratibhāti 1yadvai|
srāvaṃ sraveduṣṇamatīva ruk ca tat savraṇaṃ śukra(śukla)mudāharanti||
6.5.5| dṛṣṭeḥ samīpe na bhavettu yacca na cāvagāḍhaṃ na ca saṃsraveddhi|
avedanāvanna ca yugmaśukraṃ tatsiddhimāpnoti kadācideva||
6.5.6| vicchinnamadhyaṃ piśitāvṛtaṃ vā calaṃ sirāsaktamadṛṣṭikṛcca1|
dvitvaggataṃ lohitamantataśca cirotthitaṃ cāpi vivarjanīyam||
6.5.7| uṣṇāśrupātaḥ piḍakā ca kṛṣṇe yasmin bhavenmudganibhaṃ ca śukram|
tadapyasādhyaṃ pravadanti kecidanyacca yattittiripakṣatulyam||
6.5.8| sitaṃ yadā bhātyasitapradeśe syandātmakaṃ nātirugaśruyuktam|
vihāyasīvācchaghanānukāri1 tadavraṇaṃ sādhyatamaṃ vadanti||
6.5.9| gambhīrajātaṃ bahalaṃ ca śukraṃ cirotthitaṃ cāpi vadanti kṛcchram|
saṃcchādyate1 śvetanibhena sarvaṃ doṣeṇa yasyāsitamaṇḍalaṃ tu||
6.5.10| tamakṣipākātyayamakṣikopasamutthitaṃ1 tīvrarujaṃ vadanti|
ajāpurīṣapratimo rujāvān salohito lohitapicchilāśruḥ|
vidārya kṛṣṇaṃ pracayo 'bhyupaiti taṃ cājakājātamiti vyavasyet||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre kṛṣṇagatarogavijñānīyo nāma pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ||5||

ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.6.1| athātaḥ sarvagatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.6.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.6.3| syandāstu catvāra ihopadiṣṭāstāvanta eveha tathā 'dhimanthāḥ|
śophānvito 'śophayutaśca pākāvityevamete daśa saṃpradiṣṭāḥ||
6.6.4| hatādhimantho 'nilaparyayaśca śuṣkākṣipāko 'nyata eva vātaḥ|
dṛṣṭistatathā 'mlādhyuṣitā sirāṇāmutpātaharṣāvapi sarvabhāgāḥ||
6.6.5| prāyeṇa sarve nayanāmayāstu bhavantyabhiṣyandanimittamūlāḥ|
tasmādabhiṣyandamudīryamāṇamupācaredāśu hitāya dhīmān||
6.6.6| nistodanaṃ stambhanaromaharṣasaṅgharṣapāruṣyaśirobhitāpāḥ|
viśuṣkabhāvaḥ śiśirāśrutā ca vātābhipanne nayane bhavanti||
6.6.7| dāhaprapākau śiśirābhinandā dhūmāyanaṃ bāṣpasamucchrayaśca|
uṣṇāśrutā pītakanetratā ca pittābhipanne nayane bhavanti||
6.6.8| uṣṇābhinandā gurutā 'kṣiśophaḥ kaṇḍūpadehau sitatā 'tiśaityam|
srāvo muhuḥ picchila eva cāpi kaphābhipanne nayane bhavanti||
6.6.9| tāmrāśrutā lohitanetratā ca rājyaḥ samantādatilohitāśca|
pittasya liṅgāni ca yāni tāni raktābhipanne nayane bhavanti||
6.6.10| vṛddhairetairabhiṣyandairnarāṇāmakriyāvatām|
tāvantastvadhimanthāḥ syurnayane tīvravedanāḥ||
6.6.11| utpāṭyata ivātyarthaṃ netraṃ nirmathyate tathā|
śiraso 'rdhaṃ ca taṃ vidyādadhimanthaṃ svalakṣaṇaiḥ||
6.6.12| netramutpāṭyata iva mathyate 'raṇivacca yat|
saṅgharṣatodanirbhedamāṃsasaṃrabdhamāvilam||
6.6.13| kuñcanāsphoṭanādhmānavepathuvyathanairyutam|
śiraso 'rdhaṃ ca yena syādadhimanthaḥ sa mārutāt||
6.6.14| raktarājicitaṃ srāvi vahninevāvadahyate|
yakṛtpiṇḍopamaṃ dāhi kṣāreṇāktamiva kṣatam||
6.6.15| prapakvocchūnavartmāntaṃ sasvedaṃ pītadarśanam|
mūrcchāśirodāhayutaṃ pittenākṣyadhimanthitam||
6.6.16| śophavannātisaṃrabdhaṃ srāvakaṇḍūsamanvitam|
śaityagauravapaicchilyadūṣikāharṣaṇānvitam||
6.6.17| rūpaṃ paśyati duḥkhena pāṃśupūrṇamivāvilam|
nāsādhmānaśiroduḥkhayutaṃ śleṣmādhimanthitam||
6.6.18| bandhujīvapratīkāśaṃ tāmyati sparśanākṣamam|
raktāsrāvaṃ sanistodaṃ paśyatyagninibhā diśaḥ||
6.6.19| raktāmagnāriṣṭavacca kṛṣṇabhāgaśca lakṣyate|
yaddīptaṃ raktaparyantaṃ tadraktenādhimanthitam||
6.6.20| hanyādṛṣṭiṃ saptarātrāt kaphottho 'dhīmantho 'sṛksaṃbhavaḥ pañcarātrāt|
ṣaḍrātrādvau mārutottho nihanyānmithyācārāt paittikaḥ sadya eva||
6.6.21| kaṇḍūpadehāśruyutaḥ pakvodumbarasannibhaḥ|
dāhasaṃharṣatāmratvaśophanistodagauravaiḥ||
6.6.22| juṣṭo muhuḥ sraveccāsramuṣṇaśītāmbu picchilam|
saṃrambhī pacyate yaśca netrapākaḥ saśophajaḥ||
6.6.23| śophahīnāni liṅgāni netrapāke tvaśophaje|
upekṣaṇādakṣi yadā 'dhimantho vātātmakaḥ sādayati prasahya|
rujābhirugrābhirasādhya eṣa hatādhimanthaḥ khalu nāma rogaḥ||
6.6.24| antaḥsirāṇāṃ śvasanaḥ sthito dṛṣṭiṃ pratikṣipan|
hatādhimanthaṃ janayettamasādhyaṃ vidurbudhāḥ||
6.6.25| pakṣmadvayākṣibhruvamāśritastu yannānilaḥ saṃcarati praduṣṭaḥ|
paryāyaśaścāpi rujaḥ karoti taṃ vātaparyāyamudāharanti||
6.6.26| yat kūṇitaṃ dāruṇarūkṣavartma vilokane cāviladarśanaṃ yat|
sudāruṇaṃ yat pratibodhane ca śuṣkākṣipākopahataṃ tadakṣi||
6.6.27| yasyāvaṭūkarṇaśirohanustho manyāgato vā 'pyanilo 'nyato vā|
kuryādrujo 'ti bhruvi locane vā tamanyatovātamudāharanti||
6.6.28| amlena bhuktena vidāhinā ca saṃchādyate sarvata eva netram|
śophānvitaṃ lohitakaiḥ sanīlairetādṛgamlādhyuṣitaṃ vadanti||
6.6.29| avedanā vā 'pi savedanā vā yasyākṣirājyo hi bhavanti tāmrāḥ|
muhurvirajyanti ca tāḥ samantād vyādhiḥ sirotpāta iti pradiṣṭaḥ||
6.6.30| mohāt sirotpāta upekṣitastu jāyeta rogastu sirāpraharṣaḥ|
tāmrācchamasraṃ1 sravati pragāḍhaṃ tathā na śaknotyabhivīkṣituṃ ca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre sarvagatarogavijñānīyo nāma ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ||6||

saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.7.1| athāto dṛṣṭigatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.7.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.7.3| marūradalamātrāṃ tu pañcabhūtaprasādajām|
khadyotavisphuliṅgābhāmiddhāṃ1 tejobhiravyayaiḥ||
6.7.4| āvṛtāṃ paṭalenākṣṇorbāhyena vivarākṛtim|
śītasātmyāṃ nṛṇāṃ dṛṣṭimāhurnayanacintakāḥ||
6.7.5| rogāṃstadāśrayān ghorān ṣaṭ ca ṣaṭ ca pracakṣmahe|
paṭalānupraviṣṭasya timirasya ca lakṣaṇam||
6.7.6| sirābhirabhisaṃprāpya viguṇo 'bhyantare bhṛśam|
prathame paṭale doṣo yasya dṛṣṭau vyavathitaḥ||
6.7.7| avyaktāni sa rūpāṇi sarvāṇyeva prapaśyati|
dṛṣṭirbhṛśaṃ vihvalati dvitīyaṃ paṭalaṃ gate||
6.7.8| makṣikā maśakān keśāñjālakāni ca paśyati|
maṇḍalāni patākāṃśca marīcīḥ kuṇḍalāni ca||
6.7.9| 1pariplavāṃśca vividhān varṣamabhraṃ tamāṃsi ca|
dūrasthānyapi rūpāṇi manyate ca samīpataḥ||
6.7.10| samīpasthāni dūre ca dṛṣṭergocaravibhramāt|
yatnavānapi cātyarthaṃ sūcīpāśaṃ na paśyati||
6.7.11| ūrdhvaṃ paśyati gādhastāttṛtīyaṃ paṭalaṃ gate|
mahāntyapi ca rūpāṇi cchāditānīva vāsasā||
6.7.12| karṇanāsākṣiyuktāni viparītāni vīkṣate1|
yathādoṣaṃ ca rajyeta dṛṣṭirdoṣe balīyasi||
6.7.13| adhaḥsthite samīpasthaṃ dūrasthaṃ coparisthite|
pārśvasthite tathā doṣe pārśvasthāni na paśyati||
6.7.14| samantataḥ sthite doṣe saṅkulānīva1 paśyati|
dṛṣṭimadhyagate doṣe sa ekaṃ manyate dvidhā||
6.7.15| dvidhāsthite tridhā paśyedbahudhā cānavasthite|
timirākhyaḥ sa vai doṣaḥ caturthaṃ paṭalaṃ gataḥ||
6.7.16| ruṇaddhi sarvato dṛṣṭiṃ liṅganāśaḥ sa ucyate|
tasminnapi tamobhūte nātirūḍhe mahāgade||
6.7.17| candrādityau sanakṣatrāvantarīkṣe ca vidyutaḥ|
nirmalāni ca tejāṃsi bhrājiṣṇūni1 ca paśyati||
6.7.18| sa eva liṅganāśastu nīlikākācasaṃjñitaḥ|
tatra vātena rūpāṇi bhramantīva sa paśyati||
6.7.19| āvilānyaruṇābhāni vyāviddhāni ca mānavaḥ|
pittenādityakhadyotaśakracāpataḍidguṇān||
6.7.20| śikhibarhavicitrāṇi nīlakṛṣṇāni paśyati|
kaphena paśyedrūpāṇi snigdhāni ca sitāni ca||
6.7.21| gauracāmaragaurāṇi śvetābhrapratimāni ca|
paśyedasūkṣmāṇyatyarthaṃ vyabhre caivābhrasaṃplavam||
6.7.22| salilaplāvitānīva parijāḍyāni mānavaḥ||
tathā raktena raktāni tamāṃsi vividhāni ca||
6.7.23| haritaśyāvakṛṣṇāni dhūmadhūmrāṇi cekṣate|
sannipātena citrāṇi viplutāni ca paśyati||
6.7.24| bahudhā vā dvidhā vā 'pi sarvāṇyeva samantataḥ|
hīnādhikāṅgānyathavā jyotīṃṣyapi ca 1paśyati||
6.7.25| pittaṃ kuryāt parimlāyi mūrcchitaṃ raktatejasā|
pītā diśastathodyantamādityamiva paśyati||
6.7.26| vikīryamāṇān khadyotairvṛkṣāṃstejobhireva ca|
vakṣyāmi ṣaḍvidhaṃ1 rāgairliṅganāśamataḥ param||
6.7.27| rāgo 'ruṇo mārutajaḥ pradiṣṭaḥ pittāt parimlāyyathavā 'pi nīlaḥ|
kaphāt sitaḥ śoṇitajastu raktaḥ samastadoṣo 'tha vicitrarūpaḥ1||
6.7.28| raktajaṃ maṇḍalaṃ dṛṣṭau sthūlakācānalaprabham1|
parimlāyini roge syānmlāyyānīlaṃ ca maṇḍalam||
6.7.29| doṣakṣayāt kadācit syātsvayaṃ tatra ca darśanam|
aruṇaṃ maṇḍalaṃ vātāccañcalaṃ paruṣaṃ tathā||
6.7.30| pittānmaṇḍalamānīlaṃ kāṃsyābhaṃ pītameva vā|
śleṣmaṇā bahalaṃ snigdhaṃ śaṅkhakundendupāṇḍuram||
6.7.31| calatpadmapalāśasthaḥ śuklo bindurivāmbhasaḥ|
saṃkucatyātape 'tyarthaṃ chāyāyāṃ vistṛto bhavet||
6.7.32| mṛdyamāne ca nayane maṇḍalaṃ tadvisarpati|
pravālapadmapatrābhaṃ maṇḍalaṃ śoṇitātmakam||
6.7.33| dṛṣṭirāgo bhaveccitro liṅganāśe tridoṣaje|
yathāsvaṃ doṣaliṅgāni sarveṣveva bhavanti hi||
6.7.34| ṣaḍ liṅganāśāḥ ṣaḍime ca rogā dṛṣṭyāśrayāḥ ṣaṭ ca ṣaḍeva ca syuḥ|
tathā naraḥ pittavidagdhadṛṣṭiḥ kaphena cānyastvatha dhūmadarśī||
6.7.35| yo hrasvajāḍyo1(hrasvajātyo) nakulāndhatā ca gambhīrasaṃjñā ca tathaiva dṛṣṭiḥ|
pittena duṣṭena gatena dṛṣṭiṃ pītā bhavedyasya narasya dṛṣṭiḥ||
6.7.36| pītāni rūpāṇi ca manyate yaḥ sa mānavaḥ pittavidagdhadṛṣṭiḥ|
prāpte tṛtīyaṃ paṭalaṃ tu doṣe divā na paśyenniśi vīkṣate ca||
6.7.37| (1rātrau sa śītānugṛhītadṛṣṭiḥ pittālpabhāvādapi tāni paśyet)|
tathā naraḥ śleṣmavidagdhadṛṣṭistānyeva śuklāni hi manyate tu||
6.7.38| triṣu sthitolpaḥ paṭaleṣu doṣo naktāndhyamāpādayati prasahya|
divā sa 1sūryānugṛhītacakṣurīkṣeta rūpāṇi kaphālpabhāvāt||
6.7.39| śokajvarāyāsaśirobhitāpairabhyāhatā yasya narasya dṛṣṭiḥ|
sadhūmakān paśyati sarvabhāvāṃstaṃ dhūmadarśīti vadanti rogam||
6.7.40| sa 1hrasvajāḍyo divaseṣu kṛcchrāddhrasvāni rūpāṇi ca yena paśyet|
vidyotate yena narasya dṛṣṭirdoṣābhipannā nakulasya yadvat||
6.7.41| citrāṇi rūpāṇi divā sa paśyet sa vai vikāro nakulāndhyasaṃjñaḥ|
dṛṣṭirvirūpā śvasanopasṛṣṭā saṅkucyate 'bhyantarataśca yāti||
6.7.42| rujāvagāḍhā ca tamakṣirogaṃ gambhīriketi pravadanti tajjñāḥ|
bāhyau punardvāviha saṃpradiṣṭau nimittataścāpyanimittataśca||
6.7.43| nimittatastatra śirobhitāpājjñeyastvabhiṣyandanidarśanaiśca1|
surarṣigandharvamahoragāṇāṃ sandarśanenāpi ca bhāsvarāṇām||
6.7.44| hanyeta dṛṣṭirmanujasya yasya sa liṅganāśastvanimittasaṃjñaḥ|
tatrākṣi vispaṣṭamivāvabhāti vaidūryavarṇā vimalā ca dṛṣṭiḥ||
6.7.45| vidīryate sīdati hīyate vā nṛṇāmabhīghātahatā tu dṛṣṭiḥ||
6.7.46| ityete nayanagatā mayā vikārāḥ saṃkhyātāḥ pṛthagiha ṣaṭ ca saptatiśca|
eteṣāṃ pṛthagiha vistareṇa sarvaṃ vakṣye 'haṃ tadanu cikitsitaṃ yathāvat||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre dṛṣṭigatarogavijñānīyo nāma saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ||7||

aṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.8.1| athātaścikitsitapravibhāgavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.8.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ (suśrutāya)||
6.8.3| ṣaṭsaptatirye 'bhihitā vyādhayo nāmalakṣaṇaiḥ|
cikitsitamidaṃ teṣāṃ samāsavyāsataḥ1 śṛṇu||
6.8.4| chedyāsteṣu daśaikaśca nava lekhyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ|
bhedyāḥ pañca vikārāḥ syurvyadhyāḥ pañcadaśaiva tu||
6.8.5| dvādaśā 'śastrakṛtyāśca yāpyāḥ sapta bhavanti hi|
rogā varjayitavyāḥ syurdaśa pañca ca jānatā|
asādhyau vā bhavetāṃ tu yāpyau cāgantusaṃjñitau||
6.8.6| arśo 'nvitaṃ bhavati vartma tu yattathā 'rśaḥ śuṣkaṃ tathā 'rbudamatho piḍakāḥ sirājāḥ|
jālaṃ sirājamapi pañcavidhaṃ tathā 'rma chedyā bhavanti saha parvaṇikāmayena||
6.8.7| utsaṅginī bahalakardamavartmanī ca śyāvaṃ ca yacca paṭhitaṃ tviha baddhavartma|
kliṣṭaṃ ca pothakiyutaṃ khalu yacca vartma kumbhīkinī ca saha śarkarayā ca lekhyāḥ||
6.8.8| śleṣmopanāhalagaṇau ca bisaṃ ca bhedyā granthiśca yaḥ kṛmikṛto 'ñjananāmikā ca|
ādau sirā nigaditāstu yayoḥ prayoge pākau ca yau nayanayoḥ pavano 'nyataśca||
6.8.9| pūyālasānilaviparyayamanthasaṃjñāḥ syandāstu yantyupaśamaṃ hi sirāvyadhena|
śuṣkākṣipākakaphapittavidagdhadṛṣṭiṣvamlākhyaśukrasahitārjunapiṣṭakeṣu||
6.8.10| aklinnavartmahutabhugdhvajadarśiśuktipraklinnavartmasu tathaiva balāsasaṃjñe|
āgantunā++āmayayugena ca dūṣitāyāṃ dṛṣṭau na śastrapatanaṃ pravadanti tajjñāḥ||
6.8.11| saṃpaśyataḥ ṣaḍapi ye 'bhihitāstu kācāste pakṣmakopasahitāstu bhavanti yāpyāḥ|
catvāra eva pavanaprabhavāstvasādhyā dvau pittajau kaphanimittaja eka eva|
aṣṭārdhakā rudhirajāśca gadāstridoṣāstāvanta eva gaditāvapi bāhyajau dvau||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre cikitsitapravibhāgavijñānīyo nāmāṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ||8||

navamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.9.1| athāto vātābhiṣyandapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.9.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.9.3| purāṇasarpiṣā snigdhau syandādhīmanthapīḍitau|
svedayitvā yathānyāyaṃ sirāmokṣeṇa yojayet||
6.9.4| saṃpādayedbastibhistu samyak snehavirecitau|
tarpaṇaiḥ puṭapākaiśca dhūmairāścyotanaistathā||
6.9.5| nasyasnehaparīṣekaiḥ śirobastibhireva ca|
vātaghnanūpajalajamāṃsāmlakvāthasecanaiḥ||
6.9.6| snehaiścaturbhiruṣṇaiśca tatpītāmbaradhāraṇaiḥ|
payobhirvesavāraiśca sālvaṇaiḥ pāyasaistathā||
6.9.7| bhiṣak saṃpādayedetāvupanāhaiśca pūjitaiḥ|
grāmyānūpaudakarasaiḥ snigdhaiḥ phalarasānvitaiḥ||
6.9.8| susaṃskṛtaiḥ payobhiśca tayorāhāra iṣyate|
tathā copari bhaktasya sarpiḥpānaṃ(pāne) praśasyate1||
6.9.9| triphalākvāthasaṃsiddhaṃ kevalaṃ jīrṇameva vā|
siddhaṃ vātaharaiḥ kṣīraṃ prathamena gaṇena vā||
6.9.10| snehāstailādvinā siddhā vātaghnaistarpaṇe hitāḥ|
snaihikaḥ puṭapākaśca dhūmo nasyaṃ ca tadvidham||
6.9.11| nasyādiṣu sthirākṣīramadhuraistailamiṣyate|
eraṇḍapallave mūle tvaci vā++ājaṃ payaḥ śṛtam||
6.9.12| kaṇṭakāryāśca mūleṣu sukhoṣṇaṃ secane hitam|
saindhavodīcyayaṣṭyāhvapippalībhiḥ śṛtaṃ payaḥ||
6.9.13| hitamardhodakaṃ seke tathā++āścyotanameva ca|
hrīberavakramañjiṣṭhodumbaratvakṣu sādhitam||
6.9.14| sāmbhaśchāgaṃ payo vā 'pi śūlāścyotanamuttamam|
madhukaṃ rajanīṃ pathyāṃ devadāruṃ ca peṣayet||
6.9.15| ājena payasā śreṣṭhamabhiṣyande tadañjanam|
gairikaṃ saindhavaṃ kṛṣṇāṃ nāgaraṃ ca yathottaram||
6.9.16| dviguṇaṃ piṣṭamadbhistu guṭikāñjanamiṣyate|
snehāñjanaṃ hitaṃ cātra vakṣyate tadyathāvidhi||
6.9.17| rogo yaścānyatovāto yaśca mārutaparyayaḥ|
anenaiva vidhānena bhiṣak tāvapi sādhayet||
6.9.18| pūrvabhaktaṃ hitaṃ sarpiḥ kṣīraṃ vā 'pyatha bhojane|
vṛkṣādanyāṃ kapitthe ca pañcamūle mahatyapi||
6.9.19| sakṣīraṃ karkaṭarase siddhaṃ cātra ghṛtaṃ pibet|
siddhaṃ vā hitamatrāhuḥ pattūrārtagalāgnikaiḥ||
6.9.20| sakṣīraṃ meṣaśṛṅgyā vā sarpirvīratareṇa vā|
saindhavaṃ dāru śuṇṭhī ca mātuluṅgaraso ghṛtam||
6.9.21| stanyodakābhyāṃ kartavyaṃ śuṣkapāke tadañjanam|
pūjitaṃ sarpiṣaścātra pānamakṣṇośca tarpaṇam||
6.9.22| ghṛtena jīvanīyena nasyaṃ tailena cāṇunā|
pariṣeke hitaṃ cātra payaḥ śītaṃ sasaindhavam||
6.9.23| rajanīdārusiddhaṃ vā saindhavena samāyutam|
sarpiryutaṃ stanyaghṛṣṭamañjanaṃ vā mahauṣadham||
6.9.24| vasā vā++ānūpajalajā saindhavena samāyutā|
nāgaronmiśritā kiñcicchuṣkapāke tadañjanam||
6.9.25| pavanaprabhavā rogā ye keciddṛṣṭināśanāḥ|
bījenānena matimān teṣu karma prayojayet||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttratantrāntargate śālākyatantre vātābhiṣyandapratiṣedho nāma navamo 'dhyāyaḥ||9||

daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.10.1| athātaḥ pittābhiṣyandapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.10.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.10.3| pittasyande paittike cādhimanthe raktāsrāvaḥ sraṃsanaṃ cāpi kāryam|
akṣṇoḥ sekālepanasyāñjanāni paitte ca syādyadvisarpe vidhānam||
6.10.4| gundrāṃ śāliṃ śaivalaṃ śailabhedaṃ dārvīmelāmutpalaṃ rodhramabhram|
padmātpatraṃ śarkarā darbhamikṣuṃ tālaṃ rodhraṃ vetasaṃ padmakaṃ ca||
6.10.5| drākṣāṃ kṣaudraṃ candanaṃ yaṣṭikāhvaṃ yoṣitkṣīraṃ rātryanante ca piṣṭvā|
sarpiḥsiddhaṃ tarpaṇe sekanasye1 śastaṃ kṣīraṃ siddhameteṣu cājam||
6.10.6| yojyo vargo vyasta eṣo 'nyathā vā samyaṅnasye 'ṣṭārdhasaṃkhye 'pi nityam|
kriyāḥ sarvāḥ pittaharyaḥ praśastāstryahāccordhvaṃ kṣīrasarpiśca 1nasyam||
6.10.7| pālāśaṃ syācchoṇitaṃ cāñjanārthe śallakyā vā śarkarākṣaudrayuktam|
rasakriyāṃ śarkarākṣaudrayuktāṃ pālindyāṃ vā madhuke vā 'pi kuryāt||
6.10.8| mustā phenaḥ sāgarasyotpalaṃ ca kṛmighnailādhātribījādrasaśca|
tālīśailāgairikośīraśaṅkhairevaṃ yuñjyādañjanaṃ stanyapiṣṭaiḥ||
6.10.9| cūrṇaṃ kuryādañjanārthe raso vā stanyopeto dhātakīsyandanābhyām|
yoṣitstanyaṃ śātakumbhaṃ vighṛṣṭaṃ kṣaudropetaṃ kaiśukaṃ cāpi puṣpam||
6.10.10| rodhraṃ drākṣāṃ śarkarāmutpalaṃ ca nāryāḥ kṣīre yaṣṭikāhvaṃ vacāṃ ca|
piṣṭvā kṣīre varṇakasya tvacaṃ ca toyonmiśre candanodumbare ca||
6.10.11| kāryaḥ phenaḥ sāgarasyāñjanārthe nārīstanye mākṣike cāpi ghṛṣṭaḥ|
yoṣitstanye sthāpitaṃ yaṣṭikāhvaṃ rodhraṃ drākṣāṃ śarkarāmutpalaṃ ca||
6.10.12| kṣaumābaddhaṃ pathyamāścyotane vā 1sarpirghṛṣṭaṃ yaṣṭikāhvaṃ sarodhram|
toyonmiśrāḥ kāśmarīdhātripathyāstadvaccāhuḥ kaṭphalaṃ cāmbunaiva||
6.10.13| eṣo 'mlākhye 'nukramaścāpi śuktau kāryaḥ sarvaḥ syātsirāmokṣavarjyaḥ||
6.10.14| sarpiḥ peyaṃ traiphalaṃ tailvakaṃ vā peyaṃ vā syāt kevalaṃ yat purāṇam|
doṣe 'dhastācchuktikāyāmapāste śītairdravyairañjanaṃ kāryamāśu||
6.10.15| vaidūryaṃ yat sphāṭikaṃ vaidrumaṃ ca mauktaṃ śāṅkhaṃ rājataṃ śātakumbham|
cūrṇaṃ sūkṣmaṃ śarkarākṣaudrayuktaṃ śuktiṃ hanyādañjanaṃ caitadāśu||
6.10.16| yuñjyāt sarpirdhūmadarśī narastu śeṣaṃ kuryādraktapitte vidhānam|
yaccaivānyat pittahṛccāpi sarvaṃ yadvīsarpe paittike vai vidhānam||
iti śrīsuśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre pittābhiṣyandapratiṣedho nāma daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ||10||

ekādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.11.1| athātaḥ śleṣmābhiṣyandapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.11.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.11.3| syandādhimanthau kaphajau pravṛddhau jayet sirāṇāmatha mokṣaṇena|
svedāvapīḍāñjanadhūmasekapralepayogaiḥ kavalagrahaiśca||
6.11.4| rūkṣaistathā++āścyotanasaṃvidhānaistathaiva rūksaiḥ puṭapākayogaiḥ|
tryahāttryahāccāpyapatarpaṇānte prātastayostiktaghṛtaṃ praśastam||
6.11.5| tadannapānaṃ ca samācareddhi yacchleṣmaṇo naiva karoti vṛddhim|
kuṭannaṭāsphoṭaphaṇijjñabilvapattūrapilvarkakapitthabhaṅgaiḥ||
6.11.6| svedaṃ vidadhyāt athavā 'nulepaṃ barhiṣṭhaśuṇṭhīsurakāṣṭhakuṣṭhaiḥ|
sindhūtthahiṅgutriphalāmadhūkaprapauṇḍarīkāñjanatutthatāmraiḥ||
6.11.7| piṣṭairjalenāñjanavartayaḥ syuḥ pathyāharidrāmadhukāñjanairvā|
trīṇyūṣaṇāni triphalā haridrā viḍaṅgasāraśca samāni ca syuḥ||
6.11.8| barhiṣṭhakuṣṭhāmarakāṣṭhaśaṅkhapāṭhāmalavyoṣamanaḥśilāśca1|
piṣṭvā 'mbunā vā kusumāni jātikarañjaśobhāñjanajāni yuñjyāt||
6.11.9| phalaṃ prakīryādathavā 'pi śigroḥ puṣpaṃ ca 1tulyaṃ bṛhatīdvayasya|
rasāñjanaṃ saindhavacandanaṃ ca manaḥśilāle laśunaṃ ca tulyam||
6.11.10| piṣṭvā 'ñjanārthe kaphajeṣu dhīmān vartīrvidadhyānnayanāmayeṣu|
roge balāsagrathite 'ñjanaṃ jñaiḥ kartavyametat suviśuddhakāye||
6.11.11| nīlān yavān gavyapayo 'nupītān śalākinaḥ śuṣkatanūn vidahya|
tathā 'rjakāsphotakapitthabilvanirguṇḍijātīkusumāni caiva||
6.11.12| tatkṣāravatsaindhavatuttharocanaṃ pakvaṃ vidadhyādatha lohanāḍyām|
etadbalāsagrathite 'ñjanaṃ syādeṣo 'nukalpastu phaṇijjñakādau||
6.11.13| mahauṣadhaṃ māgadhikāṃ ca mustāṃ1 sasaindhavaṃ yanmaricaṃ ca śuklam|
tanmātuluṅgasvarasena piṣṭaṃ netrāñjanaṃ piṣṭakamāśu hanyāt||
6.11.14| 1phale bṛhatyā magadhodbhavānā nidhāya kalkaṃ phalapākakāle|
1srotojayuktaṃ ca taduddhṛtaṃ syāttadvattu piṣṭe vidhireṣa cāpi||
6.11.15| vārtākaśigrvindrasurāpaṭolakirātatiktāmalakīphaleṣu|
kāsīsasāmudrarasāñjanāni jātyāstathā kṣārakam(korakam)eva cāpi||
6.11.16| praklinnavartmanyupadiśyate tu yogāñjanaṃ tanmadhunā 'vaghṛṣṭam|
nādeyamagryaṃ maricaṃ ca śuklaṃ nepālajātā ca samapramāṇā||
6.11.17| samātuluṅgadrava eṣa yogaḥ kaṇḍūṃ nihanyāt sakṛdañjanena|
saśṛṅgaveraṃ suradāru mustaṃ sindhuprabhūtaṃ(prasūtaṃ) mukulāni jātyāḥ||
6.11.18| surāprapiṣṭaṃ tvidamañjanaṃ hi kaṇḍvāṃ ca śophe ca hitaṃ vadanti|
syandādhimanthakramamācarecca sarveṣu caiteṣu sadā 'pramattaḥ||
(viśeṣato nāvanameva kāryaṃ saṃsarjanaṃ cāpi yathopadiṣṭam1)
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre kaphābhiṣyandapratiṣedho nāmaikādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||11||

dvādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.12.1| athāto raktābhiṣyandapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.12.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.12.3| manthaṃ syandaṃ sirotpātaṃ sirāharṣaṃ ca raktajam|
ekenaiva vidhānena cikitseccaturo gadān||
6.12.4| vyādhyārtāṃścaturo 'pyetān snigdhānkaumbhena sarpiṣā|
rasairudārairathavā sirāmokṣeṇa yojayet||
6.12.5| viriktānāṃ prakāmaṃ ca śirāṃsyeṣāṃ viśodhayet|
vairecanikasiddhena sitāyuktena sarpiṣā||
(majjñā vā tadvimiśreṇa medasā tacchṛtena vā|)
6.12.6| tataḥ pradehāḥ pariṣecanāni nasyāni dhūmāśca yathāsvameva|
āścyotanābhyañjanatarpaṇāni snigdhāśca kāryāḥ puṭapākayogāḥ||
6.12.7| nīlotpalośīrakaṭaṅkaṭerīkālīyayaṣṭīmadhumustarodhraiḥ|
sapadmakairdhautaghṛtapradigdhairakṣṇoḥ pralepaṃ paritaḥ prakuryāt||
6.12.8| rujāyāṃ cāpyatibhṛśaṃ svedāśca mṛdavo hitāḥ|
akṣṇoḥ samantataḥ kāryaṃ pātanaṃ ca jalaukasām||
6.12.9| ghṛtasya mahatī mātrā pītā cārtiṃ niyacchati|
pittābhiṣyandaśamano vidhiścāpyupapāditaḥ||
6.12.10| kaśerumadhukābhyāṃ vā cūrṇamambarasaṃvṛtam|
nyastamapsvāntarikṣāsu hitamāścyotanaṃ bhavet||
6.12.11| pāṭalyarjunaśrīparṇīdhātakīdhātribilvataḥ|
puṣpāṇyatha bṛhatyośca bimbīloṭācca tulyaśaḥ||
6.12.12| samañjiṣṭhāni madhunā piṣṭānīkṣurasena vā|
raktābhiṣyandaśāntyarthametadañjanamiṣyate||
6.12.13| candanaṃ kumudaṃ patraṃ śilājatu sakuṅkumam|
ayastāmrarajastutthaṃ nimbaniryāsamañjanam||
6.12.14| trapu kāṃsyamalaṃ cāpi piṣṭvā puṣparasena tu|
vipulā yāḥ kṛtā vartyaḥ pūjitāścāñjane sadā||
6.12.15| syādañjanaṃ ghṛtaṃ kṣaudraṃ sirotpātasya bheṣajam|
tadvatsaindhavakāsīsaṃ stanyaghṛṣṭaṃ ca pūjitam||
6.12.16| madhunā śaṅkhanaipālītutthadārvyaḥ sasaindhavāḥ|
rasaḥ śirīṣapuṣpācca surāmaricamākṣikaiḥ||
6.12.17| yuktaṃ tu madhunā vā 'pi gairikaṃ hitamañjane|
sirāharṣe 'ñjanaṃ kuryāt phaṇitaṃ madhusaṃyutam||
6.12.18| madhunā tārkṣyajaṃ vā 'pi kāsīaṃ vā sasaidhavam|
vetrāmlastanyasaṃyuktaṃ phāṇitaṃ ca sasaindhavam||
6.12.19| paittaṃ vidhimaśeṣeṇa kuryādarjunaśāntaye|
ikṣukṣaudrasitāstanyadārvīmadhukasaindhavaiḥ||
6.12.20| sekāñjanaṃ cātra hitamamlairāścyotanaṃ tathā|
sitāmadhukakaṭvaṅgamastukṣaudrāmlasaindhavaiḥ||
6.12.21| bījapūrakakolāmladāḍimāmlaiśca yuktitaḥ|
ekaśo vā dviśo vā 'pi yojitaṃ vā tribhistribhiḥ||
6.12.22| sphaṭikaṃ vidrumaṃ śaṅkho madhukaṃ kadhu caiva hi|
śaṅkhakṣaudrasitāyuktaḥ sāmudraḥ phena eva vā||
6.12.23| dvāvimau vihitau yogāvañjane 'rjunanāśanau|
saindhavakṣaudrakatakāḥ sakṣaudraṃ vā rasāñjanam||
6.12.24| kāsīsaṃ madhunā vā 'pi yojyamatrāñjane sadā|
lohacūrṇāni sarvāṇi dhātavo lavaṇāni ca||
6.12.25| ratnāni dantāḥ śṛṅgāṇi gaṇaścāpyavasādanaḥ|
kukkuṭāṇḍakapālāni laśunaṃ kaṭukatrayam||
6.12.26| karañjabījamelā ca lekhyāñjanamidaṃ smṛtam|
puṭapākāvasānena raktavisrāvaṇādinā||
6.12.27| saṃpāditasya vidhinā kṛtsnena syandaghātinā|
anenāpaharecchukramavraṇaṃ kuśalo bhiṣak||
6.12.28| uttānamavagāḍhaṃ vā karkaśaṃ vā 'pi savraṇam|
śirīṣabījamaricapippalīsaindhavairapi||
6.12.29| śukrasya gharṣaṇaṃ kāryamathavā saindhavena tu|
kuryāttāmrarajaḥśaṅkhaśilāmaricasaindhavaiḥ||
6.12.30| antyāddviguṇitairebhirañjanaṃ śukranāśanam|
kuryādañjanayogau vā samyak ślokārdhikāvimau||
6.12.31| śaṅkhakolāsthikatakadrāksāmadhukamākṣikaiḥ|
kṣaudradantārṇavamalaśirīṣakusumairapi||
6.12.32| kṣārāñjanaṃ vā vitaredbalāsagrathitāpaham|
mudgān vā nistuṣān bhṛṣṭān śaṅkhakṣaudrasitāyutān||
6.12.33| madhūkasāraṃ madhunā yojayeccāñjane sadā|
bibhītakāsthimajjā vā sakṣaudraḥ śukranāśanaḥ||
6.12.34| śaṅkhaśuktimadhudrākṣāmadhukaṃ katakāni ca|
dvitvaggate saśūle vā vātaghnaṃ tarpaṇaṃ hitam||
6.12.35| vaṃśajāruṣkarau tālaṃ nārikelaṃ ca dāhayet|
visrāvya ksāravaccūrṇaṃ bhāvayetkarabhāsthijam||
6.12.36| bahuśo 'ñjanametatsyācchukravaivarṇyanāśanam|
ajakāṃ pārśvato viddhvā sūcyā visrāvya codakam||
6.12.37| vraṇaṃ gomāṃsacūrṇena pūrayet sarpiṣā saha|
bahuśo 'valikheccāpi vartmāsyopagataṃ yadi||
6.12.38| saśophaścāpyaśophaśca dvau pākau yau prakīrtitau|
snehasvedopapannasya tatra viddhvā sirāṃ bhiṣak||
6.12.39| sekāścyotananasyāni puṭapākāṃśca kārayet|
sarvataścāpi śuddhasya kartavyamidamañjanam||
6.12.40| tāmrapātrasthitaṃ 1māsaṃ sarpiḥ saindhavasaṃyutam|
maireyaṃ vā 'pi dadhyevaṃ dadhyuttarakameva vā||
6.12.41| ghṛtaṃ kāṃsyamalopetaṃ stanyaṃ vā 'pi sasaindhavam|
madhūkasāraṃ madhunā tulyāṃśaṃ gairikeṇa vā||
6.12.42| sarpiḥsaindhavatāmrāṇi yoṣitstanyayutāni vā|
dāḍimārevatāśmantakolāmlaiśca sasaindhavām|
rasakriyāṃ vā vitaretsamyakpākajighāṃsayā||
6.12.43| 1māsaṃ saindhavasaṃyuktaṃ sthitaṃ sarpiṣi nāgaram|
āścyotanāñjanaṃ yojyamabalākṣīrasaṃyutam||
6.12.44| jātyāḥ puṣpaṃ saindhavaṃ śṛṅgaveraṃ kṛṣṇābījaṃ kīṭaśatrośca sāram|
etat piṣṭaṃ netrapāke 'ñjanārthaṃ kṣaudropetaṃ nirviśaṅkaṃ1 prayojyam||
6.12.45| pūyālase śoṇitamokṣaṇaṃ ca hitaṃ tathaivāpyupanāhanaṃ ca|
kṛtsno vidhiścekṣaṇapākaghātī yathāvidhānaṃ bhiṣajā prayojyaḥ||
6.12.46| kāsīsasindhuprabhavārdrakaistu hitaṃ bhavedañjanameva cātra|
kṣaudrānvitairebhirathopayuñjyādanyattu tāmrāyasacūrṇayuktaiḥ||
6.12.47| snehādibhiḥ samyagapāsya doṣāṃstṛptiṃ vidhāyātha yathāsvameva|
praklinnavartmānamupakrameta sekāñjanāścyotananasyadhūmaiḥ||
6.12.48| mustāharidrāmadhukapriyaṅgusiddhārtharodhrotpalasārivābhiḥ|
kṣuṇṇābhirāścyotanameva kāryamatrāñjanaṃ cāñjanamākṣikaṃ syāt||
6.12.49| patraṃ phalaṃ cāmalakasya paktvā kriyāṃ vidadhyādathavā 'ñjanārthe|
vaṃśasya bhūlena rasakriyāṃ vā vartīkṛtāṃ tāmrakapālapakvām||
6.12.50| rasakriyāṃ vā triphalāvipakvāṃ palāśapuṣpaiḥ svaramañjarervā|
piṣṭvā chagalyāḥ payasā malaṃ vā kāṃsasya dagdhvā saha tāntavena||
6.12.51| pratyañjanaṃ tanmaricairupetaṃ cūrṇena tāmrasya sahopayojyam|
samudraphenaṃ lavaṇottamaṃ ca śaṅkho 'tha mudgo maricaṃ ca śuklam||
6.12.52| cūrṇāñjanaṃ 1jāḍyamathāpi kaṇḍūmaklinnavartmānyupahanti śīghram|
praklinnavartmanyapi caita eva yogāḥ prayojyāśca samīkṣya doṣam||
6.12.53| sakajjalaṃ tāmraghaṭe ca ghṛṣṭaṃ sarpiryutaṃ tulthakamañjanaṃ ca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre raktābhiṣyandapratiṣedho nāma dvādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||12||

trayodaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.13.1| athāto lekhyarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.13.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.13.3| nava ye 'bhihitā lekhyāḥ sāmānyasteṣvayaṃ vidhiḥ|
snigdhavāntaviriktasya nivātātapasadmani||
6.13.4| (āptairdṛḍhaṃ gṛhītasya veśmanyuttānaśāyinaḥ|)
sukhodakaprataptena vāsasā susamāhitaḥ|
svedayedvartma nirbhujya vāmāṅguṣṭhāṅgulishtitam||
6.13.5| aṅgulyaṅguṣṭhakābhyāṃ tu nirbhugnaṃ vartma yatnataḥ|
1plotāntarābhyāṃ na yathā calati sraṃsate 'pi vā||
6.13.6| tataḥ pramṛjya plotena vartma śastrapadāṅkitam|
likhecchastreṇa patrairvā tato rakte sthite punaḥ||
6.13.7| svinnaṃ manohvākāsīsavyoṣārdrāñjanasaindhavaiḥ1|
ślakṣṇapiṣṭaiḥ samākṣīkaiḥ pratisāryoṣṇavāriṇā||
6.13.8| prakṣālya haviṣā siktaṃ vraṇavat samupācaret|
svedāvapīḍaprabhṛtīṃstryahādūrdhvaṃ prayojayet||
6.13.9| vyāsataste samuddiṣṭaṃ vidhānaṃ lekhyakarmaṇi|
asṛgāsrāvarahitaṃ kaṇḍūśophavivarjitam||
6.13.10| samaṃ nakhanibhaṃ vartma likhitaṃ samyagiṣyate|
raktamakṣi sravet skannaṃ kṣatācchastrakṛtāddhruvam||
6.13.11| rāgaśophaparisrāvāstimiraṃ vyādhyanirjayaḥ|
vartma śyāvaṃ guru stabdhaṃ kaṇḍūharṣopadehavat||
6.13.12| netrapākamudīrṇaṃ vā kurvītāpratikāriṇaḥ|
etaddurlikhitaṃ jñeyaṃ snehayitvā punarlikhet||
6.13.13| vyāvartate yadā vartma pakṣma cāpi 1vimuhyati|
syāt saruk srāvabahulaṃ tadatisrāvitaṃ viduḥ||
6.13.14| snehasvedādiriṣṭaḥ syāt kramastatrānilāpahaḥ|
vartmāvabandhaṃ kliṣṭaṃ ca bahalaṃ yacca kīrtitam||
6.13.15| pothakīścāpyavalikhet pracchayitvā 'grataḥ śanaiḥ|
samaṃ likhettu medhāvī śyāvakardamavartmanī||
6.13.16| kumbhīkinīṃ śarkarāṃ ca tathaivotsaṅginīmapi|
1kalpayitvā tu śastreṇa likhet paścādatandritaḥ||
6.13.17| bhaveyurvartmasu ca yāḥ piḍakāḥ kaṭhinā bhṛśam|
hrasvāstāmrāśca tāḥ pakvā bhindyādbhinnā likhedapi||
6.13.18| taruṇīścālpasaṃrambhā piḍakā bāhyavartmajāḥ|
viditvaitāḥ praśamayet svedālepanaśodhanaiḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre lekhyarogapratiṣedho nāma trayodaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||13||

caturdaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.14.1| athāto bhedyarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.14.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.14.3| svedayitvā bisagranthiṃ chidrāṇyasya nirāśayam1|
pakvaṃ bhittvā tu śastreṇa sindhavenāvacūrṇayet||
6.14.4| kāsīsamāgadhīpuṣpanepālyelāyutena tu|
tataḥ kṣaudraghṛtaṃ dattvā samyagbandhamathācaret||
6.14.5| rocanākṣāratutthāni pippalyaḥ kṣaudrameva ca|
pratisāraṇamekaikaṃ bhinne lagaṇa iṣyate||
6.14.6| mahatyapi ca yuñjīta kṣārāgnī vidhikovidaḥ|
svinnāṃ bhinnāṃ viniṣpīḍya bhiṣagañjananāmikām||
6.14.7| śilailānatasindhūtthaiḥ sakṣaudraiḥ pratisārayet|
rasāñjanamadhubhyāṃ tu bhittvā vā śastrakarmavit||
6.14.8| pratisāryāñjanairyuñjyāduṣṇairdīpaśikhodbhavaiḥ|
samyaksvinne kṛmigranthau bhinne syāt pratisāraṇam||
6.14.9| triphalātutthakāsīsasaindhavaiśca rasakriyā1|
bhittvopanāhaṃ kaphajaṃ pippalīmadhusaindhavaiḥ||
6.14.10| lekhayenmaṇḍalāgreṇa samantāt pracchayedapi|
saṃsnehya patrabhaṅgaiśca svedayitvā yathāsukham||
6.14.11| sarveṣveteṣu vihitaṃ vidhānaṃ snehapūrvakam|
saṃpakve prayato bhūtvā kurvīta vraṇaropaṇam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre bhedyarogapratiṣedho nāma caturdaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||14||

pañcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.15.1| athātaśchedyarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.15.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.15.3| snigdhaṃ bhuktavato hyannamupaviṣṭasya yatnataḥ|
saṃroṣayettu nayanaṃ bhiṣak cūrṇaistu lāvaṇaiḥ||
6.15.4| tataḥ saṃroṣitaṃ tūrṇaṃ susvinnaṃ paridhaṭṭitam|
arma yatra valījātaṃ tatraitallagayedbhiṣak||
6.15.5| apāṅgaṃ prekṣamāṇasya baḍiśena samāhitaḥ|
mucuṇḍyā++ādāya medhāvī sūcīsūtreṇa vā punaḥ||
6.15.6| na cotthāpayatā kṣipraṃ kāryamabhyunnataṃ1 tu tat|
1śastrābādhabhayāccāsya vartmanī grāhayeddṛḍham||
6.15.7| tataḥ praśithilībhūtaṃ tribhireva vilambitam|
ullikhanmaṇḍalāgreṇa tīkṣṇena pariśodhayet||
6.15.8| vimuktaṃ sarvataścāpi kṛṣṇācchuklācca maṇḍalāt|
nītvā kanīnakopāntaṃ chindyānnātikanīnakam||
6.15.9| caturbhāgasthite māṃse nākṣi vyāpattimṛcchati|
kanīnakavadhādasraṃ nāḍī vā 'pyupajāyate||
6.15.10| hīnacchedāt punarvṛddhiṃ śīgramevādhigacchati|
arma yajjālavadvyāpi tadapyunmārjya1 lambitam||
6.15.11| chindyādvakreṇa śastreṇa vartmaśuklāntamāthitam|
pratisāraṇamakṣṇostu tataḥ kāryamanantaram||
6.15.12| yāvanālasya cūrṇena trikaṭorlavaṇasya ca|
svedayitvā tataḥ paścādbadhnīyāt kuśalo bhiṣak||
6.15.13| doṣartubalakālajñaḥ snehaṃ dattvā yathāhitam|
vraṇavat saṃvidhānaṃ tu tasya kuryādataḥ param||
6.15.14| tryahānmuktvā karasvedaṃ dattvā śodhanamācaret|
karañjabījāmalakamadhukaiḥ sādhitaṃ payaḥ||
6.15.15| hitamāścyotanaṃ śūle dvirahnaḥ kṣaudrasaṃyutam|
madhukotpalakiñjalkadūrvākalkaiśca mūrdhani||
6.15.16| pralepaḥ saghṛtaḥ śītaḥ kṣīrapiṣṭaḥ praśasyate|
lekhyāñjanairapaharedarmaśeṣaṃ bhavedyadi||
6.15.17| arma cālpaṃ dadhinibhaṃ nīlaṃ raktamathāpi vā|
dhūsaraṃ tanu yaccāpi śukravattadupācaret||
6.15.18| carmābhaṃ bahulaṃ yattu snāyumāṃsaghanāvṛtam|
chedyameva tadarma syāt kṛṣṇamaṇḍalagaṃ ca yat||
6.15.19| viśuddhavarṇamakliṣṭaṃ kriyāsvakṣi gataklamam|
chinne 'rmaṇi bhavet samyagyathāsvamanupadravam||
6.15.20| sirājāle sirā yāstu kaṭhināstāśca buddhimān|
ullikhenmaṇḍalāgreṇa baḍiśenāvalambitāḥ||
6.15.21| sirāsu piḍakā jātā yā na sidhyanti bheṣajaiḥ|
armavanmaṇḍalāgreṇa tāsāṃ chedanamiṣyate||
6.15.22| rogayoścaitayoḥ kāryamarmoktaṃ pratisāraṇam|
vidhiścāpi yathādoṣaṃ lekhanadravyasaṃbhṛtaḥ||
6.15.23| sandhau saṃsvedya śastreṇa varṇīkāṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ|
uttare ca tribhāge ca baḍiśenāvalambitām||
6.15.24| chindyāttato 'rdhamagre syādaśrunāḍī hyato 'nyathā|
pratisāraṇamatrāpi saindhavakṣaudramiṣyate||
6.15.25| lekhanīyāni cūrṇāni vyādhiśeṣasya bheṣajam|
śaṅkhaṃ samudraphenaṃ ca maṇḍūkīṃ ca samudrajām||
6.15.26| sphaṭikaṃ kuruvindaṃ ca pravālāśmantakaṃ tathā|
1vaidūryaṃ pulakaṃ muktāmayastāmrarajāṃsi ca||
6.15.27| samabhāgāni saṃpiṣya sārdhaṃ srotoñjanena tu|
cūrṇāñjanaṃ kārayitvā bhājane bheṣaśṛṅgaje||
6.15.28| saṃsthāpyobhayataḥ kālamañjayet satataṃ budhaḥ|
armāṇi piḍakāṃ hanyāt sirājālāni tena vai||
6.15.29| arśastathā yacca nāmnā śuṣkārśo 'rbudameva ca|
abhyantaraṃ vartmaśayā vidhānaṃ teṣu vakṣyate||
6.15.30| vartmopasvedya nirbhujya sūcyotkṣipya prayatnataḥ|
maṇḍalāgreṇa tīkṣṇena mūle bhindyādbhiṣagvaraḥ||
6.15.31| tataḥ saindhavakāsīsakṛṣṇābhiḥ pratisārayet|
sthite ca rudhire vartma dahet samyak śalākayā||
6.15.32| kṣāreṇāvalikheccāpi vyādhiśeso bhavedyadi|
tīkṣṇairubhayatobhāgaistato doṣamadhikṣipet||
6.15.33| vitarecca yathādoṣamabhiṣyandakriyāvidhim|
śastrakarmaṇyuparate māsaṃ ca syāt suyantritaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre chedyarogapratiṣedho nāma pñcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||15||

ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.16.1| athātaḥ 1pakṣmakopapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.16.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.16.3| yāpyastu yo vartmabhavo vikāraḥ pakṣmaprakopo 'bhihitaḥ purastāt|
tatropaviṣṭasya narasya carma vartmopariṣṭādanutiryageva||
6.16.4| bhruvoradhastāt parimucya bhāgau pakṣmāśritaṃ caikamato 'vakṛntet|
kanīnakāpāṅgasamaṃ samantādyavākṛti snigdhatanornarasya||
6.16.5| utkṛtya śastreṇa yavapramāṇaṃ bālena sīvyodbhiṣagapramattaḥ|
dattvā ca sarpirmadhunā 'vaśeṣaṃ kuryādvidhānaṃ1 vihitaṃ vraṇe yat||
6.16.6| lalāṭadeśe ca nibaddhapaṭṭaṃ1 prāksyūtamatrāpyaparaṃ ca baddhvā|
sthairyaṃ gate cāpyatha śastramārge bālān vimuñcet kuśalo 'bhivīkṣya||
6.16.7| evaṃ na cecchāmyati tasya vartma nirbhujya doṣopahatāṃ valiṃ ca|
tato 'gninā vā pratisārayettāṃ kṣāreṇa vā samyagavekṣya dhīraḥ||
6.16.8| chittvā samaṃ vā 'pyupapakṣmamālāṃ samyaggṛhītvā baḍiśaistribhistu|
pathyāphalena pratisārayettu ghṛṣṭena vā tauvarakeṇa samyak||
6.16.9| catvāra ete vidhayo vihantuṃ pakṣmoparodhaṃ pṛthageva śastāḥ|
virecanāścyotanadhūmanasyalepāñjanasneharasakriyāśca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre pakṣmagatarogapratiṣedho nāma ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||16||

saptadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.17.1| athāto dṛṣṭigatarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.17.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.17.3| trayaḥ sādhyāstrayo 'sādhyā yāpyāḥ ṣaṭ ca bhavanti hi|
tatraikasya pratīkāraḥ kīrtito dhūmadarśinaḥ||
6.17.4| dṛṣṭau pittavidagdhāyāṃ vidagdhāyāṃ kaphena ca|
pittaśleṣmaharaṃ kuryādvidhiṃ śastrakṣatādṛte||
6.17.5| nasyasekāñjanālepapuṭapākaiḥ satarpaṇaiḥ|
ādye tu traiphalaṃ peyaṃ sarpistraivṛtamuttare||
6.17.6| tailvakaṃ cobhayoḥ pathyaṃ kevalaṃ jīrṇameva vā|
gairikaṃ saindhavaṃ kṛṣṇā godantasya maṣī tathā||
6.17.7| gomāṃsaṃ maricaṃ bījaṃ śirīṣasya manaḥśilā|
vṛntaṃ kapitthānmadhunā svayaṅguptāphalāni ca||
6.17.8| catvāra ete yogāḥ syurubhayorañjane hitāḥ|
kubjakāśokaśālāmrapriyaṅgunalinotpalaiḥ||
6.17.9| puṣpairhareṇukṛṣṇāhvāpathyāmalakasaṃyutaiḥ|
sarpirmadhuyutaiścūrṇairveṇunāḍyāmavasthitaiḥ||
6.17.10| añjayed dvādapi bhiṣak pittaśleṣmavibhāvitau|
āmrajambūdbhavaṃ puṣpaṃ tadrasena hareṇukām||
6.17.11| piṣṭvā kṣaudrājyasaṃyuktaṃ prayojyamathavā 'ñjanam|
nalinotpalakiñjalkagairikairgośakṛdrasaiḥ||
6.17.12| guḍikāñjanametadvā dinarātryandhayorhitam|
rasāñjanarasakṣaudratālīśasvarṇagairikam||
6.17.13| gośakṛdrasasaṃyuktaṃ pittopahatadṛṣṭaye|
śītaṃ sauvīrakaṃ vā 'pi piṣṭvā 'tha rasabhāvitam||
6.17.14| kūrmapittena matimān bhāvayedrauhitena vā|
cūrṇāñjanamidaṃ nityaṃ prayojyaṃ pittaśāntaye||
6.17.15| kāśmarīpuṣpamadhukadārvīrodhrarasāñjanaiḥ|
sakṣaudramañjanaṃ tadvaddhitamatrāmaye sadā||
6.17.16| srotojaṃ saindhavaṃ reṇukāṃ cāpi peṣayet|
ajāmūtreṇa tā vartyaḥ kṣaṇadāndhyāñjane hitāḥ||
6.17.17| kālānusārivāṃ kṛṣṇāṃ nāgaraṃ madhukaṃ tathā|
tālīśapatraṃ kṣaṇade gāṅgeyaṃ ca yakṛdrase||
6.17.18| kṛtāstā vartayaḥ piṣṭāśchāyāśuṣkāḥ sukhāvahāḥ|
manaḥśilābhayāvyoṣabalākālānusārivāḥ||
6.17.19| saphenā vartayaḥ piṣṭāśchāgakṣīrasamanvitāḥ|
gomūtrapittamadirāyakṛddhātrīrase pacet||
6.17.20| kṣudrāñjanaṃ rasenānyadyakdtastraiphale 'pi vā|
gomūtrājyārṇavamalapippalīkṣaudrakaṭphalaiḥ||
6.17.21| saindhavopahitaṃ yuñjyānnihitaṃ veṇugahvare1|
medo yakṛdghṛtaṃ cājaṃ pippalyaḥ saidhavaṃ madhu||
6.17.22| rasamāmalakāccāpi pakvaṃ samyaṅnidhāpayet|
kośe khadiranirmāṇe tadvat kṣudrāñjanaṃ hitam||
6.17.23| hareṇumagadhājāsthimajjailāyakṛdanvitam|
yakṛdrasenāñjanaṃ vā śleṣmopahatadṛṣṭaye||
6.17.24| vipācya godhāyakṛdardhapāṭitaṃ supūritaṃ māgadhikābhiragninā|
niṣevitaṃ tadyakṛdañjanena nihanti naktāndhyamasaṃśayaṃ khalu||
6.17.25| tathā yakṛcchāgabhavaṃ hutāśane vipācya samyaṅmagadhāsamanvitam|
prayojitaṃ pūrvavadāśvasaṃśayaṃ jayet kṣapāndhyaṃ sakdṛañjanānnṛṇām||
6.17.26| plīhā yakṛccāpyupabhākṣite1 ubhe prakalpya śūlye ghṛtatailasaṃyute|
te sārṣapasnehasamāyute 'ñjanaṃ naktāndhyamāśveva hataḥ prayojite||
6.17.27| nadījaśimbītrikaṭūnyathāñjanaṃ manaḥśilā dve ca niśe yakṛd(śakṛd)gavām|
sacandaneyaṃ guṭikā 'thavā 'ñjanaṃ praśasyate vai divaseṣvapaśyatām||
6.17.28| bhavanti yāpyāḥ khalu ye ṣaḍāmayā haredasṛkteṣu sirāvimokṣaṇaiḥ|
virecayeccāpi purāṇasarpiṣā virecanāṅgopahitena sarvadā||
6.17.29| payovimiśraṃ pavanodbhave hitaṃ vadanti pañcāṅgulatailameva tu|
bhavedghṛtaṃ traiphalameva śodhanaṃ viśeṣataḥ śoṇitapittarogayoḥ||
6.17.30| trivṛdvirekaḥ kaphaje praśasyate tridoṣaje tailamuśanti tatkṛtam|
purāṇasarpistimireṣu sarvaśo hitaṃ bhavedāyasabhājanasthitam||
6.17.31| hitaṃ ca vidyāttriphalāghṛtaṃ sadā kṛtaṃ ca yanmeṣaviṣāṇanāmabhiḥ|
sadā 'valihyāttriphalāṃ sucūrṇitāṃ ghṛtapragāḍhāṃ timire 'tha pittaje||
6.17.32| samīraje tailayutāṃ kaphātmake madhupragāḍhāṃ vidadhīta yuktitaḥ|
gavāṃ śakṛtkvāthavipakvamuttamaṃ hitaṃ tu tailaṃ timireṣu nāvanam||
6.17.33| hitaṃ ghṛtaṃ kevala eva paittike hyajāvikaṃ yanmadhurairvipācitam|
tailaṃ sthirādau madhure ca yadgaṇe tathā 'ṇutailaṃ pavanāsṛgutthayoḥ||
6.17.34| sahāśvagandhātibalāvarīśṛtaṃ hitaṃ ca nasye trivṛtaṃ yadīritam|
jalodbhavānūpajamāṃsasṃskṛtādghṛtaṃ vidheyaṃ payaso yadutthitam||
6.17.35| sasaindhavaḥ kravyabhugeṇamāṃsayorhitaḥ sasarpiḥ samadhuḥ puṭāhvayaḥ|
vasā 'tha gṛdhroragatāmracūḍajā sadā praśastā madhukānvitā 'ñjane||
6.17.36| pratyañjanaṃ srotasi yatsamutthitaṃ kramādrasakṣīraghṛteṣu bhāvitam|
sthitaṃ daśāhatrayametadañjanaṃ kṛṣṇoragāsye kuśasaṃpraveṣṭite||
6.17.37| tanmālatīkorakasaindhavāyutaṃ sadā 'ñjanaṃ syāttimire 'tha rāgiṇi|
subhāvitaṃ vā payasā dinatrayaṃ kācāpahaṃ śāstravidaḥ pracakṣate||
6.17.38| havirhitaṃ kṣīrabhavaṃ tu paittike vadanti nasye madhurauṣadhaiḥ kṛtam|
tattarpaṇe caiva hitaṃ prayojitaṃ sajāṅgalasteṣu ca yaḥ puṭāhvayaḥ||
6.17.39| rasāñjanakṣaudrasitāmanaḥśilāḥ kṣudrāñjanaṃ tanmadhukena saṃyutam|
samāñjanaṃ vā kanakākarodbhavaṃ sucūrṇitaṃ śreṣṭhamuśanti tadvidaḥ||
6.17.40| bhilloṭagandhodakasekasecitaṃ pratyañjane cātra hitaṃ tu tutthakam|
sameṣaśṛṅgāñjanabhāgasaṃmitaṃ jalodbhavaṃ kācamalaṃ vyapohati||
6.17.41| palāśarohītamadhūkajā rasāḥ kṣaudreṇa yuktā madirāgramiśritāḥ1|
uśīralodhratriphalāpriyaṅgubhiḥ pacettu nasyaṃ kapharogaśāntaye||
6.17.42| viḍaṅgapāṭhākiṇihīṅgudītvacaḥ prayojayeddhūmadhuśīrasaṃyutāḥ|
vanaspatikvāthavipācitaṃ ghṛtaṃ hitaṃ haridrānalade ca tarpaṇam||
6.17.43| samāgadho mākṣikasaindhavāḍhyaḥ sajāṅgalaḥ syāt puṭapāka eva ca|
manaḥśilātryūṣaṇaśaṅkhamākṣikaiḥ sasindhukāsīsarasāñjanaiḥ kriyāḥ||
6.17.44| hite ca kāsīsarasāñjane tathā vadanti pathye guḍanāgarairyute|
yadañjanaṃ vā bahuśo niṣecitaṃ samūtravarge triphalodake śṛte||
6.17.45| niśācarāsthisthitametadañjanaṃ kṣipecca māsaṃ salile 'sthire punaḥ|
meṣasya puṣpairmadhukena saṃyutaṃ tadañjanaṃ sarvakṛte prayojayet||
6.17.46| kriyāśca sarvāḥ kṣatajodbhave hitaḥ kramaḥ parimlāyini cāpi pittahṛt|
kramo hitaḥ syandaharaḥ prayojitaḥ samīkṣya doṣeṣu1 yathāsvameva ca||
6.17.47| doṣodaye naiva ca viplutiṃgate dravyāṇi nasyādiṣu yojayedbudhaḥ|
punaśca kalpe 'ñjanavistaraḥ śubhaḥ pravakṣyate 'nyastamapīha yojayet||
6.17.48| ghṛtaṃ purāṇaṃ triphalāṃ śatāvarīṃ paṭolamudgāmalakaṃ yavānapi|
niṣevamāṇasya narasya yatnato bhayaṃ sughorarāttimirānna vidyate||
6.17.49| śatāvarīpāyasa eva kevalastathā kṛto vā++āmalakeṣu pāyasaḥ|
prabhūtasarpistriphalodakottaro yavaudano vā timiraṃ vyapohati||
6.17.50| jīvantiśākaṃ suniṣaṇṇakaṃ ca sataṇḍulīyaṃ varavāstukaṃ ca|
cillī tathā mūlakapotikā ca dṛṣṭerhitaṃ śākunajāṅgalaṃ ca||
6.17.51| paṭolakarkoṭakakāravellavārtākutarkārikarīrajāni|
śākāni śigrvārtagalāni caiva hitāni dṛṣṭerghṛtasādhitāni||
6.17.52| vivarjayetsirāmokṣaṃ timire rāgamāgate|
yantreṇotpīḍito doṣo nihanyādāśu darśanam||
6.17.53| arāgi timiraṃ sādhyamādyaṃ paṭalamāśritam|
kṛcchraṃ dvitīye rāgi syāttṛtīye yāpyamucyate||
6.17.54| rāgaprāpteṣvapi hitāstimireṣu tathā kriyāḥ|
yāpanārthaṃ yathoddiṣṭāḥ sevyāścāpi jalaukasaḥ||
6.17.55| ślaiṣmike liṅganāśe tu karma vakṣyāmi siddhaye|
na cedardhendugharmāmbubindumuktākṛtiḥ sthiraḥ||
6.17.56| viṣamo vā tanurmadhye rājimān vā bahuprabhaḥ|
dṛṣṭistho lakṣyate doṣaḥ sarujo vā salohitaḥ||
6.17.57| snigdhasvinnasya tasyātha kāle nātyuṣṇaśītale|
yantritasyopaviṣṭasya svāṃ nāsāṃ paśyataḥ samam||
6.17.58| matimān śuklabhāgau dvau kṛṣṇānmuktvā hyapāṅgataḥ|
unmīlya nayane samyak sirājālavivarjite||
6.17.59| nādho nordhvaṃ na pārśvābhyāṃ chidre daivakṛte tataḥ|
śalākayā prayatnena viśvastaṃ yavavakrayā||
6.17.60| madhyapradeśinyaṅguṣṭhasthirahastagṛhītayā|
dakṣiṇena bhiṣak savyaṃ vidhyet savyena cetarat||
6.17.61| vāribindvāgamaḥ samyag bhavecchabdestathā vyadhe|
saṃsicya viddhamātraṃ tu yoṣitstanyena kovidaḥ||
6.17.62| sthire doṣe cale vā 'pi svedayedakṣi bāhyataḥ|
samyak śalākāṃ saṃsthāpya bhaṅgairanilanāśanaiḥ||
6.17.63| śalākāgreṇa tu tato nirlikheddṛṣṭimaṇḍalam|
vidhyato yo 'nyapārśve 'kṣṇastaṃ ruddhvā nāsikāpuṭam||
6.17.64| ucchiṅghanena hartavyo dṛṣṭimaṇḍalagaḥ kaphaḥ|
nirabhra iva gharmāṃśuryadā dṛṣṭiḥ prakāśate||
6.17.65| tadā 'sau likhitā samyag jñeyā yā cāpi nirvyathā|
(evaṃ tvaśakye nirhartuṃ doṣe pratyāgate 'pi vā||
6.17.66| snehādyairupapannasya vyadho bhūyo vidhīyate|)
tato dṛṣṭeṣu rūpeṣu śalākāmāharecchanaiḥ||
6.17.67| ghṛtenābhyajya nayanaṃ vastrapaṭṭena veṣṭayet|
tato gṛhe nirābādhe śayītottāna eva ca||
6.17.68| udgārakāsakṣavathuṣṭhīvanotkampanāni1 ca|
tatkālaṃ nācaredūrdhvaṃ yantraṇā snehapītavat||
6.17.69| tryahāt tryahācca dhāveta kaṣāyairanilāpahaiḥ|
vāyorbhayāt tryahādūrdhvaṃ svedayedakṣi pūrvavat||
6.17.70| daśāhamevaṃ saṃyamya hitaṃ dṛṣṭiprasādanam|
paścātkarma ca seveta laghvannaṃ cāpi mātrayā||
6.17.71| sirāvyadhavidhau pūrvaṃ narā ye ṛca vivarjitāḥ|
na teṣāṃ nīlikāṃ vidhyedanyatrābhihitādbhiṣak||
6.17.72| pūryate śoṇitenākṣi sirāvedhādvisarpatā|
tatra strīstanyayaṣṭyāhvapakvaṃ seke hitaṃ ghṛtam||
6.17.73| apāṅgāsannaviddhe tu śophaśūlāśruraktatāḥ|
tatropanāhaṃ bhrūmadhye kuryāccoṣṇājyasecanam||
6.17.74| vyadhenāsannakṛṣṇena rāgaḥ kṛṣṇaṃ ca pīḍyate|
tatrādhaḥśodhanaṃ sekaḥ sarpiṣā raktamokṣaṇam||
6.17.75| athāpyupari viddhe tu kaṣṭā ruk saṃpravartate|
tatra koṣṇena haviṣā pariṣekaḥ praśasyate||
6.17.76| śūlāśrurāgāstvatyarthamadhovedhena1 picchilaḥ|
śalākāmanu cāsrāvastatra1 pūrvacikitsitam||
6.17.77| rāgāśruvedanāstambhaharṣāścātivighaṭṭite|
snehasvedau hitau tatra hitaṃ cāpyanuvāsanam||
6.17.78| doṣastvadho 'pakṛṣṭo 'pi taruṇaḥ punarūrdhvagaḥ|
kuryācchuklāruṇaṃ netraṃ tīvraruṅnaṣṭadarśanam||
6.17.79| madhuraistatra siddhena ghṛtenākṣṇaḥ prasecanam|
śirobastiṃ ca tenaiva dadyānmāṃsaiśca bhojanam||
6.17.80| doṣastu saṃjātabalo ghanaḥ saṃpūrṇamaṇḍalaḥ|
prāpya naśyecchalākāgraṃ tanvabhramiva mārutam||
6.17.81| mūrdhābhighātavyāyāmavyavāyavamimūrcchanaiḥ|
doṣaḥ pratyeti kopācca 1viddho 'titaruṇaśca yaḥ||
6.17.82| śalākā karkaśā śūlaṃ kharā doṣapariplutim|
vraṇaṃ viśālaṃ sthūlāgrā tīkṣṇā hiṃsyādanekadhā||
6.17.83| jalāsrāvaṃ tu viṣamā kriyāsaṅgamathāsthirā|
karoti varjitā doṣaistasmādebhirhitā bhavet||
6.17.84| aṣṭāṅgulāyatā madhye sūtreṇa pariveṣṭitā|
aṅguṣṭhaparvasamitā vaktrayormukulākṛtiḥ||
6.17.85| tāmrāyasī śātakumbhī śalākā syādaninditā|
rāgaḥ śopho 'rbudaṃ coṣo budbudaṃ śūkarākṣitā||
6.17.86| adhimanthādayaścānye rogāḥ syurvyadhadoṣajāḥ|
ahitācārato vā 'pi yathāsvaṃ tānupācaret||
6.17.87| rujāyāmakṣirāge vā yogān bhūyo nibodha me|
gairikaṃ sārivā dūrvā yavapiṣṭaṃ ghṛtaṃ payaḥ||
6.17.88| 1sukhālepaḥ prayojyo 'yaṃ vedanārāgaśāntaye|
mṛdubhṛṣṭaistilairvā 'pi siddhārthakasamāyutaiḥ||
6.17.89| mātuluṅgarasopetaiḥ 1sukhālepastadarthakṛt|
payasyāsārivāpatramañjiṣṭhāmadhukairapi||
6.17.90| ajākṣīrānvitairlepaḥ sukhoṣṇaḥ pathya ucyate|
dārupadmakaśuṇṭhībhirevameva kṛto 'pi vā||
6.17.91| drākṣāmadhukakuṣṭhairvā tadvat saidhavasaṃyutaiḥ|
rodhrasaindhavamṛdvīkāmadhukairvā 'pyajāpayaḥ||
6.17.92| śṛtaṃ seke prayoktavyaṃ rujārāganivāraṇam|
madhukotpalakuṣṭhairvā drākṣālākṣāsitāyutaiḥ|
sasaindhavaiḥ śṛtaṃ kṣīraṃ rujārāganibarhaṇam||
6.17.93| śatāvarīpṛthakparṇīmustāmalakapadmakaiḥ1|
sājakṣīraiḥ śṛtaṃ sarpirdāhaśūlanibarhaṇam||
6.17.94| vātaghnasiddhe payasi siddhaṃ sarpiścaturguṇe|
kākolyādipratīvāpaṃ tadyuñjyāt sarvakarmasu||
6.17.95| śāmyatyevaṃ na cecchūlaṃ snigdhasvinnasya mokṣayet|
tataḥ sirāṃ dahedvā 'pi matimān kīrtitaṃ yathā||
6.17.96| dṛṣṭerataḥ prasādārthamañjane śṛṇu me śubhe|
meṣaśṛṅgasya puṣpāṇi śirīṣadhavayorapi||
6.17.97| sumanāyāśca 1puṣpāṇi muktā vaidūryameva ca|
ajākṣīreṇa saṃpiṣya tāmre saptāhamāvapet||
6.17.98| pravidhāya ca tadvartīryojayeccāñjane bhiṣak|
srotojaṃ vidrumaṃ phenaṃ sāgarasya manaḥśilām||
6.17.99| maricāni ca tadvartīḥ kārayeccāpi pūrvavat|
dṛṣṭisthairyārthametattu vidadhyādañjane hitam||
6.17.100| bhūyo vakṣyāmi mukhyāni vistareṇāñjanāni ca|
kalpe nānāprakārāṇi tānyapīha prayojayet||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre dṛṣṭigatarogavijñānīyo nāma saptadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||17||

aṣṭādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.18.1| athātaḥ kriyākalpaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.18.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.18.3| sarvaśāstrārthatattvajñastapodṛṣṭirudāradhīḥ1|
vaiśvāmitraṃ śaśāsātha śiṣyaṃ kāśipatirmuniḥ||
6.18.4| tarpaṇaṃ puṭapākaśca seka āścyotanāñjane|
tatra tatropadiṣṭāni teṣāṃ vyāsaṃ nibodha me||
6.18.5| saṃśuddhadehaśiraso jīrṇānnasya śubhe dine|
pūrvāhṇe vā 'parāhṇe vā kāryamakṣṇostu tarpaṇam||
6.18.6| vātātaparajohīne veśmanyuttānaśāyinaḥ|
ādhārau māṣacūrṇena klinnena parimaṇḍalau||
6.18.7| samau dṛḍhāvasaṃbādhau kartavyau netrakośayoḥ|
pūrayedghṛtamaṇḍasya vilīnasya sukhodake||
6.18.8| āpakṣmāgrāttataḥ sthāpyaṃ pañca tadvākśatāni tu|
svasthe kaphe ṣaṭ pitte 'ṣṭau daśa vāte taduttamam||
6.18.9| rogasthānaviśeṣeṇa kecit kālaṃ pracakṣate|
yathākramopadiṣṭeṣu trīṇyekaṃ pañca sapta ca||
6.18.10| daśa dṛṣṭyāmathāṣṭau ca vākśatāni vibhāvayet|
tataścāpāṅgataḥ snehaṃ srāvayitvā 'kṣi śodhayet||
6.18.11| svinnena yavapiṣṭena snehavīryeritaṃ tataḥ|
yathāsvaṃ dhūmapānena kaphamasya viśodhayet||
6.18.12| ekāhaṃ vā tryahaṃ vā 'pi pañcāhaṃ ceṣyate param|
tarpaṇe tṛptiliṅgāni netrasyemāni lakṣayet||
6.18.13| sukhasvapnāvabodhatvaṃ vaiśadyaṃ varṇapāṭavam|
nirvṛtirvyādhividhvaṃsaḥ kriyālāghavameva ca||
6.18.14| gurvāvilamatisnigdhamaśrukaṇḍūpadehavat|
jñeyaṃ doṣasamutkliṣṭaṃ netramatyarthatarpitam||
6.18.15| rūkṣamāvilamasrāḍhyamasahaṃ rūpadarśane|
vyādhivṛddhiśca tajjñeyaṃ hīnatarpitamakṣi ca||
6.18.16| ajayordoṣabāhulyāt prayateta cikitsite|
dhūmanasyāñjanaiḥ sekai rūkṣaiḥ snigdhaiśca yogavit||
6.18.17| tāmyatyativiśuṣkaṃ yadrūkṣaṃ yaccātidāruṇam|
śīrṇapakṣmāvilaṃ jihmaṃ rogakliṣṭaṃ ca yadbhṛśam||
6.18.18| tadakṣi tarpaṇādeva labhetorjāmasaṃśayam|
durdinātyuṣṇaśīteṣu cintāyāsabhrameṣu ca||
6.18.19| aśāntopadrave cākṣiṇa tarpaṇaṃ na praśasyate|
puṭapākastathaiteṣu nasyaṃ yeṣu ca garhitam||
6.18.20| tarpaṇārhā na ye proktāḥ snehapānākṣamāśca ye|
tataḥ praśāntadoṣeṣu puṭapākakṣameṣu ca||
6.18.21| puṭapākaḥ prayoktavyo netreṣu bhiṣajā bhavet|
snehano lekhanīyaśca ropaṇīyaśca sa tridhā||
6.18.22| hitaḥ snigdho 'tirūkṣasya snigdhasyāpi ca lekhanaḥ|
dṛṣṭerbalārthamaparaḥ pittāsṛgvraṇavātanut||
6.18.23| snehamāṃsavasāmajjamedaḥsvādvauṣadhaiḥ kṛtaḥ|
snehataḥ puṭapākastu dhāryo dve vākśate tu saḥ||
6.18.24| jāṅgalānāṃ yakṛnmāṃsairlekhanadravyasaṃbhṛtaiḥ|
kṛṣṇaloharajastāmraśaṅkhavidrumasindhujaiḥ||
6.18.25| samudraphenakāsīsasrotojadadhimastubhiḥ|
lehano vākśataṃ tasya paraṃ dhāraṇamucyate||
6.18.26| stanyajāṅgalamadhvājyatiktadravyavipācitaḥ|
lekhanāttriguṇaṃ dhāryaḥ puṭapākastu ropaṇaḥ||
6.18.27| vitarettarpaṇoktaṃ tu dhūmaṃ hitvā tu ropaṇam|
