6.18.32| atiyogādrujaḥ śophaḥ piḍakāstimirodgamaḥ|
pāko 'śru harṣaṇaṃ cāpi hīne doṣodgamastathā||
6.18.33| ata ūrdhvaṃ pravakṣyāmi puṭapākaprasādhanam|
dvau bilvamātrau ślakṣṇasya piṇḍau māṃsasya peṣitau||
6.18.34| dravyāṇāṃ bilvamātraṃ tu dravāṇāṃ kuḍavo mataḥ|
tadaikadhyaṃ samāloḍya patraiḥ supariveṣṭitam||
6.18.35| (1kāśmarīkumudairaṇḍapadminīkadalībhavaiḥ|)
mṛdāvaliptamaṅgāraiḥ khādirairavakūlayet||
6.18.36| katakāśmantakairaṇḍapāṭalāvṛṣabādaraiḥ|
sakṣīradrumakāṣṭhairvā gomayairvā 'pi yuktitaḥ||
6.18.37| svinnamuddhṛtya niṣpīḍya rasamādāya taṃ nṛṇām|
tarpaṇoktena vidhinā yathāvadavacārayet||
6.18.38| kanīnake niṣecyaḥ syānnityamuttānaśāyinaḥ|
rakte pitte ca tau śītau koṣṇau vātakaphāpahau||
6.18.39| atyuṣṇatīkṣṇau satataṃ dāhapākakarau smṛtau|
aplutau śītalau cāśrustambharuggharṣakārakau||
6.18.40| atimātrau kaṣāyatvasaṅkocasphuraṇāvahau|
hīnapramāṇau doṣāṇāmutkleśajananau bhṛśam||
6.18.41| yuktau kṛtau dāhaśopharuggharṣasrāvanāśanau|
kaṇḍūpadehadūṣīkāraktarājivināśanau||
6.18.42| tasmāt pariharan doṣān vidadhyāttau sukhāvahau|
vyāpadaśca yathādoṣaṃ nasyadhūmāñjanairjayet||
6.18.43| ādyantayoścāpyanayoḥ sveda uṣṇāmbucailikaḥ|
