6.18.45| tau tridhaivopayujyete rogeṣu puṭapākavat|
lekhane sapta cāṣṭau vā bindavaḥ snaihike daśa||
6.18.46| āścyotane prayoktavyā dvādaśaiva tu ropaṇe|
sekasya dviguṇaḥ kālaḥ puṭapākāt paro mataḥ||
6.18.47| athavā kāryanirvṛtterupayogo yathākramam|
pūrvāparāhṇe madhyāhne rujākāleṣu cobhayoḥ||
6.18.48| yogāyogāt snehaseke tarpaṇoktān pracakṣate|
rogāñchirasi saṃbhūtān hatvā 'tiprabalān guṇān||
6.18.49| karoti śiraso bastiruktā ye mūrdhatailikāḥ|
śuddhadehasya sāyāhne yathāvyādhyaśitasya tu||
6.18.50| ṛjvāsīnasya badhnīyādbastikośaṃ tato dṛḍham|
yathāvyādhiśṛtasnehapūrṇaṃ saṃyamya dhārayet||
6.18.51| tarpaṇoktaṃ daśaguṇaṃ yathādoṣaṃ vidhānavit||
vyaktarūpeṣu doṣeṣu śuddhakāyasya kevale||
6.18.52| netra eva sthite doṣe prāptamañjanamācaret|
lekhanaṃ ropaṇaṃ cāpi prasādanamathāpi vā||
6.18.53| tatra pañca rasān vyastānādyaikarasavarjitān|
pañcadhā lekhanaṃ yuñjyādyathādoṣamatandritaḥ||
6.18.54| netravartmasirākośasrotaḥśṛṅgāṭakāśritam|
mukhanāsākṣibhirdoṣamojasā srāvayettu tat||
6.18.55| kaṣāyaṃ tiktakaṃ vā 'pi sasnehaṃ ropaṇaṃ matam|
1tatsnehaśaityādvarṇyaṃ syāddṛṣṭeśca balavardhanam||
6.18.56| madhuraṃ snehasaṃpannamañjanaṃ tu prasādanam|
dṛṣṭidoṣaprasādārthaṃ snehanārthaṃ ca taddhitam||
6.18.57| yathādoṣaṃ prayojyāni tāni rogaviśāradaiḥ|
añjanāni yathoktāni prāhṇasāyāhnarātriṣu||
6.18.58| guṭikārasacūrṇāni trividhānyañjanāni tu|
yathāpūrvaṃ balaṃ teṣāṃ śreṣṭhamāhurmanīṣiṇaḥ||
6.18.59| hareṇumātrā vartiḥ syāllekhanasya pramāṇataḥ|
prasādanasya cādhyardhā dviguṇā ropaṇasya ca||
6.18.60| rasāñjanasya mātrā tu 1yathāvartimitā matā|
dvitricatuḥśalākāśca cūrṇasyāpyanupūrvaśaḥ||
6.18.61| teṣāṃ tulyaguṇānyeva vidadhyādbhājanānyapi|
sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ śārṅgaṃ tāmraṃ vaidūryakāṃsyajam||
6.18.62| āyasāni ca yojyāni śalākāśca yathākramam|
vaktrayormukulākārā kalāyaparimaṇḍalā||
6.18.63| aṣṭāṅgulā tanurmadhye sukṛtā sādhunigrahā|
audumbaryaśmajā vā 'pi śārīrī vā hitā bhavet||
6.18.64| vāmenākṣi vinirbhujya hastena susamāhitaḥ|
śalākayā dakṣiṇena kṣipet kānīnamañjanam||
6.18.65| āpāṅgyaṃ vā yathāyogaṃ kuryāccāpi gatāgatam|
vartmopalepi vā yattadaṅgulyaiva prayojayet||
6.18.66| akṣi nāsyantayorañjyādbādhamāno 'pi vā bhiṣak|
na cānirvāntadoṣe 'kṣṇi dhāvanaṃ saṃprayojayet||
6.18.67| doṣaḥ pratinivṛttaḥ san hanyād dṛṣṭerbalaṃ tathā|
gatadoṣamapetāśru paśyedyat samyagambhasā||
6.18.68| prakṣālyākṣi yathādoṣaṃ kāryaṃ pratyañjanaṃ tataḥ|
śramodāvartaruditamadyakrodhabhayajvaraiḥ||
6.18.69| vegāghātaśirodoṣaiścārtānāṃ neṣyate 'ñjanam|
rāgaruktimirāsrāvaśūlasaṃrambhasaṃbhavāt||
6.18.70| nidrākṣaye kriyāśaktiṃ pravāte dṛgbalakṣayam|
rajodhūmahate rāgasrāvādhīmanthasaṃbhavam||
6.18.71| saṃrambhaśūlau nasyānte śiroruji śirorujam|
śiraḥsnāte 'tiśīte ca ravāvanudite 'pi ca||
6.18.72| doṣasthairyādapārthaṃ syāddoṣotkleśaṃ karoti ca|
ajīrṇe 'pyevameva syāt srotomārgāvarodhanāt||
6.18.73| doṣavegodaye dattaṃ kuryāttāṃstānupadravān|
tasmāt pariharan doṣānañjanaṃ sādhu yojayet||
6.18.74| lekhanasya viśeṣeṇa kāla eṣa prakīrtitaḥ|
vyāpadaśca jayedetāḥ sekāścyotanalepanaiḥ||
6.18.75| yathāsvaṃ dhūmakavalairnasyaiścāpi samutthitāḥ|
viśadaṃ laghvanāsrāvi kriyāpaṭu sunirmalam||
6.18.76| saṃśāntopadravaṃ netraṃ viriktaṃ samyagādiśet|
jihmaṃ dāruṇadurvarṇaṃ srastaṃ rūkṣamatīva ca||
6.18.77| netraṃ virekātiyoge syandate cātimātraśaḥ|
tatra saṃtarpaṇaṃ kāryaṃ vidhānaṃ cānilāpaham||
6.18.78| akṣi mandaviriktaṃ syādudagrataradoṣavat|
dhūmanasyāñjanaistatra hitaṃ doṣāvasecanam||
6.18.79| snehavarṇabalopetaṃ prasannaṃ doṣavarjitam|
jñeyaṃ prasādane samyagupayukte 'kṣi nirvṛtam||
6.18.80| kiñciddhīnavikāraṃ syāttarpaṇāddhi kṛtādati|
tatra doṣaharaṃ rūkṣaṃ bheṣajaṃ śasyate mṛdu||
6.18.81| sādhāraṇamapi jñeyamevaṃ ropaṇalakṣaṇam|
prasādanavadācaṣṭe tasmin yukte 'tibheṣajam||
6.18.82| snehanaṃ ropaṇaṃ vā 'pi hīnayuktamapārthakam|
kartavyaṃ mātrayā tasmādañjanaṃ siddhimicchatā||
6.18.83| puṭapākakriyādyāsu kriyāsveṣaiva(kriyāsvekaiva) kalpanā|
sahasraśaścāñjaneṣu bījenoktena pūjitāḥ||
6.18.84| dṛṣṭerbalavivṛddhyarthaṃ yāpyarogakṣayāya ca|
rājārhānyañjanāgryāṇi nibodhemānyataḥ param||
6.18.85| aṣṭau bhāgānañjanasya nīlotpalasamatviṣaḥ|
auḍumbaraṃ śātakumbhaṃ rājataṃ ca samāsataḥ||
6.18.86| ekādaśaitān bhāgāṃstu yojayet kuśalo bhiṣak|
mūṣākṣiptaṃ tadādhmātamāvṛtaṃ jātavedasi||
6.18.87| khadirāśmantakāṅgarairgośakṛdbhirathāpi vā|
gavāṃ śakṛdrase mūtre dadhni sarpiṣi mākṣike||
6.18.88| tailamadyavasāmajjasarvagandhodakeṣu ca|
drākṣārasekṣutriphalāraseṣu suhimeṣu ca||
6.18.89| sārivādikaṣāye ca kaṣāye cotpalādike|
niṣecayet pṛthak cainaṃ dhmātaṃ dhmātaṃ punaḥ punaḥ||
6.18.90| tato 'ntarīkṣe saptāhaṃ plotabaddhaṃ sthitaṃ jale|
viśoṣya cūrṇayenmuktāṃ sphaṭikaṃ vidrumaṃ tathā||
6.18.91| kālānusārivāṃ cāpi śucirāvāpya yogataḥ|
etaccūrṇāñjanaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ nihitaṃ bhājane śubhe||
6.18.92| dantasphaṭikavaidūryaśaṅkhaśailāsanodbhave|
śātakumbhe 'tha śārṅge vā rājate vā susaṃskṛte|
sahasrapākavat pūjāṃ kṛtvā rājñaḥ prayojayet||
6.18.93| tenāñjitākṣo nṛpatirbhavet sarvajanapriyaḥ|
adhṛṣyaḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ dṛṣṭirogavivarjitaḥ||
6.18.94| kuṣṭhaṃ candanamelāśca patraṃ madhukamañjanam|
meṣaśṛṅgasya puṣpāṇi vakraṃ ratnāpi sapta ca||
6.18.95| utpalasya bṛhatyośca padmasyāpi ca keśaram|
nāgapuṣpamuśīrāṇi pippalī tutthamuttamam||
6.18.96| kukkuṭāṇḍakapālāni dārvīṃ pathyāṃ sarocanām|
maricānyakṣamajjānaṃ tulyāṃ ca gṛhagopikām||
6.18.97| kṛtvā sūkṣmaṃ tataścūrṇaṃ nyasedabhyarcya pūrvavat|
etadbhadrodayaṃ nāma sadaivārhati bhūmipaḥ||
6.18.98| vakraṃ samaricaṃ caiva māṃsīṃ śaileyameva ca|
tulyāṃśāni samānaistaiḥ samagraiśca manaḥśilā||
6.18.99| patrasya bhāgāścatvāro dviguṇaṃ sarvato 'ñjanam|
tāvacca yaṣṭīmadhukaṃ pūrvavaccaitadañjanam||
6.18.100| manaḥśilāṃ devakāṣṭhaṃ rajanyau triphaloṣaṇam|
lākṣālaśunamañjiṣṭhāsaindhavailāḥ samākṣikāḥ||
6.18.101| rodhraṃ sāvarakaṃ cūrṇamāyasaṃ tāmrameva ca|
kālānusārivāṃ caiva kukkuṭāṇḍadalāni ca||
6.18.102| tulyāni payasā piṣṭvā guṭikāṃ kārayedbudhaḥ|
kaṇḍūtimiraśuklārmaraktarājyupaśāntaye||
6.18.103| kāṃsyāpamārjanamasī madhukaṃ saindhavaṃ tathā|
eraṇḍamūlaṃ ca samaṃ bṛhatyaṃśadvayānvitam||
6.18.104| ājena payasā piṣṭvā tāmrapātraṃ pralepayet|
saptakṛtvastu tā vartyaśchāyāśuṣkā rujāpahāḥ||
6.18.105| pathyātutthakayaṣṭyāhvaistulyairmaricaṣoḍaśā|
pathyā sarvavikāreṣu vartiḥ śītāmbupeṣitā||
6.18.106| rasakriyāvidhānena yathoktavidhikovidaḥ|
piṇḍāñjanāni kurvīta yathāyogamatandritaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre kriyākalpo nāmāṣṭadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ||18||

ekonaviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.19.1| athāto nayanābhighātapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.19.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.19.3| abhyāhate tu nayane bahudhā narāṇāṃ saṃrambharāgatumulāsu rujāsu dhīmān|
nasyāsyalepapariṣecanatarpaṇādyamuktaṃ punaḥ kṣatajapittajaśūlapathyam||
6.19.4| dṛṣṭiprasādajananaṃ vidhimāśu kuryāt snigdhairhimaiśca madhuraiśca tathā prayogai|
svedāgnidhūmabhayaśokarujābhighātairabhyāhatāmapi tathaiva bhiṣak cikitset||
6.19.5| sadyohate nayana eṣa vidhistadūrdhvaṃ syanderito bhavati doṣamavekṣya kāryaḥ|
abhyāhataṃ nayanamīṣadathāsyabāṣpasaṃsveditaṃ bhavati tannirujaṃ kṣaṇena||
6.19.6| sādhyaṃ kṣataṃ paṭalamekamubhe tu kṛcchre trīṇi kṣatāni paṭalāni vivarjayattu|
syāt piccitaṃ ca nayanaṃ hyati cāvasannaṃ srastaṃ cyutaṃ ca hatadṛk ca bhavettu yāpyam||
6.19.7| vistīrṇadṛṣṭitanurāgamasatpradarśi sādhyaṃ yathāsthitamanāviladarśanaṃ ca|
prāṇoparodhavamanakṣutakaṇṭharodhairunnamyamāśu nayanaṃ yadatipraviṣṭam||
6.19.8| netre vilambini vidhirvihitaḥ purastāducchiṅghanaṃ śirasi vāryavasecanaṃ ca|
ṣaṭsaptatirnayanajā ya ime pradiṣṭā rogā bhavantyamahatāṃ mahatāṃ ca tebhyaḥ||
6.19.9| stanyaprakopakaphamārutapittaraktairbalākṣivartmabhava eva kukūṇako 'nyaḥ|
mṛdnāti netramatikaṇḍumathākṣikūṭaṃ nāsālalāṭamapi tena śiśuḥ sa nityam||
6.19.10| sūryaprabhāṃ na sahate sravati prabaddhaṃ tasyāharedrudhiramāśu vinirlikhecca|
kṣaudrāyutaiśca kaṭubhiḥ pratisārayettu mātuḥ śiśorabhihitaṃ ca vidhiṃ vidadhyāt||
6.19.11| taṃ vāmayettu madhusaindhavasaṃprayuktaiḥ pītaṃ payaḥ khalu phalaiḥ kharamañjarīṇām||
6.19.12| syātpippalīlavaṇamākṣikasaṃyutairvā nainaṃ vamantamapi vāmayituṃ yateta|
dattvā vacāmaśanadugdhabhuje prayojyamūrdhvaṃ tataḥ phalayutaṃ vamanaṃ vidhijñaiḥ||
6.19.13| jambvāmradhātryaṇudalaiḥ paridhāvanārthaṃ kāryaṃ kaṣāyamavasecanameva cāpi|
āścyotane ca hitamatra ghṛtaṃ guḍūcīsiddhaṃ tathā++āhurapi ca triphalāvipakvam||
6.19.14| nepālajāmaricaśaṅkharasāñjanāni sindhuprasūtaguḍamākṣikasaṃyutāni|
syādañjanaṃ madhurasāmadhukāmrakairvā kṛṣṇāyasaṃ ghṛtapayo madhu vā 'pi dagdham||
6.19.15| vyoṣaṃ palāṇḍu madhukaṃ lavaṇottamaṃ ca lākṣāṃ ca gairikayutāṃ guṭikāñjanaṃ vā|
nimbacchadaṃ madhukadārvi satāmralodhramicchanti cātra bhiṣajo 'ñjanamaṃśatulyam||
6.19.16| srotojaśaṅkhadadhisaindhavamardhapakṣaṃ śukraṃ śiśornudati bhāvitamañjanena|
syande kaphādabhihitaṃ kramamācarecca bālasya rogakuśalo 'kṣigadaṃ jighāṃsuḥ||
6.19.17| samudra iva gambhīraṃ naiva śakyaṃ cikitsitam|
vaktuṃ niravaśeṣeṇa ślokānāmayutairapi||
6.19.18| sahasrairapi vā proktamarthamalpamatirnaraḥ|
tarkagranthārtharahito naiva gṛhṇātyapaṇḍitaḥ||
6.19.19| tadidaṃ bahugūḍhārthaṃ cikitsābījamīritam|
kuśalenābhipannaṃ tadbahudhā 'bhiprarohati||
6.19.20| tasmānmatimatā nityaṃ nānāśāstrārthadarśinā|
sarvamūhyamagādhārthaṃ śāstramāgamabuddhinā||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre nayanābhighātacikitsitaṃ nāmaikonaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||19|| 

viṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.20.1| athātaḥ karṇagatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.20.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.20.3| karṇaśūlaṃ praṇādaśca bādhiryaṃ kṣveḍa eva ca|
karṇasrāvaḥ karṇakaṇḍūḥ karṇavarcastathaiva ca||
6.20.4| kṛmikarṇapratināhau vidradhirdvividhastathā|
karṇapākaḥ pūtikarṇastathaivārśaścaturvidham||
6.20.5| karṇārbudaṃ saptavidhaṃ śophaścāpi caturvidhaḥ|
ete karṇagatā rogā aṣṭāviṃśatirīritāḥ||
6.20.6| samīraṇaḥ śrotragato 'nyathācaraḥ samantataḥ śūlamatīva karṇayoḥ|
karoti doṣaiśca yathāsvamāvṛtaḥ sa karṇaśūlaḥ kathito durācaraḥ||
6.20.7| yadā tu nāḍīṣu vimārgamāgataḥ sa eva śabdābhivahāsu tiṣṭhati|
śrṇoti śabdān vividhāṃstadā naraḥ praṇādamenaṃ kathayanti cāmayam||
6.20.8| sa eva śabdānuvahā yadā sirāḥ kaphānuyāto vyanusṛtya tiṣṭhati|
tadā narasyāpratikārasevino bhavettu bādhiryamasaṃśayaṃ khalu||
6.20.9| śramāt kṣayādrūkṣakaṣāyabhojanāt samīraṇaḥ śabdapathe pratiṣṭhitaḥ|
viriktaśīrṣasya ca śītasevinaḥ karoti hi kṣveḍamatīva karṇayoḥ||
6.20.10| śirobhighātādathavā nimajjato jale prapākādayavā 'pi vidradheḥ|
sravettu pūyaṃ śravaṇo 'nilāvṛtaḥ sa karṇasaṃsrāva iti prakīrtitaḥ||
6.20.11| kaphena kaṇḍūḥ pracitena karṇayorbhṛśaṃ bhavet srotasi karṇasaṃjñite|
viśoṣite śleṣmaṇi pittatejasā nṛṇāṃ bhavet srotasi karṇagūthakaḥ||
6.20.12| sa karṇaviṭko dravatāṃ yadā gato vilāyito ghrāṇamukhaṃ prapadyate|
tadā sa karṇapratināhasaṃjñito bhavedvikāraḥ śiraso 'bhitāpanaḥ||
6.20.13| yadā tu mūrcchantyathavā 'pi jantavaḥ sṛjantyapatyānyathavā 'pi makṣikāḥ|
tadañjanatvācchravaṇo nirucyate bhiṣagbhirādyaiḥ kṛmikarṇako gadaḥ||
6.20.14| kṣatābhighātaprabhavastu vidradhirbhavettathā doṣakṛto 'paraḥ punaḥ|
saraktapītāruṇamasramāsravet pratodadhūmāyanadāhacopavān||
6.20.15| bhavet prapākaḥ khalu pittakopato vikothavikledakaraśca karṇayoḥ|
sthite kaphe srotasi pittatejasaḥ vilāyyamāne bhṛśasaṃpratāpavān||
6.20.16| avedano vā 'pyathavā savedano ghanaṃ sravet pūti ca pūtikarṇakaḥ|
pradiṣṭaliṅgānyaraśāṃsi tattvatastathaiva śophārbudaliṅgamīritam|
mayā purastāt prasamīkṣya yojayedihaiva tāvat prayato bhiṣagvaraḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre karṇagatarogavijñānīyo nāma viṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ||20||

ekoviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.21.1| athātaḥ karṇagatarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.21.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.21.3| sāmānyaṃ karṇarodheṣu ghṛtapānaṃ rasāyanam|
avyāyāmo 'śiraḥsnānaṃ brahmacaryamakatthanam||
6.21.4| karṇaśūle praṇāde ca bādhiryakṣveḍayorapi|
caturṇāmapi rogāṇāṃ sāmānyaṃ bheṣajaṃ viduḥ||
6.21.5| snigdhaṃ vātaharaiḥ svedairnaraṃ snehavirecitam|
nāḍīsvedairupacaretpiṇḍasvedaistathaiva ca||
6.21.6| bilvairaṇḍārkavarṣābhūdadhitthonmattaśigrubhiḥ|
bastagandhāśvagandhābhyāṃ tarkārīyavaveṇubhiḥ||
6.21.7| āranālaśṛtairebhirnāḍīsvedaḥ prayojitaḥ|
kaphavātasamutthānaṃ karṇaśūlaṃ nirasyati||
6.21.8| mīnakukkuṭalāvānāṃ māṃsajaiḥ payasā 'pi vā|
piṇḍaiḥ svedaṃ ca kurvīta karṇaśūlanivāraṇam||
6.21.9| aśvatthapatrakhallaṃ vā vidhāya bahupatrakam|
tadaṅgāraiḥ susaṃpūrṇaṃ nidadhyāchravaṇopari||
6.21.10| yattailaṃ cyavate tasmāt khallādaṅgāratāpitāt|
tat prāptaṃ śravaṇasrotaḥ sadyo gṛhṇāti vedanām||
6.21.11| kṣaumaguggulvagurubhiḥ saghṛtairdhūpayecca tam|
bhaktopari hitaṃ sarpirbastikarma ca pūjitam||
6.21.12| niranno niśi tatsarpiḥ pītvopari pibet payaḥ|
mūrdhvastiṣu nasye ca mastiṣke pariṣecane||
6.21.13| śatapākaṃ balātailaṃ praśastaṃ cāpi bhojane|
kaṇṭakārīmajākṣīre paktvā kṣīreṇa tena ca||
6.21.14| vipacet kukkuṭavasāṃ karṇayostatprapūraṇam|
taṇḍulīyakamūlāni phalamaṅkolajaṃ tathā||
6.21.15| ahiṃsākendukānmūlaṃ saralaṃ devadāru ca|
laśunaṃ śṛṅgaveraṃ ca tathā vaṃśāvalekhanam||
6.21.16| kalkaireṣāṃ tathā 'mlaiśca pacet snehaṃ caturvidham|
vedanāyāḥ praśāntyarthaṃ hitaṃ tatkarṇapūraṇam||
6.21.17| laśunārdrakaśigrūṇāṃ muraṅgyā mūlakasya ca|
kadalyāḥ svarasaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ kaduṣṇaḥ karṇapūraṇe||
6.21.18| śṛṅgaverarasaḥ kṣaudraṃ saindhavaṃ tailameva ca|
kaduṣṇaṃ karṇayordeyametadvā vedanāpaham||
6.21.19| vaṃśāvalekhanāyukte mūtre cājāvike bhiṣak|
sarpiḥ pacettena karṇaṃ pūrayet karṇaśūlinaḥ||
6.21.20| mahataḥ pañcamūlasya kāṇḍamaṣṭādaśāṅgulam|
kṣaumeṇāveṣṭya saṃsicya tailenādīpayettataḥ||
6.21.21| yattailaṃ cyavate tebhyo dhṛtebhyo bhājanopari|
jñeyaṃ taddīpikātailaṃ sadyo gṛhṇāti vedanām||
6.21.22| kuryādevaṃ bhadrakāṣṭhe kuṣṭhe kāṣṭhe ca sārale|
matimān dīpikātailaṃ karṇaśūlanibarhaṇam||
6.21.23| arkāṅkurānamlapiṣṭāṃstailāktān lavaṇānvitān|
sannidadhyāt sruhīkāṇḍe korite tacchadāvṛte||
6.21.24| puṭapākakramasvinnān pīḍayedārasāgamāt|
sukhoṣṇaṃ tadrasaṃ karṇe dāpayecchūlaśāntaye||
6.21.25| kapitthamātuluṅgāmlaśṛṅgaverarasaiḥ śubhaiḥ|
sukhoṣṇaiḥ pūrayet karṇaṃ tacchūlavinivṛttaye||
6.21.26| karṇaṃ koṣṇena cukreṇa pūrayet karṇaśūlinaḥ|
samudraphenacūrṇena yuktyā cāpyavacūrṇayet||
6.21.27| aṣṭānāmiha mūtrāṇāṃ mūtreṇānyatamena tu|
koṣṇena pūrayet karṇaṃ karṇaśūlopaśāntaye||
6.21.28| mūtreṣvamleṣu vātaghne gaṇe ca kvathite bhiṣak|
paceccaturvidhaṃ snehaṃ pūraṇaṃ tacca karṇayoḥ||
6.21.29| etā eva kriyāḥ kuryāt pittaghnaiḥ pittasaṃyute|
kākolyādau daśakṣīraṃ tiktaṃ cātra hitaṃ haviḥ||
6.21.30| kṣīravṛkṣapravāleṣu madhuke candane tathā|
kalkakvāthe paraṃ pakvaṃ śarkarāmadhukaiḥ saraiḥ||
6.21.31| iṅgudīsarṣapasnehau sakaphe pūraṇe hitau|
tiktauṣadhānāṃ yūṣāśca svedāśca kaphanāśanāḥ||
6.21.32| surasādau kṛtaṃ tailaṃ pañcamūle mahatyapi|
mātuluṅgarasaḥ śuktaṃ laśunārdrakayo rasaḥ||
6.21.33| ekaikaḥ pūraṇe pathyastailaṃ teṣvapi vā kṛtam|
tīkṣṇā mūrdhavirekāśca kavalāścātra pūjitāḥ||
6.21.34| karṇaśūlavidhiḥ kṛtsnaḥ pittaghnaḥ śoṇitāvṛte|
śūlapraṇādabādhiryakṣveḍānāṃ tu prakīrtitam||
6.21.35| sāmānyato viśeṣeṇa1 bādhirye pūraṇaṃ śṛṇu|
gavāṃ mūtreṇa bilvāni piṣṭvā tailaṃ vipācayet||
6.21.36| sajalaṃ ca sadugdhaṃ ca bādhirye karṇapūraṇam|
sitāmadhukabimbībhiḥ siddhaṃ vā++āje payasyapi||
6.21.37| bimbīkvāthe vimathyoṣṇaṃ śītībhūtaṃ taduddhṛtam|
punaḥ paceddaśakṣīraṃ sitāmadhukacandanaiḥ||
6.21.38| bilvāmbugāḍhaṃ tattailaṃ bādhirye karṇapūraṇam|
vakṣyate yaḥ pratiśyāye vidhiḥ so 'pyatra pūjitaḥ||
6.21.39| vātavyādhiṣu yaścokto vidhiḥ sa ca hito bhavet|
karṇasrāve pūtikarṇe tathaiva kṛmikarṇake||
6.21.40| samānaṃ karma kurvīta yogān vaiśeṣikānapi|
śirovirecanaṃ caiva dhūpanaṃ pūraṇaṃ tathā||
6.21.41| pramārjanaṃ dhāvanaṃ ca vīkṣya vīkṣyāvcārayet|
rājavṛkṣāditoyena surasādigaṇena vā||
6.21.42| karṇaprakṣālanaṃ kāryaṃ cūrṇaireṣāṃ ca pūraṇam|
kvāthaṃ pañjcakaṣāyaṃ tu kapittharasayojitam||
6.21.43| karṇasrāve praśaṃsanti pūraṇaṃ madhunā saha|
sarjatvakcūrṇasaṃyuktaḥ kārpāsīphalajo rasaḥ||
6.21.44| yojito madhunā vā 'pi karṇasrāve praśasyate|
lākṣā rasāñjanaṃ sarjaścūrṇitaṃ karṇapūraṇam||
6.21.45| saśaivalaṃ mahāvṛkṣajambvāmraprasavāyutam|
kulīrakṣaudramaṇḍūkīsiddhaṃ tailaṃ ca pūjitam||
6.21.46| tindukānyabhayā rodhraṃ samaṅgā++āmalakaṃ madhu|
pūraṇaṃ cātra1 pathyaṃ syātkapittharasayojitam||
6.21.47| rasamāmrakapitthānāṃ madhūkadhavaśālajam|
pūraṇārthaṃ praśaṃsanti tailaṃ vā tairvipācitam||
6.21.48| priyaṅgumadhukāmbaṣṭhādhātakīśilaparṇibhiḥ|
mañjiṣṭhālobhralākṣābhiḥ kapitthasya rasena vā||
6.21.49| pacettailaṃ tadāsrāvamavagṛhṇāti pūraṇāt|
ghṛtaṃ rasāñjnaṃ nāryāḥ kṣīreṇa madhusaṃyutam||
6.21.50| tatpraśastaṃ cirotthe 'pi sāsrāve pūtikarṇake|
nirguṇḍīsvarasastailaṃ sindhurdhūmarajo guḍaḥ||
6.21.51| pūraṇaḥ pūtikarṇasya śamano madhusaṃyutaḥ|
kṛmikarṇakanāśārthaṃ kṛmighnaṃ yojayedvidhim||
6.21.52| vārtākudhūmaśca hitaḥ sārṣapasneha eva ca|
kṛmighnaṃ haritālena gavāṃ mūtrayutena ca||
6.21.53| gugguloḥ karṇadaurgandhye dhūpanaṃ śreṣṭhamucyate|
chardanaṃ dhūmapānaṃ ca kavalasya ca dhāraṇam||
6.21.54| karṇakṣveḍe hitaṃ tailaṃ sārṣapaṃ caiva pūraṇam|
vidradhau cāpi kurvīta vidradhyuktaṃ cikitsitam||
6.21.55| prakledya dhīmāṃstailena svedena pravilāyya ca|
śodhayetkarṇaviṭkaṃ tu bhiṣak samyak śalākayā||
6.21.56| nāḍīsvedo 'tha vamanaṃ dhūmo mūrdhavirecanam|
vidhiśca kaphahṛtsarvaḥ karṇakaṇḍūmapohati||
6.21.57| atha karṇapratīnāhe snehasvedau prayojayet|
tato viriktaśirasaḥ kriyāṃ prāptāṃ samācaret||
6.21.58| karṇapākasya bhaiṣajyaṃ kuryātpittavisarpavat|
karṇacchidre vartamānaṃ kīṭaṃ kledamalādi vā||
6.21.59| śṛṅgeṇāpahareddhīmānathavā 'pi śalākayā|
śeṣāṇāṃ tu vikārāṇāṃ prāk cikitsitamīritam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre karṇagatarogapratiṣedho nāmaikaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||21||

dvāviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ||
6.22.1| athāto nāsāgatarogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.22.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.22.3| apīnasaḥ pūtinasyaṃ1 nāsāpākastathaiva ca|
tathā śoṇitapittaṃ ca pūyaśoṇitameva ca||
6.22.4| kṣavathurbhraṃśathurdīpto nāsānāhaḥ parisravaḥ|
nāsāśoṣeṇa sahitā daśaikāśceritā gadāḥ||
6.22.5| catvāryarśāṃsi catvāraḥ śophāḥ saptārbudāni ca|
pratiśyāyāśca ye pañca vakṣyante sacikitsitāḥ|
1ekatriṃśanmitāste tu nāsārogāḥ prakīrtitāḥ||
6.22.6| ānahyate yasya vidhūpyate ca praklidyate śuṣyati1 cāpi nāsā|
na vetti yo gandharasāṃśca janturjuṣṭaṃ vyavasyettamapīnasena||
6.22.7| taṃ cānilaśleṣmabhavaṃ vikāraṃ brūyāt pratiśyāyasamānaliṅgam|
doṣairvidagdhairlatālumūle saṃvāsito yasya samīraṇastu||
6.22.8| nireti pūtirmukhanāsikābhyāṃ taṃ pūtināsaṃ pravadanti rogam|
vrāṇāśritaṃ pittamarūṃṣi kuryādyasmin vikāre balavāṃśca pākaḥ||
6.22.9| taṃ nāsikāpākamiti vyavasyedvikledakothāvapi yatra dṛṣṭau|
caturvidhaṃ dviprabhavaṃ vakṣyāmi bhūyaḥ khalu raktapittam||
6.22.10| doṣairvidagdhairathavā 'pi jantorlalāṭadeśe 'bhihatasya taistu|
nāsā sravet pūyamasṛgvimiśraṃ taṃ pūyaraktaṃ pravadanti rogam||
6.22.11| ghrāṇāśrite marmaṇi saṃpraduṣṭe1 yasyānilo nāsikayā nireti||
6.22.12| kaphānuyāto bahuśaḥ saśabdastaṃ rogamāhuḥ kṣavathuṃ vidhijñāḥ|
tīkṣṇopayogādatijighrato vā bhāvān kaṭūnarkanirīkṣaṇādvā||
6.22.13| sūtrādibhirvā taruṇāsthimarmaṇyudghāṭite 'nyaḥ kṣavathurnireti|
prabhraśyate nāsikayaiva yaśca1 sāndro vidagdho lavaṇaḥ kaphastu||
6.22.14| prāk saṃcito mūrdhani pittataptastaṃ bhraṃśathuṃ vyādhimudāharanti|
ghrāṇe bhṛśaṃ dāhasamanvite tu viniḥsareddhūma iveha vāyuḥ||
6.22.15| nāsā pradīpteva ca yasya jantorvyādhiṃ tu taṃ dīptamudāharanti|
kaphāvṛto vāyurudānasaṃjño yadā svamārge viguṇaḥ sthitaḥ syāt||
6.22.16| ghrāṇaṃ vṛṇotīva tadā sa rogo nāsāpratīnāha iti pradiṣṭaḥ|
ajasramacchaṃ salilaprakāśaṃ yasyāvivarṇe sravatīha nāsā||
6.22.17| rātrau viśeṣeṇa hi taṃ vikāraṃ nāsāparisrāvamiti vyavasyet|
ghrāṇāśrite śleṣmaṇi mārutena pittena gāḍhaṃ pariśoṣite ca||
6.22.18| samucchvasityūrdhvamadhaśca kṛcchrādyastasya nāsāpariśoṣa uktaḥ|
doṣaiśtribhistaiḥ pṛthagekaśaśca brūyāttathā 'rśāṃsi tathaiva śophān||
6.22.19| śālākyasiddhāntamavekṣya cāpi sarvātmakaṃ saptamamarbudaṃ tu|
rogaḥ pratiśyāya ihopadiṣṭaḥ sa vakṣyate pañcavidhaḥ purastāt||
6.22.20| (nāsāsrotogatā rogāstriṃśadekaśca kīrtitāḥ|
srotaḥpathe yadvipulaṃ kośavaccārbudaṃ bhavet1||)
6.22.21| śophāstu śophavijñānā nāsāsrotovyavasthitāḥ|
nidāne 'rśāṃsi nirdiṣṭānyevaṃ tāni vibhāvayet||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre nāsāgatarogavijñānīyo nāma dvāviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||22||

trayoviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.23.1| athāto nāsāgatarogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.23.2| athovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.23.3| pūrvoddiṣṭe pūtinasye ca jantoḥ snehasvedau chardanaṃ sraṃsanaṃ ca|
yuktaṃ bhaktaṃ tīkṣṇamalpaṃ laghu syāduṣṇaṃ toyaṃ dhūmapānaṃ ca kāle||
6.23.4| hiṅgu vyoṣaṃ vatsakākhyaṃ śivāṭī lākṣā bījaṃ saurabhaṃ kaṭphalaṃ ca|
ugrā kuṣṭhaṃ tīkṣṇagandhā viḍaṅgaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ nityaṃ cāvapīḍe karañjam||
6.23.5| etairdravyaiḥ sārṣapaṃ mūtrayuktaṃ tailaṃ dhīmānnasyahetoḥ paceta|
nāsāpāke pittahṛtsaṃvidhānaṃ kāryaṃ sarvaṃ bāhyamābhyantaraṃ ca||
6.23.6| hṛtvā raktaṃ kṣīravṛkṣatvacaśca sājyāḥ sekā yojanīyāśca lepāḥ|
vakṣyāmyūrdhvaṃ raktapītopaśāntiṃ nāḍīvatsyāt pūyarakte cikitsā||
6.23.7| vānte samyak cāvapīḍaṃ vadanti tīkṣṇaṃ dhūmaṃ śodhanaṃ cātra nasyam|
kṣepyaṃ nasyaṃ mūrdhavairecanīyairnāḍyā cūrṇaṃ kṣavathau bhraṃśathau ca||
6.23.8| kuryāt svedān mūrdhni vātāmayaghnān snigdhān dhūmān yadyanyaddhitaṃ ca|
dīpte roge paittikaṃ saṃvidhānaṃ kuryāt sarvaṃ svādu yacchītalaṃ ca||
6.23.9| nāsānāhe snehapānaṃ pradhānaṃ snigdhā dhūmā mūrdhabastiśca nityam|
balātailaṃ sarvathaivopayojyaṃ vātavyādhāvanyaduktaṃ ca yadyat||
6.23.10| nāsāsrāve ghrāṇataścūrṇamuktaṃ nāḍyā deyaṃ yo 'vapīḍaśca tīkṣṇaḥ|
tīkṣṇaṃ dhūmaṃ devadārvagnikābhyāṃ māṃsaṃ vā++ājaṃ yuktamatrādiśanti||
6.23.11| nāsāśoṣe kṣīrasarpiḥ pradhānaṃ siddhaṃ tailaṃ cāṇukalpena nasyam|
sarpiḥpānaṃ bhojanaṃ jāṅgalaiśca snehaḥ svedaḥ snaihikaścāpi dhūmaḥ||
6.23.12| śeṣān rogān ghrāṇajān sanniyaccheduktaṃ teṣāṃ yadyathā saṃvidhānam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre nāsāgatarogapratiṣedho nāma trayoviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||23||

caturviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.24.1| athātaḥ pratiśyāyapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.24.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.24.3| nārīprasaṅgaḥ śiraso 'bhitāpo dhūmo rajaḥ śītamatipratāpaḥ|
saṃdhāraṇaṃ mūtrapurīṣayośca sadyaḥ pratiśyāyanidānamuktam||
6.24.4| cayaṃ gatā mūrdhani mārutādayaḥ pṛthak samastāśca tathaiva śoṇitam|
prakopyamāṇā vividhaiḥ prakopaṇairnṛṇāṃ pratiśyāyakarā bhavanti hi||
6.24.5| śirogurutvaṃ kṣavathoḥ pravartanaṃ tathā 'ṅgamardaḥ parihṛṣṭaromatā|
upadravāścāpyapare pṛthagvidhā nṛṇāṃ pratiśyāyapuraḥsarāḥ smṛtāḥ||
6.24.6| ānaddhā pihitā nāsā tanusrāvapravartinī|
galatālvoṣṭhaśoṣaśca nistodaḥ śaṅkhayostathā||
6.24.7| svaropaghātaśca bhavet pratiśyāye 'nilātmake|
uṣṇaḥ sapītakaḥ srāvo ghrāṇāt sravati paittike||
6.24.8| kṛśo 'tipāṇḍuḥ santapto bhavettṛṣṇānipīḍitaḥ(tṛṣṇābhipīḍitaḥ)|
sadhūmaṃ sahasā vahniṃ vamatīva ca mānavaḥ||
6.24.9| kaphaḥ kaphakṛte ghrāṇācchuklaḥ śītaḥ sravenmuhuḥ|
śuklāvabhāsaḥ śūnākṣo bhavedguruśiromukhaḥ||
6.24.10| śirogalauṣṭhatālūnāṃ kaṇḍūyanamatīva ca|
bhūtvā bhūtvā pratiśyāyo yo 'kasmādvinivartate||
6.24.11| saṃpakvo vā 'pyapakvo vā sa sarvaprabhavaḥ smṛtaḥ|
liṅgāni caiva sarveṣāṃ pīnasānāṃ ca sarvaje||
6.24.12| raktaje tu pratiśyāye raktāsrāvaḥ pravartate|
tāmrākṣaśca bhavejjantururoghātaprapīḍitaḥ||
6.24.13| durgandhocchvāsavadanastathā gandhānna vetti ca|
mūrcchanti cātra kṛmayaḥ śvetāḥ 1snigdhāstathā 'ṇavaḥ||
6.24.14| kṛmimūrdhavikāreṇa samānaṃ cāsya lakṣaṇam|
praklidyati punarnāsā puanaśca pariśuṣyati||
6.24.15| muhurānahyate cāpi muhurvivriyate tathā|
niḥśvāsocchvāsadaurgandhyaṃ tathā gandhānna vetti ca||
6.24.16| evaṃ duṣṭapratiśyāyaṃ jānīyāt kṛcchrasādhanam|
sarva eva pratiśyāyā narasyāpratikāriṇaḥ||
6.24.17| kālena rogajananā jāyante duṣṭapīnasāḥ|
bādhiryamāndhyamaghrāṇaṃ ghorāṃśca nayanāmayān|
kāsāgnisādaśophāṃśca vṛddhāḥ kurvanti pīnasāḥ||
6.24.18| navaṃ pratiśyāyamapāsya sarvamupācaret sarpiṣa eva pānaiḥ|
svedairvicitrairvamanaiśca yuktaiḥ kālopapannairavapīḍanaiśca||
6.24.19| apacyamānasya hi pācanārthaṃ svedo hito 'mlairahimaṃ ca bhojyam|
niṣevyamāṇaṃ payasā++ārdrakaṃ vā saṃpācayedikṣuvikārayogaiḥ||
6.24.20| pakvaṃ ghanaṃ cāpyavalambamānaṃ śirovirekairapakarṣayettam|
virecanāsthāpanadhūmapānairavekṣya doṣān kavalagrahaiśca||
6.24.21| nivātaśayyāsanaceṣṭanāni mūrdhno gurūṣṇaṃ ca tathaiva vāsaḥ|
tīkṣṇā virekāḥ śirasaḥ sadhūmā rūkṣaṃ 1yavānnaṃ vijayā ca sevyā||
6.24.22| śītāmbuyoṣicchiśirāvagāhacintātirūkṣāśanavegarodhān|
śokaṃ ca madyāni navāni caiva vivarjayet pīnasarogajuṣṭaḥ||
6.24.23| chardyaṅgasādajvaragauravārtamarocakāratyatisārayuktam|
vilaṅghanaiḥ pācanadīpanīyairupācaret pīnasinaṃ yathāvat||
6.24.24| bahudravairvātakaphopasṛṣṭaṃ pracchardayet pīnasinaṃ vayaḥstham|
upadravāṃścāpi yathopadeśaṃ svairbheṣajairbhojanasaṃvidhānaiḥ|
jayedviditvā mṛdutāṃ gateṣu prāglakṣaṇeṣūktamathādiśecca||
6.24.25| vātike tu pratiśyāye pibet sarpiryathākramam|
pañcabhirlavaṇaiḥ siddhaṃ prathamena gaṇena ca||
6.24.26| nasyādiṣu vidhiṃ kṛtsnamavekṣetārditeritam|
pittaraktotthayoḥ peyaṃ sarpirmadhurakaiḥ śṛtam||
6.24.27| pariṣekān pradehāṃśca kuryādapi ca śītalān|
śrīsarjarasapattaṅgapriyaṅgumadhuśarkarāḥ||
6.24.28| drākṣāmadhūlikāgojīśrīparṇīmadhuphaistathā|
yujyante kavalāścātra vireko madhurairapi||
6.24.29| dhavatvaktriphalāśyāmātilvakairmadhukena ca|
śrīparṇīrajanīmiśraiḥ kṣīre daśaguṇe pacet||
6.24.30| tailaṃ kālopapannaṃ tannasyaṃ syādanayorhitam|
kaphaje sarpiṣā snigdhaṃ tilamāṣavipakvayā||
6.24.31| yavāgvā vāmayedvāntaḥ kaphaghnaṃ kramamācaret|
ubhe bale bṛhatyau ca viḍaṅgaṃ satrikaṇṭakam||
6.24.32| śvetāmūlaṃ 1sadābhadrāṃ varṣabhūṃ cātra saṃharet|
tailamebhirvipakvaṃ tu nasyamasyopakalpayet||
6.24.33| saralākiṇihīdārunikumbheṅgudibhiḥ kṛtāḥ|
vartayaścopayojyāḥ syurdhūmapāne yathāvidhi||
6.24.34| sarpīṃṣi kaṭutiktāni tīkṣṇadhūmāḥ kaṭūni ca|
bheṣajānyupayuktāni hanyuḥ sarvaprakopajam||
6.24.35| rasāñjane sātiviṣe mustāyāṃ bhadradāruṇi|
tailaṃ vipakvaṃ nasyārthe vidadhyāccātra buddhimān||
6.24.36| mustā tejovatī pāṭhā kaṭphalaṃ kaṭukā vacā|
sarṣapāḥ pippalīmūlaṃ pippalyaḥ saindhavāgnikau||
6.24.37| tutthaṃ karañjabījaṃ ca lavaṇaṃ bhadradāru ca|
etaiḥ kṛtaṃ kaṣāyaṃ tu kavale saṃprayojayet||
6.24.38| hitaṃ mūrdhavireke ca tailamebhirvipācitam|
kṣīramardhajale kvāthyaṃ jāṅgalairmṛgapakṣibhiḥ||
6.24.39| puṣpairvimiśraṃ jalajairvātaghnairauṣadhairapi|
hime kṣīrāvaśiṣṭe 'smin ghṛtamutpādya yatnataḥ||
6.24.40| sarvagandhasitānantāmadhukaṃ1 candanaṃ tathā|
āvāpya vipacedbhūyo daśakṣīraṃ tu tadghṛtam||
6.24.41| nasye prayuktamudriktān pratiśyāyān vyapohati|
yathāsvaṃ doṣaśamanaistailaṃ kuryācca yatnataḥ||
6.24.42| samūtrapittāścoddiṣṭāḥ kriyāḥ kṛmiṣu yojayet|
yāpanārthaṃ kṛmighnāni bheṣajāni ca buddhimān||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre pratiśyāyapratiṣedho nāma caturviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ||24||

pañcaviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.25.1| athātaḥ śirorogavijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.25.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.25.3| śiro rujati martyānāṃ vātapittakaphaistribhiḥ|
sannipātena raktena kṣayeṇa krimibhistathā||
6.25.4| sūryāvartānantavātārdhāvabhedakaśaṅkhakaiḥ|
ekādaśaprakārasya1 lakṣaṇaṃ saṃpravakṣyate||
6.25.5| yasyānimittaṃ śiraso rujaśca bhavanti tīvrā niśi cātimātram|
bandhopatāpaiśca bhavedviśeṣaḥ śirobhitāpaḥ sa samīraṇena||
6.25.6| yasyoṣṇamaṅgāracitaṃ yathaiva 1dahyeta dhūpyeta śiroksināsam|
śītena rātrau ca bhavedviśeṣaḥ śirobhitāpaḥ sa tu pittakopāt||
6.25.7| śirogalaṃ yasya kaphopadigdhaṃ guru pratiṣṭabdhamatho himaṃ ca|
śūnākṣikūṭaṃ vadanaṃ ca yasya śirobhitāpaḥ sa kaphaprakopāt||
6.25.8| śirobhitāpe tritayapravṛtte sarvāṇi liṅgāni samudbhavanti1|
raktātmakaḥ pittasamānaliṅgaḥ sparśāsahatvaṃ śiraso bhavecca||
6.25.9| vasābalāsakṣatasṃbhavānāṃ śirogatānāmiha saṃkṣayeṇa|
kṣayapravṛttaḥ śiraso 'bhitāpaḥ kaṣṭo bhavedugrarujo 'timātram||
6.25.10| saṃsvedanacchardanadhūmanasyairasṛgvimokṣaiśca vivṛddhimeti|
nistudyate yasya śiro 'timātraṃ saṃbhakṣyamāṇaṃ 1sphuṭatīva cāntaḥ||
6.25.11| ghrāṇācca gacchetsalilaṃ saraktaṃ śirobhitāpaḥ kṛmibhiḥ sa ghoraḥ|
sūryodayaṃ yā prati mandamandamakṣibhruvaṃ ruk samupaiti gāḍham||
6.25.12| vivardhate cāṃśumatā sahaiva sūryāpavṛttau vinivartate ca|
śītena śāntiṃ labhate kadāciduṣṇena jantuḥ sukhamāpnuyācca||
6.25.13| taṃ bhāskarāvartamudāharanti sarvātmakaṃ kaṣṭatamaṃ vikāram|
doṣāstu duṣṭāstraya eva manyāṃ saṃpīḍya ghāṭāsu rujāṃ sutīvrām||
6.25.14| kurvanti sākṣibhruvi śaṅkhadeśe sthitiṃ karotyāśu viśeṣatastu|
gaṇḍasya pārśve tu karoti kampaṃ hanugrahaṃ locanajāṃśca rogān||
6.25.15| anantavātaṃ tamudāharanti doṣatrayotthaṃ śiraso vikāram|
yasyottamāṅgārdhamatīva jantoḥ saṃbhedatodabhramaśūlajuṣṭam||
6.25.16| pakṣāddaśāhādathavā 'pyakasmāttasyārdhamedaṃ tritayādvyavasyet|
śaṅkhāśrito vāyurudīrṇavegaḥ kṛtānuyātraḥ kaphapittaraktaiḥ||
6.25.17| rujaḥ sutīvrāḥ pratanoti mūrdhni viśeṣataścāpi hi śaṅkhayostu|
sukaṣṭamenaṃ khalu śaṅkhakākhyaṃ maharṣayo vedavidaḥ purāṇāḥ||
6.25.18| vyādhiṃ vadantyudgatamṛtyukalpaṃ bhiṣaksahasrairapi durnivāram||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre śirorogavijñānīyo nāma pañcaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||25||

ṣaḍviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.26.1| athātaḥ śirorogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.26.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.26.3| vātavyādhividhiḥ kāryaḥ śiroroge 'nilātmake|
payonupānaṃ seveta ghṛtaṃ tailamathāpi vā||
6.26.4| mudgān kulatthānmāṣāṃśca khādecca niśi kevalān|
kaṭūṣṇāṃśca1 sasarpiṣkānuṣṇaṃ cānu payaḥ pibet||
6.26.5| pibedvā payasā tailaṃ tatkalkaṃ vā 'pi mānavaḥ|
vātaghnasiddhaiḥ kṣīraiśca sukhoṣṇaiḥ sekamācaret||
6.26.6| tatsiddhaiḥ pāyasairvā 'pi sukhoṣṇairlepayecchiraḥ|
1svinnairvā matsyapiśitaiḥ kṛśarairvā sasaindhavaiḥ||
6.26.7| candanotpalakuṣṭhairvā suślakṣṇairmagadhāyutaiḥ|
snigdhasya tailaṃ nasyaṃ syāt kulīrarasasādhitam||
6.26.8| varuṇādau gaṇe kṣuṇṇe kṣīramardhodakaṃ pacet|
kṣīraśeṣaṃ ca tanmathyaṃ śītaṃ sāramupāharet||
6.26.9| tato madhurakaiḥ siddhaṃ nasye tat pūjitaṃ haviḥ|
tasmin vipakve kṣīre tu peyaṃ sarpiḥ saśarkaram||
6.26.10| dhūmaṃ cāsya yathākālaṃ snaihikaṃ yojayedbhiṣak|
pānābhyañjananasyeṣu basikarmaṇi secane||
6.26.11| vidadhyāttraivṛtaṃ dhīmān balātailamathāpi vā|
bhojayecca rasaiḥ snigdhaiḥ payobhirvā susaṃskṛtaiḥ||
6.26.12| pittaraktasamutthānau śirorogau nivārayet|
śirolepaiḥ sasarpiṣkaiḥ pariṣekaiśca śītalaiḥ||
6.26.13| kṣīrekṣurasadhānyāmlamastukṣaudrasitājalaiḥ|
nalavañjulakahlāracandanotpalapadmakaiḥ||
6.26.14| 1vaṃśaśaivalayaṣṭyāhvamustāmbhoruhasaṃyutaiḥ|
śiraḥpralepaiḥ saghṛtairvaisarpaiśca tathāvidhaiḥ||
6.26.15| madhuraiśca mukhālaipairnasyakarmabhireva ca|
āsthāpanairvirekaiśca pathyaiśca snehabastibhiḥ||
6.26.16| kṣīrasarpirhitaṃ nasyaṃ vasā vā jāṅgalā śubhā|
utpalādivipakvena kṣīreṇāsthāpanaṃ hitam||
6.26.17| bhojanaṃ jāṅgalarasaiḥ sarpiṣā cānuvāsanam|
madhuraiḥ kṣīrasarpistu snehane ca saśarkaram||
6.26.18| pittaraktaghnamuddiṣṭaṃ yaccānyadapi taddhitam|
kaphotthitaṃ śirorogaṃ jayet kaphanivāraṇaiḥ||
6.26.19| śirovirekairvamanaistīkṣṇairgaṇḍūṣadhāraṇaiḥ|
acchaṃ ca pāyayetsarpiḥ svedayeccāpyabhīkṣṇaśaḥ||
6.26.20| śiro madhūkasāreṇa snigdhaṃ cāpi virecayet|
iṅgudasya tvacā vā 'pi meṣaśṛṅgasya1 vā bhiṣak||
6.26.21| ābhyāmeva kṛtāṃ vartiṃ dhūmapāne prayojayet|
ghreyaṃ kaṭphalacūrṇaṃ ca kavalāśca kaphāpahāḥ||
6.26.22| saralākuṣṭhaśārṅgeṣṭādevakāṣṭhaiḥ sarohiṣaiḥ|
kṣārapiṣṭaiḥ salavaṇaiḥ sukhoṣṇairlepayecchiraḥ||
6.26.23| yavaṣaṣṭikayoścānnaṃ vyoṣakṣārasamāyutam|
paṭolamudgakaulatthairmātrāvadbhojayedrasaiḥ||
6.26.24| śiroroge tridoṣotthe tridoṣaghno vidhirhitaḥ|
sarpiḥpānaṃ viśeṣeṇa purāṇaṃ vā diśanti hi||
6.26.25| kṣayaje kṣayamāsādya kartavyo bṛṃhaṇo vidhiḥ|
pāne nasye ca sarpiḥ syādvātaghnamadhuraiḥ śṛtam||
6.26.26| kṣayakāsāpahaṃ cātra sarpiḥ pathyatamaṃ viduḥ|
kṛmibhirbhakṣyamāṇasya vakṣyate śirasaḥ kriyā||
6.26.27| nasye hi śoṇitaṃ dadyāttena mūrcchanti jantavaḥ|
mattāḥ śoṇitagandhena samāyānti yatastataḥ||
6.26.28| teṣāṃ nirharaṇaṃ kāryaṃ tato mūrdhavirecanaiḥ|
hrasvaśigrukabījairvā kāṃsyanīlīsamāyutaiḥ||
6.26.29| kṛmighnairavapīḍaiśca mūtrapiṣṭairupācaret|
pūtimatsyayutān dhūmān kṛmighnāṃśca prayojayet||
6.26.30| bhojanāni kṛmighnāni pānāni vividhāni ca|
sūryāvarte vidhātavyaṃ nasyakarmādibheṣajam||
6.26.31| bhojanaṃ jāṅgalaprāyaṃ kṣīrānnavikṛtirghṛtam|
tathā 'rdhabhedake vyādhau prāptamanyacca yadbhavet||
6.26.32| śirīṣamūlakaphalairavapīḍo 'nayorhitaḥ|
vaṃśamūlakaphalairavapīḍo 'nayorhitaḥ||
6.26.33| avapīḍo hitaścātra vacāmāgadhikāyutaḥ|
madhukenāvpīḍo vā madhunā saha saṃyutaḥ||
6.26.34| manaḥśilāvapīḍo vā madhunā candanena vā|
teṣāmante hitaṃ nasyaṃ sarpirmadhurasānvitam||
6.26.35| sārivotpalakuṣṭhāni madhukaṃ cāmlapeṣitam|
sarpistailayuto lepo dvayorapi sukhāvahaḥ||
6.26.36| eṣa eva prayoktavyaḥ śiroroge kaphātmake|
anantavāte kartavyaḥ sūryāvartaharo1 vidhiḥ||
6.26.37| sirāvyadhaśca kartavyo 'nantavātapraśāntaye|
āhāraśca vidhātavyo vātapittavināśanaḥ||
6.26.38| madhumastakasaṃyāvaghṛtapūraiśca bhojanam|
kṣīrasarpiḥ praśaṃsanti nasye pāne ca śaṅkhake||
6.26.39| jāṅgalānāṃ rasaiḥ snigdhairāhāraścātra śasyate|
śatāvarīṃ tilān kṛṣṇān madhukaṃ nīlamutpalam||
6.26.40| dūrvāṃ punarnavāṃ caiva lepe sādhvavacārayet|
mahāsugandhāmathavā pālindīṃ cāmlapeṣitām||
6.26.41| śītāṃścātra parīṣekān pradehāṃśca prayojayet|
avapīḍaśca deyo 'tra sūryāvartanivāraṇaḥ||
6.26.42| kṛmikṣayakṛtau hitvā śirorogeṣu buddhimān|
madhutailasamāyuktaiḥ śirāṃsyativirecayet||
6.26.43| paścātsarṣapatailena tato nasyaṃ prayojayet|
na cecchāntiṃ vrajantyevaṃ snigdhasvinnāṃstato bhiṣak||
6.26.44| paścādupācaretsamyak sirāṇāmatha mokṣaṇaiḥ|
ṣaṭsaptatirnetrarogā daśāṣṭādaśa karṇajāḥ||
6.26.45| ekatriṃśad ghrāṇagatāḥ śirasyekādaśaiva tu|
iti vistarato dṛṣṭāḥ(diṣṭāḥ) salakṣaṇacikitsitāḥ||
6.26.46| etāvanto yathāsthūlamuttamāṅgagatā gadāḥ|
asmiñchāstre nigaditāḥ saṅkhyārūpacikitsitaiḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate śālākyatantre śirorogapratiṣedho nāma ṣaṅviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||26||

saptaviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.27.1| athāto navagrahākṛtivijñānīyamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.27.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.27.3| bālagrahāṇāṃ vijñānaṃ sādhanaṃ cāpyanantaram|
utpattiṃ kāraṇaṃ caiva suśrutaikamanāḥ śṛṇu||
6.27.4| skandagrahastu prathamaḥ skandāpasmāra eva ca|
śakunī revatī caiva pūtanā cāndhapūtanā||
6.27.5| pūtanā śītanāmā ca tathaiva mukhamaṇḍikā|
navamo naigameṣaśca yaḥ pitṛgrahasaṃjñitaḥ||
6.27.6| dhātrīmātroḥ prākpradiṣṭāpacārācchaucabhraṣṭānmaṅgalācārahīnān|
trastān hṛṣṭāṃtarjitān tāḍitān vā pūjāhetorhiṃsyurete kumārān||
6.27.7| aiśvaryasthāste na śakyā viśanto dehaṃ draṣṭuṃ mānuṣairviśvarūpāḥ|
āptaṃ vākyaṃ tatsamīkṣyābhidhāsye liṅgānyeṣāṃ yāni dehe bhavanti||
6.27.8| śūnākṣaḥ1 kṣatajasagandhikaḥ stanadviḍ vakrāsyo hatacalitaikapakṣmanetraḥ|
udvigraḥ sululitacakṣuralparodī skandārto bhavati ca gāḍhamuṣṭivarcāḥ||
6.27.9| niḥsaṃjño bhavati punarbhavetsasaṃjñaḥ saṃrabdhaḥ karacaraṇaiśca nṛtyatīva|
viṇmūtre sṛjati vinadya jṛmbhamāṇaḥ phenaṃ ca prasṛjati tatsakhābhipannaḥ||
6.27.10| srastāṅgo bhayacakito vihaṅgagandhiḥ saṃsrāvivraṇaparipīḍitaḥ samantāt|
sphoṭaiśca pracitatanuḥ sadāhapākairvijñeyo bhavati śiśuḥ kṣataḥ śakunyā||
6.27.11| raktāsyo haritamalo 'tipāṇḍudehaḥ śyāvo vā jvaramukhapākavedanātaḥ|
revatyā viyathitatanuśca karṇanāsaṃ mṛdgāti dhruvamabhipīḍitaḥ kumāraḥ||
6.27.12| srastāṅgaḥ svapiti sukhaṃ divā na rātrau viḍ bhinnaṃ sṛjati ca kākatulyagandhiḥ|
chardyā++ārto hṛṣitatanūruhaḥ kumārastṛṣṇālurbhavati ca pūtanāgṛhītaḥ||
6.27.13| yo dveṣṭi stanamatisārakāsahikkācchardībhirjvarasahitābhirardyamānaḥ|
durvarṇaḥ satatamadhaḥśayo 'mlagandhistaṃ brūyurbhiṣaja ihāndhapūtanārtam||
6.27.14| udvigro bhṛśamativepate prarudyāt saṃlīnaḥ śvapiti ca yasya cāntrakūjaḥ|
visrāṅgo bhṛśamatisāryate ca yastaṃ jānīyādbhiṣagiha śītapūtanārtam||
6.27.15| mlānāṅgaḥ surucirapāṇipādavaktro bahvāśī kaluṣasirāvṛtodaro yaḥ|
sodvego bhavati ca mūtratulyagandhiḥ sa jñeyaḥ śiśuriha vaktramaṇḍikārtaḥ||
6.27.16| yaḥ phenaṃ vamati vinamyate ca madhye sodvegaṃ vilapati cordhvamīkṣamāṇaḥ|
jvaryeta pratatamatho vasāsagandhirniḥsaṃjño bhavati hi naigameṣajuṣṭaḥ||
6.27.17| prastabdho yaḥ stanadveṣī muhyate cāviśanmuhuḥ|
taṃ bālamacirāddhanti grahaḥ saṃpūrṇalakṣaṇaḥ||
6.27.18| viparītamataḥ sādhyaṃ cikitsedacirārditam|
gṛhe purāṇahaviṣā 'bhyajya bālaṃ śucau śuciḥ||
6.27.19| sarṣapān prakiretteṣāṃ tailairdīpaṃ1 ca kārayet|
sadā sannihitaṃ cāpi juhuyāddhavyavāhanam||
6.27.20| sarvagandhauṣadhībījairgandhamālyairalaṅkṛtam|
agnye kṛttikābhyaśca svāhā svāheti saṃtatam||
6.27.21| namaḥ skandāya devāya grahādhipataye namaḥ|
śirasā tvā 'bhivande 'haṃ pratigṛhṇīṣva me balim|
nīrujo nirvikāraśca śiśurme jāyatāṃ drutam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre navagrahākṛtivijñānīyo nāma (prathamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) saptaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||27||

aṣṭāviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.28.1| athātaḥ skandhagrahapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.28.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.28.3| skandagrahopasṛṣṭānāṃ kumārāṇāṃ praśasyate|
vātaghnadrumapatrāṇāṃ niṣkvāthaḥ pariṣecane||
6.28.4| teṣāṃ mūleṣu siddhaṃ ca tailamabhyañjane hitam|
sarvagandhasurāmaṇḍakaiḍaryāvāpamiṣyate||
6.28.5| devadāruṇi rāsnāyāṃ madhureṣu drumeṣu ca|
siddhaṃ sarpiśca sakṣīraṃ pānamasmai prayojayet||
6.28.6| sarṣapāḥ sarpanirmoko vacā kākādanī ghṛtam|
uṣṭrājāvigavāṃ caiva romāṇyuddhūpanaṃ śiśoḥ||
6.28.7| somavallīmindravallīṃ śamīṃ bilvasya kaṇṭakān|
mṛgādanyāśca mūlāni grathitānyeva dhārayet||
6.28.8| raktāni mālyāni tathā patākā raktāśca gandhā vividhāśca bhakṣyāḥ|
ghaṇṭā ca devāya balirnivedyaḥ sukukkuṭaḥ skandagrahe hitāya||
6.28.9| snānaṃ trirātraṃ niśi catvareṣu kuryāt puraṃ śāliyavairnavaistu|
adbhiśca gāyatryabhimantritābhiḥ prajvālanaṃ vyāhṛtibhiśca vahneḥ||
6.28.10| rakṣāmataḥ pravakṣyāmi bālānāṃ pāpanāśinīm|
ahanyahani kartavyā yā bhiṣagbhiratandritaiḥ||
6.28.11| tapasāṃ tejasāṃ caiva yaśasāṃ vapuṣāṃ tathā|
nidhānaṃ yo 'vyayo devaḥ sa te skandaḥ prasīdatu||
6.28.12| grahasenāpatirdevo devasenāpatirvibhuḥ|
devasenātipuharaḥ pātu tvāṃ bhagavān guhaḥ||
6.28.13| devadevasya mahataḥ pāvakasya ca yaḥ sutaḥ|
gaṅgomākṛttikānāṃ ca sa te śarma prayacchatu||
6.28.14| raktamālyāmbaraḥ śrīmān raktacandanabhūṣitaḥ|
raktadivyavapurdevaḥ pātu tvāṃ krauñcasūdanaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre skandapratiṣedho nāmā (dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ, ādito+)aṣṭāviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||28||

ekonatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.29.1| athātaḥ skandāpasmārapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.29.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.29.3| bilvaḥ śirīṣo golomī surasādiśca yo gaṇaḥ|
pariṣeke prayoktavyaḥ skandāpasmāraśāntaye||
6.29.4| sarvagandhavipakvaṃ tu tailamabhyañjane hitam|
kṣīravṛkṣakaṣāye ca kākolyādau gaṇe tathā||
6.29.5| vipaktavyaṃ ghṛtaṃ cāpi pānīyaṃ payasā saha|
utsādanaṃ vacāhiṅguyuktaṃ skandagrahe hitam||
6.29.6| gṛdhrolūkapurīṣāṇi keśā hastinakhā ghṛtam|
vṛkṣabhasya ca romāṇi yojyānyuddhūpane 'pi ca||
6.29.7| anantāṃ kukkuṭīṃ bimbīṃ markaṭīṃ cāpi dhārayet|
pakvāpakvāni māṃsāni prasannā rudhiraṃ payaḥ||
6.29.8| bhūtaudano nivedyaśca skandāpasmāriṇe 'vaṭe|
catuṣpathe ca kartavyaṃ snānamasya yatātmanā||
6.29.9| skandāpasmārasaṃjño yaḥ skandasya dayitaḥ sakhā|
viśākhasaṃjñaśca śiśoḥ śivo 'stu vikṛtānanaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre skandāpasmārapratiṣedho nāma (tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ekonatriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||29||

triṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.30.1| athātaḥ śakunīpratīṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.30.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.30.3| śakunyabhiparītasya kāryo vaidyena jānatā|
vetasāmrakapitthānāṃ niṣkvāthaḥ pariṣecane||
6.30.4| kaṣāyamadhuraistailaṃ kāryamabhyañjane śiśoḥ|
madhukośīrahrīberasārivotpalapadmakaiḥ||
6.30.5| rodhrapriyaṅgumañjiṣṭhāgairikaiḥ pradihecchiśum|
vraṇeṣūktāni cūrṇāni pathyāni vividhāni ca||
6.30.6| skandagrahe dhūpanāni tānīhāpi prayojayet|
śatāvarīmṛgairvārunāgadantīnidigdhikāḥ||
6.30.7| lakṣmaṇāṃ sahadevāṃ ca bṛhatīṃ cāpi dhārayet|
tilataṇḍulakaṃ mālyaṃ haritālaṃ manaḥśilā||
6.30.8| balirepa karañjeṣu nivedyo niyatātmanā|
niṣkuṭe ca prayoktavyaṃ snānamasya yathāvidhi||
6.30.9| skandāpasmāraśamanaṃ ghṛtaṃ cāpīha pūjitam|
kuryācca vividhāṃ pūjāṃ śakunyāḥ kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ||
6.30.10| antarīkṣacarā devī sarvālaṅkārabhūṣitā|
ayomukhī tīkṣṇatuṇḍā śakunī te prasīdatu||
6.30.11| durdarśanā mahākāyā piṅgākṣī bhairavasvarā|
lambodarī 1śaṅkukarṇī śakunī te prasīdatu||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre śakunīpratiṣedho nāma (caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) triṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||30||

ekatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.31.1| athāto revatīpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.31.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.31.3| aśvagandhā ca śṛṅgī ca sārivā sapunarnavā|
sahe tathā vidārī ca kaṣāyāḥ secane hitāḥ||
6.31.4| tailamabhyañjane kāryaṃ kuṣṭhe sarjarase 'pi ca|
palaṅkaṣāyāṃ nalade tathā girikadambake||
6.31.5| dhavāśvakarṇakakubhadhātakītindukīṣu ca|
kākolyādigaṇe caiva pānīyaṃ sarpiriṣyate||
6.31.6| kulatthāḥ śaṅkhacūrṇaṃ ca pradehaḥ sārvagandhikaḥ|
gṛdhrolūkapurīṣāṇi yavā yavaphalo ghṛtam||
6.31.7| sandhyayorubhayoḥ kāryametaduddhūpanaṃ śiśoḥ|
varuṇāriṣṭakamayaṃ rucakaṃ saindukaṃ tathā||
6.31.8| satataṃ dhārayeccāpi kṛtaṃ vā pautrajīvikam|
śuklāḥ sumanaso lājāḥ payaḥ śālyodanaṃ tathā||
6.31.9| balirnivedyo gotīrthe revatyai prayatātmanā|
saṅgame ca bhiṣak snānaṃ kuryāddhātrīkumārayoḥ||
6.31.10| nānāvastradharā devī citramālyānulepanā|
calatkuṇḍalinī śyāmā revatī te prasīdatu||
6.31.11| upāsate yāṃ satataṃ devyo vividhabhūṣaṇāḥ|
lambā karālā vinatā tathaiva bahuputrikā|
revatī śuṣkanāmā yā sā te devī prasīdatu||
iti suśurtasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre revatīpratiṣedho nāma (pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ekatriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||31||

dvātriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.32.1| athātaḥ pūtanāratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.32.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.32.3| kapotavaṅkā 'raluko varuṇaḥ pāribhadrakaḥ|
āsphotā caiva yojyāḥ syurbālānāṃ pariṣecane||
6.32.4| vacā vayaḥsthā golomī haritālaṃ manaḥśilā|
kuṣṭhaṃ sarjarasaścaiva tailārthe varga iṣyate||
6.32.5| hitaṃ ghṛtaṃ tugākṣīryāṃ siddhaṃ madhurakeṣu ca|
kuṣṭhatālīśakhadiracandanasyandane tathā||
6.32.6| devadāruvacāhiṅgukuṣṭhaṃ girikadambarakaḥ|
elā hareṇavaścāpi yojyā uddhūpane sadā||
6.32.7| gandhanākulikumbhīke majjāno badarasya ca|
karkaṭāsthi ghṛtaṃ cāpi dhūpanaṃ sarṣapaiḥ saha||
6.32.8| kākādanīṃ citraphalāṃ bimbīṃ guñjāṃ ca dhārayet|
matsyaudanaṃ ca kurvīta kṛśarāṃ palalaṃ tathā|
śarāvasaṃpuṭe kṛtvā baliṃ śūnyagṛhe haret||
6.32.9| ucchiṣṭenābhiṣekeṇa śiśoḥ snapanamiṣyate|
pūjyā ca pūtanā devī balibhiḥ sopahārakaiḥ||
6.32.10| malināmbarasaṃvītā malinā rūkṣamūrdhajā|
śūnyāgārāśritā1 devī dārakaṃ pātu pūtanā||
6.32.11| durdarśanā sudurgandhā karālā meghakālikā|
bhinnagārāśrayā devī dārakaṃ pātu pūtanā||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre (ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) dvātriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||32||

trayastriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.33.1| athāto 'ndhapūtanāprasiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.33.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.33.3| tiktakadrumapatrāṇāṃ kāryaḥ kvātho 'vasecane|
surā sauvīrakaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ haritālaṃ manaḥśilā||
6.33.4| tathā sarjarasaścaiva tailārthamupadiśyate|
pippalyaḥ pippalīmūlaṃ vargo madhurako madhu||
6.33.5| śālapārṇī bṛhatyau ca ghṛtārthamupadiśyate|
sarvagandhaiḥ pradehaśca gātreṣvakṣṇośca śītalaiḥ||
6.33.6| purīṣaṃ kaukkuṭaṃ keśāṃścarma sarpatvacaṃ tathā|
jīrṇāṃ ca bhikṣusaṃghāṭīṃ dhūmanāyopakalpayet||
6.33.7| kukkuṭīṃ markaṭīṃ śimbīmanantāṃ cāpi dhārayet|
māṃsamāmaṃ tathā pakvaṃ śoṇitaṃ ca catuṣpathe||
6.33.8| nivedyamantaśca gṛhe śiśo rakṣānimittataḥ|
śiśośca snapanaṃ kuryāt sarvagandhodakaiḥ śubhaiḥ||
6.33.9| karālā piṅgalā muṇḍā kaṣāyāmbaravāsinī|
devī bālamimaṃ prītā saṃrakṣatvandhapūtanā||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre 'ndhapūtanāpratiṣedho nāma (saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) trayastriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||33||

catustriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.34.1| athātaḥ śītapūtanāpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.34.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.34.3| kapitthaṃ suvahāṃ bimbīṃ tathā bilvaṃ pracībalam|
nandīṃ bhallātakaṃ cāpi pariṣeke prayojayet||
6.34.4| bastamūtraṃ gavāṃ mūtraṃ mustaṃ ca suradāru ca|
kuṣṭhaṃ ca sarvagandhāṃśca tailārthamavacārayet||
6.34.5| rohiṇīsarjakhadirapalāśakakubhatvacaḥ|
niṣkvāthya tasminniṣkvāthe sakṣīraṃ vipacedghṛtam||
6.34.6| gṛdhrolūkapurīṣāṇi bastagandhāmahestvacaḥ|
nimbapatrāṇi madhukaṃ dhūpanārthaṃ prayojayet||
6.34.7| dhārayedapi lambāṃ ca guñjāṃ kākādanīṃ tathā|
nadyāṃ mudgakṛtaiścānnaistarpayecchītapūtanām||
6.34.8| devyai deyaścopahāro vāruṇī rudhiraṃ tathā|
jalāśayānte bālasya snapanaṃ copadiśyate||
6.34.9| mudgaudanāśanā devī surāśoṇitapāyinī|
jalāśayālayā devī pātu tvāṃ śītapūtanā||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre śītapūtanāpratiṣedho nāma (aṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) catustriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||34||

pañcatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.35.1| athāto mukhamaṇḍikāpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.35.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.35.3| kapitthabilvatarkārīvāṃśīgandharvahastakāḥ|
kuberākṣī ca yojyāḥ syurbālānāṃ pariṣecane||
6.35.4| svarasairbhṛṅgavṛkṣāṇāṃ1 tathā 'jaharigandhayoḥ|
tailaṃ vasāṃ ca saṃyojya pacedabhyañjane śiśoḥ||
6.35.5| madhūlikāyāṃ payasi tugākṣīryāṃ gaṇe tathā|
madhure pañcamūle ca kanīyasi ghṛtaṃ pacet||
6.35.6| vacā sarjarasaḥ kuṣṭhaṃ sarpiścoddhūpanaṃ hitam|
dhārayedapi jihvāśca cāṣacīrallisarpajāḥ||
6.35.7| varṇakaṃ cūrṇakaṃ mālyamañjanaṃ pāradaṃ tathā|
manaḥśilāṃ copaharedgoṣṭhamadhye baliṃ tathā||
6.35.8| pāyasaṃ sapuroḍāśaṃ balyarthamupasaṃharet|
mantrapūtābhiradbhiśca tatraiva snapanaṃ hitam||
6.35.9| alaṅkṛtā rūpavatī subhagā kāmarūpiṇī|
goṣṭhamadhyālayaratā pātu tvāṃ mukhamaṇḍikā||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre mukhamaṇḍikāpratiṣedho nāma (navamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) pañcatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||35||

ṣaṭtriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.36.1| athāto naigameṣapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.36.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.36.3| bilvāgnimanthapūtīkāḥ kāryāḥ syuḥ pariṣecane|
surā sabījaṃ dhānyāmlaṃ pariṣeke ca śasyate||
6.36.4| priyaṅgusaralānantāśatapuṣpākuṭannaṭaiḥ|
pacettailaṃ sagomūtrairdadhimastvamlakāñjikaiḥ||
6.36.5| pañcamūladvayakvāthe kṣīre madhurakeṣu ca|
pacedghṛtaṃ ca medhāvī kharjūrīmastake 'pi vā||
6.36.6| vacāṃ vayaḥsthāṃ golomīṃ jaṭilāṃ cāpi dhārayet|
utsādanaṃ hitaṃ cātra skandāpasmāranāśanam||
6.36.7| siddhārthakavacāhiṅgukuṣṭhaṃ caivākṣataiḥ saha|
bhallātakājamodāśca hitamuddhūpanaṃ śiśoḥ||
6.36.8| markaṭolūkagṛdhrāṇāṃ purīṣāṇi navagrahe|
dhūpaḥ supte jane kāryo bālasya hitamicchatā||
6.36.9| tilataṇḍulakaṃ mālyaṃ bhakṣyāṃśca vividhānapi|
kumārapitṛmeṣāya vṛkṣamūle nivedayet||
6.36.10| adhastādvaṭavṛkṣasya snapanaṃ copadiśyate|
baliṃ nyagrodhavṛkṣeṣu tithau ṣaṣṭhyāṃ nivedayet||
6.36.11| ajānanaścalākṣibhrūḥ kāmarūpī mahāyaśāḥ|
bālaṃ bālapitā devo naigameṣo 'bhirakṣatu||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre naigameṣapratiṣedho nāma (daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ṣaṭtriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||36||

saptatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.37.1| athāto grahotpattimadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.37.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.37.3| nava skandādayaḥ proktā bālānāṃ ya ime grahāḥ|
śrīmanto divyavapuṣo nārīpuruṣavigrahāḥ||
6.37.4| ete guhasya rakṣārthaṃ kṛttikomāgniśūlibhiḥ|
sṛṣṭāḥ śaravaṇasthasya rakṣitasyātmatejasā||
6.37.5| strīvigrahā grahā ye tu nānārūpā mayeritāḥ|
gaṅgomākṛttikānāṃ te bhāgā rājasatāmasāḥ||
6.37.6| naigameṣastu pārvatyā sṛṣṭo meṣānano grahaḥ|
kumāradhārī devasya guhasyātmasamaḥ sakhā||
6.37.7| skandāpasmārasaṃjño yaḥ so 'gninā 'gnisamadyutiḥ|
sa ca skandasakhā nāma viśākha iti cocyate||
6.37.8| skandaḥ sṛṣṭo bhagavatā devena tripurāriṇā|
bibharti cāparāṃ saṃjñāṃ kumāra iti sa grahaḥ||
6.37.9| bālalīlādharo yo 'yaṃ devo rudrāgnisṃbhavaḥ|
mithyācāreṣu1 bhagavān svayaṃ naiṣa pravartate||
6.37.10| kumāraḥ skandasāmānyādatra kecidapaṇḍitāḥ|
gṛhṇātītyalpavijñānā bruvate dehacintakāḥ||
6.37.11| tato bhagavati skande surasenāpatau kṛte|
upatasthurgrahāḥ sarve dīptaśaktidharaṃ guham||
6.37.12| ūcuḥ prāñjalayaścainaṃ vṛttiṃ naḥ saṃvidhatsva vai|
teṣāmarthe tataḥ skandaḥ śivaṃ devamacodayat||
6.37.13| tato grahāṃstānuvāca bhagavān bhaganetrahṛt|
tiryagyoniṃ mānuṣaṃ ca tritayaṃ jagat||
6.37.14| parasparopakāreṇa vartate dhāryate 'pi ca|
devā manuṣyān prīṇanti tairyagyonīṃstathaiva ca||
6.37.15| vartamānairyathākālaṃ śītavarṣoṣṇamārutaiḥ|
ijyāñjalinamaskārajapahomavratādibhiḥ||
6.37.16| narāḥ samyak prayuktaiśca prīṇanti tridiveśvarān|
bhāgadheyaṃ vibhaktaṃ ca śeṣaṃ kiñcinna vidyate||
6.37.17| tadyuṣmākaṃ śubhā vṛttirbāleṣveva bhaviṣyati|
kuleṣu yeṣu nejyante devāḥ pitara eva ca||
6.37.18| brāhmaṇāḥ sādhavaścaiva guravo 'tithayastathā|
nivṛttācāraśauceṣu parapākopajīviṣu||
6.37.19| utsannabalibhikṣeṣu bhinnakāṃsyopabhojiṣu|
gṛheṣu teṣu ye bālāstān gṛhṇīdhvamaśaṅkitāḥ||
6.37.20| tatra vo vipulā vṛttiḥ pūjā caiva bhaviṣyati|
evaṃ grahāḥ samutpannā bālān gṛhṇanti cāpyataḥ||
6.37.21| grahopasṛṣṭā bālāstu duścikitsyatamā matāḥ|
vaikalyaṃ maraṇaṃ cāpi dhruvaṃ skandagrahe matam||
6.37.22| skandagraho 'tyugratamaḥ sarveṣveva yataḥ smṛtaḥ|
anyo vā sarvarūpastu na sādhyo graha ucyate||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kumāratantre grahotpattyadhyāyo nāma (ekādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) saptatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||37||

aṣṭatriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.38.1| athāto yonivyāpatpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.38.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.38.3| pravṛddhaliṅgaṃ puruṣaṃ yā 'tyarthamupasevate|
rūkṣadurbalabālā yā tasyā vāyuḥ prakupyati||
6.38.4| sa duṣṭo yonimāsādya yonirogāya kalpate|
trayāṇāmapi doṣāṇāṃ yathāsvaṃ lakṣaṇena tu||
6.38.5| viṃśatirvyāpado yonernirdiṣṭā rogasaṃgrahe|
mithyācāreṇa yāḥ strīṇāṃ praduṣṭenārtavena ca||
6.38.6| jāyante bījadoṣācca daivācca śṛṇu tāḥ pṛthak|
udāvartā tathā vandhyā viplutā ca pariplutā||
6.38.7| vātalā ceti vātotthāḥ pittotthā rudhirakṣarā|
vāminī snāṃsinī cāpi putraghnī pittalā ca yā||
6.38.8| atyānandā ca yā yoniḥ karṇinī caraṇādvayam1|
śleṣmalā1 ca kaphājjñeyā ṣaṇḍākhyā phalinī tathā||
6.38.9| 1mahatī sūcivaktrā ca sarvajeti tridoṣajā|
saphenilamudāvartā rajaḥ kṛcchreṇa muñcati||
6.38.10| vandhyāṃ naṣṭārtavāṃ vidyādviplutāṃ nityavedanām|
pariplutāyāṃ bhavati grāmyadharme rujā bhṛśam||
6.38.11| vātalā karkaśā stabdhā śūlanistodapīḍitā|
catasṛṣvapi cādyāsu bhavantyanilavedanāḥ||
6.38.12| sadāhaṃ prakṣaratyasraṃ yasyāṃ sā lohitakṣarā|
savātamudgiredbījaṃ vāminī rajasā yutam||
6.38.13| prasraṃsinī syandate tu kṣobhitā duḥprasūśca yā|
sthitaṃ sthitaṃ hanti garbhaṃ putraghnī raktasaṃsravāt||
6.38.14| atyarthaṃ pittalā yonirdāhapākajvarānvitā|
catasṛṣvapi cādyāsu pittaliṅgocchrayo bhavet||
6.38.15| atyānandā na santoṣaṃ grāmyadharmeṇa gacchati|
karṇinyāṃ karṇikā yonau śleṣmāsṛgbhyāṃ prajāyate||
6.38.16| maithune 'caraṇā1 pūrvaṃ puruṣādatiricyate|
bahuśaścāticaraṇādanyā bījaṃ na vindati||
6.38.17| śleṣmalā picchilā yoniḥ kaṇḍūyuktā 'tiśītalā|
catasṛṣvapi cādyāsu śleṣmaliṅgocchritirbhavet||
6.38.18| anārtavastanā ṣaṇḍī kharasparśā ca maithune|
atikāyagṛhītāyāstaruṇyāḥ phalinī bhavet||
6.38.19| vivṛtā 'timahāyoniḥ sūcīvaktrā 'tisaṃvṛtā|
sarvaliṅgasamutthānā sarvadoṣaprakopajā||
6.38.20| catasṛṣvapi cādyāsu sarvaliṅgocchritirbhavet|
pañcāsādhyā bhavantīmā yonayaḥ sarvadoṣajāḥ||
6.38.21| pratidoṣaṃ tu sādhyāsu snehādikrama iṣyate|
