6.39.106| upadravāśca śvāsādyāḥ saṃbhavantyatilaṅghanāt|
dīpanaṃ kaphavicchedi pittavātānulomanam||
6.39.107| kaphavātajvarārtebhyo hitamuṣṇāmbu tṛṭchidam|
taddhi mārdavakṛddoṣasrotasāṃ śītamanyathā||
6.39.108| sevyamānena toyena jvaraḥ śītena vardhate|
pittamadyaviṣottheṣu śītalaṃ tiktakaiḥ śṛtam||
6.39.109| gāṅgeyanāgarośīraparpaṭodīcyacandanaiḥ|
dīpanī pācanī laghvī jvarārtānāṃ jvarāpahā||
6.39.110| annakāle hitā peyā yathāsvaṃ pācanaiḥ kṛtā|
bahudoṣasya mandāgneḥ saptarātrāt paraṃ jvare||
6.39.111| 1laṅghanāmbuyavāgūbhiryadā doṣo na pacyate|
tadā taṃ mukhavairasyatṣṇārocakanāśanaiḥ||
6.39.112| kaṣāyaiḥ pācanairhṛdyairjvaraghnaiḥ samupācaret|
pañcamūlīkaṣāyaṃ tu pācanaṃ pavanajvare||
6.39.113| sakṣaudraṃ paittike mustakaṭukendrayavaiḥ kṛtam|
pippalyādikaṣāyaṃ tu kaphaje paripācanam||
6.39.114| dvandvajeṣu tu saṃsṛṣṭaṃ dadyādatha vivarjayet|
pītāmburlaṅghito bhukto 'jīrṇī kṣīṇaḥ pipāsitaḥ||
6.39.115| (tīkṣṇe jvare gurau dehe vibaddheṣu maleṣu ca|
sāmadoṣaṃ vijānīyājjvaraṃ pakvamato 'yathā1||)
mṛdau jvare laghau dehe pracaleṣu maleṣu ca|
pakvaṃ doṣaṃ vijānīyājjvare deyaṃ tadauṣadham||
6.39.116| doṣaprakṛtivaikṛtyādekeṣāṃ pakvalakṣaṇam|
hṛdayodveṣṭanaṃ tandrā lālāsrutirarocakaḥ||
6.39.117| doṣāpravṛttirālasyaṃ vibandho bahumūtratā|
gurūdaratvamasvedo na paktiḥ śakṛto 'ratiḥ||
6.39.118| svāpaḥ stambho gurutvaṃ ca gātrāṇāṃ vahnimārdavam|
mukhasyāśuddhiraglāniḥ prasaṅgī balavāñjvaraḥ||
6.39.119| liṅgairebhirvijānīyājjvaramāmaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ|
saptarātrātparaṃ kecinmanyante deyamauṣadham||
6.39.120| daśarātrātparaṃ keciddātavyamiti niścitāḥ|
paittike vā jvare deyamalpakālasamutthite||
6.39.121| acirajvaritasyāpi deyaṃ syāddoṣapākataḥ|
bheṣajaṃ hyāmadoṣasya bhūyo jvalayati jvaram||
6.39.122| śodhanaṃ śamanīyaṃ tu karoti viṣamajvaram|
cyavamānaṃ jvarotkliṣṭamupekṣeta malaṃ sadā||
6.39.123| atipravartamānaṃ ca sādhayedatisāravat|
yadā koṣṭhānugāḥ pakvā vibaddhāḥ srotasāṃ malāḥ||
6.39.124| acirajvaritasyāpi tadā dadyādvirecanam|
pakvo hyanirhṛto doṣo dehe tiṣṭhan mahātyayam||
6.39.125| viṣamaṃ vā jvaraṃ kuryādbalavyāpadameva ca|
tasmānnirharaṇaṃ kāryaṃ doṣāṇāṃ vamanādibhiḥ||
6.39.126| prakkarma vamanaṃ cāsya kāryamāsthāpanaṃ tathā|
virecanaṃ tathā kuryācchirasaśca virecanam||
6.39.127| kramaśaḥ baline deyaṃ vamanaṃ ślaiṣmike jvare|
pittaprāye virekastu kāryaḥ praśithilāśaye||
6.39.128| saruje 'nilaje kāryaṃ sodāvarte nirūhaṇam|
kaṭīpṛṣṭhagrahārtasya dīptāgneranuvāsanam||
6.39.129| śirogauravaśūlaghnamindriyapratibodhanam|
kaphābhipanne śirasi kāryaṃ mūrdhavirecanam||
6.39.130| durbalasya samādhmātamudaraṃ sarujaṃ dihet|
dāruhaimavatīkuṣṭhaśatāhvāhiṅgusaindhavaiḥ||
6.39.131| amlapiṣṭaiḥ sukhoṣṇaiśca pavane tūrdhvamāgate|
ruddhamūtrapurīṣāya gude vartiṃ nidhāpayet||
6.39.132| pippālīpippalīmūlayavānīcavyasādhitām|
pāyayeta yavāgūṃ vā mārutādyanulominīm||
6.39.133| śuddhasyobhayato yasya jvaraḥ śāntiṃ na gacchati|
saśeṣadoṣarūkṣasya tasya taṃ sarpiṣā jayet||
6.39.134| kṛśaṃ caivālpadoṣaṃ ca śamanīyairupācaret|
upavāsairbalasthaṃ tu jvare santarpaṇotthite||
6.39.135| klinnāṃ yavāgūṃ mandāgniṃ tṛṣārtaṃ pāyayennaram|
tṛṭchardidāhagharmārtaṃ madyapaṃ lājatarpaṇam||
6.39.136| sakṣaudramambhasā paścājjīrṇe yūṣarasaudanam|
upavāsaśramakṛte kṣīṇaṃ(kṣīṇe) vātādhike jvare||
6.39.137| dīptāgniṃ bhojayet prājño naraṃ māṃsarasaudanam|
mudgayūṣaudanaścāpi hitaḥ kaphasamutthite||
6.39.138| sa eva sitayā yuktaḥ śītaḥ pittajvare hitaḥ|
dāḍimāmalamudgānāṃ yūṣaścānilapaittike||
6.39.139| 1hrasvamūlakayūṣastu vātaśleṣmādhike hitaḥ|
paṭolanimbayūṣastu pathyaḥ pittakaphātmake||
6.39.140| dāhacchardiyutaṃ kṣāmaṃ nirannaṃ tṛṣṇayā 'rditam|
sitākṣaudrayutaṃ lājatarpaṇaṃ pāyayeta ca||
6.39.141| kaphapittaparītasya grīṣme 'sṛkpittinastathā|
madyanityasya na hitā yavāgūstamupācaret||
6.39.142| yūṣairamlairanamlairvā jāṅgalaiśca rasairhitaiḥ|
madyaṃ purāṇaṃ mandāgneryavānnopahitaṃ hitam||
6.39.143| savyoṣaṃ vitarettakraṃ kaphārocakapīḍite|
kṛśo 'lpadoṣo dīnaśca naro jīrṇajvarārditaḥ||
6.39.144| vibaddhaḥ sṛṣṭadoṣaśca rūkṣaḥ pittānilajvarī|
pipāsārtaḥ sadāho vā payasā sa sukhī bhavet||
6.39.145| 1tadeva taruṇe pītaṃ viṣavaddhanti mānavam|
sarvajvareṣu sulaghu mātrāvadbhojanaṃ hitam||
6.39.146| vegāpāye 'nyathā taddhi jvaravegābhivardhanam|
jvarito hitamaśnīyādyadyapyasyārucirbhavet||
6.39.147| annakāle hyabhuñjānaḥ kṣīyate mriyate 'thavā|
sa kṣīṇaḥ kṛcchratāṃ yāti yātyasādhyatvameva ca||
6.39.148| tasmādrakṣedbalaṃ puṃsāṃ bale sati hi jīvitam|
gurvabhiṣyandyakāle ca jvarī nādyāt kathañcana||
6.39.149| na tu tasyāhitaṃ bhuktamāyuṣe vā sukhāya vā|
saṃtataṃ viṣamaṃ vā 'pi kṣīṇasya sucirotthitam||
6.39.150| jvaraṃ saṃbhojanaiḥ pathyairlaghubhiḥ samupācaret|
mudgānmasūrāṃścaṇakān kulatthān samakuṣṭhakān||
6.39.151| āhārakāle yūṣārthaṃ jvaritāya pradāpayet|
paṭolapatraṃ vārtākaṃ kaṭhillaṃ pāpacailikam||
6.39.152| karkāṭakaṃ parpaṭakaṃ gojihvāṃ bālamūlakam|
patraṃ guḍūcyāḥ śākārthe jvaritānāṃ pradāpayet||
6.39.153| lāvān kapiñjalāneṇān pṛṣatāñcharabhāñchaśān|
kālapucchān kuraṅgāṃśca tathaiva mṛgamātṛkān||
6.39.154| māṃsārthe māṃsasātmyānāṃ 1jvaritānāṃ pradāpayet|
sārasakrauñcaśikhinaḥ kukkuṭāṃstittirāṃs(tittirīṃ)tathā||
6.39.155| gurūṣṇatvānna śaṃsanti jvare keciccikitsakāḥ|
jvaritānāṃ prakopaṃ tu yadā yāti samīraṇaḥ||
6.39.156| tadaite 'pi hi śasyante mātrākālopapāditāḥ|
pariṣekān pradehāṃśca snehān saṃśodhanāni ca||
6.39.157| (snānābhyaṅgadivāsvapnaśītavyāyāmayoṣitaḥ)|
kaṣāyagururūkṣāṇi krodhādīni tathaiva ca||
6.39.158| sāravanti ca bhojyāni varjayettaruṇajvarī|
tathaiva navadhānyādiṃ varjayecca samāsataḥ||
6.39.159| anavasthitadoṣāgnerebhiḥ sandhukṣito jvaraḥ|
gambhīratīkṣṇavegatvaṃ yātyamādhyatvameva ca||
6.39.160| śītatoyadivāsvapnakrodhavyāyāmayoṣitaḥ|
na seveta jvarotsṛṣṭo yāvanna balavān bhavet||
6.39.161| muktasyāpi jvareṇāśu durbalasyāhitairjvaraḥ|
pratyāpanno daheddehaṃ śuṣkaṃ vṛkṣamivānalaḥ||
6.39.162| tasmātkāryaḥ parīhāro jvaramuktairviriktavat|
yāvanna prakṛtisthaḥ syāddoṣataḥ prāṇatastathā||
6.39.163| jvare pramoho bhavati svalpairapyavaceṣṭitaiḥ|
niṣaṇṇaṃ bhojayettasmānmūtroccārau ca kārayet||
6.39.164| arocake gātrasāde vaivarṇye 'ṅgamalādiṣu|
śāntajvaro 'pi śodhyaḥ syādanubandhabhayānnaraḥ||
6.39.165| na jātu 1snāpayet prājñaḥ sahasā jvarakarśitam|
tena saṃdūṣito hyasya punareva bhavejjvaraḥ||
6.39.166| cikitsecca jvarān sarvānnimittānāṃ viparyayaiḥ|
śramakṣayābhighātotthe mūlavyādhimupācaret||
6.39.167| strīṇāmapaprajātānāṃ stanyāvataraṇe ca yaḥ|
tatra saṃśamanaṃ kuryādyathādoṣaṃ vidhānavit||
6.39.168| ataḥ saṃśamanīyāni kaṣāyāṇi nibodha me|
sarvajvareṣu deyāni yāni vaidyena jānatā||
6.39.169| pippalīsārivādrākṣāśatapuṣoāhareṇubhiḥ|
kṛtaḥ kaṣāyaḥ saguḍo hanyācchvasanajaṃ jvaram||
6.39.170| śṛtaṃ śītakaṣāyaṃ vā guḍūcyāḥ peyameva tu|
balādarbhaśvadaṃṣṭrāṇāṃ kaṣāyaṃ pādaśeṣitam||
6.39.171| śarkarāghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ pibedvātajvarāpaham|
śatapuṣpāvacākuṣṭhadevadāruhareṇukāḥ||
6.39.172| kustumburūṇi naladaṃ 1mustaṃ caivāpsu sādhayet|
kṣaudreṇa sitayā cāpi yuktaḥ kvātho 'nilādhike||
6.39.173| drākṣāguḍūcīkāśmaryatrāyamāṇāḥ sasārivāḥ|
niṣkvāthya saguḍaṃ kvāthaṃ pibedvātakṛte jvare||
6.39.174| guḍūcyāḥ svaraso grāhyaḥ śatāvaryāśca tatsamaḥ|
nihanyātsaguḍaḥ pītaḥ sadyo 'nilakṛtaṃ jvaram||
6.39.175| ghṛtābhyaṅgasvedalepānavasthāsu ca yojayet|
śrīparṇīcandanośīraparūṣakamadhūkajaḥ||
6.39.176| śarkarāmadhuro hanti kaṣāyaḥ paittikaṃ jvaram|
pītaṃ pittajvaraṃ hanyātsārivādyaṃ saśarkaram||
6.39.177| sayaṣṭīmadhukaṃ hanyāttathaivotpalapūrvakam|
śṛtaṃ śītakaṣāyaṃ vā sotpalaṃ śarkarāyutam||
6.39.178| guḍūcīpadmarodhrāṇāṃ sārivotpalayostathā|
śarkarāmadhuraḥ kvāthaḥ śītaḥ pittajvarāpahaḥ||
6.39.179| drākṣāragvadhayoścāpi kāśmaryasyāthavā punaḥ|
svādutiktakaṣāyāṇāṃ kaṣāyaiḥ śarkarāyutaiḥ||
6.39.180| suśītaiḥ śamayettṛṣṇāṃ pravṛddhāṃ dāhameva ca|
śītaṃ madhuyutaṃ toyamākaṇṭhādvā pipāsitam||
6.39.181| vāmayetpāyayitvā tu tena tṛṣṇā praśāmyati|
kṣīraiḥ kṣīrikaṣāyaiśca suśītaiścandanāyutaiḥ||
6.39.182| antardāhe vidhātavyamebhiścānyaiśca śītalaiḥ|
padmakaṃ madhukaṃ drākṣāṃ puṇḍarīkamathotpalam||
6.39.183| yavān bhṛṣṭānuśīrāṇi samaṅgāṃ kaśmarīphalam|
nidadhyādapsu cāloḍya niśāparyuṣitaṃ tataḥ||
6.39.184| kṣaudreṇa yuktaṃ pibato jvaradāhau praśāmyataḥ|
jihvātālugalaklomaśoṣe mūrdhni ca dāpayet||
6.39.185| keśaraṃ mātuluṅgasya madhusaindhavasaṃyutam|
śarkarādāḍimābhyāṃ vā drākṣākharjūrayostathā||
6.39.186| vairasye dhārayetkalkaṃ gaṇḍūṣaṃ ca tathā hitam|
saptacchadaṃ guḍūcīṃ ca nimbaṃ sphūrjakameva ca||
6.39.187| kvāthayitvā pibet kvāthaṃ sakṣaudraṃ kaphaje jvare|
kaṭutrikaṃ nāgapuṣpaṃ haridrā kaṭurohiṇī||
6.39.188| kauṭajaṃ ca phalaṃ hanyāt sevyamānaṃ kaphajvaram|
haridrāṃ ciatrakaṃ nimbamuśīrātiviṣe vacām||
6.39.189| kuṣṭhamindrayavān mūrvāṃ paṭolaṃ cāpi sādhitam|
pibenmaricasaṃyuktaṃ sakṣaudraṃ kaphaje jvare||
6.39.190| sārivātiviṣākuṣṭhapurākhyaiḥ sadurālabhaiḥ|
mustena ca kṛtaḥ kvāthaḥ pīto hanyāt kaphajvaram||
6.39.191| mustaṃ vṛkṣakabījāni triphalā kaṭurohiṇī|
parūṣakāṇi ca kvāthaḥ kaphajvaravināśanaḥ||
6.39.192| rājavṛkṣādivargasya kaṣāyo madhusaṃyutaḥ|
kaphavātajvaraṃ hanyācchīghraṃ kāle 'vacāritaḥ||
6.39.193| nāgaraṃ dhānyakaṃ bhārgīmabhayāṃ suradāru ca|
vacāṃ parpaṭakaṃ mustaṃ bhūtīkamatha kaṭphalam||
6.39.194| niṣkvāthya kaphavātotthe kṣaudrahiṅgusamanvitam|
dātavyaṃ(apātavyaṃ) śvāsakāsaghnaṃ śleṣmotseke galagrahe||
6.39.195| hikkāsu kaṇṭhaśvayathau śūle hṛdayapārśvaje|
balāpaṭolatriphalāyaṣṭyāhvānāṃ vṛṣasya ca||
6.39.196| kvātho madhuyutaḥ pīto hanti pittakaphajvaram|
kaṭukāvijayādrākṣāmustaparpaṭakaiḥ kṛtaḥ||
6.39.197| kaṣāyo nāśayet pītaḥ śleṣmapittabhavaṃ jvaram|
bhārgīvacāparpaṭakadhānyahiṅgvabhayāghanaiḥ||
6.39.198| kāśmaryanāgaraiḥ kvāthaḥ sakṣaudraḥ śleṣmapittaje|
saśarkarāmakṣamātrāṃ kaṭukāmuṣṇavāriṇā||
6.39.199| pītvā jvaraṃ jayejjantuḥ kaphapittasamudbhavam|
kirātatiktamamṛtāṃ drākṣāmāmalakaṃ śaṭīm||
6.39.200| niṣkvāthya vātapittotthe taṃ kvāthaṃ saguḍaṃ pibet|
rāsnā vṛṣo 'tha triphalā rājavṛkṣaphalaiḥ saha||
6.39.201| kaṣāyaḥ sādhitaḥ pīto vātapittajvaraṃ jayet|
sarvadoṣasamutthe tu saṃsṛṣṭānavacārayet||
6.39.202| yathādoṣocchrayaṃ cāpi jvarān sarvānupācaret|
vṛścīvabilvavarṣābhvaḥ payaścodakameva ca||
6.39.203| pacet kṣīrāvaśiṣṭaṃ tu taddhi sarvajvarāpaham|
udakāṃśāstrayaḥ kṣīraṃ 1śiṃśapāsārasaṃyutam||
6.39.204| tat kṣīraśeṣaṃ kvathitaṃ peyaṃ sarvajvarāpaham|
nalavetasayormūle mūrvāyāṃ devadāruṇi||
6.39.205| kaṣāyaṃ vidhivat kṛtvā peyametajjvarāpaham|
haridrā bhadramustaṃ ca triphalā kaṭurohiṇī||
6.39.206| picumandaḥ paṭolī ca devadāru nidigdhikā|
eṣāṃ kaṣāyaḥ pītastu sannipātajvaraṃ jayet||
6.39.207| avipaktiṃ prasekaṃ ca śophaṃ kāsamarocakam|
traiphalo vā sasarpiṣkaḥ kvāthaḥ peyastridoṣaje||
6.39.208| anantāṃ bālakaṃ mustāṃ nāgaraṃ kaṭurohiṇīm|
sukhāmbunā prāgudayātpāyayetākṣasaṃmitam||
6.39.209| eṣa sarvajvarān hanti dīpayatyāśu cānalam|
dravyāṇi dīpanīyāni tathā vairecanāni ca||
6.39.210| ekaśo vā dviśo vā 'pi jvaraghnāni prayojayet|
sarpirmadhvabhayātailaleho 'yaṃ sarvajaṃ jvaram||
6.39.211| śāntiṃ nayettrivṛccāpi sakṣaudrā prabalaṃ jvaram|
jvare tu viṣame kāryamūrdhvaṃ cādhaśca śodhanam||
6.39.212| ghṛtaṃ plīhodaroktaṃ vā nihanyādviṣamajvaram|
guḍapragāḍhāṃ triphalāṃ pibedvā viṣamārditaḥ||
6.39.213| guḍūcīnimbadhātrīṇāṃ kaṣāyaṃ vā samākṣikam|
prātaḥ prātaḥ sasarpiṣkaṃ rasonamupayojayet||
6.39.214| tricaturbhiḥ pibet kvāthaṃ pañcabhirvā 1samanvitaiḥ|
madhukasya paṭolasya rohiṇyā mustakasya ca||
6.39.215| harītakyāśca sarvo 'yaṃ trividho yoga iṣyate1|
sarpiḥkṣīrasitākṣaudramāgadhīrvā yathābalam||
6.39.216| daśamūlīkaṣāyeṇa māgadhīrvā prayojayet|
pippalīvardhamānaṃ vā pibet kṣīrarasāśanaḥ||
6.39.217| tāmracūḍasya māṃsena pibedvā madyamuttamam|
kolāgnimanthatriphalākvāthe dadhnā ghṛtaṃ pacet||
6.39.218| tilvakāvāpametaddhi viṣamajvaranāśanam|
pippalyativiṣādrākṣārārivābilvacandanaiḥ||
6.39.219| kaṭukendrayavośīrasiṃhītāmalakīghanaiḥ|
trāyamāṇāsthirādhātrīviśvabheṣajacitrakaiḥ||
6.39.220| pakvametairghṛtaṃ pītaṃ vijitya visamāgnitām|
jīrṇajvaraśiraḥśūlagulmodarahalīmakān||
6.39.221| kṣayakāsaṃ sasaṃtāpaṃ pārśvaśūlānapāsyati|
guḍūcītriphalāvāsātrāyamāṇāyavāsakaiḥ||
6.39.222| kvathitairvidhivatpakvametaiḥ kalkīkṛtaiḥ samaiḥ|
drākṣāmāgadhikāmbhodanāgarotpalacandanaiḥ||
6.39.223| pītaṃ sarpiḥ kṣayaśvāsakāsajīrṇajvarān jayet|
kalaśībṛhatīdrākṣātrāyantīnimbagokṣuraiḥ||
6.39.224| balāparpaṭakāmbhodaśālaparṇīyavāsakaiḥ|
pakvamutkvathitaiḥ sarpiḥ kalkairebhiḥ samanvitam||
6.39.225| śaṭītāmalakībhārgīmedāmalakapauṣkaraiḥ|
kṣīradviguṇasaṃyuktaṃ jīrṇajvaramapohati||
6.39.226| śiraḥpārśvarujākāsakṣayapraśamanaṃ param|
paṭolīparpaṭāriṣṭaguḍūcītriphalāvṛṣaiḥ||
6.39.227| kaṭukāmbudabhūnimbayāsayaṣṭyāhvacandanaiḥ|
dārvīśakrayavośīratrāyamāṇākaṇotpalaiḥ||
