6.40.22| śarīriṇāmatīsāraḥ saṃbhūto yena kenacit|
doṣāṇāmeva liṅgāni kadācinnātivartate||
6.40.23| snehājīrṇanimittastu bahuśūlapravāhikaḥ|
visūcikānimittastu cānyo 'jīrṇanimittajaḥ|
viṣārśaḥkṛmisaṃmūto yathāsvaṃ doṣalakṣaṇaḥ||
6.40.24| āmapakvakramaṃ hitvā nātisāre kriyā yataḥ|
ataḥ sarve 'tisārāstu jñeyāḥ pakvāmalakṣaṇaiḥ||
6.40.25| 1tatrādau laṅghanaṃ kāryamatisāreṣu dehinām|
tataḥ pācanasaṃyukto yavāgvādikramo hitaḥ||
6.40.26| athavā vāmayitvā++āme śūlādhmānanipīḍitam|
pippalīsaindhavāmbhobhirlaṅghanādyairupācaret||
6.40.27| kāryaṃ ca vamanasyānte pradravaṃ laghubhojanam|
khaḍayūṣayavāgūṣu pippalyādyaṃ ca yojayet||
6.40.28| anena vidhinā cāmaṃ yasya vai nopaśāmyati|
haridrādiṃ vacādiṃ vā pibet prātaḥ sa mānavaḥ||
6.40.29| āmātīsāriṇāṃ kāryaṃ nādau saṃgrahaṇaṃ nṛṇām|
teṣāṃ doṣā vibaddhāḥ prāgjanayantyāmayānimān||
6.40.30| plīhapāṇḍvāmayānāhamehakuṣṭhodarajvarān|
śophagulmagrahaṇyarśaḥśūlālasakahṛdgrahān||
6.40.31| saśūlaṃ bahuśaḥ kṛcchrādvibaddhaṃ yo 'tisāryate|
doṣān sannicitān tasya pathyābhiḥ saṃpravartayet||
6.40.32| yo 'tidravaṃ prabhūtaṃ ca purīṣamatisāryate|
tasyādau vamanaṃ kuryāt paścāllaṅghanapācanam||
6.40.33| stokaṃ stokaṃ vibaddhaṃ vā saśūlaṃ yo 'tisāryate|
abhayāpippalīkalkaiḥ sukhoṣṇaistaṃ virecayet||
6.40.34| āme ca laṅghanaṃ śastamādau pācanameva vā|
yogāścātra pravakṣyante tvāmātīsāranāśanāḥ||
6.40.35| kaliṅgātiviṣāhiṅgusauvarcalavacābhayāḥ|
devadāruvacāmustānāgarātiviṣābhayāḥ||
6.40.36| abhayā dhānyakaṃ mustaṃ pippalī nāgaraṃ vacā|
nāgaraṃ dhānyakaṃ mustaṃ vālakaṃ bilvameva ca||
6.40.37| mustaṃ parpaṭakaṃ śuṇṭhī vacā prativiṣā 'bhayā|
abhayā 'tiviṣā hiṅgu vacā sauvarcalaṃ tathā||
6.40.38| citrakaḥ pippalīmūlaṃ vacā kaṭukarohiṇī|
pāṭhā vatsakabījāni harītakyo mahauṣadham||
6.40.39| mūrvā nirdahanī pāṭhā tryūṣaṇaṃ gajapippalī|
siddhārthakā bhadradāru śatāhvā kaṭurohiṇī||
6.40.40| elā sāvarakaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ haridre kauṭajā yavāḥ|
meṣaśṛṅgī tvagele ca kṛmighnaṃ vṛkṣakāṇi ca||
6.40.41| vṛkṣādanī vīratarurbṛhatyau dve sahe tathā|
aralutvak taindukī ca dāḍimī kauṭajī śamī||
6.40.42| pāṭhā tejovatī mustaṃ pippalī kauṭajaṃ phalam|
paṭolaṃ(paṭolī) dīpyako bilvaṃ haridre devadāru ca||
6.40.43| viḍaṅgamabhayā pāṭhā śṛṅgaveraṃ ghanaṃ vacā|
vacā vatsakabījāni saindhavaṃ kaṭurohiṇī||
6.40.44| hiṅgurvatsakabījāni vacā bilvaśalāṭu ca|
nāgarātiviṣe mustaṃ pippalyo vātsakaṃ phalam||
6.40.45| mahauṣadhaṃ prativiṣā mustaṃ cetyāmapācanāḥ|
prayojyā viṃśatiryogāḥ ślokārdhavihitāstvime||
6.40.46| dhānyāmloṣṇāmbumadyānāṃ pibedanyatamena vā|
niṣkvāthān vā pibedeṣāṃ sukhoṣṇān sādhu sādhitān||
6.40.47| payasyutkvāthya mustānāṃ viṃśatiṃ triguṇāmbhasi|
kṣīrāvaśiṣṭaṃ tatpītaṃ hantyāmaṃ śūlameva ca||
6.40.48| nikhilenopadiṣṭo 'yaṃ vidhirāmopaśāntaye|
harītakīmativiṣāṃ hiṅgu sauvarcalaṃ vacām||
6.40.49| pibet sukhāmbunā janturāmātisārapīḍitaḥ|
paṭolaṃ dīpyakaṃ bilvaṃ vacāpippalināgaram||
6.40.50| mustaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ viḍaṅgaṃ ca pibedvā 'pi sukhāmbunā|
śṛṅgaveraṃ guḍūcīṃ ca pibeduṣṇena vāriṇā||
6.40.51| lavaṇānyatha pippalyo viḍaṅgāni harītakī|
citrakaṃ śiṃśapā pāṭhā śārṅgeṣṭā lavaṇāni ca||
6.40.52| hiṅgurvṛkṣakabījāni lavaṇāni ca bhāgaśaḥ|
hastidantyatha pippalyaḥ kalkāvakṣasamau smṛtau||
6.40.53| vacā guḍūcīkāṇḍāni yogo 'yaṃ paramo mataḥ|
ete sukhāmbunā yogā deyāḥ paśca satāṃ matāḥ||
6.40.54| nivṛtteṣvāmaśūleṣu yasya na praguṇo 'nilaḥ|
stokaṃ stokaṃ rujāmacca saśūlaṃ yo 'tisāryate||
6.40.55| sakṣāralavaṇairyuktaṃ mandāgniḥ sa pibedghṛtam|
kṣīranāgaracāṅgarīkoladadhyamlasādhitam||
6.40.56| sarpiracchaṃ pibedvāpi śūlātīsāraśāntaye|
dadhnā tailaghṛtaṃ pakvaṃ savyoṣājāticitrakaiḥ||
6.40.57| sabilvapippalīmūladāḍimairvā ruganvitaiḥ|
nikhilo vidhirukto 'yaṃ vātaśleṣmopaśāntaye||
6.40.58| tīkṣṇoṣṇavarjyamenaṃ tu vidadhyātpittaje bhiṣak|
yathoktamupavāsānte yavāgūśca praśasyate||
6.40.59| balayoraṃśumatyāṃ ca śvadaṃṣṭrabṛhatīṣu ca|
śatāvaryāṃ ca saṃsiddhāḥ suśītā madhusaṃyutāḥ||
6.40.60| mudgādiṣu ca yūṣāḥ syurdravyairetaiḥ susaṃskṛtāḥ|
mṛdubhirdīpanaistiktairdravyaiḥ syādāmapācanam||
6.40.61| haridrātiviṣāpāṭhāvatsabījarasāñjanam|
rasāñjanaṃ haridre dve bījāni kuṭajasya ca||
6.40.62| pāṭhā guḍūcī bhūnimbastathaiva kaṭurohiṇī|
etaiḥ ślokārdhanirdiṣṭaiḥ kvāthāḥ syuḥ pittapācanāḥ||
6.40.63| mustaṃ kuṭajabījāni bhūnimbaṃ sarasāñjanam|
dārvī durālabhā bilvaṃ vālakaṃ raktacandanam||
6.40.64| candanaṃ vālakaṃ mustaṃ bhūnimbaṃ sadurālabham|
mṛṇālaṃ candanaṃ rodhraṃ nāgaraṃ nīlamutpalam||
6.40.65| pāṭhā mustaṃ haridre dve pippalī kauṭajaṃ phalam|
phalatvacaṃ vatsakasya śṛṅgaveraṃ 1ghanaṃ vacā||
6.40.66| ṣaḍete 'bhihitā yogāḥ pittātīsāranāśanāḥ|
bilvaśakrayavāmbhodabālakātiviṣākṛtaḥ|
kaṣāyo hantyatīsāraṃ sāmaṃ pittasamudbhavam||
6.40.67| madhukotpalabilvābdahrīberośīranāgaraiḥ|
kṛtaḥ kvātho madhuyutaḥ pittātīsāranāśanaḥ||
6.40.68| yadā pakvo 'pyatīsāraḥ sarasyeva muhurmuhuḥ|
grahaṇyā mārdavājjantostatra saṃstambhanaṃ hitam||
6.40.69| samaṅgā dhātakīpuṣpaṃ mañjiṣṭhā lodhramustakam|
śālmalīveṣṭako rodhraṃ vṛkṣadāḍimayostvacau||
6.40.70| āmrāsthimadhyaṃ lodhraṃ ca bilvamadhyaṃ priyaṅgavaḥ|
madhukaṃ śṛṅgaveraṃ ca dīrghavṛntatvageva ca||
6.40.71| catvāra ete yogāḥ syuḥ pakvātīsāranāśanāḥ|
uktā ya upayojyāste sakṣaudrāstaṇḍulāmbunā||
6.40.72| maustaṃ kaṣāyamekaṃ vā peyaṃ madhusamāyutam|
lodhrāmbaṣṭhāpriyaṅgvādīn gaṇānevaṃ prayojayet||
6.40.73| padmāṃ samaṅgāṃ madhukaṃ bilvajambūśalāṭu ca|
pibettaṇḍulatoyena sakṣaudramagadaṅkaram||
6.40.74| kacchurāmūlakalkaṃ vā 'pyudumbaraphalopamam|
payasyā candanaṃ padmā sitāmustābjakeśaram||
6.40.75| pakvātisāraṃ yogo 'yaṃ jayetpītaḥ saśoṇitam|
nirāmarūpaṃ śūlārtaṃ laṅghanādyaiśca karṣitam||
6.40.76| naraṃ rūkṣamavekṣyāgniṃ sakṣāraṃ pāyayedghṛtam|
balābṛhatyaṃśumatīkacchurāmūlasādhitam||
6.40.77| madhūkṣitaṃ samadhukaṃ pibecchūlairabhidrutaḥ|
dārvībilvakaṇādrākṣākaṭukendrayavairghṛtam||
6.40.78| sādhitaṃ hantyatīsāraṃ vātapittakaphātmakam|
dadhnā cāmlena saṃpakvaṃ savyoṣājājicitrakam||
6.40.79| sacavyapippalīmūlaṃ dāḍimairvā rugarditaḥ|
payo ghṛtaṃ ca madhu ca pibecchūlairabhidrutaḥ||
6.40.80| sitājamodakaṭvaṅgamadhukairavacūrṇitam|
avedanaṃ susaṃpakvaṃ dīptāgneḥ sucirotthitam||
6.40.81| nānāvarṇamatīsāraṃ puṭapākairupācaret|
tvakpiṇḍaṃ dīrghavṛntasya padmakesarasaṃyutam||
6.40.82| kāśmarīpadmapatraiścāveṣṭya sūtreṇa saṃdṛḍham|
mṛdā 'valiptaṃ sukṛtamaṅgāreṣvavakūlayet||
6.40.83| svinnamuddhṛtya niṣpīḍya rasamādāya taṃ tataḥ|
śītaṃ madhuyutaṃ kṛtvā pāyayetodarāmaye||
6.40.84| jīvantīmeṣaśṛṅgyādiṣvevaṃ dravyeṣu sādhayet|
tittiriṃ luñcitaṃ samyak niṣkṛṣṭāntraṃ tu pūrayet||
6.40.85| nyagrodhāditvacāṃ kalkaiḥ pūrvavaccāvakūlayet|
rasamādāya tasyātha susvinnasya samākṣikam||
6.40.86| śarkaropahitaṃ śītaṃ pāyayetodarāmaye|
lodhracandanayaṣṭyāhvadārvīpāṭhāsitotpalān||
6.40.87| taṇḍulodakasṃpiṣṭān dīrghavṛntatvaganvitān|
pūrvavat kūlitāttasmādrasamādāya śītalam||
6.40.88| madhvāktaṃ pāyayeccaitat kaphapittodarāmaye|
evaṃ prarohaiḥ kurvīta vaṭādīnaṃ vidhānavat||
6.40.89| puṭapākān yathāyogaṃ jāṅgalopahitān śubhān|
bahuśleṣma saraktaṃ ca mandavātaṃ cirotthitam||
6.40.90| kauṭajaṃ phāṇitaṃ vā 'pi hantyatīsāramojasā|
ambaṣṭhādimadhuyutaṃ pippalyādisamanvitam||
6.40.91| pṛśniparṇībalābilvavālakotpaladhānyakaiḥ|
sanāgaraiḥ pibet peyāṃ sādhitāmudarāmayī||
6.40.92| aralutvak priyaṅguṃ ca madhukaṃ dāḍimāṅkurān|
āvāpya piṣṭvā dadhani yavāgūṃ sādhayeddravām||
6.40.93| eṣā sarvānatīsārān hanti pakvānasaṃśayam|
rasāñjanaṃ sātiviṣaṃ tvagbījaṃ kauṭajaṃ tathā||
6.40.94| dhātakī nāgaraṃ caiva pāyayettaṇḍulāmbunā|
saśūlaṃ raktajaṃ ghnanti ete madhusamāyutāḥ||
6.40.95| madhukaṃ bilvapeśī ca śarkarāmadhusaṃyutā|
atīsāraṃ nihanyuśca śāliṣaṣṭikayoḥ kaṇāḥ||
6.40.96| tadvallīḍhaṃ madhuyutaṃ badarīmūlameva tu|
badaryarjunajambvāmraśallakīvetasatvacaḥ||
6.40.97| śarkarākṣaudrasaṃyuktāḥ pītā ghnantyudarāmayam|
etaireva yavāgūṃśca ṣaḍān yūṣāṃśca kārayet||
6.40.98| pānīyāni ca tṛṣṇāsu dravyeṣveteṣu buddhimān|
kṛtaṃ śālmalivṛnteṣu kaṣāyaṃ himasaṃjñitam||
6.40.99| niśāparyuṣitaṃ peyaṃ sakṣaudraṃ madhukānvitam|
vibaddhavātaviṭ śūlaparītaḥ sapravāhikaḥ||
6.40.100| saraktapittaśca payaḥ pibettṛṣṇāsamanvitaḥ|
yathā 'mṛtaṃ yathā kṣīramatīsāreṣu pūjitam||
6.40.101| cirotthiteṣu tat peyamapāṃ bhāgaistribhiḥ śṛtam|
doṣaśeṣaṃ harettaddhi tasmātpathyatamaṃ smṛtam||
6.40.102| hitaḥ snehavireko vā bastayaḥ picchilāśca ye|
picchilasvarase siddhaṃ hitaṃ ca ghṛtamucyate||
6.40.103| śakṛtā yastu saṃsṛṣṭamatisāryeta śoṇitam|
prāk paścādvā purīṣasya saruk saparikartikaḥ||
6.40.104| kṣīriśuṅgāśṛtaṃ sarpiḥ pibet sakṣaudraśarkaram|
dārvītvakpippalīśuṇṭhīlākṣāśakrayavairghṛtam||
6.40.105| saṃyuktaṃ bhadrarohiṇyā pakvaṃ peyādimiśritam|
tridoṣamapyatīsāraṃ pītaṃ hanti sudāruṇam||
6.40.106| gaurave vamanaṃ pathyaṃ yasya syāt prabalaḥ kaphaḥ|
jvare dāhe saviṅbandhe mārutādraktapittavat||
6.40.107| saṃpakve bahudoṣe ca vibandhe mūtraśodhanaiḥ|
kāryamāsthāpanaṃ kṣipraṃ 1tathā caivānuvāsanam||
6.40.108| 1pravāhaṇe gudabhraṃśe mūtrāghāte kaṭigrahe|
madhurāmlaiḥ śṛtaṃ tailaṃ sarpirvā 'pyanuvāsanam||
6.40.109| gudapākastu pittena yasya syādahitāśinaḥ|
tasya pittaharāḥ sekāstatsiddhāścānuvāsanāḥ||
6.40.110| dadhimaṇḍasurābilvasiddhaṃ tailaṃ samārute|
bhojane ca hitaṃ kṣīraṃ kacchurāmūlasādhitam||
6.40.111| alpālpaṃ bahuśo raktaṃ sarugya upaveśyate|
yadā vāyurvibaddhaśca picchābastistadā hitaḥ||
6.40.112| prāyeṇa gudadaurbalyaṃ dīrghakālātisāriṇām|
bhavettasmāddhitaṃ teṣāṃ gude tailāvacāraṇam||
6.40.113| kapitthaśālmalīphañjīvaṭakārpāsadāḍimāḥ|
yūthikā kacchurā śeluḥ śaṇaścuccūśca dādhikāḥ||
6.40.114| śālaparṇī pṛśniparṇī bṛhatī kaṇṭakārikā|
balāśvadaṃṣṭrābilvāni pāṭhānāgaradhānyakam||
6.40.115| eṣa āhārasaṃyoge hitaḥ sarvātisāriṇām|
tilakalko hitaścātra maudgo mudgarasastathā||
6.40.116| pittātisārī yo martyaḥ pittalānyatiṣevate|
pittaṃ praduṣṭaṃ tasyāśu raktātīsārabhāvahet||
6.40.117| jvaraṃ śūlaṃ tṛṣāṃ dāhaṃ gudapākaṃ ca dāruṇam|
yo raktaṃ śakṛtaḥ pūrvaṃ paścādvā pratisāryate||
6.40.118| sa pallavairvaṭādīnaṃ sasarpiḥ sādhitaṃ payaḥ|
pibet saśarkarākṣaudramathavā 'pyabhimathya tat||
6.40.119| navanītamatho lihyāttakraṃ cānupibettataḥ|
priyālaśālmalīplakṣaśallakītiniśatvacaḥ||
6.40.120| kṣīre vimṛditāḥ pītāḥ sakṣaudrā raktanāśanāḥ|
madhukaṃ śarkarāṃ lodhraṃ payasyāmatha sārivām||
6.40.121| pibecchāgena payasā sakṣaudraṃ raktanāśanam|
mañjiṣṭhāṃ sārivāṃ lodhraṃ padmakaṃ kumudotpalam||
6.40.122| pibet padmāṃ ca dugdhena chāgenāsṛkpraśāntaye|
śarkarotpalalodhrāṇi samaṅgā madhukaṃ tilāḥ||
6.40.123| tilāḥ kṛṣṇāḥ sayaṣṭyāhvāḥ samaṅgā cotpalāni ca|
tilā mocaraso lodhraṃ tathaiva madhukotpalam||
6.40.124| kacchurā tilakalkaśca yogāścatvāra eva ca|
ājena payasā peyāḥ sarakte madhusaṃyutāḥ||
6.40.125| drave sarakte sravati bālabilvaṃ saphāṇitam|
sakṣaudratailaṃ prāgeva lihyādāśu hitaṃ hi tat||
6.40.126| kośakāraṃ ghṛte bhṛṣṭaṃ lājacūrṇaṃ sitā madhu|
saśūlaṃ raktapittotthaṃ līḍhaṃ hantyudarāmayam||
6.40.127| bilvamadhyaṃ samadhukaṃ śarkarākṣaudrasaṃyutam|
taṇḍulāmbuyuto yogaḥ pittaraktotthitaṃ jayet||
6.40.128| yogān sāṃgrāhikāṃścānyān pibetsakṣaudraśarkarān|
nyagrodhādiṣu kuryācca puṭapākān yatheritān||
6.40.129| gudāpāke ca ye uktāste 'trāpi vidhayaḥ smṛtāḥ|
rujāyāṃ cāpraśāmyantyāṃ picchāvastirhito bhavet||
6.40.130| saktaviḍ doṣabahulaṃ dīptāgniryo 'tisāryate|
viḍaṅgatriphalākṛṣṇākaṣāyaistaṃ virecayet||
6.40.131| athavairaṇḍasiddhena payasā kevalena vā|
yavāgūrvitareccāsya vātaghnairdīpanaiḥ kṛtāḥ||
6.40.132| dīptāgnirniṣpurīṣo yaḥ sāryate phenilaṃ śakṛt|
sa pibet phāṇitaṃ śuṇṭhīdadhitailapayoghṛtam||
6.40.133| svinnāni guḍatailābhyāṃ bhakṣayedbadarāṇi ca|
svinnāni piṣṭavadvā 'pi samaṃ bilvaśalāṭubhiḥ||
6.40.134| dadhnopayujya kulmāṣān śvetāmanupibet surām|
śaśamāṃsaṃ sarudhiraṃ samaṅgāṃ saghṛtaṃ dadhi||
6.40.135| khādedvipācya seveta mṛdvannaṃ śakṛtaḥ kṣaye|
saṃskṛto yamake māṣayavakolarasaḥ śubhaḥ||
6.40.136| bhojanārthaṃ pradātavyo dadhidāḍimasādhitaḥ|
viḍaṃ bilvaśalāṭūni nāgaraṃ cāmlapeṣitam||
6.40.137| dadhnaḥ saraśca yamake bhṛṣṭo varcaḥkṣaye hitaḥ|
saśūlaṃ kṣīṇavarcā yo dīptāgniratisāryate|
sa pibeddīpanairyuktaṃ sarpiḥ saṃgrāhakaiḥ saha||
6.40.138| vāyuḥ pravṛddho nicitaṃ balāsaṃ nudatyadhastādahitāśanasya|
pravāhamāṇasya muhurmalāktaṃ pravāhikāṃ tāṃ pravadanti tajjñāḥ||
6.40.139| pravāhikā vātakṛtā saśūlā pittāt sadāhā sakaphā kaphācca|
saśoṇitā śoṇitasaṃbhavā tu tāḥ sneharūkṣaprabhavā matāstu||
6.40.140| tāsāmatīsāravadādiśecca liṅgaṃ kramaṃ cāmavipakvatāṃ ca|
na śāntimāyāti vilaṅghanairyā yogairudīrṇā yadi pācanairvā||
6.40.141| tāṃ kṣīramevāśu śṛtaṃ nihanti tailaṃ tilāḥ picchilabastayaśca|
ārdraiḥ kuśaiḥ saṃpariveṣṭitāni vṛntānyathārdrāṇi hi śālmalīnām||
6.40.142| pkvāni samyak puṭapākayogenāpothya tebhyo rasamādadīta|
kṣīraṃ śṛtaṃ tailahavirvimiśraṃ kalkena yaṣṭīmadhukasya vā 'pi||
6.40.143| bastiṃ vidadhyādbhiṣagapramattaḥ pravāhikāmūtrapurīṣasaṅge|
dvipañjcamūlīkvathitena śūle pravāhamāṇasya samākṣikeṇa||
6.40.144| kṣīreṇa cāsthāpanamagryamuktaṃ tailena yuñjyādanuvāsanaṃ ca|
vātaghnavarge lavaṇeṣu caiva tailaṃ ca siddhaṃ hitamannapāne||
6.40.145| lodhraṃ viḍaṃ bilvaśalāṭu caiva lihyācca tailena kaṭutrikāḍhyam|
dadhnā sasāreṇa samākṣikeṇa bhuñjīta niścāraka(niḥsāraka))pīḍitastu||
6.40.146| sutaptakupyakvathitena vā 'pi kṣīreṇa śītena madhuplutena|
śūlārdito vyoṣavidārigandhāsiddhena dugdhena hitāya bhojyaḥ||
6.40.147| vātaghnasaṃgrāhikadīpanīyaiḥ kṛtān 1ṣaḍāṃścāpyupabhojayecca|
khādecca matsyān rasamāpnuyācca vātaghnasiddhaṃ saghṛtaṃ satailam||
6.40.148| eṇāvyajānāṃ tu vaṭapravālaiḥ siddhāni sārdhaṃ piśitāni khādet|
medhyasya(medyasya) siddhaṃ tvatha vā 'pi raktaṃ bastasya dadhnā ghṛtatailayuktam||
6.40.149| khādet pradehaiḥ śikhilāvajairvā bhuñjīta yūṣairdadhibhiśca mukhyaiḥ|
māṣān susiddhān ghṛtamaṇḍayuktān khādecca dadhnā maricopadaṃśān||
6.40.150| mahāruje mūtrakṛcchre bhiṣag bastiṃ pradāpayet|
payomadhughṛtonmiśraṃ madhukotpalasādhitam||
6.40.151| sa bastiḥ śamayettasya raktaṃ dāhamatho jvaram|
madhurauṣadhasiddhaṃ ca hitaṃ tasyānuvāsanam||
6.40.152| rātrāvahani vā nityaṃ rujārto yo bhavennaraḥ|
yathā yathā satailaḥ syādvātaśāntistathā tathā||
6.40.153| praśānte mārute cāpi śāntiṃ yāti pravāhikā|
tasmāt pravāhikāroge mārutaṃ śamayedbhiṣak||
6.40.154| pāṭhājamodākuṭajotpalaṃ1 ca śuṇṭhī samā māgadhikāśca piṣṭāḥ|
sukhāmbupītāḥ śamayanti rogaṃ medhyāṇḍasiddhaṃ saghṛtaṃ payo vā||
6.40.155| śuṇṭhīṃ ghṛtaṃ sakṣavakaṃ satailaṃ vipācya līḍhvā++āmayamāśu hanyāt|
gajāśanākumbhikadāḍimānāṃ rasaiḥ kṛtā tailaghṛte sadadhni||
6.40.156| bilvānvitā pathyatamā yavāgūrdhāroṣṇadugdhasya tathā ca pānam|
laghūni pathyānyatha dīpanāni snigdhāni bhojyānyudarāmayeṣu||
6.40.157| hitāya nityaṃ vitaredvibhajya yogāṃśca tāṃstān bhiṣagapramattaḥ||
6.40.158| tṛṣṇāpanayanī laghvī dīpanī bastiśodhanī|
jvare caivātisāre ca yavāgūḥ sarvadā hitā||
6.40.159| rūkṣājjāte kriyā snigdhā rūkṣā snehanimittaje|
bhayaje sāntvanāpūrvā śokaje śokanāśinī||
6.40.160| viṣārśaḥkṛmisaṃbhūte hitā cobhayaśarmadā|
chardimūrcchātṛḍādyāṃśca sādhayedavirodhataḥ||
6.40.161| samavāye tu doṣāṇāṃ pūrvaṃ pittamupācaret|
jvare caivātisāre ca sarvatrānyatra mārutam||
6.40.162| yasyoccāraṃ vinā mūtraṃ samyagvāyuśca gacchati|
dīptāgnerlaghukoṣṭhasya sthitastasyodarāmayaḥ||
6.40.163| karmajā vyādhayaḥ keciddoṣajāḥ santi cāpare|
karmadoṣodbhavāścānye karmajāsteṣvahetukāḥ||
6.40.164| naśyanti tvakriyābhiste kriyābhiḥ karmasaṃkṣaye|
śāmyanti doṣasaṃbhūtā doṣasaṃkṣayahetubhiḥ||
6.40.165| teṣāmalpanidānā ye pratikaṣṭā bhavanti ca|
mṛdavo bahudoṣā vā karmadoṣodbhavāstu te||
6.40.166| karmadoṣakṣayakṛtā teṣāṃ siddhirvidhīyate|
duṣyati grahaṇī jantoragnisādanahetubhiḥ||
6.40.167| atisāre nivṛtte 'pi mandāgnerahitāśinaḥ|
bhūyaḥ saṃdūṣito vahnirgrahaṇīmabhidūṣayet||
6.40.168| tasmātkāryaḥ parīhārastvatīsāre viriktavat|
yāvanna prakṛtisthaḥ syāddoṣataḥ prāṇatastathā||
6.40.169| ṣaṣṭhī pittadharā nāma yā kalā parikīrtitā|
pakvāmāśayamadhyasthā grahaṇī sā prakīrtitā||
6.40.170| grahaṇyā balamagnirhi sa cāpi grahaṇīṃ śritaḥ|
tasmāt saṃdūṣite vahnau grahaṇī saṃpraduṣyati||
6.40.171| ekaśaḥ sarvaśaścaiva doṣairatyarthamucchritaiḥ|
sā duṣṭā bahuśo bhuktamāmameva vimuñcati||
6.40.172| pakvaṃ vā sarujaṃ pūti muhurbaddhaṃ muhurdravam|
grahaṇīrogamāhustamāyurvedavido janāḥ||
6.40.173| tasyotpattau vidāho+āne sadanālasyatṛṭklamāḥ|
balakṣayo 'ruciḥ kāsaḥ karṇakṣveḍo 'ntrakūjanam||
6.40.174| atha jāte bhavejjantuḥ śūnapādakaraḥ kṛśaḥ|
parvaruglaulyatṛṭchardijvarārocakadāhavām||
6.40.175| udgirecchuktatiktāmlalohadhūmāmagandhikam|
prasekamukhavairasyatamakārucipīḍitaḥ||
6.40.176| vātācchūlādhikaiḥ pāyuhṛtpārśvodaramastakaiḥ|
pittāt sadāhairgurubhiḥ kaphāttribhyastrilakṣaṇaiḥ||
6.40.177| doṣavarṇairnakhaistadvadviṇmūtranayanānanaiḥ|
hṛtpāṇḍūdaragulmārśaḥplīhāśaṅkhī ca mānavaḥ||
6.40.178| yathādoṣocchrayaṃ tasya viśuddhasya yathākramam|
peyādiṃ vitaret samyagdīpanīyopasaṃbhṛtam||
6.40.179| tataḥ pācanasaṃgrāhidīpanīyagaṇatrayam|
pibet prātaḥ surāriṣṭasnehamūtrasukhāmbubhiḥ||
6.40.180| takreṇa vā 'tha takraṃ vā kevalaṃ hitamucyate|
kṛmigulmodarārśoghnīḥ kriyāścātrāvacārayet||
6.40.181| cūrṇaṃ hiṅgvādikaṃ cātra ghṛtaṃ vā plīhanāśanam|
kalkena magadhādeśca cāṅgerīsvarasena ca||
6.40.182| caturguṇena dadhnā ca ghṛtaṃ siddhaṃ hitaṃ bhavet|
jvarādīnavirodhācca sādhayet svaiścikitsitaiḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre 'tisārapratiṣedho nāma (dvitīyo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ|) catvāriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||40||


ekacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.41.1| athātaḥ śoṣapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.41.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.41.3| anekarogānugato bahurogapurogamaḥ|
durvijñeyo durnivāraḥ śoṣo vyādhirmahābalaḥ||
6.41.4| saṃśoṣaṇādrasādīnāṃ śoṣa ityabhidhīyate|
kriyākṣayakaratvācca kṣaya ityucyate punaḥ||
6.41.5| rājñaścandramaso yasmādabhūdeṣa kilāmayaḥ|
tasmāttaṃ rājayakṣmeti kecidāhuḥ1 punarjanāḥ||
6.41.6| sa vyastairjāyate doṣairiti kecidvadanti hi|
ekādaśānāmekasmin sānnidhyāttantrayuktitaḥ||
6.41.7| kriyāṇāmavibhāgena prāgekotpādanena ca|
eka eva mataḥ śoṣaḥ sannipātātmako hyataḥ||
6.41.8| udrekāttatra liṅgāni doṣāṇāṃ nipatanti hi|
ksayādvegapratīghātādāghātādviṣamāśanāt||
6.41.9| jāyate kupitairdoṣairvyāptadehasya dehinaḥ|
kaphapradhānairdoṣairhi ruddheṣu rasavartmasu||
6.41.10| ativyavāyino vā 'pi kṣīṇe retasyanantaram|
kṣīyante dhātavaḥ sarve tataḥ śuṣyanti mānavaḥ||
6.41.11| bhaktadveṣo jvaraḥ śvāsaḥ kāsaḥ śoṇitadarśanam|
svarabhedaśca jāyeta ṣaḍrūpe rājayakṣmaṇi||
6.41.12| svarabhedo 'nilāñchūlaṃ saṃlocaścāṃsapārśvayoḥ|
jvaro dāho 'tisāraśca pittādraktasya cāgamaḥ||
6.41.13| śirasaḥ paripūrṇatvamabhaktacchanda eva ca|
kāsaḥ kaṇṭhasya coddhvaṃso vijñeyaḥ kaphakopataḥ||
6.41.14| ekādaśabhirebhirvā ṣaḍbhirvā 'pi samanvitam|
(kāsātīsārapārśvārtisvarabhedārucijvaraiḥ||
6.41.15| tribhirvā pīḍitaṃ liṅgairjvarakāsāsṛgāmayaiḥ|)
jahyācchoṣārditaṃ jantumicchan suvipulaṃ yaśaḥ||
6.41.16| vyāyaśokasthāviryavyāyāmadhvopavāsataḥ|
vraṇoraḥkṣatapīḍābhyāṃ śoṣānanye vadanti hi||
6.41.17| vyavāyaśoṣī śukrasya kṣayaliṅgairupadrutaḥ|
pāṇḍudeho yathāpūrvaṃ kṣīyante cāsya dhātavaḥ||
6.41.18| pradhyānaśīlaḥ srastāṅgaḥ śokaśoṣyapi tādṛśaḥ|
vinā śukraksayakṛtairvikārairabhilakṣitaḥ||
6.41.19| jarāśoṣī kṛśo mandavīryabuddhibalendiryaḥ|
1kampano 'rucimān bhinnakāṃsyapātrahatasvaraḥ(naḥ)||
6.41.20| ṣṭhīvati śleṣmaṇā hīnaṃ gauravārucipīḍitaḥ1|
saṃprasrutāsyanāsākṣaḥ suptarūkṣamalacchaviḥ||
6.41.21| adhvapraśoṣī srastāṅgaḥ saṃbhṛṣṭaparuṣacchaviḥ|
prasuptagātrāvayavaḥ śuṣkaklomagalānanaḥ||
6.41.22| vyāyāmaśoṣī bhūyiṣṭhamebhireva samanvitaḥ|
uraḥkṣatakṛtairliṅgaiḥ saṃyuktaśca kṣatādvinā||
6.41.23| raktakṣayādvedanābhistathaivāhārayantraṇāt|
vraṇitasya1 bhavecchoṣaḥ sa cāsādhyatamaḥ smṛtaḥ||
6.41.24| vyāyāmabhārādhyayanairabhighātātimaithunaiḥ|
karmaṇā 1cāpyurasyena vakṣo yasya vidāritam|
tasyorasi kṣate raktaṃ pūyaḥ śleṣmā ca gacchati||
6.41.25| kāsamānaśchardayecca pītaraktāsitāruṇam|
saṃtaptavakṣāḥ so 'tyarthaṃ dūyanātparitāmyati||
6.41.26| durgandhavadanocchvāso bhinnavarṇasvaro naraḥ|
keṣāṃcidevaṃ śoṣo hi kāraṇairbhedamāgataḥ||
6.41.27| na tatra doṣaliṅgānāṃ samastānāṃ nipātanam|
kṣayā eva hi te jñeyāḥ pratyekaṃ dhātusaṃjñitāḥ||
6.41.28| cikitsitaṃ tu teṣāṃ hi prāguktaṃ dhātusaṃkṣaye||
6.41.29| śvāsāṅgasādakaphasaṃsravatāluśoṣacchardyagnisādamadapīnasapāṇḍunidrāḥ|
śoṣe bhaviṣyati bhavanti sa cāpi jantuḥ śuklekṣaṇe bhavati māṃsaparo ririṃsuḥ||
6.41.30| svapneṣu kākaśukaśallakinīlakaṇṭhagṛdhrāstathaiva kapayaḥ kṛkalāsakāśca|
taṃ vāhayanti sa nadīrvijalāśca paśyecchuṣkāṃstarūn pavanadhūmadavārditāṃśca||
6.41.31| mahāśanaṃ kṣīyamāṇamatīsāranipīḍitam|
śūnamuṣkodaraṃ caiva yakṣmiṇaṃ parivarjayet||
6.41.32| upācaredātmavantaṃ dīptāgnimakṛśaṃ 1navam|
sthirādivargasiddhena dhṛtenājāvikena ca||
6.41.33| snigdhasya mṛdu kartavyamūrdhvaṃ cādhaśca śodhanam|
āsthāpanaṃ tathā kāryaṃ śirasaśca virecanam||
6.41.34| yavagodhūmaśālīṃśca rasairbhuñjīta śodhitaḥ|
dṛḍhe 'gnau bṛṃhayeccāpi nivṛttopadravaṃ naram||
6.41.35| vyavāyaśoṣiṇaṃ prāyo bhajante vātajā gadāḥ|
bṛṃhaṇīyo vidhistasmai hitaḥ snighdo 'nilāpahaḥ||
6.41.36| kākānulūkānnakulān biḍālān gaṇḍūpadān vyālabileśayākhūn|
gṛdhrāṃśca dadyādvividhaiḥ 1pravādaiḥ sasaindhavān sarṣapatailabhṛṣṭān||
6.41.37| deyāni māṃsāni ca jāṅgalāni mudgāḍhakīsūparasāśca1 hṛdyāḥ|
kharoṣṭranāgāśvatarāśvajāni deyāni māṃsāni sukalpitāni||
6.41.38| māṃsopadaṃśāṃśca pibedariṣṭān mārdvīkayuktān madirāśca sevyāḥ|
arkāmṛtākṣārajaloṣitebhyaḥ kṛtvā yavebhyo vividhāṃśca bhakṣyān||
6.41.39| khādet pibet sarpirajāvikaṃ vā kṛśo yavāgvā saha bhaktakāle|
sarpirmadhubhyāṃ trikaṭu pralihyāccavyāviḍaṅgopahitaṃ kṣayārtaḥ||
6.41.40| māṃsādamāṃseṣu ghṛtaṃ ca siddhaṃ śosāpahaṃ kṣaudrakaṇāsametam|
drākṣāsitāmāgadhikāvalehaḥ sakṣaudratailaḥ kṣayarogaghātī||
6.41.41| ghṛtena cājena samākṣikeṇa turaṅgagandhātilamāṣacūrṇam|
sitāśvagandhāmagadhodbhavānāṃ 1cūrṇaṃ ghṛtakṣaudrayutaṃ pralihyāt||
6.41.42| kṣīraṃ pibedvā 'pyatha vājigandhāvipakvamevaṃ labhate 'ṅgapuṣṭim|
tadutthitaṃ kṣīraghṛtaṃ sitāḍhyaṃ prātaḥ pibedvā 'pi payonupānam||
6.41.43| utsādane cāpi turaṅgagandhā yojyā yavāścaiva punarnave ca|
kṛtsne vṛṣe tatkusumaiśca siddhaṃ sarpiḥ pibetkṣaudrayutaṃ hitāśī||
6.41.44| yakṣmāṇametat prabalaṃ ca kāsaṃ śvāsaṃ ca hanyādapi pāṇḍutāṃ ca|
śakṛdrasā gośvagajāvyajānāṃ kvāthā mitāścāpi tathaiva bhāgaiḥ||
6.41.45| mūrvāharidrākhadiradrumāṇāṃ kṣīrasya bhāgastvaparo ghṛtasya|
bhāgān daśautān vipacedvidhijño dattvā trivargaṃ madhuraṃ ca kṛtsnam||
6.41.46| kaṭutrikaṃ caiva sabhadradāru ghṛtottamaṃ yakṣmanivāraṇāya|
dve pañcamūlyau varuṇaṃ karañjaṃ bhallātakaṃ bilvapunarnave ca||
6.41.47| yavān kulatthān badarāṇi bhārgīṃ pāṭhāṃ hutāśaṃ samahīkadambam|
kṛtvā kaṣāyaṃ vipaceddhi tasya ṣaḍbhirhi pātrairghṛtapātramekam||
6.41.48| vyoṣaṃ mahāvṛkṣapayo 'bhayāṃ ca cavyaṃ surākhyaṃ lavaṇottamaṃ ca|
etaddhi śoṣaṃ jaṭharāṇi caiva hanyāt pramehāṃśca sahānilena||
6.41.49| gośvāvyajebhaiṇakharoṣṭrajātaiḥ śakṛdrasakṣīrarasakṣatotthaiḥ|
drākṣāśvagandhāmagadhāsitābhiḥ siddhaṃ ghṛtaṃ yakṣmavikārahāri||
6.41.50| elājamodāmalakābhayākṣagāyatryariṣṭāsanaśālasārān|
viḍaṅgabhallātakacitrakogrākaṭutrikāmbhodasurāṣṭrajāṃśca||
6.41.51| paktvā jale tena paceddhi sarpistasmin susiddhe tvavatārite ca|
triṃśatpalānyatra sitopalāyā dattvā tugākṣīripalāni ṣaṭ ca||
6.41.52| prasthe ghṛtasya dviguṇaṃ ca dadyāt kṣaudraṃ tato manthahataṃ vidadhyāt|
palaṃ palaṃ prātarataḥ pralihya paścāt pibet kṣīramatandritaśca||
6.41.53| etaddhi medhyaṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ cakṣuṣyamāyuṣyamatho yaśasyam|
yakṣmāṇamāśu vyapahanti caitat pāṇḍvāmayaṃ caiva bhagandaraṃ ca||
6.41.54| śvāsaṃ ca hanti svarabhedakāsahṛtplīhagulmagrahaṇīgadāṃśca|
na cātra kiṃcit parivarjanīyaṃ rasāyanaṃ caitadupāsyamānam||
6.41.55| plīhodaroktaṃ vihitaṃ ca sarpistrīṇyeva cānyāni hitāni cātra|
upadravāṃśca svaravaikṛtādīn jayedyathāsvaṃ prasamīkṣya śāstram||
6.41.56| ajāśakṛnmūtrapayoghṛtāsṛṅmāṃsālayāni pratisevamānaḥ|
snānādinānāvidhinā jahāti māsādaśeṣaṃ niyamena śoṣam||
6.41.57| rasonayogaṃ vidhivat kṣayārtaḥ kṣīreṇa vā nāgabalāprayogam|
seveta vā māgadhikāvidhānaṃ tathopayogaṃ jatuno 'śmajasya||
6.41.58| śokaṃ striyaṃ krodhamasūyanaṃ ca tyajedudārān viṣayān bhajeta|
vaidyān dvijātīṃstridaśān gurūśca vācaśca puṇyāḥ śṛṇuyādbijebhyaḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre (tṛtīyo 'dhyāyaḥ, ādita) ekacatvāriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||41||

dvicatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.42.1| athāto gulmapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.42.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.42.3| yathoktaiḥ kopanairdoṣāḥ kupitāḥ koṣṭhamāgatāḥ|
janayanti nṛṇāṃ gulmaṃ sa pañcavidha ucyate||
6.42.4| hṛdbastyorantare granthiḥ saṃcārī yadi vā 'calaḥ|
cayāpacayavān vṛttaḥ sa gulma iti kīrtitaḥ||
6.42.5| pañca gulmāśrayā nṛṛṇāṃ pārśve hṛnnābhibastayaḥ|
1gupitānilamūlatvādgūḍhamūlodayādapi||
6.42.6| gulmavadvā viśālatvādgulma ityabhidhīyate|
sa yasmādātmani cayaṃ gacchatyapsviva budbudaḥ||
6.42.7| antaḥ sarati yasmācca na pākamupayātyataḥ|
sa vyastairjāyate doṣaiḥ samastairapi cocchritaiḥ||
6.42.8| puruṣāṇāṃ tathā strīṇāṃ jñeyo raktena cāparaḥ|
sadanaṃ madantā vahnerāṭopo 'ntravikūjanam||
6.42.9| viṇmūtrānilasaṅgaśca sauhityāsahatā tathā|
dveṣo 'nne vāyurūrdhvaṃ ca pūrvarūpeṣu gulminām||
6.42.10| hṛtkukṣiśūlaṃ mukhakaṇṭhaśoṣo vāyornirodho viṣamāgnitā ca|
te te vikārāḥ pavanātmakāśca bhavanti gulme 'nilasaṃbhave tu||
6.42.11| svedajvarāhāravidāhadāhāstṛṣṇā 'ṅgarāgaḥ kaṭuvaktratā ca|
pittasya liṅgānyakhilāni yāni pittātmake tāni bhavanti gulme||
6.42.12| staimityamanne 'ruciraṅgasādaśchardiḥ praseko madhurāsyatā ca|
kaphasya liṅgāni ca yāni tāni bhavanti gulme kaphasaṃbhave tu||
6.42.13| sarvātmakaḥ sarvavikārayuktaḥ so 'sādhya uktaḥ kṣatajaṃ pravakṣye|
navaprasūtā 'hitabhojanā yā yā cāmagarbhaṃ visṛjedṛtau1 vā||
6.42.14| vāyurhi tasyāḥ parigṛhya raktaṃ karoti gulmaṃ sarujaṃ sadāham|
paittasya liṅgena samānaliṅgaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ cāpyaparaṃ nibodha||
6.42.15| na spandate nodarameti vṛddhiṃ bhavanti liṅgāni ca garbhiṇīnām|
taṃ garbhakālātigame caikitsyamasṛgbhavaṃ gulmamuśanti tajjñāḥ||
6.42.16| vātagulmārditaṃ snigdhaṃ yuktaṃ snehavirecanaiḥ|
upācaredyathākālaṃ nirūhaiḥ sānuvāsanaiḥ||
6.42.17| pittagulmārditaṃ snigdhaṃ kākolyādighṛtena tu|
viriktaṃ madhurairyogairnirūhaiḥ samupācaret||
6.42.18| śleṣmagulmārditaṃ snigdhaṃ pippalyādighṛtena tu|
tīkṣṇairviriktaṃ tadrūpairnirūhaiḥ samupācaret||
6.42.19| sannipātotthite gulme tridoṣaghno vidhirhitaḥ|
pittavadraktagulminyā nāryāḥ kāryaḥ kriyāvidhiḥ||
6.42.20| viśeṣamaparaṃ cāsyāḥ śṛṇu raktavibhedanam|
1palāśakṣāratoyena siddhaṃ sarpiḥ prayojayet||
6.42.21| dadyāduttarabastiṃ ca pippalyādighṛtena tu|
uṣṇairvā bhedayedbhinne vidhirāsṛgdaro hitaḥ||
6.42.22| ānūpaudakamajjāno vasā tailaṃ ghṛtaṃ dadhi|
vipakvamekataḥ śastaṃ vātagulme 'nuvāsanam||
6.42.23| jāṅgalaikaśaphānāṃ tu vasā sarpiśca paittike|
tailaṃ jāṅgalamajjāna evaṃ gulme kaphotthite||
6.42.24| dhātrīphalānāṃ svarase ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vipacedghṛtam|
śarkarāsaindhavopetaṃ taddhitaṃ vātagulmine||
6.42.25| citrakavyoṣasindhūtthapṛthvīkācavyadāḍimaiḥ|
dīpyakagranthikājājīhapuṣādhānyakaiḥ samaiḥ||
6.42.26| dadhyāranālabadaramūlakasvarasairghṛtam|
tatpibedvātagulmāgnidaurbalyāṭopaśūlanut||
6.42.27| hiṅgusauvarcalājājīviḍadāḍimadīpyakaiḥ|
puṣkaravyoṣadhānyāmlavetasakṣāracitrakaiḥ||
6.42.28| śaṭīvacājagandhailāsurasaiśca vipācitam|
śūlānāhaharaṃ sarpirdadhnā cānilagulminām||
6.42.29| viḍadāḍimasindhūtthahutabhugvyoṣajīrakaiḥ|
hiṅgusauvarcalakṣārarugvṛkṣāmlāmlavetasaiḥ||
6.42.30| bījapūrarasopetaṃ sarpirdadhicaturguṇam|
sādhitṃ dādhikaṃ nāma gulmahṛt plīhaśūlajit||
6.42.31| rasonasvarase sarpiḥ pañcamūlarasānvitam|
surāranāladadhyamlamūlakasvarasaiḥ saha||
6.42.32| vyoṣadāḍimavṛkṣāmlayavānīcavyasaindhavaiḥ|
hiṅgvamlavetasājājīdīpyakaiśca samāṃśikaiḥ||
6.42.33| siddhaṃ gulmagrahaṇyarśaḥśvāsonmādakṣayajvarān|
kāsāpasmāramandāgniplīhaśūlānilāñjayet||
6.42.34| dadhi sauvīrakaṃ sarpiḥ kvāthau mudgakulatthajau|
pañcāḍhakāni vipacedāvāpya dvipalānyatha||
6.42.35| sauvarcalaṃ sarjikāṃ ca devadārvatha saindhavam|
vātagulmāpahaṃ sarpiretaddīpanameva ca||
6.42.36| tṛṇamūlakaṣāye tu jīvanīyaiḥ pacedghṛtam|
nyagrodhādigaṇe vā 'pi gaṇe vā 'pyutpalādike||
6.42.37| raktapittotthitaṃ ghnanti ghṛtānyetānyasaṃśayam|
āragvadhādau vipaceddīpanīyayutaṃ ghṛtam||
6.42.38| kṣāravarge paceccanyat pacenmūtragaṇe 'param|
ghnanti gulmaṃ kaphodbhūtaṃ ghṛtānyetānyasaṃśayam||
6.42.39| yathādoṣocchrayaṃ cāpi cikitsetsānnipātikam|
cūrṇaṃ hiṅgvādikaṃ vā 'pi ghṛtaṃ vā plīhanāśanam||
6.42.40| pibedgulmāpahaṃ kāle sarpistailvakameva vā|
tilekṣurakapālāśasārṣapaṃ yāvanālajam||
6.42.41| bhasma mūlakajaṃ cāpi gojāvikharahantinām|
mūtreṇa mahiṣīṇāṃ ca pālikaiścāvacūrṇitaiḥ||
6.42.42| kuṣṭhasaindhavayaṣṭyāhvanāgarakṛmighātibhiḥ|
sājamodaiśca daśabhiḥ sāmudrācca palairyutam||
6.42.43| ayaḥpātre 'gninā 'lpena paktvā lehyam(laham)athoddharet|
tasya mātrāṃ pibeddadhnā surayā sarpiṣā 'pi vā||
6.42.44| dhānyāmlenoṣṇatoyena kaulatthena rasena vā|
gulmān vātavikārāṃśca kṣāro 'yaṃ hantyasaṃśayam||
6.42.45| svarjikākuṣṭhasahitaḥ kṣāraḥ ketakijo 'pi vā|
tailena śamayet pīto gulmaṃ pavanasaṃbhavam||
6.42.46| pītaṃ sukhāmbunā vā 'pi svarjikākuṣṭhasaindhavam|
vṛścīvamurubūkaṃ(vṛścīramurubūkaṃ)1 ca varṣābhūrbṛhatīdvayam||
6.42.47| citrakaṃ ca jaladroṇe paktvā pādāvaśeṣitam|
māgadhīciktrakakṣaudralipte kumbhe nidhāpayet||
6.42.48| madhunaḥ prasthamāvāpya pathyācūrṇārdhasaṃyutam|
1busoṣitaṃ daśāhaṃ tu jīrṇabhaktaḥ pibennaraḥ||
6.42.49| ariṣṭo 'yaṃ jayedgulmamavipākamarocakam|
pāṭhānikumbharajanītrikaṭutriphalāgnikam||
6.42.50| lavaṇaṃ vṛkṣabījaṃ ca tulyaṃ syādanavo guḍaḥ|
pathyābhirvā 1yutaṃ cūrṇaṃ gavāṃ mūtrayutaṃ pacet||
6.42.51| guṭikāstadghṛnībhūtaṃ kṛtvā khādedabhuktavān|
gulmaplīhāgnisādāṃtā nāśayeyuraśeṣataḥ||
6.42.52| hṛdrogaṃ grahaṇīdoṣaṃ pāṇḍurogaṃ ca dāruṇam|
saśūle sonnate 'spande dāhapākaruganvite||
6.42.53| gulme raktaṃ jalaukobhiḥ sirāmokṣeṇa vā haret|
sukhoṣṇā jāṅgalarasāḥ susnigdhā vyaktasaindhavāḥ||
6.42.54| kaṭutrikasamāyuktā hitāḥ pāne tu gulminām|
peyā vātaharaiḥ siddhāḥ kaulatthāḥ saṃskṛtā rasāḥ||
6.42.55| khalāḥ sapañcamūlāśca gulmināṃ bhojane hitāḥ|
baddhavarconilānāṃ tu sārdrakaṃ kṣīramiṣyate||
6.42.56| kumbhīpiṇḍeṣṭakāsvedān kārayet kuśalo bhiṣak|
gulminaḥ sarva evoktā durvirecyatamā bhṛśam||
6.42.57| ataśaitāṃstu susvinnān sraṃsanenopapādayet|
vimlāpanābhyañjanāni1 tathaiva dahanāni ca||
6.42.58| upanāhāśca kartavyāḥ sukhoṣṇāḥ sālvaṇādayaḥ|
udaroktāni sarpīṃṣi 1mūtravartikriyāstathā||
6.42.59| lavaṇāni ca yojyāni yānyuktānyanilāmaye|
vātavarconirodhe tu sāmudrārdrakasarṣapaiḥ||
6.42.60| kṛtvā pāyau vidhātavyā vartayo maricottarāḥ|
dantīcitrakamūleṣu tathā vātahareṣu ca||
6.42.61| kuryādariṣṭān sarvāṃśca ślokasthāne yatheritān|
khādedvā 'pyaṅkurān bhṛṣṭān pūtīkanṛpavṛkṣayoḥ||
6.42.62| ūrdhvavātaṃ manuṣyaṃ ca gulminaṃ na nirūhayet|
pibettrivṛnnāgaraṃ vā saguḍāṃ vā harītakīm||
6.42.63| gugguluṃ trivṛtāṃ dantīṃ dravantīṃ saindhavaṃ vacām|
mūtramadyapayodrākṣārasairvīkṣya balābalam||
6.42.64| evaṃ pīlūni 1bhṛṣṭāni pibet salavaṇāni tu|
pippalīpippalīmūlacavyacitrakasaindhavaiḥ||
6.42.65| yuktā hanti surā gulmaṃ śīghraṃ kāle prayojitā|
baddhaviṇmāruto gulmī bhuñjīta payasā yavān||
6.42.66| kulmāṣān vā bahusnehān bhakṣyellavaṇottarān|
athāsyopadravaḥ 1śūlaḥ kathaṃcidupajāyate||
6.42.67| 1śūlaṃ nikhānitamivāsukhaṃ yena tu vattyasau|
tatra viṇmūtrasaṃrodhaḥ kṛcchrocchvāsaḥ sthirāṅgatā||
6.42.68| tṛṣṇā dāho bhramo 'nnasya vidagdhaparivṛddhitā|
romaharṣo 'ruciśchardirbhuktavṛddhirjaḍāṅgatā||
6.42.69| vāyvādibhiryathāsaṅkhyāṃ miśrairvā vīkṣya yojayet|
pathyātrilavaṇaṃ kṣāraṃ hiṅgutumburupauṣkaram||
6.42.70| yavānīṃ ca haridrāṃ ca viḍaṅgānyamlavetasam|
vidārītriphalā 'bhīruśṛṅgāṭīguḍaśarkarāḥ||
6.42.71| kāśmarīphalayaṣṭyāhvaparūṣakahimāni ca|
ṣaḍgranthātiviṣādārupathyāmaricavṛkṣajān||
6.42.72| kṛṣṇāmūlakacanvyaṃ ca nāgarakṣāracitrakān|
uṣṇāmlakāñjikakṣīratoyaiḥ ślokasamāpanān||
6.42.73| yathākramaṃ vimiśrāṃśca dvandve sarvāṃśca sarvaje|
tathaiva sekāvagāhapradehābhyaṅgabhojanam||
6.42.74| śiśirodakapūrṇānāṃ bhājanānāṃ ca dhāraṇam|
vamanonmardanasvedalaṅghanakṣapaṇakriyāḥ||
6.42.75| snehādiśca karamaḥ sarvo viśeṣeṇopadiśyate|
vallūraṃ mūlakaṃ matsyān śuṣkaśākāni vaidalam||
6.42.76| na khādedālukaṃ gulmī madhurāṇi phalāni ca|
vinā gulmena yacchūlaṃ gulmasthāneṣu jāyate||
6.42.77| nidānaṃ tasya vakṣyāmi rūpaṃ ca sacikitsitam|
vātamūtrapurīṣāṇāṃ nigrahādatibhojanāt||
6.42.78| ajīrṇādhyaśanāyāsaviruddhānnopasevanāt|
pānīyapānāt kṣutkāle virūḍhānāṃ ca sevanāt||
6.42.79| piṣṭānnaśuṣkamāṃsānāmupayogāttathaiva ca|
evaṃvidhānāṃ dravyāṇāmanyeṣāṃ copasevanāt||
6.42.80| vāyuḥ prakupitaḥ koṣṭhe śūlaṃ saṃjanayedbhṛśam|
nirucchvāsī bhavettena vedanāpīḍito naraḥ||
6.42.81| 1śaṅkusphoṭanavattasya yasmāttīvrāśca vedanāḥ|
śūlāsaktasya lakṣyante tasmācchūlamihocyate||
6.42.82| nirāhārasya yasyaiva tīvraṃ śūlamudīryate|
prastabdhagātro bhavati kṛcchreṇocchvasitīva ca||
6.42.83| vātamūtrapurīṣāṇi kṛcchreṇa kurute naraḥ|
etairliṅgairvijānīyācchūlaṃ vātasamudbhavam||
6.42.84| tṛṣṇā dāho mado mūrcchā tīvraṃ śūlaṃ tathaiva ca|
śītābhikāmo bhavati śītenaiva praśāmyati||
6.42.85| etairliṅgairvijānīyācchūlaṃ pittasamudbhavam|
śūlenotpīḍyamānasya hṛllāsa upajāyate||
6.42.86| atīva pūrṇakoṣṭhatvaṃ tathaiva gurugātratā|
etacchleṣmasamutthasya śūlasyoktaṃ nidarśanam||
6.42.87| sarvāṇi dṛṣṭvā rūpāṇi nirdiśetsānnipātikam|
sannipātasamutthānamasādhyaṃ taṃ vinirdiśet||
6.42.88| śūlānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ cikitsāṃ tu nibodha me|
āśukārī hi pavanastasmāttaṃ tvarayā jayet||
6.42.89| tasya śūlābhipannasya sveda eva sukhāvahaḥ|
pāyasaiḥ kṛśarāpiṇḍaiḥ snigdhairvā piśitairhitaḥ||
6.42.90| trivṛcchākena vā snigdhamuṣṇaṃ bhiñjīta bhojanam|
cirabilvāṅkurān vāpi tailabhṛṣṭāṃstu bhakṣayet||
6.42.91| vaihaṅgāṃśca rasān snigdhān jāṅgalān śūlapīḍitaḥ|
yathālābhaṃ niṣeveta māṃsāni bilaśāyinām||
6.42.92| surā sauvīrakaṃ cukraṃ mastūdaśvittathā dadhi|
sakālalavaṇaṃ peyaṃ śūle vātasamudbhave||
6.42.93| kulatthayūṣo yuktāmlo lāvakīyūṣasaṃskṛtaḥ|
sasaindhavaḥ samarico vātaśūlavināśanaḥ||
6.42.94| viḍaṅgaśigrukampillapathyāśyāmāmlavetasān|
1surasāmaśvamūtrīṃ ca sauvarcalayutān pibet||
6.42.95| madyena vātajaṃ śūlaṃ kṣiprameva praśāmyati|
pṛthvīkājājicavikāyavānīvyoṣacitrakāḥ||
6.42.96| pippalyaḥ pippalīmūlaṃ saindhavaṃ ceti cūrṇayet|
tāni cūrṇāni payasā pibet kāmbalikena vā||
6.42.97| madhvāsavena cukreṇa surāsauvīrakeṇa vā|
athavaitāni(athacaitāni) cūrṇāni mātuluṅgarasena vā||
6.42.98| tathā badarayūṣeṇa bhāvitāni punaḥ punaḥ|
tāni hiṅgupragāḍhāni saha śarkarayā pibet||
6.42.99| saha dāḍimasāreṇa vartiḥ kāryā bhiṣagjitā|
sā vartirvātikaṃ śūlaṃ kṣiprameva vyapohati||
6.42.100| guḍatailena vā līḍhā pītā madyena vā punaḥ|
bubhukṣāprabhave śūle laghu saṃtarpaṇaṃ hitam||
6.42.101| uṣṇaiḥ kṣīrairyavāgūbhiḥ snigdhairmāṃsarasaistathā|
vātaśūle samutpanne rūkṣaṃ snigdhena bhojayet||
6.42.102| susaṃskṛtāḥ pradeyāḥ syurghṛtapūrā viśeṣataḥ|
vāruṇīṃ ca pibejjantustathā saṃpadyate sukhī||
6.42.103| etadvātasamutthasya śūlasyoktaṃ cikitsitam|
atha pittasamutthasya kriyāṃ vakṣyāmyataḥ param||
6.42.104| sa sukhaṃ chardayitvā tu pītvā śītodakaṃ naraḥ|
śītalāni ca seveta sarvāṇyuṣṇāni varjayet||
6.42.105| maṇirājatatāmrāṇi bhājanāni ca sarvaśaḥ|
vāripūrṇāni tānyasya śūlasyopari nikṣipet||
6.42.106| guḍaḥ śāliryavāḥ kṣīraṃ sarpiḥpānaṃ virecanam|
jāṅgalāni ca māṃsāni bheṣajaṃ pittaśūlinām||
6.42.107| rasān seveta pittaghnān pittalāni vivarjayet|
pālāśaṃ dhānvanaṃ vā 'pi pibedyūṣaṃ saśarkaram||
6.42.108| parūṣakāṇi mṛdvīkākharjūrodakajānyapi|
tat pibeccharkarāyuktaṃ pittaśūlanivāraṇam||
6.42.109| aśane bhuktamātre tu prakopaḥ ślaiṣmikasya ca|
vamanaṃ kārayettatra pippalīvāriṇā bhiṣak||
6.42.110| rūkṣaḥ svedaḥ prayojyaḥ syādanyāścoṣṇāḥ kriyā hitāḥ|
pippalī śṛṅgaveraṃ ca śleṣmaśūle bhiṣagjitam||
6.42.111| pāṭhāṃ vacāṃ trikaṭukaṃ tathā kaṭukarohiṇīm|
citrakasya ca 1niryūhe pibedyūṣaṃ sahārjakam||
6.42.112| eraṇḍaphalamūlāni mūlaṃ gokṣurakasya ca|
śālaparṇīṃ 1pṛśniparṇīṃ bṛhatīṃ kaṇṭakārikām||
6.42.113| dadyācchṛgālavinnāṃ ca sahadevāṃ tathaiva ca|
mahāsahāṃ kṣudrasahāṃ mūlamikṣurakasya ca||
6.42.114| etat saṃbhṛtya saṃbhāraṃ jaladroṇe vipācayet|
caturbhāgāvaśeṣaṃ tu yavakṣārayutaṃ pibet||
6.42.115| vātikaṃ paittikaṃ vā 'pi ślaiṣmikaṃ sānnipātikam|
prasahya nāśayecchūlaṃ chinnābhramiva mārutaḥ||
6.42.116| pippalī svarjikākṣāro yavāścitraka eva ca|
sevyaṃ caitat samānīya bhasma kuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ||
6.42.117| taduṣṇavāriṇā pītaṃ śleṣmaśūle bhiṣagjitam|
ruṇaddhi mārutaṃ śleṣmā kukṣipārśvavyavasthitaḥ||
6.42.118| sa saṃruddhaḥ karotyāśu 1sādhmānaṃ guḍguḍāyanam|
sūcībhiriva nistodaṃ kṛcchrocchvāsī tadā naraḥ||
6.42.119| nānnaṃ vāñchati no nidrāmupaityartinipīḍitaḥ|
pārśvaśūlaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kaphānilasamudbhavaḥ||
6.42.120| tatra puṣkaramūlāni hiṅgu sauvarcalaṃ viḍam|
saindhavaṃ tumburuṃ pathyāṃ cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā tu pāyayet||
6.42.121| pārśvahṛdbastiśūleṣu yavakvāthena saṃyutam|
sarpiḥ plīhodaroktaṃ vā ghṛtaṃ vā hiṅgusaṃyutam||
6.42.122| bījapūrakasāraṃ vā payasā saha sādhitam|
eraṇḍatailamathavā madyamastupayorasaiḥ||
6.42.123| bhojayeccāpi payasā jāṅgalena rasena vā|
prakupyati yadā kukṣau vahnimākramya mārutaḥ||
6.42.124| tadā 'sya bhojanaṃ bhuktaṃ sopastambhaṃ na pacyate|
ucchvasityāmaśakṛtā śūlenāhanyate muhuḥ||
6.42.125| naivāsane na śayane 1tiṣṭhan vā labhate sukham|
kukṣiśūla iti khyāto vātādāmasamudbhavaḥ||
6.42.126| vamanaṃ kārayettatra laṅghayedvā yathābalam|
saṃsargapācanaṃ kuryādamlairdīpanasaṃyutaiḥ||
6.42.127| nāgaraṃ dīpyakaṃ cavyaṃ hiṅgu sauvarcalaṃ viḍam|
mātuluṅgasya bījāni tathā śyāmorubūkayoḥ||
6.42.128| bṛhatyāḥ kaṇṭakāryāśca kvāthaṃ śūlaharaṃ pibet|
vacā sauvarcalaṃ hiṅgu kuṣṭhaṃ sātiviṣā 'bhayā||
6.42.129| kuṭajasya ca bījāni sadyaḥśūlaharāṇi tu|
virecane1 prayuñjīta jñātvā doṣabalābalam||
6.42.130| snehabastīnnirūhāṃśca kuryāddoṣanibarhaṇān|
upanāhāḥ snehasekā dhānyāmlapariṣecanam||
6.42.131| avagāhāśca śasyante yaccānyadapi taddhitam|
kaphapittāvaruddhastu māruto rasamūrcchitaḥ||
6.42.132| hṛdisthaḥ kurute śūlamucchvāsārodhakaṃ1 param|
sa hṛcchūla iti khyāto rasamārutasaṃbhavaḥ||
6.42.133| tatrāpi karmābhihitaṃ yaduktaṃ hṛdvikāriṇām|
saṃrodhāt kupito vāyurbastimāvṛtya tiṣṭhati||
6.42.134| bastivaṅkṣaṇanābhīṣu tataḥ śūlo 'sya jāyate|
viṇmūtravātasaṃrodhī bastiśūlaḥ sa 1mārutāt||
6.42.135| nābhyāṃ vaṅkṣaṇapārśveṣu kukṣau meḍhrāntramardakaḥ|
mūtramāvṛtya gṛhṇāti mūtraśūlaḥ sa 1mārutāt||
6.42.136| vāyuḥ prakupito yasya rūkṣāhārasya dehinaḥ|
malaṃ ruṇaddhi koṣṭhasthaṃ mandīkṛtya tu pāvakam||
6.42.137| śūlaṃ saṃjanayaṃstīvraṃ srotāṃsyāvṛtya tasya hi|
dakṣiṇaṃ yadi vā vāmaṃ kukṣimādāya jāyate||
6.42.138| sarvatra vardhate kṣipraṃ bhramannatha1 saghoṣavān|
pipāsā vardhate tīvrā bhramo mūrcchā ca jāyate||
6.42.139| uccārito mūtritaśca na śāntimadhigacchati|
viṭśūlametajjānīyādbhiṣak paramadāruṇam||
6.42.140| kṣipraṃ doṣaharaṃ kāryaṃ bhiṣajā sādhu jānatā|
svedanaṃ śamanaṃ caiva nirūhāḥ snehabastayaḥ||
6.42.141| pūrvoddiṣṭān pāyayeta yogān koṣṭhaviśodhanān|
udāvartaharāścāsya kriyāḥ sarvāḥ sukhāvahāḥ||
6.42.142| atimātraṃ yadā bhuktaṃ pāvake mṛdutāṃ gate|
sthirībhūtaṃ tu tatkoṣṭhe vāyurāvṛtya tiṣṭhati||
6.42.143| avipākagataṃ hyannaṃ śūlaṃ tīvraṃ karotyati|
mūrcchā++ādhmānaṃ vidāhaśca hṛdutkleśo vilambikā||
6.42.144| viricyate chardayati kampate 'tha vimuhyati|
avipākādbhavecchūlastvannadoṣasamudbhavaḥ||
6.42.145| vamanaṃ laṅghanaṃ svedaḥ pācanaṃ phalavartayaḥ|
kṣārāścūrṇāni1 guṭikāḥ śasyante śūlanāśanāḥ||
gulmāvasthāḥ kriyāḥ kāryā yathāvat sarvaśūlinām||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre gulmapratiṣedho nāma (caturtho 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) dvicatvāriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||42||

tricatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.43.1| athāto hṛdrogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.43.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.43.3| vegāghātoṣṇarūkṣānnairatimātropasevitaiḥ|
viruddhādhyaśanājīrṇairasātmyaiścāpi(cāti) bhojanaiḥ||
6.43.4| dūṣayitvā rasaṃ doṣā viguṇā hṛdayaṃ gatāḥ|
kurvanti hṛdaye bādhāṃ hṛdrogaṃ taṃ pracakṣate||
6.43.5| caturvidhaḥ sa doṣaiḥ syāt kṛmibhiśca1 pṛthak pṛthak|
lakṣaṇaṃ tasya vakṣyāmi cikitsitamanantaram||
6.43.6| āyamyate mārutaje hṛdayaṃ 1tudyate tathā|
nirmathyate dīryate ca sphoṭyate pāṭyate 'pi ca||
6.43.7| tṛṣṇoṣādāhacoṣāḥ syuḥ paittike hṛdayaklamaḥ|
dhūmāyanaṃ ca mūrcchā ca svedaḥ śoṣo mukhasya ca||
6.43.8| gauravaṃ kaphasaṃsrāvo 'ruciḥ stambho 'gnimārdavam|
mādhuryamapi cā++āsyasya balāsāvatate hṛdi||
6.43.9| utkleśaḥ ṣṭhīvanaṃ todaḥ śūlo hṛllāsakastamaḥ|
aruciḥ śyāvnetratvaṃ śoṣaśca kṛmije bhavet||
6.43.10| bhramaklamau sādaśoṣau jñeyāsteṣāmupadravāḥ|
kṛmije kṛmijātīnāṃ ślaiṣmikāṇāṃ ca ye matāḥ||
6.43.11| vātopasṛṣṭe hṛdaye vāmayet snigdhamāturam|
dvipañcamūlakvāthena sasnehalavaṇena tu||
6.43.12| pippalyelāvacāhiṅguyavabhasmāni saindhavam|
sauvarcalamatho śuṇṭhīmajamodāṃ ca cūrṇitam||
6.43.13| phaladhānyāmlakaulatthadadhimadyāsavādibhiḥ|
pāyayeta viśuddhaṃ ca snehenānyatamena vā||
6.43.14| bhojayejjīrṇaśālyannaṃ jāṅgalaiḥ saghṛtai rasaiḥ|
vātaghnasiddhaṃ tailaṃ ca dadyādbastiṃ pramāṇataḥ||
6.43.15| śrīparṇīmadhukakṣaudrasitotpalajalairvamet|
pittopasṛṣṭe hṛdaye seveta madhuraiḥ śṛtam||
6.43.16| ghṛtaṃ kaṣāyāṃścoddiṣṭān pittajvaravināśanān|
tṛptasya ca rasairmukhyairmadhuraiḥ1 saghṛtairbhiṣak||
6.43.17| sakṣaudraṃ 1vitaredbastau tailaṃ madhukasādhitam|
vacānimbakaṣāyābhyāṃ vāntaṃ hṛdi kaphātmake||
6.43.18| cūrṇaṃ tu pāyayetoktaṃ vātaje bhojayecca1 tam|
phalādimatha mustādiṃ triphalāṃ vā pibennaraḥ||
6.43.19| śyāmātrivṛtkalkayutaṃ ghṛtaṃ vā 'pi virecanam|
1balātailairvidadhyācca bastiṃ bastiviśāradaḥ||
6.43.20| kṛmihṛdrogiṇaṃ snigdhaṃ bhojayet piśitaudanam|
dadhnā ca palalopetaṃ tryahaṃ paścādvirecayet||
6.43.21| sugandhibhiḥ salavaṇairyogaiḥ sājājiśarkaraiḥ|
viḍaṅgagāḍhaṃ dhānyāmlaṃ pāyayetāpyanantaram||
6.43.22| hṛdayasthāḥ patantyevamadhastāt krimayo nṛṇām|
yavānnaṃ vitareccāsya saviḍaṅgamataḥ param||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre hṛdrogapratiṣedho nāma (pañcamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) tricatvāriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||43||

catuścatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.44.1| athātaḥ pāṇḍurogapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.44.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvandariḥ||
6.44.3| vyavāyamamlaṃ lavaṇāni madyaṃ mṛdaṃ divāsvapnamatīva tīkṣṇam|
niṣevamāṇasya vidūṣya raktaṃ kurvanti doṣāstvaci pāṇḍubhāvam||
6.44.4| pāṇḍvāmayo 'ṣṭārdhavidhaḥ pradiṣṭaḥ pṛthaksamastairyugapacca doṣaiḥ|
sarveṣu caiteṣviha pāṇḍubhāvo yato 'dhiko 'taḥ khalu pāṇḍurogaḥ||
6.44.5| tvaksphoṭanaṃ ṣṭhīvanagātrasādau mṛdbhakṣaṇaṃ prekṣaṇakūṭaśothaḥ|
viṇmūtrapītatvamathāvipāko bhaviṣyatastasya puraḥsarāṇi||
6.44.6| sa kāmalāpānakipāṇḍurogaḥ kumbhāhvayo lāgharako(lāghavako) 'lasākhyaḥ|
vibhāṣyate lakṣaṇamasya kṛtsnaṃ nibodha vakṣyāmyanupūrvaśastat1||
6.44.7| kṛṣṇekṣaṇaṃ kṛṣṇasirāvanaddhaṃ tadvarṇaviṇmūtranakhānanaṃ ca|
vātena pāṇḍuṃ manujaṃ vyavasyedyuktaṃ tathā 'nyaistadupadravaiśca||
6.44.8| pītekṣaṇaṃ pītasirāvanaddhaṃ tadvarṇaviṇmūtranakhānanaṃ ca|
pittena pāṇḍuṃ manujaṃ vyavasyedyuktaṃ tathā 'nyaistadupadravaiśca||
6.44.9| śuklekṣaṇaṃ śuklasirāvanaddhaṃ tadvarṇaviṇmūtranakhānanaṃ ca|
kaphena pāṇḍuṃ manujaṃ vyavasyedyuktaṃ tathā 'nyaistadupadravaiśca||
6.44.10| sarvātmake sarvamidaṃ vyavasyed vakṣyāmi liṅgānyatha kāmalāyāḥ|
yo hyāmayānte sahasā 'nnamamlamadyādapathyāni ca tasya pittam||
6.44.11| karoti pāṇḍuṃ vadanaṃ viśeṣāt 1pūrveritau tandribalakṣayau ca|
bhedastu tasyāḥ khalu kumbhasāhvaḥ śopho mahāṃstatra ca parvabhedaḥ||
6.44.12| jvarāṅgamardabhramasādatandrākṣayānvito lāgharako(lāghavako) 'lasākhyaḥ|
taṃ 1vātapittāddharipītanīlaṃ halīmakaṃ nāma vadanti tajjñāḥ||
6.44.13| upadravāsteṣvaruciḥ pipāsā chardirjvaro mūrdharujā 'gnisādaḥ|
śophastathā kaṇṭhagato 'balatvaṃ mūrcchā klamo hṛdyavapīḍanaṃ ca||
6.44.14| sādhyaṃ tu pāṇḍvāmayinaṃ samīkṣya snigdhaṃ ghṛtenordhvamadhaśca śuddham|
saṃpādayet kṣaudraghṛtapragāḍhairharītakīcūrṇayutaiḥ prayogaiḥ||
6.44.15| pibedghṛtaṃ vā rajanīvipakvaṃ yantraiphalaṃ tailvakameva vā 'pi|
virecanadravyakṛtaṃ pibedvā yogāṃśca vairecanidān ghṛtena||
6.44.16| mūtre nikumbhārdhapalaṃ vipācya pibedabhīkṣṇaṃ kuḍavārdhamātram|
khādedguḍaṃ vā 'pyabhayāvipakvamāragvadhādikvathitaṃ1 pibedvā||
6.44.17| ayorajovyoṣaviḍaṅgacūrṇaṃ lihyāddharidrāṃ triphalānvitāṃ vā|
sarpirmadhubhyāṃ vidadhīta vā 'pi śāstrapradeśābhihitāṃśca yogān||
6.44.18| ahrecca doṣān bahuśo 'lpamātrān śvayeddhi doṣeṣvatinirhṛteṣu|
dhātrīphalānāṃ rasamikṣujaṃ ca manthaṃ pibet kṣaudrayutaṃ hitāśī||
6.44.19| ubhe bṛhatyau rajanīṃ śukākhyāṃ kākādanīṃ cāpi sakākamācīm|
ādāribimbīṃ sakadambapuṣpīṃ vipācya sarpirvipacet kaṣāye||
6.44.20| tat pāṇḍutāṃ hantyupayujyamānaṃ kṣīeṇa vā māgadhikā yathāgni|
hitaṃ ca yaṣṭīmadhujaṃ1 kaṣāyaṃ cūrṇaṃ samaṃ vā madhunā 'valihyāt||
6.44.21| gomūtrayuktaṃ triphalādalānāṃ dattvā++āyasaṃ cūrṇamanalpakālam|
pravālamuktāñjanaśaṅkhacūrṇaṃ lihyāttathā kāñcanagairikottham||
6.44.22| ājaṃ śakṛtsyāt1 kuḍavapramāṇaṃ viḍaṃ haridrā lavaṇottamaṃ ca|
pṛthak palāṃśāni samagrametaccūrṇaṃ hitāśī madhunā 'valihyāt||
6.44.23| maṇḍūralohāgniviḍaṅgapathyāvyoṣāṃśakaḥ sarvasamānatāpyaḥ|
1mūtrāsuto 'yaṃ madhunā 'valehaḥ pāṇḍvāmayaṃ hantyacireṇa ghoram||
6.44.24| bibhītakāyomalanāgarāṇāṃ cūrṇaṃ tilānāṃ ca guḍaśca mukhyaḥ|
1takrānupāno vaṭakaḥ prayuktaḥ kṣiṇoti ghorānapi pāṇḍurogān||
6.44.25| sauvarcalaṃ hiṅgu kirātatiktaṃ kalāyamātrāṇi sukhāmbunā vā|
mūrvāharidrāmalakaṃ ca lihyāt sthitaṃ gavāṃ saptadināni mūtre||
6.44.26| mūlaṃ balācitrakayoḥ pibedvā pāṇḍvāmayārto 'kṣasamaṃ hitāśī|
sukhāmbunā vā lavaṇena tulyaṃ śigroḥ phalaṃ kṣīrabhujopayojyam||
6.44.27| nyagrodhavargasya pibet kaṣāyaṃ śītaṃ sitākṣaudrayutaṃ hitāśī|
śālādikaṃ cāpyatha sāracūrṇaṃ dhātrīphalaṃ vā madhunā 'valihyāt||
6.44.28| viḍaṅgamustatriphalājamodaparūṣakavyoṣavinirdahanyaḥ|
cūrṇāni kṛtvā guḍaśarkare ca tathaiva sarpirmadhunī śume ca||
6.44.29| saṃbhārametadvipacennidhāya sārodake sāravato gaṇasya|
jātaṃ ca lehyaṃ matimān viditvā nidhāpayenmokṣakaje samudge||
6.44.30| hantyeṣa lehaḥ khalu pāṇḍurogaṃ saśothamugrāmapi kāmalāṃ ca|
saśarkarā kāmalināṃ tribhaṇḍī hitā gavākṣī saguḍā ca śuṇṭhī||
6.44.31| kāleyake cāpi ghṛtaṃ vipakvaṃ hitaṃ ca tat syādrajanīvimiśram|
dhātuṃ nadījaṃ jatu śailajaṃ vā kumbhāhvaye 1mūtrayutaṃ pibedvā||
6.44.32| mūtre sthitaṃ saindhavasaṃprayuktaṃ māsaṃ pibedvā 'pi hi lohakiṭṭam|
dagdhvā 'kṣakāṣṭhairmalamāyasaṃ vā gomūtranirvāpitamaṣṭavārān||
6.44.33| vicūrṇya līḍhaṃ madhunā 'cireṇa kumbhāhvayaṃ pāṇḍugadaṃ nihanyāt|
sindhūdbhavaṃ vā 'gnisamaṃ ca kṛtvā kṣiptvā ca mūtre sakṛdeva taptam||
6.44.34| lauhaṃ ca kiṭṭaṃ bahuśaśca taptvā nirvāpya mūtre bahuśastathaiva|
ekīkṛtaṃ gojalapiṣṭametadaikadhyamāvāpya pacedukhāyām||
6.44.35| yathā na dahyeta tathā viśuṣkaṃ cūrṇīkṛtaṃ peyamudaśvitā tat|
takraudanāśī vijayeta rogaṃ pāṇḍuṃ tathā dīpayate 'nalaṃ ca||
6.44.36| drākṣāguḍūcyāmalakīrasaiśca siddhaṃ ghṛtaṃ lāgharake(lāghavake) hitaṃ ca|
gauḍānariṣṭān madhuśarkarāśca mūtrāsavān kṣārakṛtāṃstathaiva||
6.44.37| snigdhān rasānāmalakairupetān kolānvitān vā 'pi hi jāṅgalānām|
seveta śophābhihitāṃśca yogān pāṇḍvāmayī śāliyavāṃśca nityam||
6.44.38| śvāsātisārārucikāsamūrcchātṛṭchardiśūlajvaraśophadāhān|
tathā 'vipākasvaramedasādān jayedyathāsvaṃ prasamīkṣya śāstram||
6.44.39| anteṣu śūnaṃ parihīnamadhyaṃ mlānaṃ tathā 'nteṣu ca madhyaśūnam|
gude ca śephasyatha muṣkaśūnaṃ1 pratāmyamānaṃ ca visaṃjñakalpam||
6.44.40| vivarjayet pāṇḍukinaṃ yaśo 'rthī tathā 'tisārajvarapīḍitaṃ ca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre pāṇḍurogapratiṣedho nāma (ṣaṣṭho 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) catuścatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|44||

pañcacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.45.1| athāto raktapittapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.45.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.45.3| krodhaśokabhayāyāsaviruddhānnātapānalān|
kaṭvamlalabaṇakṣāratīkṣṇoṣṇātividāhinaḥ||
6.45.4| nityamabhyasato duṣṭo rasaḥ pittaṃ prakopayet|
vidagdhaṃ svaguṇaiḥ pittaṃ vidahatyāśu śoṇitam||
6.45.5| tataḥ pravartate raktamūrdhvaṃ cādho dvidhā 'pi vā|
āmāśayādvrajedūrdhvamadhaḥ pakvāśayādvrajet||
6.45.6| 1vidagdhayordvayoścāpi dvidhābhāgaṃ1 pravartate|
kecit sayakṛtaḥ plīhnaḥ pravadantyasṛjo gatim||
6.45.7| ūrdhvaṃ sādhyamadhoyāpyamasādhyaṃ yugapadgatam1|
sadanaṃ śītakāmitvaṃ kaṇṭhadhūmāyanaṃ vamiḥ||
6.45.8| lohagandhiśca niḥśvāso bhavatyasmin bhaviṣyati|
bāhyāsṛglakṣaṇaistasya saṅkhyādoṣocchritīrviduḥ||
6.45.9| daurbalyaśvāsakāsajvaravamathumadāstandritādāhamūrcchā bhukte cānne vidāhastvadhṛtirapi sadā hṛdyatulyā ca pīḍā|
tṛṣṇā kaṇṭhasya bhedaḥ śirasi ca 1davanaṃ pūtiniṣṭhīvanaṃ ca dveṣo bhakte 'vipāko viratirapi rate raktapittopasargāḥ||
6.45.10| māṃsaprakṣālanābhaṃ kvathitamiva ca yat kardamāmbhonibhaṃ vā medaḥpūyāsrakalpaṃ1 yakṛdiva yadi vā pakvajambūphalābham|
yat kṛṣṇaṃ yacca nīlaṃ bhṛśamatikuṇapaṃ yatra coktā vikārāstadvarjyaṃ raktapittaṃ surapatidhanuṣā yacca tulyaṃ vibhāti||
6.45.11| nādau saṃgrāhyamudriktaṃ yadasṛgbalino 'śnataḥ|
tat pāṇḍugrahaṇīkuṣṭhaplīhagulmajvarāvaham||
6.45.12| adhaḥpravṛttaṃ vamanairūrdhvagaṃ ca virecanaiḥ|
jayedanyataradvā 'pi kṣīṇasya śamanairasṛk||
6.45.13| atipravṛddhadoṣasya pūrvaṃ lohitapittinaḥ|
akṣīṇabalamāṃsāgneḥ kartavyamapatarpaṇam||
6.45.14| laṅghitasya tataḥ peyāṃ vidadhyāt svalpataṇḍulām|
rasayūṣau pradātavyau surabhisnehasaṃskṛtau|
tarpaṇaṃ pācanaṃ lehān sarpīṣi vividhāni ca||
6.45.15| drākṣāmadhukakāśmaryasitāyuktaṃ virecanam|
yaṣṭīmadhukayuktaṃ ca sakṣaudraṃ vamanaṃ hitam||
6.45.16| payāṃsi śītāni rasāśca jāṅgalāḥ satīnayūṣāśca saśāliṣaṣṭikāḥ|
paṭolaśelūsuniṣaṇṇayūthikāvaṭātimuktāṅkurasinduvārajam||
6.45.17| hitaṃ ca śākaṃ ghṛtasaṃskṛtaṃ sadā tathaiva dhātrīphaladāḍimānvitam|
rasāśca pārāvataśaṅkhakūrmajāstathā yavāgvo vihitā ghṛtottarāḥ||
6.45.18| santānikāścotpalavargasādhite kṣīre praśastā madhuśarkarottarāḥ|
himāḥ pradehā madhurā gaṇāśca ye ghṛtāni pathyāni ca raktapittinām||
6.45.19| madhūkaśobhāñjanakovidārajaiḥ priyaṅgukāyāḥ kusumaiśca cūrṇitaiḥ|
bhiṣagvidadhyāccaturaḥ samākṣikān hitāya lehānasṛjaḥ praśāntaye||
6.45.20| lihyācca dūrvāvaṭajāṃśca pallavān madhudvitīyān sitakarṇikasya1 ca|
hitaṃ ca kharjūraphalaṃ samākṣikaṃ phalāni cānyānyapi tadguṇānyatha||
6.45.21| raktātisāraproktāṃśca yogānatrāpi yojayet|
śuddhekṣukāṇḍamāpothya nave kumbhe himāmbhasā||
6.45.22| yojayitvā kṣipedrātrāvākāśe sotpalaṃ tu tat|
prātaḥ srutaṃ kṣaudrayutaṃ pibecchoṇitapittavān||
6.45.23| pibecchītakaṣāyaṃ vā jambvāmrārjunasaṃbhavam|
udumbaraphalaṃ piṣṭvā pibettadrasameva vā||
6.45.24| trapuṣīmūlakalkaṃ vā sakṣaudraṃ taṇḍulāmbunā|
pibedakṣasamaṃ kalkaṃ yaṣṭīmadhukameva vā||
6.45.25| candnaṃ madhukaṃ rodhramevameva samaṃ pibet|
karañjabījamevaṃ vā sitākṣaudrayutaṃ pibet||
6.45.26| majjānamiṅgudasyaivaṃ pibenmadhukasaṃyutam|
sukhoṣṇaṃ lavaṇaṃ bījaṃ kārañjaṃ dadhimastunā||
6.45.27| pibedvā 'pi tryahaṃ martyo raktapittābhipīḍitaḥ|
raktapittaharāḥ śastāḥ ṣaḍete yogasattamāḥ||
6.45.28| pathyāścaivāvapīḍeṣu ghrāṇataḥ prasrute 'sṛji|
atinisrutarakto vā kṣaudrayuktaṃ pibedasṛk|
yakṛdvā bhakṣayedājamāmaṃ pittasamāyutam||
6.45.29| palāśavṛkṣasvarase vipakvaṃ sarpiḥ pibet kṣaudrayutaṃ suśītam|
vanaspatīnāṃ svarasaiḥ kṛtaṃ vā saśarkaraṃ kṣīraghṛtaṃ pibedvā||
6.45.30| drākṣāmuśīrāṇyatha padmakaṃ sitā pṛthakpalāṃśānyudake samāvapet|
sthitaṃ niśāṃ tadrudhirāmayaṃ jayet pītaṃ payo vā 'mbusamaṃ hitāśinaḥ||
6.45.31| turaṅgavarcaḥsvarasaṃ samākṣikaṃ pibet sitākṣaudrayutaṃ vṛṣasya vā|
lihettathā vāstukabījacūrṇaṃ kṣaudrānvitaṃ taṇḍulasāhvayaṃ vā||
6.45.32| lihyācca lājāñjanacūrṇamekamevaṃ sitākṣaudrayutāṃ tugākhyām|
drākṣāṃ sitāṃ tiktakarohiṇīṃ ca himāmbunā vā madhukena yuktām||
6.45.33| pathyāmahiṃsrāṃ rajanīṃ ghṛtaṃ ca lihyāttathā śoṇitapittarogī|
vāsākaṣāyotpalamṛtpriyaṅgurodhrāñjanāmbhoruhakeśarāṇi||
6.45.34| pītvā sitākṣaudrayutāni jahyāt pittasṛjo vegamudīrṇamāśu|
gāyatrijambvarjunakovidāraśirīṣarodhrāśanaśālmalīnām||
6.45.35| puṣpāṇi śigrośca vicūrṇya leho madhvanvitaḥ śoṇitapittaroge|
sakṣaudramindīvarabhasmavāri karañjabījaṃ 1madhusarpiṣī ca||
6.45.36| jambvarjunāmrakvathitaṃ ca toyaṃ ghnanti trayaḥ pittamasṛk ca yogāḥ|
mūlāni puṣpāṇi ca mātuluṅgyāḥ piṣṭvā pibettaṇḍuladhāvanena||
6.45.37| ghrāṇapravṛtte jalamāśu deyaṃ saśarkaraṃ nāsikayā payo vā|
drākṣārasaṃ kṣīraghṛtaṃ pibedvā saśarkaraṃ cekṣurasaṃ himaṃ vā||
6.45.38| śītopacāraṃ madhuraṃ ca kuryādviśeṣataḥ śoṇitapittaroge|
drākṣāghṛtakṣaudrasitāyutena vidārigandhādivipācitena||
6.45.39| kṣīreṇa cāsthāpanamagryamuktaṃ hitaṃ ghṛtaṃ cāpyanuvāsanārtham|
priyaṅgurodhrāñjanagairikotpalaiḥ suvarṇakālīyakaraktacandanaiḥ||
6.45.40| sitāśvagandhāmbudayaṣṭikāhvayairmṛṇālasaugandhikatulyapeṣitaiḥ|
nirūhya cainaṃ payasā samākṣikairghṛtaplutaiḥ śītajalāvasecitam||
6.45.41| kṣīraudanaṃ bhuktamathānuvāsayedghṛtena yaṣṭīmadhusādhitena ca|
adhovahaṃ śoṇitameṣa nāśayettathā 'tisāraṃ rudhirasya dustaram||
6.45.42| virekayoge tvati caiva śasyate vāmyaśca rakte vijite balānvitaḥ||
6.45.43| evaṃvidhā uttarabāstayaśca mūtrāśayasthe rudhire vidheyāḥ|
pravṛttarakteṣu ca pāyujeṣu kuryādvidhānaṃ khalu raktapaittam||
6.45.44| vidhiścāsṛgdare 'pyeṣa strīṇāṃ kāryo vijānatā|
śastrakarmaṇi raktaṃ ca yasyātīva pravartate||
6.45.45| trayāṇāmapi doṣāṇāṃ śoṇite 'pi ca sarvaśaḥ|
liṅgānyālokya kartavyaṃ cikitsitamanantaram||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre raktapittapratiṣedho nāma (saptamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) pañcacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||45||

ṣaṭcatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.46.1| athāto mūrcchāpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.46.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.46.3| kṣīṇasya bahudoṣasya viruddhāhārasevinaḥ|
vegāghātādabhīghātāddhīnasattvasya vā punaḥ||
6.46.4| karaṇāyataneṣūgrā bāhyeṣvābhyantareṣu ca|
niviśante yadā doṣāstadā mūrcchanti mānavāḥ||
6.46.5| hṛtpīḍā jṛmbhaṇaṃ glāniḥ saṃjñānāśo balasya ca|
sarvāsāṃ pūrvarūpāṇi 1yathāsvaṃ tā vibhāvayet||
6.46.6| saṃjñāvahāsu nāḍīṣu pihitāsvanilādibhiḥ|
tamo 'bhyupaiti sahasā sukhaduḥkhavyapohakṛt||
6.46.7| sukhaduḥkhavyapohācca naraḥ patati kāṣṭhavat|
moho mūrccheti tāṃ prāhuḥ ṣaḍvidhā sā prakīrtitā||
6.46.8| vātādibhiḥ śoṇitena madyena ca viṣeṇa ca|
ṣaṭsvapyetāsu1 pittaṃ hi prabhutvenāvatiṣṭhate||
6.46.9| apasmāroktaliṅgāni tāsāmuktāni tattvataḥ|
pṛthivyambhastamorūpaṃ raktagandhaśca1 tanmayaḥ||
6.46.10| tasmādraktasya gandhena mūrcchanti bhuvi mānavāḥ|
dravyasvabhāva ityeke sthitāstu viṣamadyayoḥ||
6.46.11| guṇāstīvrataratvena1 sthitāstu viṣamadyayoḥ|
ta eva tasmājjāyeta mohastābhyāṃ yatheritaḥ||
6.46.12| madyena vilapaṃśchete naṣṭavibhrāntamānasaḥ|
gātrāṇi vikṣipan bhūmau jarāṃ yāvanna yāti tat||
6.46.13| vepathusvapnatṛṣṇāḥ syuḥ stambhaśca viṣamūrcchite|
veditavyaṃ tīvrataraṃ yathāsvaṃ viṣalakṣaṇaiḥ||
6.46.14| sekāvagāhau maṇayaḥ sahārāḥ śītāḥ pradehā vyajanānilāśca|
śītāni pānāni ca gandhavanti sarvāsu mūrcchāsvanivāritāni||
6.46.15| sitāpriyālekṣurasaplutāni drākṣāmadhūkasvarasānvitāni|
kharjūrakāśmaryarasaiḥ śṛtāni pānāni sarpīṃṣi ca jīvanāni||
6.46.16| siddhāni varge madhure payāṃsi sadāḍimā jāṅgalajā rasāśca|
tathā yavā lohitaśālayaśca mūrcchāsu pathyāśca sadā satīnāḥ||
6.46.17| bhujaṅgapuṣpaṃ maricānyuśīraṃ kolasya madhyaṃ ca pibet samāni|
śītena toyena1 bisaṃ mṛṇālaṃ kṣaudreṇa kṛṣṇāṃ sitayā ca pathyām||
6.46.18| kuryācca nāsāvadanāvarodhaṃ kṣīraṃ pibedvā 'pyatha mānuṣīṇām|
mūrcchāṃ prasaktāṃ tu śirovirekairjayedabhīkṣṇaṃ vamanaiśca tīkṣṇaiḥ||
6.46.19| 1harītakīkvāthaśṛtaṃ ghṛtaṃ vā dhātrīphalānāṃ svarasaiḥ kṛtaṃ vā|
drākṣāsitādāḍimalājavanti śītāni nīlotpalapadmavanti||
6.46.20| pibet kaṣāyāṇi ca gandhavanti pittajvaraṃ yāni śamaṃ nayanti|
prabhūtadoṣastamaso 'tirekāt saṃmūrcchito naiva vibudhyate yaḥ||
6.46.21| saṃnyastasaṃjño bhṛśaduścikitsyo jñeyastadā buddhimatā manuṣyāḥ|
yathā++āmaloṣṭaṃ salile niṣiktaṃ samuddheredāśvavilīnameva||
6.46.22| tadvaccikitsettvarayā bhiṣaktamasvedanaṃ mṛtyuvaśaṃ prayātam|
tīkṣṇāñjanābhyañjanadhūmayogaistathā nakhābhyantaratotrapātaiḥ||
6.46.23| vāditragītānunayairapūrvairvighaṭṭanairguptaphalāvagharṣaiḥ|
ābhiḥ kriyābhiśca na labdhasaṃjñaḥ sānāhalālāśvasanaśca varjyaḥ||
6.46.24| prabuddhasaṃjñaṃ vamanānulomyaistīkṣṇairviśuddhaṃ laghupathyabhuktam|
phalatrikaiścitrakanāgarāḍhyaistathā 'śmajātājjatunaḥ prayogaiḥ|
saśarkarairmāsamupakrameta viśeṣato jīrṇaghṛtaṃ sa pāyyaḥ||
6.46.25| yathāsvaṃ ca jvaraghnāni kaṣāyāṇyupayojayet|
sarvamūrcchāparītānāṃ viṣajāyāṃ viṣāpaham||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre mūrcchāpratiṣedho nāma (aṣṭamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ṣaṭcatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||46||

saptacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.47.1| athātaḥ pānātyayapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.47.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.47.3| madyamuṣṇaṃ tathā tīkṣṇaṃ sūkṣmaṃ viśadameva ca|
rūkṣamāśukaraṃ caiva vyavāyi ca vikāśi ca||
6.47.4| auṣṇyācchītopacāraṃ tattaikṣṇyāddhanti manogatim|
viśatyavayavān saukṣmyādvaiśadyātkaphaśukranut||
6.47.5| mārutaṃ kopayedraukṣyādāśutvāccāśukarmakṛt1|
harṣadaṃ ca vyavāyitvādvikāśitvādvisarpati||
6.47.6| tadamlaṃ rasataḥ proktaṃ laghu rocanadīpanam|
kecillavaṇavarjyāṃstu rasānatrādiśanti hi||
6.47.7| snigdhaistadannairmāṃsaiśca bhakṣyaiśca saha sevitam|
bhavedāyuḥprakarṣāya balāyopacayāya ca||
6.47.8| kāmyatā manasastuṣṭirdhairyaṃ tejo 'tivikramaḥ|
vidhivat sevyamāne tu madye sannihitā guṇāḥ||
6.47.9| tadevānannamajñena sevyamānamamātrayā|
kayāgninā hyagnisamaṃ sametya kurute madam||
6.47.10| madena karaṇānāṃ tu bhāvānyatve kṛte sati|
nigūḍhamapi bhāvaṃ svaṃ prakāśīkurute 'vaśaḥ||
6.47.11| tryavasthaśca mado jñeyaḥ pūrvo madhyo 'tha paścimaḥ|
pūrve vīryaratiprītiharṣabhāṣyādivardhanam||
6.47.12| pralāpo madhyame 1moho yuktāyuktakriyāstathā|
visaṃjñaḥ paścime śete naṣṭakarmakriyāguṇaḥ||
6.47.13| ślaiṣmikānalpapittāṃśca snigdhānmātropasevinaḥ1|
pānaṃ na bādhate 'tyarthaṃ viparītāṃstu bādhate||
6.47.14| nirbhaktamekāntata eva madyaṃ niṣevyamāṇaṃ manujena nityam|
utpādayet kaṣṭatamān vikārānāpādayeccāpi śarīrabhedam||
6.47.15| kruddhena bhītena pipāsitena śokābhitaptena bubhukṣitena|
vyāyāmabhārādhvaparikṣatena vegāvarodhābhihatena cāpi||
6.47.16| atyamlabhakṣyāvatatodareṇa sājīrṇabhuktena tathā 'balena|
uṣṇābhitaptena ca sevyamānaṃ karoti madyaṃ vividhān vikārān||
6.47.17| pānātyayaṃ paramadaṃ pānājīrṇamathāpi vā|
pānavibhramamugraṃ ca teṣāṃ vakṣyāmi lakṣaṇam||
6.47.18| stambhāṅgamardhṛdayagrahatodakampāḥ pānātyaye 'nilakṛte śiraso rujaśca|
svedapralāpamukhaśoṣaṇadāhamūrcchāḥ pittātmake vadanalocanapītatā ca||
6.47.19| śleṣmātmake vamathuśītakaphaprasekāḥ sarvātmake bhavati sarvavikārasaṃpat|
ūṣmāṇamaṅgagurutāṃ virasānanatvaṃ śleṣmādhikatvamaruciṃ malamūtrasaṅgam||
6.47.20| liṅgaṃ parasya tu madasya vadanti tajjñāstṛṣṇāṃ rujāṃ śirasi sandhiṣu cāpi bhedam|
ādhmānamudgiraṇamamlaraso vidāho 'jīrṇasya pānajanitasya vadanti liṅgam||
6.47.21| jñeyāni tatra bhiṣajā suviniścitāni pittaprakopajanitāni ca kāraṇāni|
hṛdgātratodavamathujvarakaṇṭhadhūmamūrcchākaphasravaṇamūrdharujo vidāhaḥ||
6.47.22| dveṣaḥ surānnavikṛteṣu ca teṣu teṣu taṃ pānavibhramamuśantyakhilena dhīrāḥ|
hīnottarauṣṭhamatiśītamamandadāhaṃ tailaprabhāsyamatipānahataṃ(tailaprabhāsyamapipānahataṃ) vijahyāt||
6.47.23| jihvauṣṭhadantamasitaṃ tvathavā 'pi nīlaṃ pīte ca yasya nayane rudhiraprame ca|
hikkājvarau vamathuvepathupārśvaśūlāḥ kāsabhramāvapi ca pānahataṃ bhajante||
6.47.24| teṣāṃ nivāraṇamidaṃ hi mayocyamānaṃ vyaktābhidhānamakhilena vidhiṃ nibodha|
madyaṃ tu cukramaricārdrakadīpyakuṣṭhasauvarcalāyutamalaṃ1 pavanasya śāntyai||
6.47.25| pṛthvīkadīpyakamahauṣadhahiṅgubhirvā sauvarcalena ca yutaṃ vitaret sukhāya|
āmrātakāmraphaladāḍimamātuluṅgaiḥ kuryācchubhānyapi ca ṣaḍavapānakāni||
6.47.26| seveta vā phalarasopahitān rasādīnānūpavargapiśitānyapi gandhavanti|
pittātmake madhuravargakaṣāyamiśraṃ madyaṃ hitaṃ samadhuśarkaramiṣṭagandham||
6.47.27| pītvā ca madyamapi cekṣurasapragāḍhaṃ niḥśeṣataḥ kṣaṇamavasthitamullikhecca|
lāvaiṇatittirirasāṃśca pibedanamlān maudgān sukhāya saghṛtān sasitāṃśca yūṣān||
6.47.28| pānātyaye kaphakṛte kaphamullikhecca madyena bimbividulodakasaṃyutena|
seveta tiktakaṭukāṃśca rasānudārān yūṣāṃśca tiktakaṭukopahitān hitāya||
6.47.29| pathyaṃ yavānnavikṛtāni ca jāṅgalāni śleṣmaghnamanyadapi yacca niratyayaṃ syāt|
kuryācca sarvamatha sarvabhave vidhānaṃ ddvandvodbhave dvayamavekṣya yathāpradhānam||
6.47.30| sāmānyamanyadapi yacca samagramagryaṃ vakṣyāmi yacca manaso madakṛt sukhaṃ ca|
tvaṅgāgapuṣpamagadhailamadhūkadhānyaiḥ ślakṣṇairajājimaricaiśca kṛtaṃ samāṃśaiḥ||
6.47.31| pānaṃ kapittharasavāriparūṣakāḍhyaṃ pānātyayeṣu vidhivatsrutamambarānte|
hrīverapadmaparipelavasaṃprayuktaiḥ puṣpairvilipya karavīrajalodbhavaiśca||
6.47.32| piṣṭaiḥ sapadmakayutairapi sārivādyaiḥ sekaṃ jalaiśca vitaredamalaiḥ suśītaiḥ|
tvakpatracocamaricailabhujaṅgapuṣpaśleṣmātakaprasavavalkaguḍairupetam||
6.47.33| drākṣāyutaṃ hṛtamalaṃ madirāmayārtaistatpānakaṃ śuci sugandhi narairniṣevyam|
piṣṭvā pibecca madhukaṃ kaṭurohiṇīṃ ca drākṣāṃ ca mūlamasakṛt trapuṣībhavaṃ yat||
6.47.34| 1kārpāsinīmatha ca nāgabalāṃ ca tulyāṃ pītvā sukhī bhavati sādhu suvarcalāṃ ca|
kāśmaryadāruviḍadāḍimapippalīṣu drākṣānvitāsu kṛtamambuni pānakaṃ yat||
6.47.35| tadbījapūrakarasāyutamāśu pītaṃ śāntiṃ parāṃ paramade tvacirāt karoti|
drākṣāsitāmadhukajīrakadhānyakṛṣṇāsvevaṃ kṛtaṃ trivṛtayā ca pibettathaiva||
6.47.36| sauvarcalāyutamudārarasaṃ phalāmlaṃ bhārgīśṛtena ca jalena hito 'vasekaḥ||
6.47.37| ikṣvākudhāmārgavavṛkṣakāṇi kākāhvayodumbarikāśca dugdhe|
vipācya tasyāñjalinā vameddhi madyaṃ pibeccāhni gate tvajīrṇe||
6.47.38| tvakpippalībhujagapuṣpaviḍairupetaṃ seveta hiṅgumaricailayutaṃ phalāmlām|
uṣṇāmbusaindhavayutāstvathavā viḍatvakcavyailahiṅgumagadhāphalamūlaśuṇṭhīḥ||
6.47.39| hṛdyaiḥ khaḍairapi ca bhojanamatra śastaṃ drākṣākapitthaphaladāḍimapānakaṃ yat|
tat pānavibhramaharaṃ madhuśarkarāḍhyamāmrātakolarasapānakameva cāpi||
6.47.40| kharjūravetrakakarīraparūṣakeṣu1 drākṣātrivṛtsu ca kṛtaṃ sasitaṃ himaṃ vā|
śrīparṇiyuktamathavā tu pibedimāni yaṣṭyāhvayotpalahimāmbuvimiśritāni||
6.47.41| kṣīripravālabisajīrakanāgapuṣpapatrailavālusitasārivapadmakāni|
āmrātabhavyakaramardakapitthakolavṛkṣāmlavetraphalajīrakadāḍimāni||
6.47.42| seveta vā maricajīrakanāgapuṣpatvakpatraviśvacavikailayutān rasāṃśca|
sūkṣmāmbarasrutahimāṃca sugandhigandhān pānodbhavānnudati saptagadānaśeṣān||
6.47.43| pañcendriyārthaviṣayā mṛdupānayogā hṛdyāḥ sukhāśca manasaḥ satataṃ niṣevyāḥ1|
pānātyayeṣu vikaṭorunitambavatyaḥ pīnonnatastanabharānatamadhyadeśāḥ||
6.47.44| prauḍhāḥ striyo 'bhinavayauvanapīnagātryaḥ sevyāśca pañcaviṣayātiśayasvabhāvāḥ||
6.47.45| pibedrasaṃ puṣpaphalodbhavaṃ vā sitāmadhūkatrisugandhiyuktam|
saṃcūrṇya saṃyojya ca nāgapuṣpairajājikṛṣṇāmaricaiśca tulyaiḥ||
6.47.46| varṣābhūyaṣṭyāhvamadhūkalākṣātvakkarbudārāṅkurajīrakāṇi|
drākṣāṃ ca kṛṣṇāmatha keśaraṃ ca kṣīre samāloḍya pibet 1sukhepsuḥ||
6.47.47| bhavecca madyena tu yena pātitaḥ prakāmapītena surāsavādinā|
tadeva tasmai vidhivat pradāpayedviparyaye bhraṃśamavaśyamṛcchati1||
6.47.48| yathā narendropahatasya kasyacidbhavet prasādastata eva nānyataḥ|
dhruvaṃ tathā madyahatasya dehino bhavet prasādastata eva nānyataḥ||
6.47.49| vicchinnamadyaḥ sahasā yo 'timadyaṃ viṣevate|
tasya pānātyayoddiṣṭā vikārāḥ saṃbhavanti hi||
6.47.50| madyasyāgneyavāyavyau guṇāvambuvahāni(guṇāvambhovahāni) tu|
srotāṃsi śoṣayeyātāṃ tena tṛṣṇopajāyate||
6.47.51| pāṭalotpalakandeṣu mudgaparṇyāṃ ca sādhitam|
pibenmāgadhikonmiśraṃ tatrāmbho himaśītalam||
6.47.52| sarpistailavasāmajjadadhibhṛṅgarasairyutam|
kvāthena bilvayavayoḥ sarvagandhaiśca peṣitaiḥ||
6.47.53| pakvamabhyañjane śreṣṭhaṃ seke kvāthaśca śītalaḥ|
rasavanti ca bhojyāni yathāsvamavacārayet||
6.47.54| pānakāni suśītāni hṛdyāni surabhīṇi ca|
tvacaṃ prāptastu pānoṣmā pittaraktābhimūrcchitaḥ|
dāhaṃ prakurute ghoraṃ pittavattatra bheṣajam||
6.47.55| śītaṃ vidhānamata ūrdhvamahaṃ pravakṣye dāhapraśāntikaramṛddhimatāṃ narāṇām|
tatrādito malayajena hitaḥ pradehaścandrāṃśuhāratuhinodakaśītalena||
6.47.56| śītāmbuśītalataraiśca śayānamenaṃ1 hārairmṛṇālavalayairabalāḥ spṛśeyuḥ|
bhinnotpalojjvalahime śayane śayīta patreṣu vā sajalabinduṣu padminīnām||
6.47.57| āsādayan pavanamāhṛtamaṅganābhiḥ1 kahlārapadmadalaśaivalasaṃcayeṣu|
1kāntairvanāntapavanaiḥ parimṛśyamānaḥ 1śaktaścaredbhavanakānanadīrghikāsu||
6.47.58| dāhābhibhūtamathavā pariṣecayettu1 lāmajjakāmburuhacandanatoyatoyaiḥ1|
visrāvitāṃ hṛtamalāṃ navavāripūrṇāṃ padmotpalākulajalāmadhivāsitāmbum1||
6.47.59| vāpīṃ bhajeta haricandanabhūṣitāṅgaḥ kāntākaraspṛśanakarkaśaromakūpaḥ|
tatrainamamburuhapatrasamaiḥ spṛśantyaḥ śītaiḥ karoruvadanaiḥ kaṭhinaiḥ stanaiśca||
6.47.60| toyāvagāhakuśalā madhurasvabhāvāḥ saṃharṣayeyurabalāḥ sukalaiḥ1 pralāpaiḥ|
dhārāgṛhe pragalitodakadurdinābhe klāntaḥ śayīta salilānilaśītakukṣau||
6.47.61| gandhodakaiḥ sakusumairupasiktabhūmau patrāmbucandanarasairupaliptakuḍye|
jātyutpalapriyakakeśarapuṇḍarīkapunnāganāgakaravīrakṛtopacāre1||
6.47.62| tasmin gṛhe kamalareṇvaruṇe śayīta yatnāhṛtānilavikampitapuṣpadāmni|
hemantavindhyahimavanmalayācalānāṃ śītāmbhasāṃ sakadalīharitadrumāṇām||
6.47.63| udbhinnanīlanalināmburuhākarāṇāṃ candrodayasya ca kathāḥ śṛṇuyānmanojñāḥ|
mlānaṃ pratāntamanasaṃ manaso 'nukūlāḥ pīnastanorujaghanā haricandanāṅgyaḥ1||
6.47.64| tā enamārdravasanāḥ saha saṃviśeyuḥ śliṣṭvā 'valāḥ śithilamekhalahārayaṣṭyaḥ||
6.47.65| harṣayeyurnaraṃ nāryaḥ svaguṇai rahasi sthitāḥ|
tāḥ śaityācchamayeyuśca pittapānātyayāntaram1||
6.47.66| 1tṛḍdāharaktapitteṣu kāryo 'yaṃ bheṣajakramaḥ|
sāmānyato viśeṣaṃ tu śṛṇu dāheṣvaśeṣataḥ||
6.47.67| kṛtsnadehānugaṃ 1raktamudriktaṃ dahati hyati|
saṃcūṣyate dahyate ca tāmrābhastāmralocanaḥ||
6.47.68| lohagandhāṅgavadano vahninevāvakīryate|
taṃ vilaṅghya vidhānena saṃsṛṣṭāhāramācaret||
6.47.69| apraśāmyati dāhe ca rasaistṛptasya jāṅgalaiḥ|
śākhāśrayā yathānyāyaṃ rohiṇīrvyadhayet sirāḥ||
6.47.70| pittajvarasamaḥ pittāt sa cāpyasya vidhirhitaḥ|
tṛṣṇānirodhādabdhātau kṣīṇe tejaḥ 1samuddhatam||
6.47.71| sabāhyābhyantaraṃ dehaṃ dahedvai mandacetasaḥ|
saṃśuṣkagalatālvoṣṭho jihvāṃ niṣkṛṣya ceṣṭate1||
6.47.72| tatropaśamayettejastvabdhātuṃ ca vivardhayet|
pāyayet kāmamambhaśca1 śarkarāḍhyaṃ payo 'pi vā||
6.47.73| śītamikṣurasaṃ manthaṃ 1vitarecceritaṃ vidhim|
asṛjā pūrṇakoṣṭhasya dāho 1bhavati duḥsahaḥ||
6.47.74| vidhiḥ sadyovraṇīyoktastasya lakṣaṇameva ca|
dhātukṣayokto yo dāhastena mūrcchātṛṣānvitaḥ||
6.47.75| kṣāmasvaraḥ kriyāhīno 1bhṛśaṃ sīdati pīḍitaḥ|
raktapittavidhistasya hitaḥ snigdho 'nilāpahaḥ||
6.47.76| kṣatajenāśnataścānyaḥ śocato vā 'pyanekadhā|
tenāntardahyate 'tyarthaṃ tṛṣṇāmūrcchāpralāpavān||
6.47.77| tamiṣṭaviṣayopetaṃ suhṛdbhirabhisaṃvṛtam|
kṣīramāṃsarasāhāraṃ vidhinoktena sādhayet||
6.47.78| marmābhighātajo 'pyasti sa1 cāsādhyatamaḥ smṛtaḥ|
sarva eva ca varjyāḥ syuḥ śītagātreṣu dehiṣu||
6.47.79| (evaṃvidho bhavedyastu madirāmayapīḍitaḥ1|)
praśāntopadrave cāpi śodhanaṃ prāptamācaret||
6.47.80| sajīrakāṇyārdrakaśṛṅgaverasauvarcalānyardhajalaplutāni|
madyāni hṛdyānyatha gandhavanti pītāni sadyaḥ śamayanti tṛṣṇām||
6.47.81| jalaplutaścandanabhūṣitāṅgaḥ sragvī sabhaktāṃ piśitopadaṃśām|
piben surāṃ naiva labheta rogān 1manonuvighnaṃ ca madaṃ na yāti||
iti suśrutasṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre madātyayapratiṣedho nāma (navamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) saptacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||47||

aṣṭacatvāriṃśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.48.1| athātastṛṣṇāpratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.48.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.48.3| satataṃ yaḥ pibedvāri na tṛptimadhigacchati|
punaḥ kāṅkṣati toyaṃ ca taṃ tṛṣṇārditamādiśet||
6.48.4| 1sakṣobhaśokaśramamadyapānādrūkṣāmlaśuṣkoṣṇakaṭūpayogāt1|
dhātukṣayāllaṅghanasūryatāpāt pittaṃ ca vātaśca bhṛśaṃ pravṛddhau||
6.48.5| srotāṃsi saṃdūṣayataḥ sametau yānyambuvāhīni śarīriṇāṃ hi|
srotaḥsvapāṃvāhiṣu dūṣiteṣu jāyeta tṛṣṇā 'tibalā1 tatastu||
6.48.6| tisraḥ smṛtāstāḥ kṣatajā caturthī kṣayāttathā 'nyā++āmasamudbhavā ca|
syāt saptamī bhaktanimittajā tu nibodha1 liṅgānyanupūrvaśastu||
6.48.7| tālvoṣṭhakaṇṭhāsyaviśoṣadāhāḥ1 saṃtāpamohabhramavipralāpāḥ|
pūrvāṇi rūpāṇi bhavanti tāsāmutpattikāleṣu viśeṣatastu||
6.48.8| śuṣkāsyatā mārutasaṃbhavāyāṃ todastathā 1śaṅkhaśiraḥsu cāpi|
srotonirodho virasaṃ ca vaktraṃ śītabhiradbhiśca vivṛddhimeti||
6.48.9| mūrcchāpralāpārucivaktraśoṣāḥ pītekṣaṇatvaṃ pratataśca dāhaḥ|
śītābhikāṅkṣā mukhatiktatā ca pittātmikāyāṃ paridhūpanaṃ ca||
6.48.10| kaphāvṛtābhyāmanilānalābhyāṃ kapho 'pi śuṣkaḥ prakaroti tṛṣṇām1|
nidrā gurutvaṃ madhurāsyatā ca tayā 'rditaḥ1 śuṣyati cātimātram||
6.48.11| kaṇṭhopalepo mukhapicchilatvaṃ śītajvaraśchardirarocakaśca|
kaphātmikāyāṃ gurugātratā ca śākhāsu śophastvavipāka eva|
etāni rūpāṇi bhavanti tasyāṃ tayā 'rditaḥ kāṅkṣati nāti cāmbhaḥ||
6.48.12| kṣatasya rukśoṇitanirgamābhyāṃ tṛṣṇā caturthī kṣatajā 1matā tu|
tayā 'bhibhūtasya niśādināni gacchanti duḥkhaṃ pibato 'pi toyam||
6.48.13| 1rasakṣayādyā kṣayajā matā sā tayā 'rditaḥ śuṣyati dahyate ca|
atyarthamākāṅkṣati cāpi toyaṃ tāṃ sannipātāditi kecidāhuḥ||
6.48.14| rasakṣayoktāni ca lakṣaṇāni tasyāmaśeṣeṇa bhiṣagvyavasyet|
tridoṣaliṅgā++āmasamudbhavā ca hṛcchūlaniṣṭhīvanasādayuktā||
6.48.15| snigdhaṃ tathā 'mlaṃ lavaṇaṃ ca bhuktaṃ 1gurvannamevātitṛṣāṃ karoti|
kṣīṇaṃ vicittaṃ badhiraṃ tṛṣārtaṃ vivarjayennirgatajihvamāśu||
6.48.16| tṛṣṇābhivṛddhāvudare ca pūrṇe taṃ vāmayenmāgadhikodakena|
1vilobhanaṃ cātra hitaṃ vidheyaṃ syāddāḍimāmrātakamātuluṅgaiḥ||
6.48.17| tisraḥ prayogairiha sannivāryāḥ śītaiśca samyagrasavīryajātaiḥ|
gaṇḍūṣamamlairvirase ca vaktre kuryācchubhairāmalakasya cūrṇaiḥ||
6.48.18| suvarṇarūpyādibhiragnitaptairloṣṭaiḥ kṛtaṃ vā sikatādibhirvā1|
jalaṃ sukhoṣṇaṃ śamayettu tṛṣṇāṃ saśarkaraṃ kṣaudrayutaṃ himaṃ vā||
6.48.19| pañcāṅgikāḥ pañcagaṇā ya uktāsteṣvambu1 siddhaṃ prathame gaṇe vā|
pibet sukhoṣṇaṃ manujo1 'cireṇa tṛṣo vimucyeta hi vātajāyāḥ||
6.48.20| pittaghnavargaistu kṛtaḥ kaṣāyaḥ saśarkaraḥ kṣaudrayutaḥ suśītaḥ|
pītastṛṣāṃ pittakṛtāṃ nihanti kṣīraṃ śṛtaṃ vā 'pyatha jīvanīyaiḥ||
6.48.21| bilvāḍhakīkanyakapañcamūlīdarbheṣu1 siddhaṃ kaphajāṃ nihanti|
hitaṃ bhavecchardanameva cātra taptena nimbaprasavodakena||
6.48.22| sarvāsu tṛṣṇāsvathavā 'pi paittaṃ kuryādvidhiṃ tena1 hi tā na santi|
paryāgatodumbarajo rasastu saśarkaratatkvathitodakaṃ vā||
6.48.23| vargasya siddhasya ca sārivādeḥ pātavyamambhaḥ śiśiraṃ tṛṣārtaiḥ|
kaśeruśṛṅgāṭakapadmamocabisekṣusiddhaṃ1 kṣatajāṃ nihanti||
6.48.24| lājotpalośīrakucandanāni dattvā pravāte niśi vāsayettu|
taduttamaṃ toyamudāragandhi sitāyutaṃ kṣaudrayutaṃ 1vadanti||
6.48.25| drākṣāpragāḍhaṃ ca hitāya vaidyastṛṣṇārditebhyo vitarennarebhyaḥ|
sasārivādau tṛṇapañcamūle tathotpalādau 1prathame gaṇe ca||
6.48.26| kuryāt kaṣāyaṃ ca yatheritena1 madhūkapuṣpādiṣu cāpareṣu|
rājādanakṣīrikapītaneṣu ṣaṭ pānakānyatra hitāni ca syuḥ||
6.48.27| satuṇḍikerāṇyathavā pibettu piṣṭāni kārpāsasamudbhavāni|
kṣatodbhavāṃ rugvinivāraṇena jayedrasānāmasṛjaśca pānaiḥ||
6.48.28| kṣayotthitāṃ kṣīraghṛtaṃ nihanyānmāṃsodakaṃ vā madhukodakaṃ vā|
āmodbhavāṃ bilvavacāyutaistu jayet kaṣāyairatha 1dīpanīyaiḥ||
6.48.29| āmrātabhallātabalāyutāni pibet kaṣāyāṇyatha dīpanāni|
gurvannajātāṃ vamanairjayecca kṣayādṛte sarvakṛtāṃ ca tṛṣṇām||
6.48.30| śramodbhavāṃ māṃsaraso nihanti guḍodakaṃ vā 'pyathavā 'pi manthaḥ|
bhaktoparodhāttṛṣito yavāgūmuṣṇāṃ pibenmanthamatho himaṃ ca||
6.48.31| yā snehapītasya bhavecca tṛṣṇā tatroṣṇamambhaḥ prapibenmanuṣyaḥ|
madyodbhavāmardhajalaṃ nihanti madyaṃ tṛṣāṃ yā 'pi ca madyapasya||
6.48.32| 1tṛṣṇodbhavāṃ hanti jalaṃ suśītaṃ saśarkaraṃ sekṣurasaṃ tathā 'mbhaḥ|
svaiḥ svaiḥ kaṣāyairvamanāni tāsāṃ tathā jvaroktāni ca pācanāni||
6.48.33| lepāvagāhau pariṣecanāni kuryāttathā śītagṛhāṇi cāpi|
saṃśodhanaṃ kṣīrarasau ghṛtāni sarvāsu lehānmadhurān himāṃśca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre (daśamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) aṣṭacatvāriṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ||48||

ekonapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.49.1| athātaśchardipratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.49.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.49.3| atidravairatisnigdhairahṛdyairlavaṇairati|
akāle cātimātraiśca tathā 'sātmyaiśca bhojanaiḥ||
6.49.4| śramāt kṣayāttathodvegādajīrṇāt kṛmidoṣataḥ|
nāryāścāpannasattvāyāstathā 'tidrutamaśnataḥ||
6.49.5| atyantāmaparītasya chardervai saṃbhavo dhruvam|
(bībhatsairhetubhiścānyairdrutamutkleśito balāt1||)
6.49.6| chādayannānanaṃ vegairardayannaṅgabhañjanaiḥ|
nirucyate chardiriti doṣo 1vaktrādviniścaran||
6.49.7| doṣānudīrayan vṛddhānudāno vyānasaṅgataḥ|
ūrdhvamāgacchati bhṛśaṃ viruddhāhārasevanāt1||
6.49.8| 1praseko hṛdayotkleśo bhaktasyānabhinandanam|
pūrvarūpaṃ mataṃ chardyā yathāsvaṃ ca vibhāvayet||
6.49.9| 1pracchardayet phenilamalpamalpaṃ śūlārdito 'bhyarditapārśvapṛṣṭhaḥ|
śrāntaḥ saghoṣaṃ bahuśaḥ kaṣāyaṃ jīrṇe 'dhikaṃ sā 'nilajā vamistu||
6.49.10| yo 'mlaṃ bhṛśaṃ vā kaṭutiktavaktraḥ pītaṃ saraktaṃ haritaṃ vamedvā|
sadāhacoṣajvaravaktraśoṣo mūrcchānvitaḥ1 pittanimittajā sā||
6.49.11| yo hṛṣṭaromā madhuraṃ prabhūtaṃ śuklaṃ himaṃ sāndrakaphānuviddham|
abhaktaruggauravasādayukto1 vamedvamī sā kaphakopajā syāt||
6.49.12| sarvāṇi rūpāṇi bhavanti yasyāṃ sā sarvadoṣaprabhavā matā tu|
bībhatsajā dauhṛdajā++āmajā ca 1sātmyaprakopāt kṛmijā ca 1yā hi|
sā pañcamī 1tāṃ ca vibhāvayettu doṣocchrayeṇaiva yathoktamādau||
6.49.13| śūlahṛllāsabahulā1 kṛmijā ca viśeṣataḥ|
kṛmihṛdrogatulyena lakṣaṇena ca lakṣitā||
6.49.14| kṣīṇasyopadravairyuktāṃ sāsṛkpūyāṃ sacandrikām|
chardiṃ prasaktāṃ kuśalo nārabheta cikitsitum||
6.49.15| āmāśayotkleśabhavā hi sarvāstasmāddhitaṃ laṅghanameva 1tāsu||
6.49.16| vamīṣu bahudoṣāsu chardanaṃ hitamucyate|
virecanaṃ vā kurvīta yathādoṣocchrayaṃ bhiṣak||
6.49.17| 1saṃsargaścānupūrveṇa yathāsvaṃ bheṣajāyutaḥ|
laghūni pariśuṣkāṇi sātmyānyannāni cācaret||
6.49.18| yathāsvaṃ ca kaṣāyāṇi jvaraghnāni prayojayet|
hanyāt kṣīraghṛtaṃ pītaṃ chardiṃ pavanasaṃbhavām||
6.49.19| sasaindhavaṃ pibet sarpirvātacchardinivāraṇam|
mudgāmalakayūṣo vā sasarpiṣkaḥ sasaindhavaḥ|
yavāgūṃ madhumiśrāṃ vā pañcamūlīkṛtāṃ pibet||
6.49.20| pibedvā vyaktasindhūtthaṃ phalāmlaṃ vaiṣkiraṃ rasam|
sukhoṣṇalavaṇaṃ cātra hitaṃ snehavirecanam||
6.49.21| pittopaśamanīyāni pākyāni1 śiśirāṇi ca|
kaṣāyāṇyupayuktāni ghnanti pittakṛtāṃ vamīm||
6.49.22| śodhanaṃ madhuraiścātra drākṣārasasamāyutaiḥ|
balavatyāṃ praśaṃsanti sarpistailvakameva ca||
6.49.23| 1āragvadhādiniryūhaṃ daśāṅgayogameva vā|
pāyayetātha sakṣaudraṃ kaphajāyāṃ cikitsakaḥ||
6.49.24| kṛtaṃ guḍūcyā vidhivat kaṣāyaṃ himasaṃjñitam|
tisṛṣvapi bhavet pathyaṃ mākṣikeṇa samanvitam||
6.49.25| bībhatsajāṃ hṛdyatamairdauhṛdīṃ kāṅkṣitaiḥ phalaiḥ|
laṅghanairvamanaiścāmāṃ 1sātmyaiḥ sātmyaprakopajām||
6.49.26| kṛmihṛdrogavaccāpi kṛmijāṃ sādhayedvamīm|
vitarecca yathādoṣaṃ śastaṃ vidhimanantaram||
6.49.27| dadhittharasasṃsaktāṃ pippalīṃ mākṣikānvitām|
muhurmuhurnaro līḍhvā chardibhyaḥ pravimucyate(pratimucyate)||
6.49.28| samākṣikā madhurasā pītā vā taṇḍulāmbunā|
tarpaṇaṃ vā madhuyutaṃ tisṛṇāmapi bheṣajam||
6.49.29| svayaṅguptāṃ sayaṣṭyāhvāṃ taṇḍulāmbumadhudravām|
pibedyavāgūmathavā siddhāṃ patraiḥ karañjajaiḥ||
6.49.30| yuktāmlalavaṇāḥ piṣṭāḥ kustumburyo 'thavā hitāḥ|
taṇḍulāmbuyutaṃ khādet kapitthaṃ tryūṣaṇena vā||
6.49.31| sitācandanamadhvāktaṃ lihyādvā makṣikāśakṛt|
pibet payo 'gnitaptaṃ ca nirvāpya gṛhagodhikām1||
6.49.32| sarpiḥkṣaudrayutān vā 'pi lājaśaktūn pibettathā|
sarpiḥkṣaudrasitopetāṃ māgadhīṃ vā lihettathā||
6.49.33| dhātrīrase candanaṃ vā ghṛṣṭaṃ mudgadalāmbunā|
kolāmalakamajjānaṃ lihyādvā trisugandhikam||
6.49.34| sakṣaudrāṃ śālilājānāṃ yavagūṃ vā pibennaraḥ|
ghreyāṇyupahareccāpi manoghrāṇasukhāni ca||
6.49.35| jāṅgalāni ca māṃsāni śubhāni1 pānakāni ca|
bhojanāni vicitrāṇi kuryātsarvāsvatandritaḥ||
iti suśrutasṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre chardipratiṣedho nāma (ekādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ekonapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||49||

pañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.50.1| athāto hikkāpratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.50.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.50.3| vidāhiguruviṣṭambhirūkṣābhiṣyandibhojanaiḥ|
śītapānāsanasthānarajodhūmānilānalaiḥ||
6.50.4| vyāyāmakarmabhārādhvavegāghātāpatarpaṇaiḥ|
āmadoṣābhighātastrīkṣayadoṣaprapīḍanaiḥ1||
6.50.5| viṣamāśanādhyanaśanaistathā samaśanairapi|
hikkā śvāsaśca kāsaśca nṛṇāṃ samupajāyate||
6.50.6| muhurmuhurvāyurudeti sasvano yakṛtplihāntrāṇi mukhādivākṣipan|
sa ghoṣavānāśu hinastyasūn yatastatastu hikketi bhiṣagbhirucyate||
6.50.7| annajāṃ yamalāṃ kṣudrāṃ gambhīrāṃ mahatīṃ tathā|
vāyuḥ kaphenānugataḥ pañca hikkāḥ karoti hi||
6.50.8| mukhaṃ kaṣāyamaratirgauravaṃ kaṇṭhavakṣasoḥ|
pūrvarūpāṇi hikkānāmāṭopo jaṭharasya ca||
6.50.9| tvaramāṇasya cāhāraṃ bhuñjānasyāthavā ghanam|
vāyurannairavastīrṇaḥ kaṭukairardito bhṛśam1||
6.50.10| hikkayatyūrdhvago bhūtvā tāṃ vidyādannajāṃ bhiṣak|
cireṇa yamalairvegairyā hikkā saṃpravartate||
6.50.11| kampayantī śirogrīvaṃ yamalāṃ tāṃ vinirdiśet|
vikṛṣṭakālairyā vegairmandaiḥ samabhivartate||
6.50.12| kṣudrikā nāma sā hikkā jatrumūlāt pradhāvitā|
nābhipravṛttā yā hikkā ghorā gambhīranādinī||
6.50.13| śuṣkauṣṭhakaṇṭhajihvāsyaśvāsapārśvarujākarī|
anekopadravayutā gambhīrā nāma sā smṛtā||
6.50.14| marmāṇyāpīḍayantīva satataṃ yā pravartate|
dehamāyamya vegena ghoṣayatyatitṛṣyataḥ1|
mahāhikketi sā jñeyā sarvagātraprakampinī||
6.50.15| āyamyate hikkato 'ṅgāni yasya dṛṣṭiścordhvaṃ tāmyate yasya gāḍham|
kṣīṇo 'nnadviṭ 1kāsate yaśca hikkī tau dvāvantyau varjayeddhikkamānau||
6.50.16| prāṇāyāmodvejanatrāsanāni sūcītodaiḥ saṃbhramaścātra śastaḥ|
yaṣṭyāhvaṃ vā mākṣikeṇāvapīḍe pippalyo vā śarkarācūrṇayuktāḥ||
6.50.17| sarpiḥ koṣṇaṃ kṣīramikṣo raso vā nātikṣīṇe chardanaṃ 1śāntihetoḥ|
nārīpayaḥpiṣṭamaśuklacandanaṃ ghṛtaṃ sukhoṣṇaṃ ca sasaindhavaṃ tathā||
6.50.18| cūrṇīkṛtaṃ saindhavamambhasā 'thavā nihanti hikkāṃ ca hitaṃ ca nasyataḥ|
yuñjyāddhūmaṃ śālaniryāsajātaṃ naipālaṃ vā goviṣāṇodbhavaṃ vā||
6.50.19| sarpiḥsnigdhaiścarmabālaiḥ kṛtaṃ vā hikkāsthāne svedanaṃ cāpi kāryam|
kṣaudropetaṃ gairikaṃ kāñcanāhvaṃ lihyādbhasma grāmyasattvāsthijaṃ vā||
6.50.20| tadvacchvāvinmeṣagośalyakānāṃ(gośallakānāṃ) romāṇyantardhūmadagdhāni cātra|
madhvājyāktaṃ barhipatraprasūtamevaṃ bhasmaudumbaraṃ tailvakaṃ vā||
6.50.21| svarjikṣāraṃ bījapūrādrasena kṣaudropetaṃ hanti līḍhvā++āśu hikkām|
sarpiḥsnigdhā ghnanti hikkāṃ yavāgvaḥ koṣṇagrāsāḥ pāyaso vā sukhoṣṇaḥ||
6.50.22| śuṇṭhītoye sādhitaṃ kṣīramājaṃ tadvat pītaṃ śarkarāsaṃyutaṃ vā|
ātṛptervā sevyamānaṃ nihantyād ghrātaṃ hikkāmāśu mūtraṃ tvajāvyoḥ||
6.50.23| sapūtikīṭaṃ laśunogragandhāhiṅgvabjamācūrṇya1 subhāvitaṃ tat|
kṣaudraṃ sitāṃ vāraṇakeśaraṃ ca pibedrasenekṣumadhūkajena||
6.50.24| pibet palaṃ vā lavaṇottamasya dvābhyāṃ palābhyāṃ haviṣaḥ samagram|
harītakīṃ koṣṇajalānupānāṃ pibedghṛtaṃ kṣāramadhūpapannam||
6.50.25| rasaṃ kapitthānmadhupippalībhyāṃ 1śuktipramāṇaṃ prapibet sukhāya||
6.50.26| kṛṣṇāṃ sitāṃ cāmalakaṃ ca līḍhaṃ saśṛṅgaveraṃ madhunā 'thavā 'pi|
kolāsthimajjāñjanalājacūrṇaṃ hikkā nihanyānmadhunā 'valīḍham||
6.50.27| pāṭalāyāḥ phalaṃ puṣpaṃ gairikaṃ kaṭurohiṇī|
kharjūramadhyaṃ māgadhyaḥ kāśīśaṃ dadhināma ca||
6.50.28| catvāra ete yogāḥ syuḥ pratipādapradarśitāḥ|
madhudvitīyāḥ kartavyāste hikkāsu vijānatā||
6.50.29| kapotapārāvatalāvaśaka(lla)śvadaṃṣṭragodhāvṛṣadaṃśajān rasān|
pibet phalāmlānahimān sasaindhavān snigdhāṃstathaivarṣyamṛgadvijodbhavān||
6.50.30| virecanaṃ pathyatamaṃ sasaindhavaṃ ghṛtaṃ sukhoṣṇaṃ ca sitopalāyutam|
sadāgatāvūrdhvagate 'nuvāsanaṃ vadanti kecicca hitāya hikkinām||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre hikkāpratiṣedho nāma (dvādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) pañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||50||

ekapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.51.1| athātaḥ śvāsapratiṣedhaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.51.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.51.3| yaireva kāraṇairhikkā bahubhiḥ saṃpravartate|
taireva kāraṇaiḥ śvāso ghoro bhavati dehinām||
6.51.4| vihāya prakṛtiṃ vāyuḥ prāṇo 'tha kaphasaṃyutaḥ|
śvāsayatyūrdhvago bhūtvā taṃ śvāsaṃ paricakṣate||
6.51.5| kṣudrakastamakaśchinno mahānūrdhvaśca pañcadhā|
bhidyate sa mahāvyādhiḥ śvāsa eko viśeṣataḥ||
6.51.6| prāgrūpaṃ tasya hṛtpīḍā bhaktadveṣo 'ratiḥ parā|
ānāhaḥ pārśvayoḥ śūlaṃ vairasyaṃ vadanasya ca||
6.51.7| kiñcidārabhamāṇasya yasya śvāsaḥ pravartate|
niṣaṇṇasyaiti śāntiṃ ca sa kṣudra iti saṃjñitaḥ||
6.51.8| tṛṭsvedavamathuprāyaḥ kaṇṭhaghurghurikānvitaḥ|
viśeṣāddurdine tāmyecchvāsaḥ sa tamako mataḥ||
6.51.9| ghoṣeṇa mahatā++āviṣṭaḥ sakāsaḥ sakapho naraḥ|
yaḥ śvasityabalo 'nnadviṭ 1suptastamakapīḍitaḥ||
6.51.10| sa śāmyati kaphe hīne svapataśca vidhardhate|
mūrcchājvarābhibhūtasya jñeyaḥ pratamakastu saḥ||
6.51.11| ādhmāto dahyamānena bastinā sarujaṃ naraḥ|
sarvaprāṇena vicchinnaṃ śvasyācchinnaṃ tamādiśet||
6.51.12| niḥsaṃjñaḥ pārśvaśūlārtaḥ śuṣkakaṇṭho 'tighoṣavān|
saṃrabdhanetrastvāyamya yaḥ śvasyāt sa mahān smṛtaḥ|
6.51.13| marmasvāyamyamāneṣu śvasanmūḍho muhuśca yaḥ|
ūrdhvaprekṣī hataravastamūrdhvaśvāsamādiśet||
6.51.14| kṣudraḥ sādhyatamasteṣāṃ tamakaḥ kṛcchra ucyate|
trayaḥ śvāsā na sidhyanti tamako durbalasya ca||
6.51.15| snehabastiṃ vinā1 kecidūrdhvaṃ cādhaśca śodhanam|
mṛdu rāṇavatāṃ śreṣṭhaṃ śvāsināmādiśanti hi||
6.51.16| śvāse kāse ca hikkāyāṃ hṛdroge cāpi pūjitam|
ghṛtaṃ purāṇaṃ saṃsiddhamabhayāviḍarāmaṭhaiḥ||
6.51.17| sauvarcalābhayābilvaiḥ saṃskṛtaṃ1 vā 'navaṃ ghṛtam|
pippalyādipratīvāpaṃ siddhaṃ vā prathame gaṇe||
6.51.18| sapañcalavaṇaṃ sarpiḥ śvāsakāsau vyapohati|
hiṃsrāviḍaṅgapūtīkatriphalāvyoṣacitrakaiḥ||
6.51.19| dvikṣīraṃ sādhitaṃ sarpiścaturguṇajalāplutam|
kolamātraiḥ pibettaddhi1 śvāsakāsau vyapohati||
6.51.20| arśāṃsyarocakaṃ gulmaṃ śakṛdbhedaṃ kṣayaṃ tathā|
kṛtsne vṛṣakaṣāye vā pacet sarpiścaturguṇe||
6.51.21| tanmūlakusumāvāpaṃ śītaṃ kṣaudreṇa yojayet|
śṛṅgīmadhūlikābhārgīśuṇṭhītārkṣyasitāmbudaiḥ||
6.51.22| saharidraiḥ sayaṣṭyāhvaiḥ samairāvāpya yogataḥ|
ghṛtaprasthaṃ paceddhīmān śītatoye caturguṇe||
6.51.23| śvāsaṃ kāsaṃ tathā hikkāṃ sarpiretanniyacchati|
suvahā kālikā bhargī śukākhyā naiculaṃ phalam||
6.51.24| kākādanī śṛṅgaveraṃ varṣabhūrbṛhatīdvayam|
kolamātrairghṛtaprasthaṃ pacedebhirjaladvikam||
6.51.25| kaṭūṣṇaṃ pītametaddhi śvāsāmayavināśanam|
sauvarcalayavakṣārakaṭukāvyoṣacitrakaiḥ||
6.51.26| 1vacābhayāviḍaṅgaiśca sādhitaṃ śvāsaśāntaye|
gopavallyudake siddhaṃ syādanyaddviguṇe ghṛtam||
6.51.27| pañcaitāni havīṃṣyāhurbhiṣajaḥ śvāsakāsayoḥ|
tālīśatāmalakyugrājīvantīkuṣṭhasaindhavaiḥ||
6.51.28| bilvapuṣkarabhūtīkasauvarcalakaṇāgnibhiḥ|
pathyātejovatīyuktaiḥ sarpirjalacaturguṇam||
6.51.29| hiṅgupādayutaṃ siddhaṃ sarvaśvāsaharaṃ param|
vāsāghṛtaṃ ṣaṭpalaṃ vā ghṛtaṃ cātra hitaṃ bhavet||
6.51.30| tailaṃ daśaguṇe siddhaṃ bhṛṅgarājarase śubhe|
sevyamānaṃ yathānyāyaṃ śvāsakāsau vyapohati||
6.51.31| phalāmlā viṣkirarasāḥ snigdhāḥ pravyaktasaindhavāḥ|
eṇādīnāṃ śirobhirvā kaulatthā vā susaṃskṛtāḥ||
6.51.32| hanyuḥ śvāsaṃ ca kāsaṃ ca saṃskṛtāni payāṃsi ca|
timirasya1 ca bījāni karkaṭākhyā ca cūrṇitā||
6.51.33| durālabhā 'tha pippalyaḥ kaṭukākhyā harītakī|
śvāvinmayūraromāṇi kolā māgadhikākaṇāḥ||
6.51.34| bhārgītvak śṛṅgaveraṃ ca śarkarā śallakāṅgajam|
nṛttakauṇḍakabījāni1 cūrṇitāni tu kevalam||
6.51.35| pañca ślokārdhikāstvete lehā ye samyagīritāḥ|
sarpirmadhubhyāṃ te lehyāḥ kāsaśvāsārditairnaraiḥ||
6.51.36| saptacchadasya puṣpāṇi pippalīścāpi mastunā|
pibet saṃcūrṇya madhunā dhānāścāpyatha bhakṣayet||
6.51.37| arkāṅkurairbhāvitānāṃ yavānāṃ sādhvanekaśaḥ|
tarpaṇaṃ vā pibedeṣāṃ sakṣaudraṃ śvāsapīḍitaḥ||
6.51.38| śirīṣakadalīkundapuṣpaṃ māgadhikāyutam|
taṇḍulāmbuyutaṃ pītvā jayecchvāsānaśeṣataḥ||
6.51.39| kolamajjāṃ tālamūlamṛṣyacarmamasīmapi|
lihyāt kṣaudreṇa bhārgīṃ vā sarpirmadhusamāyutām||
6.51.40| nīcaiḥkadambabījaṃ vā sakṣaudraṃ taṇḍulāmbunā|
drākṣāṃ harītakīṃ kṛṣṇāṃ karkaṭākhyāṃ durālabhām||
6.51.41| sarpirmadhubhyāṃ vilihan hanti śvāsān sudāruṇān|
haridrāṃ maricaṃ drākṣāṃ guḍaṃ rāsnāṃ kaṇāṃ śaṭīm||
6.51.42| 1lihyāttailena tulyāni śvāsārto hitabhojanaḥ|
gavāṃ purīṣasvarasaṃ madhusarpiḥkaṇāyutam1||
6.51.43| lihyācchvāśeṣu kāseṣu vājināṃ vā śakṛdrasam|
pāṇḍurogeṣu śotheṣu ye yogāḥ saṃprakīrtitāḥ||
6.51.44| śvāsakāsāpahāste 'pi kāsaghnā ye ca kīrtitāḥ|
bhārgītvak tryūṣaṇaṃ tailaṃ haridrāṃ kaṭurohiṇīm||
6.51.45| pippalīṃ maricaṃ caṇḍāṃ gośakṛdrasameva ca|
talakoṭasya bījeṣu pacedutkārikāṃ śubhām||
6.51.46| sevyamānā nihantyeṣā śvāsānāśu sudustarān|
purāṇasarpiḥ pippalyaḥ kaulatthā jāṅgalā rasāḥ||
6.51.47| surā sauvīrakaṃ hiṅgu mātuluṅgaraso madhu|
drākṣāmalakabilvāni śastāni śvāsihikkinām||
6.51.48| śvāsahikkāparigataṃ snigdhaiḥ svedairupācaret|
1āktaṃ lavaṇatailābhyāṃ tairasya grathitaḥ kaphaḥ||
6.51.49| khastho vilayanaṃ yāti mārutaśca praśāmyati|
1svinnaṃ jñātvā tataścaiva bhojayitvā rasaudanam||
6.51.50| vātaśleṣmavibandhe vā bhiṣag dhūmaṃ prayojayet|
manaḥśilādevadāruharidrācchadanāmiṣaiḥ||
6.51.51| lākṣorubūkamūlaiśca kṛtvā vartīrvidhānataḥ|
1sarpiryavamadhūcchiṣṭaśālaniryāsajaṃ tathā||
6.51.52| śṛṅgabālakhurasnāyutvak samastaṃ gavāmapi|
turuṣkaśallakīnāṃ ca gugguloḥ padmakasya ca||
6.51.53| ete sarve sasarpiṣkā dhūmāḥ kāryā vijānatā|
balīyasi kaphagraste vamanaṃ savirecanam||
6.51.54| durbale caiva rūkṣe ca tarpaṇaṃ hitamucyate|
jāṅgalorabhrajairmāṃsairānūpairvā susaṃskṛtaiḥ||
6.51.55| nidigdhikāṃ cāmalakapramāṇāṃ hiṅgvardhayuktāṃ madhunā suyuktām|
lihannaraḥ śvāsanipīḍito hi śvāsaṃ jayatyeva balāttryaheṇa||
6.51.56| yathā 'gniriddhaḥ 1pavanānuviddho vajraṃ yathā vā surarājamuktam|
rogāstathaite khalu durnivārāḥ śvāsaśca kāsaśca vilambikā ca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre hikkāśvāsapratiṣedho nāma (tryodaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ekapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||51||

dvipañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.52.1| athātaḥ kāsapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.52.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.52.3| uktā ye hetavo nṛṛṇāṃ rogayoḥ śvāsahikkayoḥ|
kāsasyāpi ca vijñeyāsta evotpattihetavaḥ||
6.52.4| dhūmopaghātādrajasastathaiva vyāyāmarūkṣānnaniṣevaṇācca|
vimārgagatvādapi bhojanasya vegāvarodhāt kṣavathostathaiva||
6.52.5| prāṇo hyudānānugataḥ praduṣṭaḥ saṃbhinnakāṃsyasvanatulyaghoṣaḥ|
nireti vaktrāt sahasā sadoṣaḥ kāsaḥ sa vidvadbhirudāhṛtastu||
6.52.6| sa vātapittaprabhavaḥ kaphācca kṣatāttathā 'nyaḥ kṣayajo 'paraśca|
pañcaprakāraḥ kathito bhiṣagbhirvivardhito yakṣmavikārakṛt syāt||
6.52.7| bhaviṣyatastasya tu kaṇṭhakaṇḍūrbhojyoparodho galatālulepaḥ|
1svaśabdavaiṣamyamarocako 'gnisādaśca liṅgāni bhavantyamūni||
6.52.8| hṛcchaṅkhamūrdhodarapārśvaśūlī kṣāmānanaḥ kṣīṇabalasvaraujāḥ|
1prasaktamantaḥkaphamīraṇena kāsettu śuṣkaṃ svarabhedayuktaḥ||
6.52.9| urovidāhajvaravaktraśoṣairabhyarditastiktamukhastṛṣārtaḥ|
pittena pītāni vamet kaṭūni kāset sa pāṇḍuḥ paridahyamānaḥ||
6.52.10| pralipyamānena(vilipyamānena) mukhena sīdan śirorujārtaḥ kaphapūrṇadehaḥ|
abhaktaruggauravasādayuktaḥ 1kāseta nā sāndrakaphaṃ kaphena||
6.52.11| vakṣo 'timātraṃ vihataṃ tu yasya vyāyāmabhārādhyayanābhighātaiḥ|
viśliṣṭavakṣāḥ sa naraḥ saraktaṃ ṣṭhīvatyabhīkṣṇaṃ kṣatajaṃ1 tamūhuḥ||
6.52.12| sa gātraśūlajvaradāhamohān prāṇakṣayaṃ copalabheta kāsī|
śuṣyan viniṣṭhīvati durbalastu prakṣīṇamāṃso rudhiraṃ sapūyam||
6.52.13| 1sasarvaliṅgaṃ bhṛśaduścikitsyaṃ cikitsitajñāḥ kṣayajaṃ 1vadanti|
vṛddhatvamāsādya 1bhavettu yo vai yāpyaṃ tamāhurbhiṣajastu kāsam||
6.52.14| śṛṅgīvacākaṭphalakattṛṇābdadhānyābhayābhārgyamarāhvaviśvam|
uṣṇāmbunā hiṅguyutaṃ tu pītvā baddhāsyamapyāśu jahāti kāsam||
6.52.15| phalatrikavyoṣaviḍaṅgaśṛṅgīrāsnāvacāpadmakadevakāṣṭhaiḥ1|
lehaḥ samaiḥ kṣaudrasitāghṛtāktaḥ kāsaṃ nihanyādacirādudīrṇam||
6.52.16| pathyāṃ sitāmāmalakāni lājāṃ samāgadhīṃ cāpi vicūrṇya śuṇṭhīm|
sarpirmadhubhyāṃ vilihīta kāsī sasaindhavāṃ voṣṇajalena kṛṣṇām||
6.52.17| khādedguḍaṃ nāgarapippalībhyāṃ drākṣāṃ ca sarpirmadhunā 'valihyāt|
drākṣāṃ sitāṃ māgadhikāṃ ca tulyāṃ saśṛṅgaveraṃ madhukaṃ tugāṃ ca||
6.52.18| lihyādghṛtakṣaudrayutāṃ samāṃśāṃ sitopalāṃ vā maricāṃśayuktām|
dhātrīkaṇāviśvasitopalāśca saṃcūrṇya maṇḍena pibecca dadhnaḥ||
6.52.19| hareṇukāṃ māgadhikāṃ ca 1tulyāṃ dadhnā pibet kāsagadābhibhūtaḥ|
ubhe haridre suradāruśuṇṭhīṃ gāyatrisāraṃ ca pibet samāṃśam||
6.52.20| bastasya mūtreṇa sukhāmbunā vā dantīṃ dravantīṃ ca satilvakākhyām1|
bhṛṣṭāni sarpīṃṣyatha bādarāṇi khādet palāśāni sasaindhavāni||
6.52.21| kolapramāṇaṃ prapibeddhi hiṅgu sauvīrakeṇāmlarasena vā 'pi|
kṣaudreṇa lihyānmaricāni vā 'pi bhārgīvacāhiṅgukṛtā ca vartiḥ||
6.52.22| dhūme praśastā ghṛtasaṃprayuktā veṇutvagelālavaṇaiḥ kṛtā vā|
musteṅgudītvaṅmadhukāhvamāṃsīmanaḥśilālaiśchagalāmbupiṣṭaiḥ||
6.52.23| vidhāya vartīśca payo 'nupānaṃ dhūmaṃ pibedvātabalāsakāsī|
pibecca sīdhuṃ maricānvitaṃ vā tenāśu kāsaṃ jayati prasahya||
6.52.24| drākṣāmbumañjiṣṭhapurāhvayābhiḥ kṣīraṃ 1śṛtaṃ mākṣikasaṃprayuktam|
nidigdhikānāgarapippalībhiḥ khādecca mudgānmadhunā susiddhān||
6.52.25| utkārikāṃ sarpiṣi nāgarāḍhyāṃ paktvā samūlaistruṭikolapatraiḥ|
ebhirniṣeveta kṛtāṃ ca peyāṃ tanvīṃ suśītāṃ madhunā vimiśrām||
6.52.26| yat plīhni sarpirvihitaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ tadvātakāsaṃ jayati prasahya|
vidārigandhādikṛtaṃ ghṛtaṃ vā rasena vā vāsakajena pakvam||
6.52.27| virecanaṃ snaihikamatra coktamāsthāpanaṃ cāpyanuvāsanaṃ ca|
dhūmaṃ pibet snaihikamapramattaḥ pibet sukhoṣṇaṃ ghṛtameva cātra||
6.52.28| hitā yavāgvaśca raseṣu siddhāḥ payāṃsi lehāḥ saghṛtāstathaiva|
pracchardanaṃ kāyaśirovirekāstathaiva dhūmāḥ kavalagrahāśca||
6.52.29| uṣṇāśca lehāḥ kaṭukā nihanyuḥ kaphaṃ viśeṣeṇa viśoṣaṇaṃ ca|
kaṭutrikaṃ cāpi vadanti pathyaṃ ghṛtaṃ kṛmighnasvarase vipakvam||
6.52.30| nirguṇḍipatrasvarase ca pakvaṃ sarpiḥ kaphotthaṃ vinihanti kāsam|
pāṭhāviḍavyoṣaviḍaṅgasindhutrikaṇṭarāsnāhutabhugbalābhiḥ||
6.52.31| śṛṅgīvacāmbhodharadevadārudurālabhābhārgyabhayaśaṭībhiḥ|
samyagvipakvaṃ dviguṇena sarpirnidigdhikāyāḥ svarasena caitat||
6.52.32| śvāsāgnisādasvarabhedabhinnānnihantyudīrṇānapi1 pañca kāsān|
vidārigandhotpalasārivādīn niṣkvāthya 1vargaṃ madhuraṃ ca kṛtsnam||
6.52.33| ghṛtaṃ pacedikṣurasāmbudugdhaiḥ kākolivarge ca saśarkaraṃ tat|
prātaḥ pibet pittakṛte ca kāse ratiprasūte kṣataje ca kāse||
6.52.34| kharjūrabhārgīmagadhāpriyālamadhūlikailāmalakaiḥ samāṃśaiḥ|
cūrṇaṃ sitākṣaudraghṛtaprāgāḍhaṃ trīn hanti kāsānupayujyamānam||
6.52.35| raktāharidrāñjanavahnipāṭhāmūrvopakulyā vilihet samāṃśāḥ|
kṣaudreṇa kāse kṣataje kṣayotthe pibedghṛtaṃ cekṣurase vipakvam||
6.52.36| cūrṇaṃ pibedāmalakasya vā 'pi kṣīreṇa pakvaṃ saghṛtaṃ hitāśī|
cūrṇāni godhūmayavodbhavāni kākolivargaśca kṛtaḥ susūkṣmaḥ||
6.52.37| kāseṣu peyastriṣu kāsavadbhiḥ kṣīreṇa sakṣaudraghṛtena vā 'pi|
guḍodakaṃ vā kvathitaṃ pibeddhi kṣaudreṇa śītaṃ maricopadaṃśam||
6.52.38| prasthatrayeṇāmalakīrasasya śuddhasya dattvā 'rdhatulāṃ guḍasya|
cūrṇīkṛtairgranthikacavyajīravyoṣebhakṛṣṇāhapuṣājamodaiḥ||
6.52.39| viḍaṅgasindhutriphalāyavānīpāṭhāgnidhānyaiśca picupramāṇaiḥ|
dattvā trivṛccūrṇapalāni cāṣṭāvaṣṭau ca tailasya pacedyathāvat||
6.52.40| taṃ bhakṣayedakṣaphalapramāṇaṃ yatheṣṭaceṣṭastrisugandhiyuktam|
anena sarve grahaṇīvikārāḥ saśvāsakāsasvarabhedaśothāḥ||
6.52.41| śāmyanti cāyaṃ ciramantaragnerhatasya puṃstvasya ca vṛddhihetuḥ|
strīṇāṃ ca vandhyāmayanāśanaḥ syāt kalyāṇako nāma guḍaḥ pratītaḥ||
6.52.42| dvipañcamūlebhakaṇātmaguptābhārgīśaṭīpuṣkaramūlaviśvān|
pāṭhāmṛtāgranthikaśaṅkhapuṣpīrāsnāgnyapāmārgabalāyavāsān||
6.52.43| dvipālikān 1nyasya yavāḍhakaṃ ca harītakīnāṃ ca śataṃ gurūṇām|
droṇe jalasyāḍhakasaṃyute ca kvāthe kṛte pūtacaturthabhāge||
6.52.44| pacettulāṃ śuddhaguḍasya dattvā pṛthak ca tailāt kuḍavaṃ ghṛtācca|
cūrṇaṃ ca tāvanmagadhodbhavāyā deyaṃ ca tasminmadhu siddhaśīte||
6.52.45| rasāyanāt karṣamato vilihyāddve cābhaye nityamathāśu hanyāt|
tadrājayakṣmagrahaṇīpradoṣaśophāgnimāndyasvarabhedakāsān||
6.52.46| pāṇḍvāmayaśvāsaśirovikārān hṛdrogahikkāviṣamajvarāṃśca|
medhābalotsāhamatipradaṃ ca cakāra caitadbhagavānagastyaḥ||
6.52.47| kulīraśuktīcaṭakaiṇalāvānniṣkvāthya vargaṃ madhuraṃ ca kṛtsnam|
pacedghṛtaṃ tattu niṣevyamāṇaṃ hanyāt kṣatotthaṃ kṣayajaṃ ca kāsam||
śatāvarīnāgabalāvipakvaṃ ghṛtaṃ vidheyaṃ ca hitāya kāsinām|
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre kāsapratiṣedho nāma (caturdaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) dvipañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||52||

tripañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.53.1| athātaḥ svarabhedapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.53.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.53.3| atyuccabhāṣaṇaviṣādhyayanātigītaśītādibhiḥ1 prakupitāḥ pavanādayastu|
srotaḥsu te svaravaheṣu gatāḥ pratiṣṭhāṃ hanyuḥ svaraṃ bhavati cāpi hi ṣaḍvidhaḥ saḥ||
6.53.4| vātena kṛṣṇanayanānanamūtravarcā bhinnaṃ śanairvadati gadgadavat svaraṃ ca|
pittena pītavadanākṣipurīṣamūtro brūyādgalena 1paridāhasamanvitena||
6.53.5| kṛcchrāt kaphena satataṃ kapharuddhakaṇṭho mandaṃ śanairvadati cāpi divā viśeṣaḥ1|
sarvātmake bhavati sarvavikārasaṃpadavyaktatā ca vacasastamasādhyamāhuḥ||
6.53.6| dhūpyeta vāk kṣayakṛte kṣayamāpnuyācca vāgeṣa cāpi(vāpi) hatavāk parivarjanīyaḥ|
1antargalaṃ svaramalakṣyapadaṃ cireṇa 1medaścayādvadati digdhagalauṣṭhatāluḥ||
6.53.7| kṣīṇasya vṛddhasya kṛśasya cāpi cirotthito yaśca sahopajātaḥ|
medasvinaḥ sarvasamudbhavaśca svarāmayo yo na sa siddhimeti||
6.53.8| snigdhān svarāturanarānapakṛṣṭadoṣān nyāyena 1tān vamanarecanabastibhiśca|
nasyāvapīḍamukhadhāvanadhūmalehaiḥ saṃpādayecca vividhaiḥ kavalagrahaiśca||
6.53.9| yaḥ śvāsakāsavidhirādita eva coktastaṃ cāpyaśeṣamavatārayituṃ yateta|
vaiśeṣikaṃ ca vidhimūrdhvamato vadāmi taṃ vai svarāturahitaṃ nikhilaṃ nibodha||
6.53.10| svaropaghāte 'nilaje bhuktopari ghṛtaṃ pibet|
kāsamardakavātārkamārkavasvarase śṛtam||
6.53.11| pītaṃ ghṛtaṃ hantyanilaṃ siddhamārtagale rase|
yavakṣārājamodābhyāṃ citrakāmalakeṣu vā||
6.53.12| devadārvagnikābhyāṃ vā siddhāmājaṃ samākṣikam|
sukhodakānupāno vā sasarpiṣko guḍaudanaḥ||
6.53.13| kṣīrānupānaṃ pitte tu pibet sarpiratandritaḥ|
aśnīyācca sasarpiṣkaṃ yaṣṭīmadhukapāyasam||
6.53.14| lihyānmadhurakāṇāṃ vā cūrṇaṃ madhughṛtāplutam|
śatāvarīcūrṇayogaṃ balācūrṇamathāpi vā||
6.53.15| pibet kaṭūni mūtreṇa kaphaje svarasaṃkṣaye|
lihyādvā madhutailābhyāṃ bhuktvā khādet kaṭūni vā||
6.53.16| svaropaghāte medoje kaphavadvidhiriṣyate|
sarvaje kṣayaje cāpi pratyākhyāyācaret kriyām||
6.53.17| śarkarāmadhumiśrāṇi śṛtāni madhuraiḥ saha|
pibet payāṃsi yasyoccairvadato 'bhihataḥ svaraḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre chardipratiṣedho nāma (pañcadaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) tripañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||53||

catuḥpañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.54.1| athātaḥ kṛmirogapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.54.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.54.3| ajīrṇādhyaśanāsātmyaviruddhamalināśanaiḥ|
avyāyāmadivāsvapnagurvatisnigdhaśītalaiḥ||
6.54.4| māṣapiṣṭānnavidalabisaśālūkaserukaiḥ|
parṇaśākasurāśuktadadhikṣīraguḍekṣubhiḥ||
6.54.5| palalānūpapiśitapiṇyākapṛthukādibhiḥ|
svādvamladravapānaiśca śleṣmā pittaṃ ca kupyati||
6.54.6| kṛmīn bahuvidhākārān karoti vividhāśrayān|
āmapakvāśaye teṣāṃ kaphaviḍjanmanāṃ punaḥ|
dhamanyāṃ raktajānāṃ ca prasavaḥ prāyaśaḥ smṛtaḥ||
6.54.7| viṃśateḥ kṛmijātīnāṃ trividhaḥ saṃbhavaḥ smṛtaḥ|
purīṣakapharaktāni tāsāṃ vakṣyāmi vistaram||
6.54.8| ajavā vijavāḥ1 kipyāścipyā gaṇḍūpadāstathā|
cūravo dvimukhāścaiva jñeyāḥ sapta purīṣajāḥ||
6.54.9| śvetāḥ sūkṣmāstudantyete gudaṃ pratisaranti ca|
teṣāmevāpare pucchaiḥ pṛthavaśca bhavanti hi||
6.54.10| śūlāgnimāndyapāṇḍutvaviṣṭambhabalasaṃkṣayāḥ|
prasekārucihṛdrogaviḍbhedāstu purīṣajaiḥ||
6.54.11| raktā gaṇḍūpadā dīrghā gudakaṇḍūnipātinaḥ|
śūlāṭopaśakṛdbhedapaktināśakarāśca te||
6.54.12| darbhapuṣpā mahāpuṣpāḥ pralūnāścipiṭāstathā|
pipīlikā dāruṇāśca kaphakopasamudbhavāḥ||
6.54.13| romaśā romamūrdhānaḥ sapucchāḥ śyāvamaṇḍalāḥ|
rūḍhadhānyāṅkurākārāḥ śuklāste tanavastathā||
6.54.14| majjādā netraleḍhārastāluśrotrabhujastathā|
śirohṛdrogavamathupratiśyāyakarāśca te||
6.54.15| keśaromanakhādāśca dantādāḥ kikkiśāstathā|
kuṣṭhajāḥ saparīsarpā jñeyāḥ śoṇitasaṃbhavāḥ||
6.54.16| te saraktāśca kṛṣṇāśca snigdhāśca pṛthavastathā|
raktādhiṣṭhānajān prāyo vikārān janayanti te||
6.54.17| māṣapiṣṭānnavidalaparṇaśākaiḥ purīṣajāḥ|
māṃsamāṣaguḍakṣīradadhitailaiḥ kaphodbhavāḥ||
6.54.18| viruddhājīrṇaśākādyaiḥ śoṇitotthā bhavanti hi|
jvaro vivarṇatā śūlaṃ hṛdrogaḥ sadanaṃ bhramaḥ||
6.54.19| bhaktadveṣo 'tisāraśca saṃjātakṛmilakṣaṇam|
dṛśyāstrayodaśādyāstu kṛmīṇāṃ parikīrtitāḥ||
6.54.20| keśādādyāstvadṛśyāste dvāvādyau parivarjayet|
eṣāmanyatamaṃ jñātvā jighāṃsuḥ snigdhamāturam||
6.54.21| surasādivipakvena sarpiṣā vāntamāditaḥ|
virecayettīkṣṇatarairyogairāsthāpayecca tam||
6.54.22| yavakolakulatthānāṃ surasādergaṇasya ca|
viḍaṅgasnehayuktena kvāthena lavaṇena ca||
6.54.23| pratyāgate nirūhe tu naraṃ snātaṃ sukhāmbunā|
yuñjyāt kṛmighnairaśanaistataḥ śīghraṃ bhiṣagvaraḥ||
6.54.24| snehenoktena cainaṃ tu yojayet snehabastinā|
tataḥ śirīṣakiṇihīrasaṃ kṣaudrayutaṃ pibet||
6.54.25| kevūkasvarasaṃ vā 'pi pūrvavattīkṣṇabhojanaḥ|
palāśabījasvarasaṃ kalkaṃ vā taṇḍulāmbunā||
6.54.26| pāribhadrakapatrāṇāṃ kṣaudreṇa svarasaṃ pibet|
pattūrasvarasaṃ vā 'pi pibedvā surasādijam||
6.54.27| lihyādaśvaśakṛccūrṇaṃ vaiḍaṅgaṃ vā samākṣikam|
patrairmūṣikaparṇyā vā supiṣṭaiḥ piṣṭamiśritaiḥ||
6.54.28| khādet pūpalikāḥ pakvā dhānyāmlaṃ ca pibedanu|
surasādigaṇe pakvaṃ tailaṃ vā pānamiṣyate||
6.54.29| viḍaṅgacūrṇayuktairvā piṣṭairbhakṣyāṃstu kārayet1|
tatkaṣāyaprapītānāṃ tilānāṃ snehameva vā||
6.54.30| śvāvidhaḥ śakṛtaścūrṇaṃ saptakṛtvaḥ subhāvitam|
viḍaṅgānāṃ kaṣāyeṇa traiphalena tathaiva ca||
6.54.31| kṣaudreṇa līḍhvā 'nupibedrasamāmalakodbhavam|
akṣābhayārasaṃ vā 'pi vidhireṣo 'yasāmapi||
6.54.32| pūtīkasvarasaṃ vā 'pi pibedvā madhunā saha|
pibedvā pippalīmūlamajāmūtreṇa saṃyutam||
6.54.33| saptarātraṃ pibedghṛṣṭaṃ trapu vā dadhimastunā|
purīṣajān kaphotthāṃśca hanyādevaṃ kṛmīn bhiṣak||
6.54.34| śirohṛdghrāṇakarṇākṣisaṃśritāṃśca pṛthagvidhān|
viśeṣeṇāñjanairnasyairavapīḍaiśca sādhayet||
6.54.35| śakṛdrasaṃ turaṅgasya suśuṣkaṃ bhāvayedati|
niṣkvāthena viḍaṅgānāṃ cūrṇaṃ pradhamanaṃ tu tat||
6.54.36| ayaścūrṇānyanenaiva vidhinā yojayedbhiṣak|
sakāṃsyanīlaṃ tailaṃ ca nasyaṃ syātsurasādike||
6.54.37| indraluptavidhiścāpi vidheyo romabhojiṣu|
dantādānāṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ vidhānaṃ mukharogikam||
6.54.38| raktajānāṃ pratīkāraṃ kuryāt kuṣṭhacikitsite|
surasādiṃ tu sarveṣu sarvathauvopayojayet||
6.54.39| pravyaktatikatakaṭukaṃ bhojanaṃ ca hitaṃ bhavet|
kulatthakṣārasaṃsṛṣṭaṃ kṣārapānaṃ ca pūjitam1||
6.54.40| kṣīrāṇi māṃsāni ghṛtāni caiva dadhīni śākāni ca parṇavanti|
samāsato 'mlānmadhurān himāṃśca kṛmīn jighāṃsuḥ parivarjayettu||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre kṛmipratiṣedho nāma (ṣoḍaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) catuḥpañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||54||

pañcapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.55.1| athāta udāvartapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.55.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.55.3| adhaścordhvaṃ ca bhāvānāṃ pravṛttānāṃ svabhāvataḥ|
na vegān dhārayet prājño vātādīnāṃ jijīviṣuḥ||
6.55.4| vātaviṇmūtrajṛmbhāśrukṣavodgāravamīndriyaiḥ|
vyāhanyamānairuditairudāvarto nirucyate||
6.55.5| kṣuttṛṣṇāśvāsanidrāṇāmudāvarto vidhāraṇāt|
tasyābhidhāsye vyāsena lakṣaṇaṃ ca cikitsitam||
6.55.6| trayodaśavidhaścāsau bhinna etaistu kāraṇaiḥ|
apathyabhojanāccāpi vakṣyate ca tathā 'paraḥ||
6.55.7| ādhmānaśūlau hṛdayoparodhaṃ śirorujaṃ śvāsamatīva hikkām|
kāsapratiśyāyagalagrahāṃśca balāsapittaprasaraṃ ca ghoram||
6.55.8| kuryādapāno 'bhihataḥ svamārge hanyāt purīṣaṃ mukhataḥ kṣipedvā|
āṭopaśūlau parikartanaṃ ca saṅgaḥ purīṣasya tathordhvavātaḥ||
6.55.9| purīṣamāsyādapi vā nireti purīṣavege 'bhihate narasya|
mūtrasya vege 'bhihate narastu kṛcchreṇa mūtraṃ kurute 'lpamalpam||
6.55.10| meḍhre gude vaṅkṣaṇabastimuṣkanābhipradeśeṣvathavā1 'pi mūrdhni|
1ānaddhabastiśca bhavanti tīvrāḥ śūlāśca śūlairiva bhinnamūrteḥ||
6.55.11| manyāgalastambhaśirovikārā jṛmbhopaghātāt pavanātmakāḥ syuḥ|
śrotrānanaghrāṇavilocanotthā bhavanti tīvrāśca tathā vikārāḥ||
6.55.12| ānandajaṃ śokasamudbhavaṃ vā netrodakaṃ prāptamamuñcato hi|
śirogurutvaṃ nayanāmayāśca bhavanti tīvrāḥ saha pīnasena||
6.55.13| bhavanti gāḍhaṃ kṣavathorvighātācchirokṣināsāśravaṇeṣu rogāḥ|
kaṇṭhāsyapūrṇatvamatīva todaḥ kūjaśca vāyoruta vā 'pravṛttiḥ||
6.55.14| udgāravege 'bhihate bhavanti ghorā vikārāḥ pavanaprasūtāḥ|
chardervighātena bhavecca kuṣṭhaṃ yenaiva doṣeṇa vidagdhamannam||
6.55.15| mūtrāśaye 1pāyuni muṣkayośca śopho rujo mūtravinigrahaśca|
śukrāśmarī tatsravaṇaṃ bhavedvā te te vikārā vihate tu śukre||
6.55.16| tandrāṅgamardārucivibhramāḥ 1syuḥ kṣudho 'bhighātāt kṛśatā ca dṛṣṭeḥ|
kaṇṭhāsyaśoṣaḥ śravaṇāvarodhastṛṣṇābhighātāddhṛdaye vyathā ca||
6.55.17| śrāntasya niḥśvāsavinigraheṇa hṛdrogamohāvathavā 'pi gulmaḥ|
jṛmbhā 'ṅgamardo 'ṅgaśirokṣijāḍyaṃ nidrābhighātādathavā 'pi tandrā||
6.55.18| tṛṣṇārditaṃ parikliṣṭaṃ kṣīṇaṃ śūlairabhidrutam|
śakṛdvamantaṃ matimānudāvartinamutsṛjet||
6.55.19| sarveṣveteṣu vidhivadudāvarteṣu kṛtsnaśaḥ|
vāyoḥ kriyā vidhātavyāḥ svamārgapratipattaye||
6.55.20| sāmānyataḥ pṛthaktvena kriyāṃ bhūyo nibodha me|
āsthāpanaṃ mārutaje snigdhasvinne viśiṣyate||
6.55.21| purīṣaje tu kartavyo vidhirānāhiko bhavet|
sauvarcalāḍhyāṃ madirāṃ mūtre tvabhihate pibet||
6.55.22| elāṃ vā 'pyatha madyena kṣīraṃ vā 'pi pibennaraḥ|
dhātrīphalānāṃ svarasaṃ sajalaṃ vā pibettryaham||
6.55.23| rasamaśvapurīṣasya gardabhasyāthavā pibet|
māṃsopadaṃśaṃ madhu vā pibedvā sīdhu gauḍikam||
6.55.24| bhadradāru ghanaṃ mūrvā haridrā madhukaṃ tathā|
kolapramāṇāni pibedāntarikṣeṇa vāriṇā||
6.55.25| duḥsparśāsvarasaṃ vā 'pi kaṣāyaṃ kuṅkumasya ca|
ervārubījaṃ toyena pibedvā 'lavaṇīkṛtam||
6.55.26| pañcamūlīśṛtaṃ kṣīraṃ drākṣārasamathāpi vā|
yogāṃśca vitaredatra pūrvoktānaśmarībhidaḥ||
6.55.27| mūtrakṛcchrakramaṃ cāpi kuryānniravaśeṣataḥ|
bhūyo vakṣyāmi yogān yān mūtrāghātopaśāntaye||
6.55.28| snehaiḥ svedairudāvartaṃ jṛmbhājaṃ samupācaret|
aśrumokṣo 'śruje kāryaḥ snigdhasvinnasya dehinaḥ||
6.55.29| tīkṣṇāñjanāvapīḍābhyāṃ tīkṣṇagandhopaśiṅghanaiḥ|
vartiprayogairathavā kṣavasaktiṃ pravartayet||
6.55.30| (tīkṣṇaiṣadhapradhamanairathavā++ādityaraśmibhiḥ|)
udgāraje kramopetaṃ snaihikaṃ dhūmamācaret||
6.55.31| surāṃ sauvarcalavatīṃ bījapūrarasānvitām|
chardyāghātaṃ yathādoṣaṃ samyak snehādibhirjayet||
6.55.32| sakṣāralavaṇopetamabhyaṅgaṃ cātra dāpayet|
bastiśuddhikarāvāpaṃ caturguṇajalaṃ payaḥ||
6.55.33| āvārināśāt kvathitaṃ pītavantaṃ prakāmataḥ|
ramayeyuḥ1 priyā nāryaḥ śukrodāvartinaṃ naram||
6.55.34| kṣudvighāte hitaṃ snigdhamuṣṇamalpaṃ ca bhojanam|
tṛṣṇāghāte pibenmanthaṃ yavāgūṃ vā 'pi śītalām||
6.55.35| bhojyo rasena viśrāntaḥ śramaśvāsāturo naraḥ|
nidrāghāte pibet kṣīraṃ svapyācceṣṭakathā1 naraḥ||
6.55.36| ādhmānādyeṣu rogeṣu yathāsvaṃ prayateta hi|
yacca yatra bhavetprāptaṃ tacca tasmin prayojayet||
6.55.37| vāyuḥ koṣṭhānugo rūkṣaiḥ kaṣāyakaṭutiktakaiḥ|
bhojanaiḥ kupitaḥ sadya udāvartaṃ karoti hi||
6.55.38| vātamūtrapurīṣāsṛkkaphamedovahāni vai|
srotāṃsyudāvartayati purīṣaṃ cātivartayet||
6.55.39| tato hṛdbastiśūlārto gauravārucipīḍitaḥ|
vātamūtrapurīṣāṇi kṛcchreṇa kurute naraḥ||
6.55.40| śvāsakāsapratiśyāyadāhamohavamijvarān|
tṛṣṇāhikkāśirorogamanaḥśravaṇavibhramān||
6.55.41| labhate ca bahūnanyān vikārān vātakopajān|
taṃ tailalavaṇābhyaktaṃ snigdhaṃ svinnaṃ nirūhayet||
6.55.42| doṣato bhinnavarcaskaṃ bhuktaṃ cāpyanuvāsayet|
na cecchāntiṃ vrajatyevamudāvartaḥ sudāruṇaḥ||
6.55.43| athainaṃ bahuśaḥ svinnaṃ yuñjyāt snehavirecanaiḥ|
pāyayeta trivṛtpīluyavānīramlapācanaiḥ||
6.55.44| hiṅgukuṣṭhavacāsvarjiviḍaṅgaṃ vā dviruttaram|
yogāvetāvudāvartaṃ śūlaṃ 1cānilajaṃ hataḥ||
6.55.45| devadārvagnikau kuṣṭhaṃ 1śuṇṭhīṃ pathyāṃ palaṅkaṣām|
pauṣkarāṇi ca mūlāni toyasyardhāḍhake pacet||
6.55.46| pādāvaśiṣṭaṃ tat pītamudāvartamapohati|
mūlakaṃ śuṣkamārdraṃ ca varṣābhūḥ pañcamūlakam||
6.55.47| ārevataphalaṃ cāpsu paktvā tena ghṛtaṃ pacet|
tat pīyamānaṃ 1śāstyugramudāvartamaśeṣataḥ||
6.55.48| vacāmativiṣāṃ kuṣṭhaṃ yavakṣāraṃ harītakīm|
kṛṣṇāṃ nirdahanīṃ cāpi pibeduṣṇena vāriṇā||
6.55.49| ikṣvākumūlaṃ madanaṃ viśalyātiviṣe vacām|
kuṣṭhaṃ kiṇvāgnikau caiva pibettulyāni pūrvavat||
6.55.50| mūtreṇa devadārvagnitriphalābṛhatīḥ pibet|
yavaprasthaṃ phalaiḥ sārdhaṃ kaṇṭakāryā jalāḍhake||
6.55.51| paktvā 'rdhaprasthaśeṣaṃ tu pibeddhiṅgusamanvitam|
madanālābubījāni pippalīṃ sanidigdhikām||
6.55.52| saṃcūrṇya pradhamennāḍyā viśatyetadyathā gudam|
cūrṇaṃ nikumbhakampillaśyāmekṣvākvagnikodbhavam||
6.55.53| kṛtavedhanamāgadhyorlavaṇānāṃ ca sādhayet|
gavāṃ mūtreṇa tā vartīḥ kārayettu gudānugāḥ|
sadyaḥ śarmakarāvetau yogāvamṛtasaṃmatau||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre udāvartapratiṣedho nāma (saptadaśo+ādhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) pañcapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||55||

ṣaṭpañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.56.1| athāto visūcikāpratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.56.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.56.3| ajīrṇamāmaṃ viṣṭabdhaṃ vidagdhaṃ ca yadīritam|
visūcyalasakau tasmādbhaveccāpi vilambikā||
6.56.4| sūcībhiriva gātrāṇi tudan saṃtiṣṭhate 'nilaḥ|
yasyājīrṇena sā vaidyairucyate ti1 visūcikā||
6.56.5| na tāṃ parimitāhārā labhante viditāgamāḥ|
mūḍhāstāmajitātmāno labhante 1kaluṣāśayāḥ||
6.56.6| mūrcchātisārau vamathuḥ pipāsā śūlaṃ bhramodveṣṭanajṛmbhadāhāḥ|
vaivarṇyakampau hṛdaye rujaśca bhavanti tasyāṃ śirasaśca bhedaḥ||
6.56.7| kukṣirānahyate 'tyarthaṃ pratāmyati vikūjati|
niruddho mārutaścāpi kukṣau1 viparidhāvati||
6.56.8| vātavarconirodhaśca kukṣau yasya bhṛśaṃ bhavet|
tasyālasakamācaṣṭe 1tṛṣṇodgārāvarodhakau||
6.56.9| duṣṭaṃ tu bhuktaṃ kaphamārutābhyāṃ pravartate nordhvamadhaśca yasya|
vilambikāṃ tāṃ 1bhṛśaduścikitsyāmācakṣate śāstravidaḥ purāṇāḥ||
6.56.10| yatrasthamāmaṃ virujettameva deśaṃ viśeṣeṇa vikārajātaiḥ|
doṣeṇa yenāvatataṃ 1svaliṅgaistaṃ lakṣayedāmasamudbhavaiśca||
6.56.11| yaḥ śyāvadantauṣṭhanakho 'lpasaṃjñaśchardyardito 'bhyantarayātanetraḥ|
kṣāmasvaraḥ sarvavimuktasandhiryāyānnaraḥ so 'punarāgamāya||
6.56.12| sādhyāsu pārṣṇyordahanaṃ praśastamagnipratāpo vamanaṃ ca tīkṣṇam|
pakve tato 'nne tu vilaṅghanaṃ syāt saṃpācanaṃ cāpi virecanaṃ ca||
6.56.13| viśuddhadehasya hi sadya eva mūrcchātisārādirupaiti śāntim|
āsthāpanaṃ cāpi vadanti pathyaṃ sarvāsu yogānaparānnibodha||
6.56.14| pathyāvacāhiṅgukaliṅgagṛñjasauvarcalaiḥ sātiviṣaiśca cūrṇam|
sukhāmbupītaṃ vinihantyajīrṇaṃ śūlaṃ visūcīmaruciṃ ca sadyaḥ||
6.56.15| kṣārāgadaṃ vā lavaṇaṃ viṣaṃ vā guḍapragāḍhānatha sarṣapān vā|
amlena vā saindhavahiṅguyuktau sabījapūrṇau saghṛtau trivargau||
6.56.16| kaṭutrikaṃ vā lavaṇairupetaṃ pibet snuhīkṣīravimiśritaṃ tu|
kalyāṇakaṃ vā lavaṇaṃ pibettu yaduktamādāvanilāmayeṣu||
6.56.17| kṛṣṇājamodakṣavakāṇi vā 'pi tulyau pibedvā magadhānikumbhau|
dantīyuta vā magadhodbhavānāṃ kalkaṃ pibet koṣavatīrasena||
6.56.18| uṣṇābhiradbhirmagadhodbhavānāṃ kalkaṃ pibennāgarakalkayuktam|
vyoṣaṃ karañjasya phalaṃ haridre mūlaṃ samaṃ cāpyatha mātuluṅgyāḥ||
6.56.19| chāyāviśuṣkā guṭikāḥ kṛtāstā hanyurvisūcīṃ nayanāñjanena|
suvāmitaṃ sādhuvirecitaṃ vā sulaṅghataṃ vā manujaṃ viditvā||
6.56.20| peyādibhirdīpanapācanīyaiḥ samyakkṣudhārtaṃ samupakrameta|
āmaṃ śakṛdvā nicitaṃ krameṇa bhūyo vibaddhaṃ viguṇānilena||
6.56.21| pravartamānaṃ na yathāsvamenaṃ vikāramānāhamudāharanti|
tasmin bhavantyāmasamudbhave tu tṛṣṇāpratiśyāyaśirovidāhāḥ||
6.56.22| āmāśaye śūlamatho gurutvaṃ hṛllāsa udgāravighātanaṃ ca|
stambhaḥ kaṭīpṛṣṭhapurīṣamūtre śūlo 'tha mūrcchā 1sa śakṛdvamecca||
6.56.23| śvāsaśca pakvāśayaje bhavanti liṅgāni cātrālasakodbhavāni|
āmodbhave vāntamupakrameta saṃsargabhaktakramadīpanīyaiḥ||
6.56.24| athetaraṃ yo na śakṛdvamettamāmaṃ jayet svedanapācanaiśca|
visūcikāyāṃ parikīrtitāni dravyāṇi vairecanikāni yāni||
6.56.25| tānyeva vartīrviracedvicūrṇya mahiṣyajāvībhagavāṃ tu mūtraiḥ|
svinnasya pāyau viniveśya tāśca cūrṇāni caiṣāṃ pradhamettu nāḍyā||
6.56.26| mūtreṣu saṃsādhya yathāvidhānaṃ dravyāṇi yānyūrdhvamadhaśca yānti|
kvāthena tenāśu nirūhayecca mūtrārdhayuktena samākṣikeṇa||
6.56.27| tribhaṇḍiyuktaṃ lavaṇaprakuñcaṃ dattvā viriktakramamācarecca|
eṣveva tailena ca sādhitena prāptaṃ yadi syādanuvāsayecca||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantre kāyacikitsātantre visūcikāpratiṣedho nāma (aṣṭādaśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ṣaṭpañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||56||

saptapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.57.1| athāto 'rocakapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.57.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.57.3| doṣaiḥ pṛthak saha ca cittaviparyayācca bhaktāyaneṣu hṛdi cāvatate pragāḍham|
nānne rucirbhavati taṃ bhiṣajo vikāraṃ bhaktopaghātamiha pañcavidhaṃ vadanti|||
6.57.4| hṛcchūlapīḍanayutaṃ virasānanatvaṃ vātātmake bhavati liṅgamarocake tu|
hṛddāhacoṣabahutā mukhatiktatā ca mūrcchā satṛḍ bhavati pittakṛte tathaiva||
6.57.5| kaṇḍūgutvakaphasaṃsravasādatandrāḥ śleṣmātmake madhuramāsyamarocake tu|
sarvātmake pavanapittakaphā bahūni rūpāṇyathāsya hṛdaye samudīrayanti||
6.57.6| saṃrāgaśokabhayaviplutacetasastu cintākṛto bhavati so 'śucidarśanācca|
vāte vacāmbuvamanaṃ kṛtavān pibecca snehaiḥ surābhirathavoṣṇajalena cūrṇam||
6.57.7| kṛṣṇāviḍaṅgayavabhasmahareṇubhārgīrāsnailahiṅgulavaṇottamanāgarāṇām|
pitte guḍāmbumadhurairvamanaṃ praśastaṃ snehaḥ sasaindhavasitāmadhusarpiriṣṭaḥ||
6.57.8| nimbāmbuvāmitavataḥ kaphaje 'nupānaṃ rājadrumāmbu madhunā tu sadīpyakaṃ syāt|
cūrṇaṃ yaduktamathavā 'nilaje tadeva sarvaiśca sarvakṛtamevamupakrameta||
6.57.9| drākṣāpaṭolaviḍavetrakarīranimbamūrvābhayākṣabadarāmalakendravṛkṣaiḥ|
bījaiḥ karañjanṛpavṛkṣabhavaiśca piṣṭairlehaṃ pacet surabhimūtrayutaṃ yathāvat||
6.57.10| mustāṃ vacāṃ trikaṭukaṃ rajanīdvayaṃ ca bhārgīṃ ca kuṣṭhamatha nirdahanīṃ ca piṣṭvā|
mūtre 'vije dviradamūtrayute pacedvā pāṭhāṃ tugāmativiṣāṃ rajanīṃ ca mukhyām||
6.57.11| maṇḍūkimarkamamṛtāṃ ca salāṅgalākhyāṃ mūtre pacettu mahiṣasya vidhānavidvā|
etānna santi caturo lihatastu lehān gulmāruciśvasanakaṇṭhahṛdāmayāśca||
6.57.12| sātmyān 1svadeśaracitān vividhāṃśca bhakṣyān pānāni mūlaphalaṣāḍavarāgayogān|
adyādrasāṃśca vividhān vividhaiḥ prakārairbhuñjīta cāpi laghurūkṣamanaḥsukhāni||
6.57.13| āsthāpanaṃ vidhivadatra virecanaṃ ca kuryānmṛdūni śirasaśca virecanāni|
trīṇyūṣaṇāni rajanītriphalāyutāni cūrṇīkṛtāni yavaśūkavimiśritāni||
6.57.14| kṣaudrāyutāni vitarenmukhabodhanārthamanyāni1 tiktakaṭukāni ca bheṣajāni|
mustādirājataruvargadaśāṅgasiddhaiḥ kvāthairjayenmadhuyutairvividhaiśca lehaiḥ||
6.57.15| mūtrāsavairguḍakṛtaiśca tathā tvariṣṭaiḥ kṣārāsavaiśca madhumādhavatulyagandhaiḥ|
syādeṣa eva kaphavātahate vidhiśca śāntiṃ gate hutabhuji praśamāya tasya||
6.57.16| icchābhighātabhayaśokahate 'ntaragnau bhāvān bhavāya vitaret khalu śakyarūpān|
artheṣu 1cāpyapaciteṣu punarbhavāya paurāṇikaiḥ śrutiśatairanumānayettam1||
6.57.17| dainyaṃ gate manasi bodhanamatra śastaṃ yadyat priyaṃ tadupasevyamarocake tu||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre 'rocakapratiṣedho nāma (ekonaviṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) saptapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||57||

aṣṭāpañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.58.1| athāto mūtrāghātapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.58.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.58.3| vātakuṇḍalikā 'ṣṭhīlā vātabastistathaiva ca|
mūtrātītaḥ sajaṭharo mūtrotsaṅgaḥ kṣayastathā||
6.58.4| mūtragranthirmūtraśukramuṣṇavātastathaiva ca|
mūtraukasādau dvau cāpi rogā dvādaśa kīrtitāḥ||
6.58.5| raukṣyādvegavighātādvā vāyurantaramāśirtaḥ1|
mūtraṃ carati saṃgṛhya viguṇaḥ kuṇḍalīkṛtaḥ||
6.58.6| sṛjedalpālpamathavā sarujaskaṃ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ|
vātakuṇḍalikāṃ taṃ tu vyādhiṃ vidyāt sudāruṇam||
6.58.7| śakṛnmārgasya basteśca cāyurantaramāśritaḥ|
aṣṭhīlāvadghanaṃ granthiṃ karotyacalamunnatam||
6.58.8| viṇmūtranilasaṅgaśca tatrādhmānaṃ ca jāyate|
vedanā ca parā bastau vātāṣṭhīleti tāṃ viduḥ||
6.58.9| vegaṃ vidhārayedyastu mūtrasyākuśalo naraḥ|
niruṇaddhi mukhaṃ tasya basterbastigato 'nilaḥ||
6.58.10| mūtrasaṅgo bhavettena bastikukṣinipīḍitaḥ|
vātabastiḥ sa vijñeyo vyādhiḥ kṛcchraprasādhanaḥ||
6.58.11| vegaṃ sandhārya mūtrasya yo bhūyaḥ sraṣṭumicchati|
tasya nābhyeti yadi vā kathañcitsaṃpravartate||
6.58.12| pravāhato mandarujamalpamalpaṃ punaḥ punaḥ|
mūtrātītaṃ tu taṃ vidyānmūtravegavighātajam||
6.58.13| mūtrasya vihate vege tadudāvartahetunā|
apānaḥ kupito vāyurudaraṃ pūrayedbhṛśam||
6.58.14| nābheradhastādādhmānaṃ janayettīvravedanam|
taṃ mūtrajaṭharaṃ vidyādadhaḥsrotonirodhanam||
6.58.15| bastau vā 'pyathavā nāle maṇau vā yasya dehinaḥ|
mūtraṃ pravṛttaṃ sajjeta 1saraktaṃ vā pravāhataḥ||
6.58.16| sravecchanairalpamalpaṃ sarujaṃ vā 'tha nīrujam|
viguṇānilajo vyādhiḥ sa mūtrotsaṅgasaṃjñitaḥ||
6.58.17| rūkṣasya klāntadehasya bastisthau pittamārutau|
sadāhavedanaṃ kṛcchraṃ kuryātāṃ mūtrasaṃkṣayam||
6.58.18| abhyantare bastimukhe vṛtto 'lpaḥ sthira eva ca|
vedanāvānati 1sadā mūtramārganirodhanaḥ||
6.58.19| jāyate sahasā yasya granthiraśmarilakṣaṇaḥ|
sa mūtragranthirityevamucyate 1vedanādibhiḥ||
6.58.20| pratyupasthitamūtrastu maithunaṃ yo 'bhinandati|
tasya mūtrayutaṃ retaḥ sahasā saṃpravartate||
6.58.21| purastādvā 'pi mūtrasya paścādvā 'pi kadācana|
bhasmodakapratīkāśaṃ mūtraśukraṃ taducyate||
6.58.22| vyāyāmādhvātapaiḥ pittaṃ bastiṃ prāpyānilāvṛtam|
bastiṃ meḍhraṃ gudaṃ caiva pradahan srāvayedadhaḥ||
6.58.23| mūtraṃ hāridramathavā saraktaṃ raktameva vā|
kṛcchrāt pravartate jantoruṣṇavātaṃ vadanti tam||
6.58.24| viśadaṃ pītakaṃ mūtraṃ sadāhaṃ bahalaṃ tathā|
śuṣkaṃ bhavati yaccāpi rocanācūrṇasannibham||
6.58.25| mūtraukasādaṃ taṃ vidyādrogaṃ pittakṛtaṃ budhaḥ|
picchilaṃ saṃhataṃ śvetaṃ tathā kṛcchrapravartanam||
6.58.26| śuṣkaṃ bhavati yaccāpi śaṅkhacūrṇaprapāṇḍuram|
mūtraukasāhaṃ taṃ vidyādāmayaṃ 1dvādaśaṃ kaphāt||
6.58.27| kaṣāyakalkasarpiṃṣi bhakṣyān lehān payāṃsi ca|
kṣāramadyāsavasvedān(kṣāramadhvāsavasvedān) bastīṃścottarasaṃjñitān||
6.58.28| vidadhyānmatimāṃstatra vidhiṃ cāśmarināśanam|
mūtrodāvartayogāṃśca kārtsnyenātra1 prayojayet||
6.58.29| kalkamervārubījānāmakṣamātraṃ sasaindhavam|
dhānyāmlayuktaṃ pītvaiva mūtrakṛcchrāt pramucyate||
6.58.30| surāṃ sauvarcalavatīṃ mūtrakṛcchrī pibennaraḥ|
madhu māṃsopadaṃśaṃ vā pibedvā 'pyatha gauḍikam||
6.58.31| pibet kuṅkumakarṣaṃ vā madhūdakasamāyutam|
rātriparyuṣitaṃ prātastathā sukhamavāpnuyāt||
6.58.32| dāḍimāmlāṃ 1yutāṃ mukhyāmelājīrakanāgaraiḥ|
pītvā surāṃ salavaṇāṃ mūtrakṛcchrāt pramucyate||
6.58.33| pṛthakparṇyādivargasya mūlaṃ gokṣurakasya ca|
ardhaprasthena toyasya pacet kṣīracaturguṇam||
6.58.34| kṣīrāvaśiṣṭaṃ tacchītaṃ 1sitākṣaudrayutaṃ pibet|
naro mārutapittotthamūtraghātanivāraṇam||
6.58.35| niṣpīḍya vāsasā samyagvarco rāsabhavājinoḥ|
rasasya kuḍavaṃ tasya pibenmūtrarujāpaham||
6.58.36| mustābhayādevadārumūrvāṇāṃ madhukasya ca|
pibedakṣasamaṃ kalkaṃ mūtradoṣanivāraṇam||
6.58.37| abhayāmalakākṣāṇāṃ kalkaṃ badarasaṃmitam|
ambhasā 'lavaṇopetaṃ pibenmūtrarujāpaham||
6.58.38| udumbarasamaṃ kalkaṃ drākṣāyā jalasaṃyutam|
pibet paryuṣitaṃ 1rātrau śītaṃ mūtrarujāpaham||
6.58.39| nidigdhikāyāḥ svarasaṃ pibet kuḍavasaṃmitam|
mūtradoṣaharaṃ kalyamathavā kṣaudrasaṃyutam||
6.58.40| prapīḍyāmalakānāṃ tu rasaṃ kuḍavasaṃmitam|
pītvā 'gadī bhavejjanturmūtradoṣarujāturaḥ||
6.58.41| dhātrīphalarasenaivaṃ sūkṣmailāṃ vā pibennaraḥ|
piṣṭvā 'thavā suśītena śālitaṇḍulavāriṇā||
6.58.42| tālasya taruṇaṃ mūlaṃ trapusasya rasaṃ tathā|
śvetaṃ karkaṭakaṃ caiva prātastu payasā pibet||
6.58.43| śṛtaṃ vā madhuraiḥ kṣīraṃ sarpirmiśraṃ pibennaraḥ|
mūtradoṣaviśuddhyarthaṃ tathaivāśmarināśanam1||
6.58.44| balāśvadaṃṣṭrākrauñcāsthikokilākṣakataṇḍulān|
śataparvakamūlaṃ ca devadāru sacitrakam||
6.58.45| akṣabījaṃ ca surayā kalkīkṛtya pibennaraḥ|
mūtradoṣaviśuddhyarthaṃ tathaivāśmarināśanam1||
6.58.46| pāṭalākṣāramāhṛtya saptakṛtvaḥ parisrutam|
pibenmūtravikāraghnaṃ saṃsṛṣṭaṃ tailamātrayā||
6.58.47| nalāśmabhedadarbhekṣutrapusairvārubījakān|
kṣīre pariśṛtān tatra pibet sarpiḥ samāyutān||
6.58.48| pāṭalyā yāvaśūkācca pāribhadrāttilādapi|
kṣārodakena matimān tvageloṣaṇacūrṇakam||
6.58.49| pibedguḍena miśraṃ vā lihyāllehān pṛthak pṛthak|
ata ūrdhvaṃ pravakṣyāmi mūtradoṣe kramaṃ hitam||
6.58.50| snehasvedopapannānāṃ hitaṃ teṣu virecanam|
tataḥ saṃśuddhadehānāṃ hitāścottarabastayaḥ||
6.58.51| strīṇāmatiprasaṅgena śoṇitaṃ yasya dṛśyate1|
maithunoparamastasya bṛṃhaṇaśca vidhiḥ smṛtaḥ||
6.58.52| tāmracūḍavasā tailaṃ hitaṃ cottarabastiṣu|
vidhānaṃ tasya pūrvaṃ hi vyāsataḥ parikīrtitam||
6.58.53| kṣaudrārdhapātraṃ dattvā ca pātraṃ tu kṣīrasarpiṣaḥ|
śarkarāyāśca cūrṇaṃ ca drākṣācūrṇaṃ ca tatsamam||
6.58.54| svayaṅguptāphalaṃ caiva tathivekṣurakasya ca|
pippalīcūrṇasaṃyuktamardhabhāgaṃ prakalpayet||
6.58.55| tadaikadhyaṃ samānīya khajenābhipramanthayet|
tataḥ pāṇitalaṃ cūrṇaṃ līḍhvā kṣīraṃ tataḥ pibet||
6.58.56| etat sarpiḥ prayuñjānaḥ śuddhadeho naraḥ sadā|
mūtradoṣāñjayet 1sarvānanyayogaiḥ sudurjayān||
6.58.57| jayecchoṇitadoṣāṃśca vandhyā garbhaṃ labheta ca|
nārī caitat prayuñjānā yonidosāt pramucyate||
6.58.58| balā kolāsthi madhukaṃ śvadaṃṣṭrā 'tha śatāvarī|
mṛṇālaṃ ca kaśeruśca bījānīkṣurakasya ca||
6.58.59| sahasravīryā 'ṃśumatī payasyā saha kālayā|
śṛgālavinnā 'tibalā bṛṃhaṇīyo gaṇastathā||
6.58.60| etāni samabhāgāni matimān saha sādhayet|
caturguṇena payasā guḍasya tulayā saha||
6.58.61| droṇāvaśiṣṭaṃ tat pūtaṃ pacettena ghṛtāḍhakam|
tat siddhaṃ kalaśe sthāpyaṃ kṣaudraprasthena saṃyutam||
6.58.62| sarpiretat prayuñjāno mūtradoṣāt pramucyate|
tugākṣīryāśca cūrṇāni śarkarāyāstathaiva ca||
6.58.63| kṣaudreṇa tulyānyāloḍya praśaste 'hani lehayet|
tasya khādedyathāśakti mātrāṃ kṣīraṃ tataḥ pibet||
6.58.64| śukradoṣāñjayenmartyaḥ prāśya samyak suyantritaḥ|
vyavāyakṣīṇaretāstu sadyaḥ saṃlabhate sukham||
6.58.65| ojasvī balavānmartyaḥ pibenneva ca hṛṣyati|
citrakaḥ sārivā caiva balā kālānusārivā||
6.58.66| drākṣā viśālā pippalyastathā citraphalā bhevet|
tathaiva madhukaṃ pathyāṃ dadyādāmalakāni ca||
6.58.67| ghṛtāḍhakaṃ pacedebhiḥ 1kalkaiḥ karṣasamanvitaiḥ|
kṣīradroṇe jaladroṇe tatsiddhamavatārayet||
6.58.68| śītaṃ parisrutaṃ caiva śarkarāprasthasaṃyutam|
tugākṣīryāśca tat sarvaṃ matimān parimiśrayet||
6.58.69| tato mitaṃ pibetkāle yathādoṣaṃ yathābalam|
vātaretāḥ śleṣmaretāḥ pittaretāstu yo bhavet||
6.58.70| raktaretā granthiretāḥ pibedicchannarogatām|
jīvanīyaṃ ca vṛṣyaṃ ca sarpiretadbalāvaham||
6.58.71| 1prakṣāhitaṃ ca dhanyaṃ ca sarvarogāpahaṃ śivam|
sarpiretat prayuñjānā strī garbhaṃ labhate 'cirāt||
6.58.72| asṛgdoṣāñjayeccāpi yonidoṣāṃśca saṃhatān|
mūtradoṣeṣu sarveṣu kuryādetaccikitsitam||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre mūtrāghātapratiṣedho nāma (viṃśo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) aṣṭapañcāśattamo 'dhyāyaḥ||58||

ūnaṣaṣṭitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.59.1| athāto mūtrakṛcchrapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.59.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.59.3| vātena pittena kaphena sarvaistathā+ābhighātaiḥ śakṛdaśmarībhyām|
tathā 'paraḥ śarkarayā sukaṣṭo mūtropaghātaḥ kathito 'ṣṭamastu||
6.59.4| alpamalpaṃ samutpīḍya muṣkamehanabastibhiḥ|
phaladbhiriva kṛcchreṇa vātāghātena mehati||
6.59.5| hāridramuṣṇaṃ raktaṃ vā muṣkamehanabastibhiḥ|
agninā dahyamānābhaiḥ pittāghātena mehati||
6.59.6| snigdhaṃ śuklamanuṣṇaṃ ca muṣkamehanabastibhiḥ|
saṃhṛṣṭaromā gurubhiḥ śleṣmāghātena mehati||
6.59.7| dāhaśītarujāviṣṭo nānāvarṇaṃ muhurmuhuḥ|
tāmyamānastu kṛcchreṇa sannipātena mehati||
6.59.8| mūtravāhiṣu śalyena kṣateṣvabhihateṣu ca|
srotaḥsu mūtrāghātastu jāyate bhṛśavedanaḥ1||
6.59.9| vātabastestu tulyāni tasya liṅgāni lakṣayet|
śakṛtastu pratīghātādvāyurviguṇatāṃ gataḥ||
6.59.10| ādhmānaṃ ca saśūlaṃ ca mūtrasaṅgaṃ karoti hi|
aśmarīhetukaḥ pūrvaṃ mūtraghāta udāhṛtaḥ||
6.59.11| aśmarī śarkarā caiva 1tulye saṃbhavalakṣaṇaiḥ|
śarkarāyā viśeṣaṃ tu śṛṇu kīrtayato mama||
6.59.12| pacyamānasya pittena bhidyamānasya vāyunā|
śleṣmaṇo 'vayavā bhinnāḥ śarkarā iti saṃjñitāḥ||
6.59.13| hṛtpīḍā vepathuḥ śūlaṃ kukṣau1 vahniḥ sudurbalaḥ|
tābhirbhavati mūrcchā ca mūtrāghātaśca dāruṇaḥ||
6.59.14| mūtraveganirastāsu tāsu śāmyati vedanā|
1yāvadanyā punarnaiti guḍikā srotaso mukham||
6.59.15| śarkarāsaṃbhavasyaitanmūtrāghātasya lakṣaṇam|
cikitsitamathaiteṣāmaṣṭānāmapi vakṣyate||
6.59.16| aśmarīṃ ca samāśritya yaduktaṃ prasamīkṣya tat|
yathādoṣaṃ prayuñjīta snehādimapi ca kramam||
6.59.17| śvadaṃṣṭrāśmabhidau kumbhīṃ hapuṣāṃ kaṇṭakārikām|
balāṃ śatāvarīṃ rāsnāṃ varuṇaṃ girikarṇikām||
6.59.18| tathā vidārigandhādiṃ saṃhṛtya traivṛtaṃ pacet|
tailaṃ ghṛtaṃ vā tat peyaṃ tena vā 'pyanuvāsanam||
6.59.19| dadyāduttarabastiṃ ca vātakṛcchropaśāntaye|
śvadaṃṣṭrāsvarase tailaṃ saguḍakṣīranāgaram||
6.59.20| paktvā tat pūrvavadyojyaṃ tatrānilarujāpaham|
tṛṇotpalādikākolīnyagrodhādigaṇaiḥ kṛtam(śṛtam)||
6.59.21| pītaṃ ghṛtaṃ pittakṛcchraṃ nāśayet kṣīrameva vā|
dadyāduttarabastiṃ ca pittakṛcchropaśāntaye||
6.59.22| ebhireva kṛtaḥ snehastrividheṣvapi bastiṣu|
hitaṃ virecanaṃ cekṣukṣīradrākṣārasairyutam||
6.59.23| surasoṣakamustādau varuṇādau ca 1yat kṛtam|
tailaṃ tathā yavāgvādi 1kaphāghāte praśasyate||
6.59.24| yathādoṣocchrayaṃ kuryādetāneva ca sarvaje|
phalguvṛścīradarbhāśmasāracūrṇaṃ ca vāriṇā||
6.59.25| surekṣurasadarbhāmbupītaṃ kṛcchrarujāpaham|
tathā 'bhighātaje kuryāt sadyovraṇacikitsitam||
6.59.26| mūtrakṛcchre śakṛjjāte kāryā vātaharī kriyā|
svedāvagāhāvabhyaṅgabasticūrṇakriyāstathā||
6.59.27| ye tvanye tu tathā kṛcchre tayoḥ proktaḥ kriyāvidhiḥ||
iti suśrutasaṃhitāyāmuttaratantrāntargate kāyacikitsātantre mūtrakṛcchrapratiṣedho nāma (ekaviṃśatitamo 'dhyāyaḥ, āditaḥ) ekonaṣaṣṭitamo 'dhyāyaḥ||59||

ṣaṣṭitamo 'dhyāyaḥ|
6.60.1| athāto 'mānuṣopasargapratiṣedhamadhyāyaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ||
6.60.2| yathovāca bhagavān dhanvantariḥ||
6.60.3| niśācarebhyo rakṣyastu nityameva kṣatāturaḥ|
iti yat prāgabhihitaṃ vistarastasya vakṣyate||
6.60.4| guhyānāgatavijñānamanavasthā 'sahiṣṇutā|
kriyā vā 'mānuṣī yasmin sagrahaḥ parikīrtyate||
6.60.5| aśuciṃ bhinnamaryādaṃ kṣataṃ vā yadi vā 'kṣatam|
hiṃsyurhiṃsāvihārārthaṃ satkārārtham athāpi vā||
6.60.6| asaṅkhyeyā grahagaṇā grahādhipatayas tu ye|
vyajyante vividhākārā bhidyante te tathā 'ṣṭadhā||
6.60.7| devāstathā śatrugaṇāśca teṣāṃ gandharvayakṣāḥ pitaro bhujaṅgāḥ|
rakṣāṃsi yā cāpi piśācajātireṣo 'ṣṭako devagaṇo grahākhyaḥ||
6.60.8| saṃtuṣṭaḥ śucirapi ceṣṭagandhamālyo nistandrī hyavitathasaṃskṛtaprabhāṣī|
tejasvī sthiranayano varapradātā brahmaṇyo bhavati naraḥ sa devajuṣṭaḥ||
6.60.9| saṃsvedī dvijagurudevadoṣavaktā jihmākṣo vigatabhayo vimārgadṛṣṭiḥ|
santuṣṭo bhavati na cānnapānajātairduṣṭātmā bhavati ca devaśatrujuṣṭaḥ||
6.60.10| hṛṣṭātmā pulinavanāntaropasevī svācāraḥ priyaparigītagandhamālyaḥ|
nṛtyan vai prahasati cāru cālpaśabdaṃ gandharvagrahaparipīḍito manuṣyaḥ||
6.60.11| tāmrākṣaḥ priyatanuraktavastradhārī gambhīro 1drutamatiralpavāk sahiṣśuḥ|
tejasvī vadati ca kiṃ dadāmi kasmai yo yakṣagrahaparipīḍito manuṣyaḥ||
6.60.12| pretebhyo visṛjati saṃstareṣu piṇḍān śāntātmā jalamapi cāpasavyavastraḥ|
māṃsepsustilaguḍapāyasābhikāmastadbhukto1 bhavati pitṛgrahābhibhūtaḥ||
6.60.13| bhūmau yaḥ prasarati sarpavat kadācit sṛkkiṇyau vilikhati1 jihvayā tathaiva|
nidrālurguḍamadhudugdhapāyasepsurvijñeyo bhavati bhujaṅgamena juṣṭaḥ||
6.60.14| māṃsāsṛgvividhasurāvikāralipsurnirlajjo bhṛśamatiniṣṭhuro 'tiśūraḥ|
krodhālurvipulabalo niśāvihārī śaucadviḍ bhavati ca rakṣasā gṛhītaḥ||
6.60.15| uddhastaḥ kṛśaparuṣaścirapralāpī durgandho bhṛśamaśucistathā 'tilolaḥ|
bahvāśī vijanahimāmburātrisevī 1vyāvigno bhramati rudan piśācajuṣṭaḥ||
6.60.16| sthūlākṣastvaritagatiḥ svaphenalehī nidrāluḥ patati ca kampate ca yo 'ti|
yaścādridviradanagādivicyutaḥ san saṃsṛṣṭo na bhavati vārdhakena juṣṭaḥ||
6.60.17| devagrahāḥ paurṇamāsyāmasurāḥ sandhyayorapi|
gandharvāḥ prāyaśo 'ṣṭamyāṃ yakṣāśca pratipadyatha||
6.60.18| kṛṣṇakṣaye ca pitaraḥ paścamyāmapi coragāḥ|
rakṣāṃsi niśi paiśācāścaturdaśyāṃ viśanti ca||
6.60.19| darpaṇādīn yathā chāyā śītoṣṇaṃ prāṇino yathā|
svamaṇiṃ bhāskarasyosrā yathā dehaṃ ca dehadhṛk|
viśanti ca na dṛśyante grahāstadvaccharīriṇam||
6.60.20| tapāṃsi tīvrāṇi tathaiva dānaṃ vratāni dharmo niyamāśca satyam|
guṇāstathā 'ṣṭāvapi teṣu nityā vyastāḥ samastāśca yathāprabhāvam||
6.60.21| na te manuṣyaiḥ saha saṃviśanti na vā manuṣyān kvacidāviśanti|
ye tvāviśantīti vadanti mohātte bhūtavidyāviṣayādapohyāḥ||
6.60.22| teṣāṃ grahāṇāṃ paricārakā ye koṭīsahasrāyutapadmasaṃkhyāḥ|
asṛgvasāmāṃsabhujaḥ subhīmā niśāvihārāśca tamāviśanti||
6.60.23| niśācarāṇāṃ teṣāṃ hi ye devagaṇamāśritāḥ|
te tu tatsattvasaṃsargādvijñeyāstu tadañjanāḥ||
6.60.24| devagrahā iti punaḥ procyante 'śucayaśca1 ye|
devavacca namasyante pratyarthyante ca devavat||
6.60.25| 1svāmiśīlakriyācārāḥ krama eṣa surādiṣu|
nirṛteryā duhitarastāsāṃ sa prasavaḥ smṛtaḥ||
6.60.26| satyatvādapavṛtteṣu vṛttisteṣāṃ gaṇaiḥ kṛtā|
hiṃsāvihārā ye keciddevabhāvabhupāśritāḥ1||
6.60.27| bhūtānīti kṛtā saṃjñā teṣāṃ saṃjñāpravaktṛbhiḥ|
grahasaṃjñāni bhūtāni yasmādvettyanayā bhiṣak||
6.60.28| vidyayā bhūtavidyātvamata eva nirucyate|
teṣāṃ śāntyarthamanvicchan vaidyastu susamāhitaḥ||
6.60.29| japaiḥ saniyamairhomairārabheta cikitsitum|
raktāni gandhamālyāni bījāni madhusarpiṣī||
6.60.30| bhakṣyāśca sarve sarveṣāṃ sāmānyo vidhirucyate|
vastrāṇi gandhamālyāni māṃsāni1 rudhirāṇi ca||
6.60.31| yāni yeṣāṃ yatheṣṭāni tāni tebhyaḥ pradāpayet|
hiṃsanti manujān yeṣu prāyaśo divaseṣu tu||
6.60.32| dineṣu teṣu deyāni tadbhūtavinivṛttaye|
devagrahe devagṛhe hutvā 'gniṃ prāpayed(dāpayed)balim||
6.60.33| kuśasvastikapūpājyacchatrapāyasasaṃbhṛtam|
asurāya yathākālaṃ vidadhyāccatvarādiṣu||
6.60.34| gandharvasya gavāṃ madhye 1madyamāṃsāmbujāṅgalam|
hṛdye veśmani yakṣasya kulmāṣāsṛksurādibhiḥ||
6.60.35| atimuktakakundābjaiḥ puṣpaiśca vitaredbalim|
nadyāṃ pitṛgrahāyeṣṭaṃ kuśāstaraṇabhūṣitam||
6.60.36| tatraivopahareccāpi nāgāya vividhaṃ balim|
catuṣpathe rākṣasasya bhīmeṣu gahaneṣu vā||
6.60.37| śūnyāgāre piśācasya tīvraṃ balimupāharet|
pūrvamācaritairmantrairbhūtavidyānidarśitaiḥ||
6.60.38| na śakyā balibhirjetuṃ yogaistān samupācaret|
ajarkṣacarmaromāṇi śalyakolūkayostathā||
6.60.39| hiṅguṃ mūtraṃ ca bastasya dhūmamasya prayojayet|
etena śāmyati kṣipraṃ balavānapi yo grahaḥ||
6.60.40| gajāhvapippalīmūlavyoṣāmalakasarṣapān|
godhānakulamārjāraṛṣyapittaprapeṣitān1||
6.60.41| nasyābhyañjanasekeṣu vidadhyādyogatattvavit|
svarāśvāśvatarolūkakarabhaśvaśṛgālajam||
6.60.42| purīṣaṃ 1gṛdhrakākānāṃ varāhasya ca peṣayet|
bastamūtreṇa tatsiddhaṃ tailaṃ syāt pūrvavaddhitam||
6.60.43| śirīṣabījaṃ laśunaṃ śuṇṭhīṃ siddhārthakaṃ vacām|
mañjiṣṭhāṃ rajanīṃ kṛṣṇāṃ bastamūtreṇa peṣayet||
6.60.44| vartyaśchāyāviśuṣkāstāḥ sapittā nayanāñjanam|
naktamālaphalaṃ vyoṣaṃ mūlaṃ śyonākabilvayoḥ||
6.60.45| haridre ca kṛtā vartyaḥ pūrvavannayanāñjanam|
saindhavaṃ kaṭukāṃ hiṅguṃ vayaḥsthāṃ ca vacāmapi|
bastamūtreṇa saṃpiṣṭaṃ matsyapittena pūrvavat||
6.60.46| ye ye grahā na sidhyanti sarveṣāṃ nayanāñjanam|
pūrāṇasarpirlaśunaṃ hiṅgu siddhārthakaṃ vacā||
6.60.47| golomī cājalomī ca bhūtakeśī jaṭā tathā|
kukkuṭā sarpagandhā ca tathā kāṇavikāṇike||
6.60.48| vajraproktā1 vayaḥsthā ca śṛṅgī mohanavallikā|
arkamūlaṃ trikaṭukaṃ latā srotojamañjanam||
6.60.49| naipālī haritālaṃ ca rakṣoghnā ye ca kīrtitāḥ|
siṃhavyāghrarkṣamārjāradvīpivājigavāṃ tathā||
6.60.50| śvāvicchalyakagodhānāmuṣṭrasya nakulasya ca|
viṭtvagromavasāmūtraraktapittanakhādayaḥ||
6.60.51| asmin varge bhiṣak kuryāttailāni ca ghṛtāni ca|
pānābhyañjananasyeṣu tāni yojyāni jānatā||
6.60.52| avapīḍe 'ñjane caiva vidadhyādguṭikīkṛtam|
vidadhīta parīṣeke kvathitaṃ cūrṇitaṃ tathā||
6.60.53| uddhūlane ślakṣṇapiṣṭaṃ pradehe cāvacārayet|
